g {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Sejiri Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", "Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{U}.", 'Strive — This spell costs {2}{G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nDestroy any number of target artifacts and/or enchantments.', 'Submerged Boneyard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', "The owner of target permanent shuffles it into their library, then reveals the top card of their library. If it's a permanent card, they put it onto the battlefield.", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature on the battlefield.\\nBlasphemous Act deals 13 damage to each creature.', 'Thornwood Falls enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Thornwood Falls enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'Trample, lifelink\\nSpells you cast that target Elderwood Scion cost {2} less to cast.\\nSpells your opponents cast that target Elderwood Scion cost {2} more to cast.', 'Trample\\nCentaur Vinecrasher enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of land cards in all graveyards.\\nWhenever a land card is put into a graveyard from anywhere, you may pay {G}{G}. If you do, return Centaur Vinecrasher from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Trample\\nCrash of Rhino Beetles gets +10/+10 as long as you control ten or more lands.', "Trample\\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.', 'Trample\\nLieutenant — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control your commander, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Trample\\nWhen Moldgraf Monstrosity dies, exile it, then return two creature cards at random from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Charnelhoard Wurm deals damage to an opponent, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Geode Golem deals combat damage to a player, you may cast your commander from the command zone without paying its mana cost. (You still pay any additional costs.)', "Trample\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Bosh, Iron Golem deals damage equal to the sacrificed artifact's mana value to any target.", 'Trample\\n{5}: Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\\n{5}, Exile Soul of New Phyrexia from your graveyard: Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Tranquil Expanse enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Tuvasa the Sunlit gets +1/+1 for each enchantment you control.\\nWhenever you cast your first enchantment spell each turn, draw a card.', "Untap all artifacts you control during each other player's untap step.", 'Vigilance, reach\\nAll creatures attack each combat if able.\\nWhenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, put a +1/+1 counter on Thantis, the Warweaver.', 'Vigilance\\nLieutenant — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control your commander, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to creatures you control this turn. Other creatures you control gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'When Avenger of Zendikar enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token for each land you control.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on each Plant creature you control.', 'When Borderland Explorer enters the battlefield, each player may discard a card. Each player who discarded a card this way may search their library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle.', "When Cloudform enters the battlefield, it becomes an Aura with enchant creature. Manifest the top card of your library and attach Cloudform to it. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)\\nEnchanted creature has flying and hexproof.", "When Coveted Jewel enters the battlefield, draw three cards.\\n{T}: Add three mana of any one color.\\nWhenever one or more creatures an opponent controls attack you and aren't blocked, that player draws three cards and gains control of Coveted Jewel. Untap it.", 'When Farhaven Elf enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "When Ground Seal enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", "When Lightform enters the battlefield, it becomes an Aura with enchant creature. Manifest the top card of your library and attach Lightform to it. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)\\nEnchanted creature has flying and lifelink.", "When Myr Battlesphere enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever Myr Battlesphere attacks, you may tap X untapped Myr you control. If you do, Myr Battlesphere gets +X/+0 until end of turn and deals X damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", "When Phyrexian Delver enters the battlefield, return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. You lose life equal to that card's mana value.", 'When Reclamation Sage enters the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Thopter Engineer enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\nArtifact creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', "When Vessel of Endless Rest enters the battlefield, put target card from a graveyard on the bottom of its owner's library.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'When Yavimaya Elder dies, you may search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Elder: Draw a card.', "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game. You may choose new targets for the copies.\\nCopy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game. You may choose new targets for the copies.\\nCreate a token that's a copy of target artifact.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nCreate a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nEach opponent sacrifices a creature. Each opponent who can't loses half their life, rounded up.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nReveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland permanent card. You may put that card onto the battlefield. Then put all cards revealed this way that weren't put onto the battlefield on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'Whenever High Priest of Penance is dealt damage, you may destroy target nonland permanent.', 'Whenever Hydra Omnivore deals combat damage to an opponent, it deals that much damage to each other opponent.', "Whenever Varchild, Betrayer of Kjeldor deals combat damage to a player, that player creates that many 1/1 red Survivor creature tokens.\\nSurvivors your opponents control can't block, and they can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.\\nWhen Varchild leaves the battlefield, gain control of all Survivors.", 'Whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, create a 2/2 white Cat creature token. If that enchantment is an Aura, you may attach it to the token.', 'Whenever an opponent attacks, if they attacked you and/or a planeswalker you control, draw a card.', 'Whenever an opponent taps an artifact for mana, gain control of that artifact until the end of your next turn.', "Whenever another nontoken artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that artifact.", 'Whenever one or more land cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\\n{G}, Sacrifice three creatures: Return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever you attack with one or more Zombies, draw that many cards, then discard that many cards. You gain that much life.\\n{2}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, draw a card.', 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', "Xantcha, Sleeper Agent enters the battlefield under the control of an opponent of your choice.\\nXantcha attacks each combat if able and can't attack its owner or planeswalkers its owner controls.\\n{3}: Xantcha's controller loses 2 life and you draw a card. Any player may activate this ability.", 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment on the battlefield.', 'You may have Estrid\'s Invocation enter the battlefield as a copy of an enchantment you control, except it has "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile this enchantment. If you do, return it to the battlefield under its owner\'s control."', 'You may play an additional land this turn.\\nDraw a card.', "Your commander costs {1} less to cast for each time it's been cast from the command zone this game.\\nWhenever your commander is put into the command zone from anywhere, draw a card.", "Zendikar Incarnate's power is equal to the number of lands you control.", "[+1]: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n[+1]: The next spell you cast this turn costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control as you cast it.\\n[−7]: For each artifact you control, create a token that's a copy of it. Those tokens gain haste. Exile those tokens at the beginning of the next end step.\\nSaheeli, the Gifted can be your commander.", '[+1]: Draw a card, then put a card from your hand on top of your library.\\n[−1]: Exile another target permanent you own, then return it to the battlefield under your control.\\n[−6]: Choose left or right. Each player gains control of all nonland permanents other than Aminatou, the Fateshifter controlled by the next player in the chosen direction.\\nAminatou, the Fateshifter can be your commander.', '[+2]: Discard a card, then draw a card. If a land card is discarded this way, draw an additional card.\\n[−3]: Return up to two target land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n[−11]: Destroy up to six target nonland permanents, then create six 2/2 green Cat Warrior creature tokens with forestwalk.\\nLord Windgrace can be your commander.', '[+2]: Untap each enchanted permanent you control.\\n[−1]: Create a white Aura enchantment token named Mask attached to another target permanent. The token has enchant permanent and totem armor.\\n[−7]: Mill seven cards. Return all non-Aura enchantment cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, then do the same for Aura cards.\\nEstrid, the Masked can be your commander.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', '{2}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control three or more lands with the same name.', '{3}: Untap Retrofitter Foundry.\\n{2}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a Servo: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Thopter: Create a 4/4 colorless Construct artifact creature token.', '{4}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Balance: Each player chooses a number of lands they control equal to the number of lands controlled by the player who controls the fewest, then sacrifices the rest. Players discard cards and sacrifice creatures the same way.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Jund Panorama: Search your library for a basic Swamp, Mountain, or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Buried Ruin: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Warped Landscape: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1, then you may reveal the top card of your library. If a basic land card is revealed this way, put it onto the battlefield tapped. Activate only if an opponent controls at least two more lands than you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Haunted Fengraf: Return a creature card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Foundry of the Consuls: Create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Choose target commander that entered the battlefield this turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature and a loyalty counter on it if it's a planeswalker.", '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}: Add {U}.', '{T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Target player exiles a card from their graveyard.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Scrabbling Claws: Exile target card from a graveyard. Draw a card.', '{T}: You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield. If you control ten or more lands, flip Budoka Gardener.', "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control."]
flavor: ['"A place like this makes me wonder if there\'s more to life than blood and treasure . . . Nah."\\n—Boyl Bucksalt, Storm Fleet swab', '"All I require is faith, loyalty, obedience, trust, and complete and utter devotion."', '"All who set foot in Paliano are pawns in someone\'s play for power."\\n—Marchesa, the Black Rose', '"And who will stop me? You?"', '"Body and spirit are sworn enemies. They will take any excuse to be rid of each other."\\n—Tariel, Reckoner of Souls', '"Doves and pigeons are too subtle. When I send a message, I want it to have some teeth."\\n—Aeschel, royal diplomat', '"Flee all you like. The further you run the more firmly I feel your heartbeat."', '"From the first touch, I know exactly what the metal wants to be."', '"Her people angered Zendikar, and they faced the land\'s wrath. That is why Nissa is the last of the animists."\\n—Numa, Joraga chieftain', '"Holy places are no longer sanctuary from death, and death is no longer sanctuary from anything."\\n—Thalia, Knight-Cathar', '"I came seeking a challenge. All I found was you."\\n—Zurgo, khan of the Mardu', '"I love what they\'ve done with the place."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"If that brain can\'t figure out the secret of the serum, then add more brains."\\n—Rhmir, Hand of the Augur', '"Into its maw went the seventh sea, never to be seen again while the world remains."\\n—Esper fable', '"Is it not the embodiment of our aspirations?"\\n—Prokopios, astronomer of Meletis', '"Knowledge is cruel. It will break your heart and test your allegiances. Are you certain you want this curse?"', '"Let all we have buried be buried forever."\\n—Seton, centaur druid', '"Let the forest spread! From salt, stone, and fen, let the new trees rise."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"Long after the land has given up the last of its secrets, there will still be mysteries in the depths of the sea."\\n—Kiora', '"Many must die for the one who should not have perished."', '"My master believes anything is achievable."', '"My people have always been here, and here we shall remain."', '"Nature is the ultimate mindless destroyer, capable of power and ferocity no army can match, and the Gruul follow its example."\\n—Trigori, Azorius senator', '"Prayers will curdle on the tongue and be heard by rotting ears."\\n—Minaldra, the Vizag Atum', '"Roil tide! Roil tide! Tie yourselves down!"', '"Savagery is the birthright of every creature that draws breath—or wishes it could."\\n—Karador, Ghost Chieftain', '"Serra isn\'t dead. She lives on through me."', '"Soaring is wasted on the winged."\\n—Edric, Spymaster of Trest', '"Survival rule 781: There are always more scute bugs."\\n—Zurdi, goblin shortcutter', '"The longer the journey, the more one learns."\\n—Isanke, Halimar seastalker', '"The partisans have unearthed a strange artifact. None know its origin, but it gives them hope of a life beyond."\\n—Elspeth\'s journal', '"The shadow travels toward the apex. I predict we will soon see the true measure of darkness."', '"The wise learn from successes as well as mistakes."', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"There shall be a vast shout and then a vaster silence."\\n—Oracle *en*-Vec', '"Those who seek my protection shall receive it."\\n—Nylea, god of the hunt', '"Though the letter was many pages long, I could tell all I needed to know from one look at the messenger\'s face."\\n—Barrin, master wizard', '"To truly know something, you must become it. The trick is to not lose yourself in the process."', '"United, our roar will level mountains."', '"Verdant bloom does exist. It merely hides for its own safety."', '"We are all decaying, always in a state of near-death. One moment without breath and we begin to break down."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"We do not believe in hiding our wealth in the shadows. This is Orzhov, and this is how we reward greatness."\\n—Teysa Karlov, Grand Envoy of Orzhov', '"We must rely on our own knowledge, not on the dogma of the seekers or the mutterings of the sphinxes."\\n—Tullus of Palandius', '"We should learn from the hydra. It never plays favorites; it devours everyone equally."\\n—Thrass, elder druid', '"We train for the improbable, like lightning striking the same place twice, or striking everywhere at once."\\n—Nundari, Sea Gate militia captain', '"What is mana but possibility, an idea not yet given form?"\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"When gods become apathetic, the people will worship anyone who answers their pleas."\\n—Kiora', '"When the herd moves, so should you."\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"When the land is angry, so are they."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Where will you run when I punish you with the very ground you flee on?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Where\'d all the birds go?"\\n—Kaldrin, jungle sightseer', '"You think they know we\'re here?"\\n—Orlo, goblin raider', '"You\'ve begun to understand the hedrons\' true purpose," said Ugin. "The Eldrazi can be imprisoned."\\n"And how did that work out last time?" asked Jace.', '"Zendikar\'s wounds can be healed."', "A ghoulcaller's playground.", 'A light to bring hope in dark times.', 'A masterwork of spite, inspired by madness.', 'A rapid and catastrophic decline.', 'After Gideon cleansed the Ninth District, none of the ganglords challenged the Boros.', "Alara's burning blood cannot be contained by mere earth and stone.", 'All around the foundry, automatons unhitched themselves from their mounts and pivoted to face Chandra.', 'All seeds share a common bond, calling to each other across infinity.', 'An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members—and the doomed.', "An explorer's reward is a view of tomorrow's possibilities.", 'An inspiring and glorious ascent.', 'An organized and methodical reproduction.', 'Anarchy comes in many forms: social, individual, Gruul . . .', 'As Glissa searches for the truth about Memnarch, Bosh searches to unearth the secrets of his past.', "As Trostani's influence grew, vitality spread through the Conclave—much to the other guilds' dismay.", 'As long as one drop of the oil exists, the joyous work continues.', "At every fifth full moon, the Moon Market convenes to peddle Ravnica's most forbidden wares.", 'Bant is a world where death and chaos hold no sway.', 'Because the dead have no will to resist.', 'Death eventually wiggles toward us all.', 'Despite the chaos of the Roil and the devastation of the Eldrazi, Zendikar is a world of breathtaking beauty.', "Dreams' riches are easily spent.\\n—Suq'Ata adage", "Each cryptolith twists the plane's mana, bending its flow to a singular purpose.", 'Each scar on its hide is a badge of honor.', 'Emrakul does not grant wishes. Desires simply align to her will.', 'Enchanters add layer upon layer of complexity to the world around them.', 'Enter those with the vision to create and the daring to release their creations.', 'Even a fragment of a powerstone contains within it not just energy, but space—vast dimensions trapped in fragile crystal.', "For wisdom's sake, it was built high to gaze on all things. For glory's sake, it was built high as a testament of power. For strength's sake, it was built high to repel all attacks.", 'From mite to mighty.', 'Golgari reclaimers resent the gorgons, begrudging the loss of so many fine nutrients locked away in stone.', 'Guarded by cartographers, disdained by warlords, coveted by adventurers.', 'He marks his territory with fire and wrath, etching the mountainside with his charring breath.', "Her roots connect her to the forest's wishes.", 'History has buried its treasures deep.', 'History is not delicately woven. It is hammered with fire.', 'If you stop to listen, you can hear it grow.', 'In the cold corridors of the undercity, misinformation unfurls from Duskmantle like a spreading stain.', "It bends not light but mana, aligning its chaotic currents into the sharp angles necessary for the mystic's purposes.", 'It fears no sword and leaves no bones behind.', 'It glints with arcane truths to those who know how to glimpse them.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It serves a justice higher than the whims of the gods.', "It's hard to argue with a force made of divine will.", "It's the only water source in miles of desert, but the local tribes avoid it at all costs.", 'Its collapse is like the lashing out of a long-dead civilization that resents being forgotten.', 'Its flight sets the sky itself on fire.', 'Its insatiable hunger quickly depletes a region of prey. It must migrate from place to place to feed its massive bulk.', 'Jund is a world as cruel as those who call it home. Their brutal struggles scar the land even as it carves them in its image, a vicious circle spiraling out of control.', "Jund's dragons hoard only sangrite crystals. Its wurms aren't so picky.", "Kill a gnarlid with your first blow, or it'll cheerfully show you how it's done.", 'Knight-Inquisitors of Saint Raban delve deep into mysteries best left unexplored.', "Kruphix hid the most dire prophecies about humankind where humans would never find them and tritons wouldn't care to read them.", 'Kuldotha, wellspring of molten metal, temple of the goblin horde.', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Lumengrid, site of the Knowledge Pool, source of vedalken arcana.', "Many who cross Sorin's path come down with a sudden and fatal case of being-in-the-way-of-a-millennia-old-vampire.", 'Mastery is achieved when "telling time" becomes "telling time what to do."', 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', 'Not all who remember Urza do so with fondness.', 'Only Sylvok magic could truly capture the perfection of a Mirrodin sunrise.', 'Only the Eldrazi mind thinks in the warped paths required to open the hedrons and tap the power within.', "She doesn't escort the dead to the afterlife, but instead raises them to fight and die again.", 'She follows the old tributaries built when merrows still shaped the tides.', 'She spins a web few can resist. Its sweet aroma sparks chaos in every heart.', 'She talks using riddles her disciples alone can unravel.', 'Some timelines forever fray, branch, and intermingle. Others end abruptly.', 'Sometimes death comes knocking. Sometimes it tears down the walls.', "Stand against the crash of the river's rapids and you will know the power of the naiads.", 'Structures built from darksteel yield to neither assault nor age.', 'The Azorius symbol stares down like a great eye, reminding visitors of the watchful presence of Isperia and her lawmages.', 'The Hold, an illegal research facility in a derelict merchant ship, became a wellspring of renegade intelligence.', 'The Izzet signet is redesigned often, each time becoming closer to a vanity portrait of Niv-Mizzet.', 'The Law of Givesies Backsies is respected by every noble pursuer of shiny things.', 'The Sunbriar druids believe that every life begins in its heart and ends under its hooves.', 'The border between life and death is as thin as a layer of topsoil.', "The distinction of bearing the gods' banner is nothing compared to the glory of being closer to Nyx.", 'The emotional echoes of dryad gatherings attract lost souls.', "The faces of Geth's corpse-dredgers are disturbingly similar.", "The form of the sigil is just as important as the sigil itself. If it's carried on a medallion, its bearer is a master. If it's tattooed on the body, its bearer is a slave.", 'The foundries of Kaladesh run like clockwork under the supervision of their formidable overseers.', 'The greatest masters of the craft abandon tools altogether, shaping metal with hand and mind alone.', 'The horizon is tantalizing in both its uncertainty and its potential.', 'The kor send their thopter kites to see if the land is in a welcoming mood.', 'The maze-like design embodies the core of Azorius law—strict structure designed to test wills and stall change.', 'The militia formed up in the central plaza awaiting the onslaught, but the giants never quite made it.', 'The mizzium-sphere array drove her mind deep into the thought field, where only the rarest motes of genius may be plucked.', 'The river split into many channels as it flowed to the Halimar Sea. Few travelers could follow the same one twice.', "The sky is the dragon's throne, the seat from which it issues its fiery decrees.", 'The true strength of nature is not the raging storm or the charging rhino, but the inexorable vitality of life.', 'The vedalken embed such urns in their living artifact creations.', 'Their war forgotten, the nations of Bant stood united in the face of a common threat.', 'There are precious few names that echo throughout the Multiverse.', 'There were no tombstones in orochi territory. Slain warriors were buried with a tree sapling, so they would become a part of the forest after death.', 'Those who fail to respect power will soon be consumed by it.', 'Those with knowledge are wise to listen to those with imagination.', 'To the Golgari, anything buried is treasure.', 'Tomorrow belongs to those who prepare for it today.', 'Torching Krosa would be pointless. It grows faster than it burns.', 'Waterways carve their routes through the land to reflect the paths the aether streams cut through the clouds.', 'When Asha left Bant, she ensured that the world would have protection and order in her absence.', 'When defeat is near and guidance is scarce, all eyes look in one direction.', 'Whether mechanical or biological, life finds a way to propagate itself.', 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.', "Zombies work best when they're fed appropriately, so it's prudent to let them eat on the job."]
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Konstad', 'Alexander Forssberg', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Bayard Wu', 'Bram Sels', 'Brandon Dorman', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Charles Urbach', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Burdett', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Cliff Childs', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Martin', 'Dermot Power', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Drew Baker', 'Drew Tucker', 'Efflam Mercier', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heather Hudson', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Zapata', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Pavelec', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Josh Hass', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kari Johnson', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karla Ortiz', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Burns', 'Min Yum', 'Nick Percival', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pete Venters', 'Randis Albion', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stanton Feng', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Ellis', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'William Wu', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
