rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Checks the number of cards in your graveyard when it starts resolving. You may drop below seven cards during resolution, but that won’t stop it from resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional mana is not an ability of the land and is not something the land can produce.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The precombat main phase is the first main phase of the turn. All others are postcombat main phases, even if they technically occur before combat.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The “precombat main phase” is the first main phase of the turn. All other main phases are “postcombat main phases.”'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not cause a player to lose if they have less than 3 cards in their library. It allows you to look at and reorder or shuffle whatever remaining cards there might be.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a mountain or forest card if you do not want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Budoka Gardener flips if you control ten or more lands when its ability resolves, even if you don’t use its ability to put a land onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Budoka Gardener flips even if you put a second copy of a legendary land onto the battlefield. You’ll have ten lands on the battlefield while the ability is resolving, so the Gardener flips. Then you will choose one of the legendary lands to keep and put the other into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The controller of the land gets the additional mana, not the controller of the enchantment.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The two mana can be of two different colors. The controller of the land chooses the colors.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2005-08-01\', \'text\': \'A creature is "enchanted" if it has any Auras attached to it.\'}]', "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than three cards in your library, follow the instructions in the order given for any cards that are there.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-07-15\', \'text\': "Adarkar Valkyrie\'s ability can target a token creature, but since token creatures cease to exist when they leave the battlefield, it won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If the Hunting Wilds is kicked, the Forests become creatures with haste permanently.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature is subject to the “summoning sickness” rule: It can only attack, and its {T} abilities can only be activated, if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You’re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it’s still in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If you cast Worm Harvest from your graveyard by using retrace, the land you discard as an additional cost will be counted by Worm Harvest when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting a card with retrace from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again. If it’s your turn, you may do so before any other player may take actions to try to remove it from your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "If combat damage is dealt to players by multiple artifact creatures you control (including, perhaps, Sharding Sphinx itself), Sharding Sphinx\'s ability will trigger that many times. You\'ll get that many Thopter tokens. You\'ll get just one token per creature, no matter how much combat damage that creature dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don\'t exist. You don\'t choose targets for those modes."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can\'t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can\'t cast the spell."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don’t exist. You don’t choose targets for those modes.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can’t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can’t cast the spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect can reduce only the generic portion of the artifact spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of an artifact spell. Rather, it reduces the total cost of the spell, which is the amount you actually pay while casting it. The total cost takes into account additional or alternative costs."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You choose the target when the ability triggers. When the ability resolves, you choose a value for X and decide whether to pay {X}{R}. If you do decide to pay {X}{R}, it’s too late for any player to respond since the ability is already in the midst of resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If Charnelhoard Wurm is dealt lethal damage at the same time it deals damage to an opponent, Charnelhoard Wurm will be in your graveyard by the time you put its ability on the stack. In that case, you can target it with its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Martial Coup checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time the Soldier tokens are put onto the battlefield and the time all other creatures are destroyed. For example, you can\'t sacrifice one of those Soldier tokens to regenerate a Skeletal Kathari."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "You do what the spell says in order. If X is 5 or more, you\'ll put the Soldier tokens onto the battlefield, then you\'ll destroy all other creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "After Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability triggers, if Enigma Sphinx is removed from your graveyard in response, it won\'t be put into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If you control an Enigma Sphinx that\'s owned by another player, it\'s put into that player\'s graveyard from the battlefield, so Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If you have zero or one card left in your library when Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability resolves, Enigma Sphinx is put on the bottom of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "Because Lavalanche doesn\'t target any creatures, it will deal damage to creatures with shroud. Any damage it would deal to creatures with appropriate protection abilities will still be prevented, however."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted player has become an illegal target by the time Lavalanche resolves, Lavalanche doesn\'t resolve. Nothing will be dealt damage."}]', "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'Finest Hour’s second ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” The ability won’t trigger at all unless it’s the first combat phase of the turn.'}, {'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'Unlike other similar cards, Finest Hour doesn’t create a main phase in between the two combat phases. The second combat phase will begin immediately after the current one ends.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted permanent is an illegal target by the time Into the Roil resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Into the Roil tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card if it was kicked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t kicked, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can\'t kick it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "kicked."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they\'re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t kicked, and you can\'t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "To determine a spell\'s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card\'s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay a kicker cost more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Essentially, Sphinx of Jwar Isle lets you play with the top card of your library revealed only to you. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand. You may look at the top card of your library whenever you want, even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes during the process of casting a spell or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until the process of casting the spell or activating the ability ends (all targets are chosen, all costs are paid, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Scute Mob’s ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability won’t trigger at all unless you control five or more lands as your upkeep starts, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control fewer than five lands by the time it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to pay {2} as the ability resolves. You may pay {2} only once per resolution.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If all the cards left in your library are lands, you’ll reveal all of them and put them all into your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The cards you put into your hand this way include one nonland card, plus all the land cards on top of it in your library (if any). If the top card of your library is a nonland card, you just get that one.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as Chain Reaction resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Aura Gnarlid\'s second ability counts each Aura regardless of who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The power of each potential blocking creature is checked against Aura Gnarlid\'s power only as blockers are declared. Once a creature blocks Aura Gnarlid, increasing the Gnarlid\'s power or decreasing the blocking creature\'s power won\'t undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Snake Umbra grants the triggered ability to the creature. It triggers whenever the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of its controller (who is not necessarily an opponent of the Aura\'s controller). In other words, if your Snake Umbra winds up enchanting your opponent\'s creature, that opponent will draw a card whenever that creature damages you."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "When the enchanted creature attacks, all lands controlled by that creature\'s controller (who is not necessarily the Aura\'s controller) untap."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'First the player whose turn it is names a card, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then each player reveals the top card of their library at the same time.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a card a player reveals this way is the card that particular player named, they must put it into their hand. Otherwise, they must put it on the bottom of their library, even if it’s the card a different player named. In no cases can a player leave the revealed card on top of their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If, during your declare attackers step, Darksteel Juggernaut is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having Darksteel Juggernaut attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won\'t cause Darksteel Juggernaut to be put into the graveyard. However, it can be put into the graveyard for a number of other reasons. The most likely reasons are if its toughness is 0 or less or it\'s sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Since Darksteel Juggernaut is itself an artifact, its power and toughness will always be at least 1 while it\'s on the battlefield (unless a spell or ability somehow changes its card type)."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The first ability works in all zones.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the exiled card will trigger when the token is put onto the battlefield. Any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the exiled card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Exiling the card as the first ability resolves is optional. If you choose not to exile it, or you can\'t exile it because the card has somehow left the graveyard before the ability resolves, the ability simply doesn\'t do anything as it resolves. Any card currently exiled by Mimic Vat remains exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Mimic Vat\'s second ability is activated during a turn\'s end step, the token will be exiled at the beginning of the following turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If multiple nontoken creatures are put into their owners\' graveyards from the battlefield at the same time, the imprint ability will trigger that many times. You put the triggered abilities on the stack in any order, so you\'ll determine in which order they resolve. However, since exiling those cards is optional, and choosing to exile a card this way causes the previously exiled cards to return to their owners\' graveyards, the order generally doesn\'t matter: You\'ll wind up with at most one of those cards exiled, and the rest will be in the appropriate graveyards."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the token is a copy of a noncreature card, it will still have haste, though that won\'t matter unless that token somehow becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the token isn\'t exiled when the delayed triggered ability resolves (due to Stifle, perhaps), it remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It continues to have haste."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The imprint ability will trigger whenever a nontoken creature is put into any graveyard from the battlefield, not just your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The token created by the second ability will be a copy of whatever card is exiled with Mimic Vat at the time the ability resolves. This might not be the same card that was exiled with Mimic Vat at the time the ability was activated. It also might not be a creature card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The token is exiled at the beginning of the next end step regardless of who controls it at that time, whether the exiled card is still exiled at that time, or whether Mimic Vat is still on the battlefield at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'You may activate the second ability even if no card has been exiled with Mimic Vat. If no card has been exiled with Mimic Vat by the time the ability resolves, no token will be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may exile a noncreature card with Mimic Vat\'s first ability. For example, if a nontoken artifact that\'s become a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, Mimic Vat\'s first ability triggers and you may exile that card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If a melded permanent dies and triggers Mimic Vat\'s triggered ability, both of its component cards are exiled. As Mimic Vat\'s second ability resolves, its controller chooses one of those cards to make a token copy of."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the creature that dies is an instant or sorcery card that\'s been manifested, Mimic Vat may have a nonpermanent card exiled. You can\'t create a token that\'s a copy of a nonpermanent card. No token is created in this case."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the exiled card will trigger when the token is put onto the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the exiled card will also work.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If Prototype Portal has left the battlefield by the time its second ability resolves, you’ll still put a token onto the battlefield that’s a copy of the exiled card. On the other hand, if Prototype Portal is still on the battlefield at this time but there is no exiled card (because, perhaps, Riftsweeper’s ability caused the exiled card to be put into its owner’s library), no token is created.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost (such as Chalice of the Void), that X is considered to be 0. The {X} in Prototype Portal’s activation cost takes this into account, though it may be greater than 0 if the exiled card has other mana symbols in its mana cost (such as Riptide Replicator).'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'You don’t choose the value of {X}. Rather, the value of X is defined by the activated ability.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'You may not activate the second ability if no card has been exiled with Prototype Portal. In that case, the value of {X} is undefined and can’t be paid.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger because a creature was destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until after Phyrexian Rebirth finishes resolving. This means the Horror creature token can be targeted by those abilities, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature regenerates or has indestructible, it won\'t be counted when determining the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the artifact it\'s copying, as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'Each time the ability triggers, you can pay {2} only one time to get one token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the artifact that caused Mirrorworks\'s ability to trigger has already left the battlefield by the time the ability resolves, you can still pay {2}. If you do, you\'ll still put a token onto the battlefield. That token has the copiable values of the characteristics of that nontoken artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The copiable values of the token\'s characteristics are the same as the copiable values of the characteristics of the artifact it\'s copying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Even if you control more than one Unwinding Clock, you\'ll only untap your artifacts once during each other player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Some effects, such as the one generated by Rust Tick\'s ability, state that an artifact doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s untap step. These effects won\'t apply and stop the artifact from untapping during another player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Those artifacts untap at the same time as the active player\'s permanents. You have no choice about what untaps and can\'t choose to not untap an artifact you control."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability looks for any permanent you control with the creature type Thopter, not just the Thopter tokens previously created by a Thopter Assembly.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Moldgraf Monstrosity’s ability can’t exile it (perhaps because it’s not still in the graveyard when the ability resolves), the two creature cards are still returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If two Moldgraf Monstrosities die simultaneously, the first ability to resolve could return the other Moldgraf Monstrosity to the battlefield. If it does, the second Moldgraf Monstrosity’s ability won’t exile it but it will return two more creature cards to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The damage dealt by Hydra Omnivore as a result of its triggered ability is not combat damage (and doesn’t cause the ability to trigger again).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'All of these Auras will become attached to Bruna before combat damage is dealt. If Bruna is attacking, these Auras become attached before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Only Auras that could legally enchant Bruna may be attached to it, whether they’re being moved from other permanents or being put onto the battlefield. An Aura with “enchant land,” for example, could not be attached to Bruna this way.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke or the alternative cost provided by the morph ability. If it has {X} in its mana cost, X must be 0. However, you can pay optional additional costs, such as kicker, and you must still pay mandatory additional costs, such as the one on Fling."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a permanent spell this way, it will enter the battlefield under your control when it resolves. If you cast an instant or sorcery spell this way, that card will be put into its owner\'s graveyard when it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'The nonland card you cast via the triggered ability is cast as part of the resolution of that ability. Timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type are ignored. Other restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during an opponent\\\'s turn," are not.\'}]', "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Aura spells require a target when they are cast. Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability will affect Aura spells cast targeting it.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability can apply to any cost of a spell, including additional or alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of a spell.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'None of Elderwood Scion’s abilities affect abilities that target it.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Spells you cast that target Elderwood Scion will cost {2} less to cast even if those spells have additional targets. The same is true for spells your opponents cast costing {2} more.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Magmaquake doesn\'t target any creature or planeswalker. For example, it will deal damage to a creature without flying that has hexproof."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only spells and abilities that target cards in graveyards will be affected. Abilities that don’t target cards in graveyards (like the one Tormod’s Crypt has) can still affect those cards.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The last ability only works when Ground Seal is on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "High Priest of Penance\'s ability triggers once for each instance of damage dealt to it, not once for each 1 damage. The ability will trigger even if High Priest of Penance is dealt lethal damage."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you activate Rubblehulk’s bloodrush ability, the value of X is the number of lands you control when that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines Rubblehulk’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The cards put into hands this way are not “drawn.” For example, you couldn’t reveal a card with miracle put into your hand this way (but it also won’t count as the first card you’ve drawn this turn either).'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The loss of life is simultaneous. If this causes both players to end up at 0 or less life, the game will be a draw. In a multiplayer game, players with 0 or less life will lose the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Gate is not a basic land type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The subtype Gate has no special rules significance, but other spells and abilities may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, the value of that X is 0.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The mana value of a creature token is 0 unless that token is a copy of another creature, in which case it copies that creature’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If you cast an Aura targeting an opponent or a permanent controlled by an opponent, you control that Aura when it enters the battlefield. The ability of Ajani\'s Chosen will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The ability doesn\'t trigger until the enchantment enters the battlefield. This means that, for example, you can\'t cast an Aura with enchant creature if there are no legal targets available, hoping to enchant the Cat token. Ajani\'s Chosen itself, however, may be a legal target for the Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "You may attach the Aura to the Cat token only if the Aura and the token are both on the battlefield when the triggered ability resolves. If the Aura leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, it won\'t become attached to the token. If the token leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the Aura won\'t move."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'You may attach the Aura to the token only if it can legally enchant that token. For example, if the enchantment that entered the battlefield is an Aura with "enchant land," it won\\\'t move.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Daxos doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If Daxos is blocked by a creature, raising that creature\'s power to 3 or greater won\'t change or undo the block."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If the exiled card is a land card, you won\'t gain any life and you won\'t be able to play the land."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs to cast the exiled card. You may pay alternative or additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Conversely, continuous effects generated by static abilities (such as an Aura that granted the appropriate ability) would resume applying if the Archetype left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you and an opponent each control the same Archetype, no creature controlled by any player will have the appropriate ability.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'The Archetype’s second ability applies to each creature controlled by any of your opponents, no matter when it entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'While you control an Archetype, continuous effects generated by the resolution of spells and abilities that would give the specified ability to creatures your opponents control aren’t created. For example, if you control Archetype of Courage, a spell cast by an opponent that gives creatures they control first strike wouldn’t cause the creatures to have first strike, even if later in the turn Archetype of Courage left the battlefield. (If the spell has additional effects, such as raising the power of the creatures, those effects will apply as normal.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If the enchantment card is an Aura, you choose a legal player or object for that Aura to enchant as it enters the battlefield. This doesn’t target the player or object, so it’s possible to enchant an opposing creature with hexproof this way, for example. If there’s no player or object the Aura can legally enchant, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you return an enchantment creature card with bestow to the battlefield, you can’t pay its bestow cost. It won’t be an Aura and can’t be attached to a creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability\'s activation cost. A player can\'t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability’s activation cost. A player can’t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Once Scuttling Doom Engine has been blocked by a creature, reducing that creature’s power to 2 or less won’t change or undo that block.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "You must choose six different legal targets in order to cast Aether Gale. If some, but not all, of those targets become illegal before Aether Gale resolves, the remaining legal targets will be put into their owners\' hands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "An Aura doesn\'t necessarily need the enchant creature ability for the abilities of Sage\'s Reverie to count it. For example, an Aura with enchant permanent that\'s attached to a creature will count."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Count the number of Auras you control attached to creatures as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves to determine how many cards to draw. This will include Sage\'s Reverie as long as it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A card’s owner is public information at all times. If the two cards you exile are owned by different players (perhaps because you gained control of a Jeskai Infiltrator owned by your opponent), which card is which is no longer hidden from your opponent. That player will know which face-down creature they own.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If Jeskai Infiltrator isn’t on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you’ll manifest just the top card of your library.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you manifest a card owned by an opponent and you leave the game, that card is exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The pile is shuffled to disguise from your opponents which manifested creature is which. After you manifest the cards, you can look at them.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Aminatou’s second ability or Adarkar Valkyrie’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Some previous Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. Although a double-faced card can enter the battlefield face down, one already on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are no cards in this set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using a morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is turned face up, the “Form” will continue to enchant it.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you have no cards in your library as the ability resolves, the “Form” will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You’ll still manifest the top card of your library even if the “Form” isn’t on the battlefield as its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Aminatou’s second ability or Adarkar Valkyrie’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Some previous Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. Although a double-faced card can enter the battlefield face down, one already on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are no cards in this set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using a morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is turned face up, the “Form” will continue to enchant it.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you have no cards in your library as the ability resolves, the “Form” will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You’ll still manifest the top card of your library even if the “Form” isn’t on the battlefield as its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Aminatou’s second ability or Adarkar Valkyrie’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Some previous Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. Although a double-faced card can enter the battlefield face down, one already on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are no cards in this set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using a morph ability, and so on).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The last ability will trigger, at most, once per combat damage step per player. However, if at least one artifact creature you control has first strike and others don\'t, or if an artifact creature you control has double strike, the ability could trigger twice per combat: once in each combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Thopter Spy Network\'s first ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless you control an artifact as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you don\'t control an artifact as it resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon can reduce alternative costs such as bestow costs.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon’s first ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of an enchantment spell.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast an enchantment spell, apply those before applying cost reductions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The ability defining Zendikar Incarnate’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield. Zendikar Incarnate’s power changes as the number of lands you control does.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Centaur Vinecrasher and a land card are put into your graveyard at the same time, Centaur Vinecrasher’s last ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter what zone Centaur Vinecrasher was previously in.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'Grapple with the Past doesn’t target the card to return to your hand. After putting the top three cards of your library into your graveyard, you may choose from among any creature or land cards there.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'Players decide whether or not they’re discarding a card in turn order. Each player will know if previous players are discarding, but not what they are discarding. All cards to be discarded are set aside, then revealed and discarded simultaneously. Similarly, all basic land cards searched for are set aside, then revealed simultaneously.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger during the resolution of Saheeli\'s Artistry will wait to be put onto the stack until Saheeli\'s Artistry finishes resolving. An ability that triggers on the first token entering the battlefield may target the second token and vice versa."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the copied permanent is a token, the token created with Saheeli\'s Artistry copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that that created that token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied permanent is an Altered Ego), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you choose both modes, the tokens enter one at a time. Thus, if the token created by the second mode has an ability that triggers “whenever an artifact enters the battlefield,” the token created by the first mode will already be on the battlefield and won\'t cause that ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you choose both modes, you may target a single artifact creature twice and get two copies of that artifact creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you chose the second mode, the token is an artifact in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Explore\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Explore resolves; Explore fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps a land you\'ll play later."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Explore when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw a card when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Explores in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Urban Evolution."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6}{W}{W}{W} to cast Entreat the Angels.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Entreat the Angels’s converted mana cost is based on its mana cost of {X}{X}{W}{W}{W}, even if you’re casting it for its miracle cost. For example, if you cast Entreat the Angels for its miracle cost and choose 4 for X, its converted mana cost is 11.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word “draw,” the card wasn’t drawn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to cast it using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'It’s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven’t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you’ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won’t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it’s the first card you’ve drawn that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don’t wish to cast it at that time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don’t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Each player chooses the order that creatures they own are put onto the bottom of their library. This order isn’t revealed to other players.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word “draw,” the card wasn’t drawn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to cast it using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'It’s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven’t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you’ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won’t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it’s the first card you’ve drawn that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don’t wish to cast it at that time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don’t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you\'ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn\'t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'All players get to see which card you return to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because Haunted Fengraf\'s ability doesn\'t target any creature card, any creature card put into the graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The creature card returned to your hand is chosen at random as the ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won\'t yet know what card will be returned."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A creature attacking a planeswalker you control won\'t cause Coveted Jewel\'s last ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Coveted Jewel\'s last ability resolves after blockers are chosen but before combat damage is dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Coveted Jewel\'s last ability triggers after you declare blockers (or declare no blockers at all) if any attacking creatures are unblocked. It doesn\'t matter if some attacking creatures were blocked."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If more than one opponent attacks you at the same time, Coveted Jewel\'s last ability triggers for each of them. You choose which player ends up with Coveted Jewel, but each of them draws three cards and has a chance to activate its mana ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A creature with indestructible or a creature that regenerates won\'t count as having been “destroyed this way.”"}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a creature with flying would be destroyed, but an Aura with the totem armor ability is destroyed instead, Whiptongue Hydra won\'t count that creature or that Aura as a “creature destroyed this way.”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both. Similarly, a permanent with bestow is either a creature or an Aura, but not both."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Bestow is an alternative cost to cast the spell with bestow. It can\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”"}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a bestow cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow still resolves if its target is illegal. Instead of entering the battlefield as an Aura, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield or becomes an illegal creature for the Aura to enchant. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both. Similarly, a permanent with bestow is either a creature or an Aura, but not both."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Bestow is an alternative cost to cast the spell with bestow. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a bestow cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow still resolves if its target is illegal. Instead of entering the battlefield as an Aura, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield or becomes an illegal creature for the Aura to enchant. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "All creatures your opponents control are affected by Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability, not just those controlled by the player it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Any power- or toughness-modifying effects (those that give +N/+N, for example) and counters will apply to the creature\'s new base power and toughness, even if they started to apply before Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control three artifacts as Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability resolves, it has no effect. If you do, the effect continues to apply even if you lose control of Vedalken Humiliator or your artifacts later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t lose power, toughness, or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability overwrites all previous effects that set an affected creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply to a creature after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "All other tokens you control become a copy of the chosen token, even those that aren\'t of the same type. For example, if you control a Treasure artifact token and choose the Myr token Brudiclad just created, your Treasure will become a copy of the Myr."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Brudiclad copies only the values defined as the original token was created (unless that token is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the chosen token is copying something else (for example, if the chosen token was previously affected by Brudiclad\'s triggered ability), then your tokens become copies of whatever the chosen token copied."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The effect of Brudiclad\'s triggered ability lasts indefinitely. It continues to apply after Brudiclad leaves the game."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The last effect of Brudiclad\'s triggered ability affects all tokens you control other than the chosen token, including the token that was just created if that isn\'t the chosen token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'Once a creature token that came under your control this turn has legally attacked, causing it to lose haste by removing Brudiclad from the battlefield won’t cause that token to stop attacking.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost is reduced for each attacking creature, not just creatures attacking you. It even counts your attacking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If there are enough attacking creatures, Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost can be reduced to {0}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast a spell is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control five attacking creatures, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, Ancient Stone Idol costs {5} to cast. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost, and it still costs only {5} to cast.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”"}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli\'s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Geode Golem\'s triggered ability triggers even if it\'s dealt lethal damage at the same time it deals combat damage to a player."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Geode Golem\'s triggered ability triggers even if your commander isn\'t in the command zone at the time Geode Golem deals combat damage to a player. If your commander finds its way there before the trigger resolves, you can cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as bestow costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as the commander tax, those must be paid to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you wish to cast your commander without paying its mana cost, you must cast it while the triggered ability of Geode Golem is resolving. You can\'t cast for free it later in the turn. It may be cast at a time you normally wouldn\'t be able to cast a creature spell, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this card only from your graveyard”) are enforced."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\'s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\'s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Bloodtracker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many cards you draw. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Bloodtracker and it gets six -1/-1 counters, you\'ll draw three cards. That\'s because Bloodtracker\'s triggered ability checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If multiple land cards are put into your graveyard at once, Turntimber Sower\'s first ability triggers only once. This could happen because an effect put them there from your library at once, or because they were destroyed at the same time (such as two land creatures that were dealt lethal combat damage), for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If no opponent controls more lands than you, you\'ll search your library and shuffle it, but you won\'t be able to find any Plains cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can find fewer Plains cards than the difference, perhaps because you don\'t have that many Plains cards left in your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won\'t get its effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand as Lord Windgrace\'s first ability resolves, you\'ll discard nothing then you\'ll draw one card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving Lord Windgrace\'s last ability, you create six Cat Warrior tokens even if fewer than six nonland permanents are destroyed. However, if you choose any targets for the ability and each of them becomes an illegal target, the ability doesn\'t resolve and you don\'t create any tokens."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Activating Primordial Mist’s last ability doesn’t trigger abilities that trigger “when [something] is turned face up.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can’t cast it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Aminatou’s second ability or Adarkar Valkyrie’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you activate Primordial Mist’s last ability but don’t play the exiled card this turn, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you somehow control a face-down token, you may exile it to activate Primordial Mist’s last ability, but you won’t be able to cast that token.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Some previous Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. Although a double-faced card can enter the battlefield face down, one already on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are no cards in this set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may play a land exiled this way only if you have an available land play this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using a morph ability, and so on).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each card you play.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs such as evoke costs.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It’s never both. Similarly, a permanent with bestow is either a creature or an Aura, but not both.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Auras attached to a creature don’t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Bestow is an alternative cost to cast the spell with bestow. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can’t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an enchanted enchantment creature attacks, you draw only one card for it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If multiple enchanted or enchantment creatures you control attack, you draw that many cards.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The phrase “you control” applies to both “enchanted creature” and “enchantment creature.” That is, Kestia’s ability triggers when an enchanted creature you control attacks, not any player’s enchanted creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a bestow cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow still resolves if its target is illegal. Instead of entering the battlefield as an Aura, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn’t put into its owner’s graveyard if the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield or becomes an illegal creature for the Aura to enchant. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it’s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A token creature can die just like a nontoken creature before ceasing to exist. Ravenous Slime can replace this by exiling the token.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Ravenous Slime dies at the same time as an opponent’s creatures, the opponent’s creatures are exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an opponent’s commander would die, that player may choose to save it and move it to the command zone before Ravenous Slime gets a taste of it, or that player may choose for Ravenous Slime to exile their commander and then save their commander from exile and move it to the command zone. Ravenous Slime receives +1/+1 counters only in the latter case.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If more than one replacement effect tries to change where a dying creature ends up, that creature’s controller chooses which effect applies. For example, if two players control a Ravenous Slime, a creature controlled by a third player will be exiled by the Ravenous Slime of that third player’s choice, and the other Ravenous Slime won’t get +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause this creature to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The exiled creature’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'An “artifact source” is a permanent, spell, or card in any zone with the card type “artifact.” For example, Tawnos’s ability can target a cycling ability you’ve activated if the discarded card is an artifact card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any choices made when the ability resolves won’t have been made yet when it’s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves. If a triggered ability asks you to pay a cost (such as that of Mirrorworks), you pay that cost for the copy separately.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to “the exiled card,” it refers to all cards exiled by the ability and the copy. For example, if Tidehollow Sculler’s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied and two cards are exiled, they both return when Tidehollow Sculler leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the ability divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets (for example, the ability of Verdurous Gearhulk), the division and number of targets can’t be changed. If you choose new targets, you must choose the same number of targets.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the ability is modal (that is, if it says, “Choose one —” or similar), the mode is copied and can’t be changed.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the activated ability’s cost contains a choice, such as a creature to sacrifice or a number of counters to remove, the copy uses that same information. You can’t pay the cost again, even if you want to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about “the exiled card.” When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Soul Foundry’s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Soul Foundry’s other ability is the sum of the two cards’ converted mana costs. As the ability resolves, you create a token copy of each card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tawnos’s ability targets an ability that is on the stack and creates another instance of that ability on the stack. It doesn’t cause any object to gain an ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The source of the copy is the same as the source of the original ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at the beginning of” in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'All of the artifacts put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they’ll see each other.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Saheeli’s Directive considers the individual converted mana costs of the artifact cards you reveal. The sum of their converted mana costs may be greater than X.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli’s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you’ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'All of the non-Aura enchantments put onto the battlefield with Estrid’s third ability enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they’ll see each other.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'An enchanted permanent is one with an Aura attached to it. Enchantment permanents you control that don’t have Auras attached to them aren’t enchanted.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Aura cards returned with Estrid’s third ability may enchant non-Aura enchantments put onto the battlefield with that ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Estrid’s second ability can’t target Estrid, but the Mask token may legally enchant Estrid if you find a way to move it onto her.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Estrid’s second ability might target a permanent that can’t have the Aura token attached to it. In this case, the token isn’t created at all.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Akroma’s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an Aura card can’t enchant anything, it remains in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an Aura with totem armor is itself enchanted by another Aura with totem armor, destroying either the first Aura or the permanent it enchants will result in only the second Aura being destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You choose what each returning Aura will enchant just before that Aura enters the battlefield. The chosen recipient must be able to legally be enchanted by the Aura. This doesn’t target the player or permanent it will enchant, so an opponent’s permanent with hexproof may be chosen this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Although the token is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature card will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature card] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature card] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature card will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Gyrus’s token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any effects that modified it before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Gyrus enters the battlefield without being cast, then no mana was spent to cast it. It enters the battlefield without any +1/+1 counters. If no other effects are increasing its toughness at that time, it will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If another creature enters the battlefield as a copy of Gyrus, consider how much mana was spent to cast that creature to determine how many +1/+1 counters it enters with.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the copied creature card has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The amount of mana you spent to cast Gyrus is usually equal to its converted mana cost, normally 3 plus the value chosen for X. However, you also include any additional costs you pay, including the commander tax.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker the token is attacking. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Gyrus is attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Aminatou’s second ability can target any permanent you own, including those another player controls.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'As Aminatou’s third ability resolves, you choose a direction, then each player takes control of their new permanents at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. The effect of Aminatou’s third ability stops applying to all permanents that player controlled and control of them reverts to their previous controller.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a two-player game, each player gains control of each permanent the other controls (aside from Aminatou) no matter which direction you choose.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once the exiled permanent returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The effect of Aminatou’s third ability lasts indefinitely. It continues to apply after Aminatou (or her controller) leaves the game.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You draw a card and put one back all while Aminatou’s first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'An artifact is "tapped for mana" when a player activates a mana ability of an artifact that includes {T} (the tap symbol). Notably, tapping an artifact to pay for a spell with the improvise keyword is not tapping that artifact for mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an opponent taps an artifact for mana during your turn, you\'ll gain control of it and keep control of it until the end of your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If multiple players each control Treasure Nabbers, an artifact tapped for mana will make quite a journey. For example, if player A taps an artifact for mana during their turn, and players B and C are the next players in turn order who control Treasure Nabbers, C\'s ability resolves before B and C gains control of the artifact. Then B gains control of the artifact. B keeps it during their turn, and then C regains control of the artifact once B\'s effect expires, then A will have it back after C\'s expires. However, if B or C taps the artifact for mana, one of them will take it from the other. You may need to pay very careful attention to which effects are still in effect, which have expired, and who owns what."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the artifact leaves the battlefield, Treasure Nabber doesn\'t nab it from the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you control multiple Treasure Nabbers, their effects all expire at the same time. You won\'t keep an artifact for any longer."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If that player controls any nabbed treasures, the effect giving that player control of those artifacts ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The artifact remains tapped when you gain control of it.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of a copied artifact will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this artifact] enters the battlefield” or “[this artifact] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the artifact will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a copied artifact is a token, the token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Saheeli’s second ability reduces only generic mana in the cost of the next spell you cast.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The total cost to cast a spell is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three artifacts, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, Saheeli’s second ability will reduce the cost of a spell you cast by {3}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost, and it remains reduced by {3}.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Saheeli’s second ability). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'While resolving Saheeli’s third ability, each token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this artifact] enters the battlefield” or “[this artifact] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen artifact will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Each Storm\'s triggered ability can copy the Storm spell even if that spell is countered before that ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Each Storm\'s triggered ability counts only how many times you\'ve cast your commander from the command zone before that triggered ability resolves. If you cast your commander again later, you won\'t get another copy."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Each copy resolves one at a time. Any abilities that trigger on the artifact token entering the battlefield resolve before the next copy resolves. The original spell is the last to resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the copied artifact is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If your commander was countered, that time you cast it still counts.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The copies are created on the stack, so they\'re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as the Storm\'s ability itself) won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you have multiple commanders, you\'ll copy this spell for each time you\'ve cast either of them. For example, if you\'ve cast one commander once and one twice, you\'ll copy this spell three times."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied enchantment will trigger when Estrid’s Invocation enters the battlefield. Any “as [this enchantment] enters the battlefield” or “[this enchantment] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen enchantment will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Estrid’s Invocation copies exactly what was printed on the original enchantment (unless that enchantment is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that enchantment is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Estrid’s Invocation doesn’t copy an enchantment as it enters the battlefield, it won’t have the ability to exile it at the beginning of your upkeep. You can’t have it copy itself to get this ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Estrid’s Invocation somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another enchantment, it can’t become a copy of that enchantment. You may choose only an enchantment that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen enchantment is a token, Estrid’s Invocation copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Estrid’s Invocation doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen enchantment is an Aura but Estrid’s Invocation won’t be able to legally enchant anything, Estrid’s Invocation remains in its current zone and doesn’t enter the battlefield. If Estrid’s Invocation is on the stack, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen enchantment is an Aura, you choose what it enchants just before Estrid’s Invocation enters the battlefield. The chosen recipient must be able to legally be enchanted by the Aura Estrid’s Invocation will be. This doesn’t target the player or permanent it will enchant, so an opponent’s permanent with hexproof may be chosen this way.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen enchantment is copying something else (for example, if the chosen enchantment is another Estrid’s Invocation), then Estrid’s Invocation enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen enchantment copied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the copied enchantment has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Estrid’s Invocation returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. You must choose an enchantment that’s currently on the battlefield to copy (or to not copy anything). Auras that were attached to it will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any counters that were on it cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any power- or toughness-modifying effects (those that give +N/+N, for example) and counters will apply to the creature’s new base power and toughness, even if they started to apply before Octopus Umbra became attached.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Akroma’s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Octopus Umbra overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply to a creature after Octopus Umbra becomes attached to it will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because all attackers are chosen at once, a spell cast this way can’t affect which creatures you can attack with, but it can affect which creatures will be able to block.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X if you cast it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card doesn’t have an odd converted mana cost or if that card does but you choose not to cast it, you draw a card. Keep in mind that revealing a card doesn’t cause it to change zones. This means that the card you draw will be the card you revealed.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to cast the revealed card without paying its mana cost, you must cast it while Yennett’s triggered ability is resolving; you can’t cast for free it later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Tuvasa may become lethal if some of your enchantments leave the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tuvasa’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Heavenly Blademaster leaves the battlefield during that turn or if an Aura or Equipment is removed from it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t try to attach an Aura or Equipment to Heavenly Blademaster if that Aura or Equipment can’t legally be attached to it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t move any Auras or Equipment until Heavenly Blademaster’s triggered ability is resolving. If Heavenly Blademaster is no longer on the battlefield, the Auras and Equipment you intended to attach to it remain as they were.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You’re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting a card with retrace from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In most cases, at least one card in your library (the card you put on the bottom of your library) will share a card type with the target permanent. However, in some unusual situations, no cards in your library share a card type with the permanent (perhaps because the permanent was a token or its types were changed). In that case, you’ll reveal your entire library, put nothing onto the battlefield, and put the cards back in a random order.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Reality Scramble can target any permanent you own, including those another player controls. A token’s owner is the player who created it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The target permanent’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its types.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again. If it’s your turn, you may do so before any other player may take actions to try to remove it from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You’ll stop as soon as you reveal a card that shares any card types with the target permanent. For example, if the target permanent is an artifact creature, you’ll stop as soon as you reveal a card that’s an artifact or a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can’t cast it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a nonland card has multiple types, such as an artifact creature, you may cast it as either of those types. For example, you could cast one artifact creature as your artifact card and another artifact creature as your creature card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you exile a land with another card type, you can’t play it later in the turn. You can only put it onto the battlefield at the time Aminatou’s Augury instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to put a land card onto the battlefield, you do so while Aminatou’s Augury is resolving, before you’re allowed to cast any of the other cards. You may do this even if you’ve already played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each spell you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability can copy the Storm spell even if that spell is countered before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability counts only how many times you’ve cast your commander from the command zone before that triggered ability resolves. If you cast your commander again later, you won’t get another copy.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each copy resolves one at a time. Any abilities that trigger on the permanent entering the battlefield resolve before the next copy resolves. The original spell is the last to resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you choose not to put the nonland permanent card you reveal onto the battlefield, you’ll put it on the bottom of your library with the other cards.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your commander was countered, that time you cast it still counts.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your library no longer has any nonland permanent cards, you’ll reveal your library and then put it back in a random order.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copies are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as the Storm’s ability itself) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you’ll copy this spell for each time you’ve cast either of them. For example, if you’ve cast one commander once and one twice, you’ll copy this spell three times.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability can copy the Storm spell even if that spell is countered before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability counts only how many times you’ve cast your commander from the command zone before that triggered ability resolves. If you cast your commander again later, you won’t get another copy.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Fury Storm can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra’s Pyrohelix), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Lavalanche does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you copy a spell, you control the copy. It will resolve before the original spell does.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your commander was countered, that time you cast it still counts.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copies are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as the Storm’s ability itself) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. This means, for example, that Fury Storm’s copies may target Fury Storm itself, but this won’t trigger the copy’s “when you cast this spell” ability, and it won’t increase the number of copies of other spells you end up with.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them, but not how many targets there are. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you’ll copy this spell for each time you’ve cast either of them. For example, if you’ve cast one commander once and one twice, you’ll copy this spell three times.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability can copy the Storm spell even if that spell is countered before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability counts only how many times you’ve cast your commander from the command zone before that triggered ability resolves. If you cast your commander again later, you won’t get another copy.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your commander was countered, that time you cast it still counts.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The amount of life to lose is determined only as Skull Storm resolves. For example, if an opponent controls no creatures and has 30 life when you cast Skull Storm and make two copies, the first to resolve causes that opponent to lose 15 life (so they have 15 life left), the second causes that opponent to lose 8 life (7 life left), and the original spell causes that player to lose 4 life, leaving the player at 3 life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copies are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as the Storm’s ability itself) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you’ll copy this spell for each time you’ve cast either of them. For example, if you’ve cast one commander once and one twice, you’ll copy this spell three times.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability can copy the Storm spell even if that spell is countered before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each Storm’s triggered ability counts only how many times you’ve cast your commander from the command zone before that triggered ability resolves. If you cast your commander again later, you won’t get another copy.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your commander was countered, that time you cast it still counts.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copies are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as the Storm’s ability itself) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you’ll copy this spell for each time you’ve cast either of them. For example, if you’ve cast one commander once and one twice, you’ll copy this spell three times.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each creature’s controller still chooses which player or planeswalker the creature attacks.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t attack yourself or your own planeswalkers to give Thantis +1/+1 counters, but Thantis appreciates the way you think.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli’s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you’ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Evoke is an alternative cost to cast the spell with evoke. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature with evoke enters the battlefield without being cast, you won’t have to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The ability that causes you to sacrifice an evoked creature is a triggered ability. Players may respond to this triggered ability while the creature is still on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as an evoke cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Emissary of Grudges leaves the battlefield and returns, it’s considered a new object. You may choose a new opponent and you may activate its last ability again.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you didn’t choose an opponent when Emissary of Grudges entered the battlefield, you can’t pay the cost to activate its last ability. This will usually happen because you gained control of another player’s Emissary of Grudges or because a creature already on the battlefield became a copy of Emissary of Grudges.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have more than one Emissary of Grudges, you may choose a different opponent for each one. Be careful to keep track of which opponent is chosen for each Emissary of Grudges.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The activated ability of Emissary of Grudges can affect a spell or ability that has multiple targets, even if some of those targets aren’t you or permanents you control. You can choose new targets as long as at least one of those targets is you or a permanent you control.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are several ways to secretly choose an opponent, including writing that player’s name on a piece of paper that’s kept with Emissary of Grudges.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Myth Unbound leaves the battlefield at the same time as your commander is put into the command zone, its last ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Myth Unbound’s cost reduction applies after you apply the commander tax. In effect, this reduces the commander tax to {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Myth Unbound’s cost reduction applies even if you’re casting your commander from a zone other than the command zone.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If another player is somehow able to cast your commander, Myth Unbound’s first ability applies to that player’s spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Sower of Discord is dealt lethal damage at the same time that one of the chosen players is dealt damage, its ability will cause the second player to lose life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Sower of Discord’s controller is dealt damage that causes them to lose the game at the same time that either of the chosen players is dealt damage, Sower of Discord’s triggered ability won’t resolve and the other chosen player won’t lose life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Sower of Discord’s triggered ability causes the second player to lose life. This isn’t damage and it’s not caused by the source that dealt damage to the first player.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must choose two different players. You can be one of those players.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Xantcha can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a player creates a token that’s a copy of Xantcha, the player who creates the token is its owner, not the player under whose control it enters the battlefield. This is a change from previous rules.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The player who draws a card when Xantcha’s last ability resolves is the player who activated the ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Xantcha’s controller may activate its last ability. In this case, the same player loses 2 life and draws a card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Xantcha’s first ability is a replacement effect that modifies how it enters the battlefield, not a triggered ability. Players can’t take actions (such as activating its last ability) while Xantcha’s on the battlefield before it’s controlled by another player.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Xantcha’s owner leaves the game, Xantcha leaves the game with them. If Xantcha’s controller leaves the game, Xantcha is exiled. This is a change from previous rulings due to Xantcha’s updated wording.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature’s power is less than 0 when it’s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Nylea’s Colossus -8/-0 so that it’s a -2/6 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+6, and it will become a -4/12 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. Toughness is doubled similarly.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a player has zero cards in hand, controls no lands, or controls no creatures, other players will have to discard their entire hand, sacrifice all of their lands, or sacrifice all of their creatures, as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Players can\'t take actions once Magus of the Balance\'s ability begins to resolve until it\'s done resolving. If any abilities trigger during this process, they\'re put onto the stack after it\'s done resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When Magus of the Balance\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses an appropriate number of lands they control (which may be zero if that player doesn\'t control more lands than the player who controls the fewest). Then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made by previous players. Finally, all of the chosen lands are sacrificed simultaneously. Players repeat this process for cards in hand and creatures they control, except while choosing cards in hand, players won\'t know the identity of cards chosen by the previous players."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card is a land, you can play it only if it’s your turn and you haven’t yet played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to play the exiled card, you must play it while the last ability of Djinn of Wishes is resolving. You can’t play it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn’t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this spell only during combat”) are enforced.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word “draw,” the card wasn’t drawn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to cast it using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'It’s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven’t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you’ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won’t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it’s the first card you’ve drawn that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don’t wish to cast it at that time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don’t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word “draw,” the card wasn’t drawn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to cast it using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'It’s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can’t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell “without paying its mana cost.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven’t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you’ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won’t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it’s the first card you’ve drawn that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don’t wish to cast it at that time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don’t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target commander is somehow a creature and a planeswalker, most likely because it’s Gideon, it receives both kinds of counters.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target commander is somehow neither a creature nor a planeswalker (such as Arixmethes, Slumbering Isle may be), it receives no counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If there are no other enchantments on the battlefield, the triggered ability of Enchanter’s Bane must target Enchanter’s Bane.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won’t get its effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Loyal Unicorn’s effect will prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to creatures you control, even if those creatures weren’t on the battlefield or weren’t creatures when the effect resolved.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Loyal Unicorn’s lieutenant ability has resolved while you control your commander, its effects persist this turn even if you lose control of your commander or Loyal Unicorn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won’t get its effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Survivor is a creature type. Varchild’s second ability affects any creatures your opponents control that happen to be Survivors, not just the Survivor tokens it creates. Similarly, its third ability affects all creatures that happen to be Survivors. A creature that’s all creature types is a Survivor.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The player who creates the Survivor tokens owns them, not Varchild’s controller.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Varchild’s second ability isn’t locked in as Survivor tokens are created. For example, if a player gains control of Varchild, that player’s Survivor tokens may attack Varchild’s former controller.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The number of cards you discard and the amount of life you gain are both equal to the number of Zombies you attack with, even if you draw a different number of cards somehow.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Varina’s first ability counts the number of Zombies you attacked with, even if some of those Zombies leave combat before the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can activate Isolated Watchtower’s ability if you control more lands than an opponent, as long as at least one opponent also controls two or more lands than you.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You’ll draw only one card for each opponent attacking you or your planeswalkers, no matter how many creatures they’re attacking with. If multiple opponents are attacking you or your planeswalkers at once, you’ll draw one card for each of those opponents.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Dismantling Blow tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw two cards if it was kicked. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do draw two cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Abilities that define a * in a creature\'s power and toughness apply while that card is in exile, but abilities that add or subtract power and toughness don\'t. For example, the ability of Crusader of Odric applies to determine Duplicant\'s power and toughness, but the ability of Death\'s Shadow doesn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s base power and toughness change to the imprinted card\'s power and toughness. Counters and other effects that modify Duplicant\'s power and toughness still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s power and toughness are constantly updated if the exiled card\'s power and/or toughness change."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a melded permanent or a merged permanent is exiled by Duplicant\'s triggered ability, that ability\'s controller chooses the relative timestamp of the exiled cards. Duplicant looks at the information of the one with the latest timestamp."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before a turn\'s end step begins, Deathreap Ritual\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Deathreap Ritual entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You draw one card when the ability resolves, not one card per creature that died during the turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Arixmethes can tap for mana the turn it enters the battlefield as long as it has slumber counters on it. If you can figure out how to untap it, that is.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Arixmethes can\'t be played as a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Arixmethes isn\'t a land until after it has entered the battlefield. Effects such as that of Blood Moon won\'t affect its enters-the-battlefield ability. Similarly, replacement effects that modify how creatures you control enter the battlefield will see Arixmethes entering as a creature rather than a land. However, triggered abilities (such as landfall abilities) will see that a land has entered the battlefield and not a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Arixmethes\'s effect causing it to be a land overwrites any earlier effects that gave it additional types. For example, a Phyrexian Metamorph that copies Arixmethes will be a land, not an artifact land, until its slumber counters are removed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Arixmethes\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Once Arixmethes is a creature again, it can attack on the same turn as long as you\'ve controlled it since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "While Arixmethes is a land, it\'s still green and blue, it\'s still legendary, and its mana value is still 4."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an artifact creature you control may become lethal if Chief of the Foundry leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Bosh can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If an artifact on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Changeling applies in all zones, not just the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Crib Swap tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player will create a Shapeshifter token."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Tribal is a card type (like creature or instant), not a supertype (like legendary).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Activating Yuriko\'s commander ninjutsu ability isn\'t the same as casting Yuriko as a spell. You won\'t have to pay the commander tax to activate that ability, and activating that ability won\'t increase the commander tax to pay later."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Although the ninjutsu ability has the creature enter the battlefield attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Commander ninjutsu is a variant of ninjutsu that can be activated from the command zone as well as from your hand. Just as with regular ninjutsu, the Ninja enters attacking the player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'You can discard either one artifact card or two cards which may or may not be artifacts. If you really want to, you can discard two artifact cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability copies Return to Dust, the copy exiles only the first target artifact or enchantment. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Return to Dust can always target a second artifact or enchantment; it just won\'t exile it if it\'s not your main phase when you cast Return to Dust."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step in this case, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The creature put onto the battlefield with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won’t normally deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because it’s not on the battlefield yet, casting Sigil of the Empty Throne won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you choose to shuffle your library, that includes the three cards you just looked at and put back on top of it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If Soul Snare\'s ability targets a creature that\'s attacking a planeswalker you control, but that planeswalker is no longer on the battlefield as the ability tries to resolve, the attacking creature will be an illegal target and Soul Snare\'s ability won\'t exile that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Sacrificing Soul Snare is part of the cost to activate the ability. Once you activate the ability, no player can do anything to Soul Snare to stop you from activating it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you activate Yavimaya Elder\'s last ability, its triggered ability will trigger and go on the stack. It will resolve first, meaning you\'ll do the search and shuffle before drawing a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The ability is independent from the spell that caused it to trigger. Notably, if the enchantment spell is countered or doesn\'t resolve for any other reason, you\'ll still draw a card (unless something specifically counters the triggered ability)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Serra Avatar is no longer in your graveyard when its triggered ability resolves, you still shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The ability that defines Serra Avatar’s power and toughness works in all zones, not only the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]']
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451482&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a28164f6-ad4a-43f1-b8a0-a4bfb6d0bfb3', 'multiverseId': 451482}, 'multiverseid': 451482}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451730&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca1f12e6-55cc-4f5c-ab64-21566c317984', 'multiverseId': 451730}, 'multiverseid': 451730}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451978&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea086ec5-ea69-4626-9269-8f868df6617c', 'multiverseId': 451978}, 'multiverseid': 451978}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452226&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0621ea8b-42a3-45ca-a637-aed5cc181fac', 'multiverseId': 452226}, 'multiverseid': 452226}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452474&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95972401-1339-4b6c-8a85-d66e61d47128', 'multiverseId': 452474}, 'multiverseid': 452474}, {'name': 'Estepe Remota', 'text': 'Estepe Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452722&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0c4cb16-2465-4255-a7bc-c299ab85c1e4', 'multiverseId': 452722}, 'multiverseid': 452722}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgelegener Wachturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Hellsicht 1, dann kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek aufdecken. Falls auf diese Weise eine Standardland-Karte aufgedeckt wird, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner mindestens zwei Länder mehr kontrolliert als du.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2127e48e-a7e4-4757-b9e9-5e5a4491cb5c\', \'multiverseId\': 450719}, \'multiverseid\': 450719}, {\'name\': \'Atalaya aislada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Adivina 1, luego puedes mostrar la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si se muestra una carta de tierra básica de esta manera, ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Activa esta habilidad solo si un oponente controla al menos dos tierras más que tú.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7b1960-441d-4c98-9682-3ace80e94579\', \'multiverseId\': 450778}, \'multiverseid\': 450778}, {\'name\': \'Tour de guet isolée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Regard 1, puis vous pouvez révéler la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si une carte de terrain de base est révélée de cette manière, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. N\'activez cette capacité que si un adversaire contrôle au moins deux terrains de plus que vous.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ad899e-90b4-4add-b9aa-e9f795f46826\', \'multiverseId\': 450837}, \'multiverseid\': 450837}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Guardia Isolata\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Profetizza 1, poi puoi rivelare la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se una carta terra base viene rivelata in questo modo, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Attiva questa abilità solo se un avversario controlla almeno due terre in più di te.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c50b3e-eff9-4ca6-9b06-0950feb133c1\', \'multiverseId\': 450896}, \'multiverseid\': 450896}, {\'name\': \'孤立した監視塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：占術１を行う。その後あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開してもよい。これにより基本土地・カードが公開されたなら、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。この能力は、対戦相手１人が土地をあなたよりも２つ以上多くコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc54ac83-ab43-462e-b7a7-cf508b48fd7f\', \'multiverseId\': 450955}, \'multiverseid\': 450955}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Vigia Isolada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Use vidência 1. Depois, você pode revelar o card do topo de seu grimório. Se um card de terreno básico for revelado dessa forma, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Ative esta habilidade somente se um oponente controlar ao menos dois terrenos a mais que você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00251e5f-8c31-4bb8-a40f-c2961a26cc8b\', \'multiverseId\': 451014}, \'multiverseid\': 451014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgenutzter Kraftstein\', \'text\': \'Der Abgenutzte Kraftstein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst der Splitter eines Kraftsteins enthält nicht nur Energie, sondern Raum — gewaltige Dimensionen gefangen in zerbrechlichem Kristall.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451433&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25f1fdf-44d9-4000-b055-c19d009b5b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 451433}, \'multiverseid\': 451433}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de poder desgastada\', \'text\': \'La Piedra de poder desgastada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso un fragmento de piedra de poder contiene en su interior no solo energía, sino espacio... vastas dimensiones encerradas en un frágil cristal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a450b1b7-8983-449d-a0da-2db8aab9b7e6\', \'multiverseId\': 451681}, \'multiverseid\': 451681}, {\'name\': \'Lithoforce usée\', \'text\': \'La Lithoforce usée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Même à l\'état de fragment, les lithoforces ne renferment pas que de l\'énergie, mais aussi de l\'espace : de vastes dimensions piégées dans un cristal fragile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e47edd-40e1-465a-9a82-8bc6126ee0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 451929}, \'multiverseid\': 451929}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Potere Consunta\', \'text\': \'La Pietra del Potere Consunta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Persino un frammento di una pietra del potere contiene al suo interno non solo energia, ma anche spazio: dimensioni enormi intrappolate nella fragilità del cristallo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e7a9d4-2cfc-44dc-8739-30c74f00d142\', \'multiverseId\': 452177}, \'multiverseid\': 452177}, {\'name\': \'摩滅したパワーストーン\', \'text\': \'摩滅したパワーストーンはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'パワーストーンの欠片ですら、その中に力だけでなく空間を持つ。脆い水晶の中に閉じ込められた広大な空間だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1bd4a4-7722-49e8-b4c5-96282f004fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 452425}, \'multiverseid\': 452425}, {\'name\': \'Pedra de Energia Gasta\', \'text\': \'Pedra de Energia Gasta entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmo um fragmento de uma pedra de energia contém em si não apenas energia, mas espaço — vastas dimensões encapsuladas em cristal frágil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902e98bc-3208-41f9-a12d-af178d7ed48e\', \'multiverseId\': 452673}, \'multiverseid\': 452673}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwicklungsuhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe während der Enttappsegmente aller anderen Spieler alle Artefakte, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Partisanen haben ein seltsames Artefakt ausgegraben. Keiner kennt seinen Ursprung, aber es gibt ihnen die Hoffnung auf ein Leben danach."\\n—Elspeths Tagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451431&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343ae9e5-13c3-4a9a-ac44-cd6cee017332\', \'multiverseId\': 451431}, \'multiverseid\': 451431}, {\'name\': \'Reloj desenredador\', \'text\': \'Durante el paso de enderezar de cada uno de los demás jugadores, endereza todos los artefactos que controles.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los partisanos han desenterrado un extraño artefacto. Nadie sabe su origen, pero les da esperanza de una vida en el más allá".\\n—Diario de Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ed2c6a-395f-4db5-b923-4949f68f50d8\', \'multiverseId\': 451679}, \'multiverseid\': 451679}, {\'name\': \'Horloge débridée\', \'text\': "Dégagez tous les artefacts que vous contrôlez pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Les partisans ont découvert un étrange artefact. Personne ne connaît son origine, mais il leur donne l\'espoir d\'un au-delà. »\\n—Journal d\'Elspeth", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451927&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05abed98-38f0-41f4-bf5b-89150c36791d\', \'multiverseId\': 451927}, \'multiverseid\': 451927}, {\'name\': \'Orologio a Scarica\', \'text\': \'STAPpa tutti gli artefatti che controlli durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I fautori hanno dissotterrato uno strano artefatto. Nessuno ne conosce l\\\'origine, ma dà loro speranza per una vita successiva."\\n—Diario di Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'574dbe0f-7f09-4f11-b9a4-70f76642c825\', \'multiverseId\': 452175}, \'multiverseid\': 452175}, {\'name\': \'巻き戻しの時計\', \'text\': \'他の各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップに、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトをすべてアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「非正規兵たちが奇妙な遺物を掘り出した。誰もその出自を知らなかったが、来世への希望を与えてくれる。」\\n――エルズペスの日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c703cf0a-3ec3-48a3-acba-f603f3d812d8\', \'multiverseId\': 452423}, \'multiverseid\': 452423}, {\'name\': \'Relógio Reversor\', \'text\': \'Desvire todos os artefatos que você controla durante a etapa de desvirar de cada outro jogador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Os guerrilheiros descobriram um estranho artefato. Ninguém sabe a sua origem, mas ele lhes dá esperanças de uma vida além."\\n— Diário de Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9479e6c2-f0b1-4092-a5c8-efcb547cfb91\', \'multiverseId\': 452671}, \'multiverseid\': 452671}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adarkarwalküre\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\n{T}: Wenn eine Kreatur deiner Wahl außer der Adarkarwalküre in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe ihre Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Anstatt die Gestorbenen in das Land der Toten zu eskortieren, erweckt sie sie wieder zum Leben, Kämpfen und erneutem Sterben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1777c9aa-f8e0-4c61-90c7-1100f6889371\', \'multiverseId\': 451263}, \'multiverseid\': 451263}, {\'name\': \'Valkiria de Adarkar\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\n{T}: Cuando la criatura objetivo que no sea la Valkiria de Adarkar muera este turno, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Ella no escolta a los muertos al más allá, sino que los resucita para que luchen y mueran de nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a86c0bb-1535-4a97-b8a4-d5bb4b6583f3\', \'multiverseId\': 451511}, \'multiverseid\': 451511}, {\'name\': "Valkyrie d\'Adarkar", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\n{T} : Quand une créature ciblée autre que la Valkyrie d\'Adarkar meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : ange\', \'flavor\': "Elle n\'escorte pas les morts dans l\'après-vie ; elle les ressuscite pour combattre et mourir à nouveau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451759&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07724e1-f1cf-46e5-91eb-022b818cd775\', \'multiverseId\': 451759}, \'multiverseid\': 451759}, {\'name\': "Valchiria dell\'Adarkar", \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\n{T}: Quando una creatura bersaglio diversa dalla Valchiria dell\'Adarkar muore in questo turno, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Non accompagna i morti nell\'oltretomba, ma li risuscita per farli combattere e morire ancora.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb758b9c-8096-4538-a90d-4ec78d0d5627\', \'multiverseId\': 452007}, \'multiverseid\': 452007}, {\'name\': \'アダーカーの戦乙女\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n{T}：アダーカーの戦乙女以外のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それが死亡したとき、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は死者を天国へと導くことはしない。蘇らせて戦わせ、再び死へと導くのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a236c5b-53a0-4aa1-91ec-0a15c40df8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 452255}, \'multiverseid\': 452255}, {\'name\': \'Valquíria de Adarkar\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\n{T}: Quando a criatura alvo que não seja Valquíria de Adarkar morrer neste turno, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Ela não acompanha os mortos à vida após a morte, mas os levanta para que lutem e morram novamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41efbbc7-4902-4c70-8e43-6b20fe6ad167\', \'multiverseId\': 452503}, \'multiverseid\': 452503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Auserwählte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein. Falls die Verzauberung eine Aura ist, kannst du sie an den Spielstein anlegen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Vereint wird unser Gebrüll ganze Berge einebnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b9cbc2-f9ad-43f4-9365-0882d01c2357\', \'multiverseId\': 451264}, \'multiverseid\': 451264}, {\'name\': \'Elegido de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Felino blanca 2/2. Si ese encantamiento es un Aura, puedes anexarlo a la ficha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Unidos, nuestro rugido arrasará montañas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a66f57c-624a-4d19-99d1-aeb3d6b1c4a9\', \'multiverseId\': 451512}, \'multiverseid\': 451512}, {\'name\': "Élus d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat. Si cet enchantement est une aura, vous pouvez l\'attacher au jeton.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Ensemble, notre rugissement pulvérisera les montagnes. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62995614-9707-4362-a012-4568524a32cb\', \'multiverseId\': 451760}, \'multiverseid\': 451760}, {\'name\': \'Prescelti di Ajani\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Felino 2/2 bianca. Se quell\'incantesimo è un\'Aura, puoi assegnarla alla pedina.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Insieme, il nostro ruggito spianerà le montagne."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b08ec64-11d3-483a-b8fa-7ad26f56aa9c\', \'multiverseId\': 452008}, \'multiverseid\': 452008}, {\'name\': \'アジャニに選ばれし者\', \'text\': \'エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、白の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。そのエンチャントがオーラであるなら、あなたはそれをそのトークンにつけてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「団結すれば、我らが咆哮は山をも更地にするだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b51d53c-538e-452c-a5dd-33ecf7cbed1d\', \'multiverseId\': 452256}, \'multiverseid\': 452256}, {\'name\': \'Escolhidos de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Felino. Se aquele encantamento for uma Aura, você poderá anexá-la à ficha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Unidos, nosso rugido derrubará montanhas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152faf43-0438-47d2-a8f0-284ea6f4c974\', \'multiverseId\': 452504}, \'multiverseid\': 452504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akoum-Refugium\', \'text\': \'Das Akoum-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Akoum-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfd7a02-a65c-42e8-99ad-1a1282e450bd\', \'multiverseId\': 451434}, \'multiverseid\': 451434}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de Akoum\', \'text\': \'El Refugio de Akoum entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Akoum entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e7b55c-a968-4c63-a98d-3011e08a5546\', \'multiverseId\': 451682}, \'multiverseid\': 451682}, {\'name\': "Refuge d\'Akoum", \'text\': "Le Refuge d\'Akoum arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge d\'Akoum arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e3a961-f35f-4141-a87d-ca8b33f1aba2\', \'multiverseId\': 451930}, \'multiverseid\': 451930}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio di Akoum\', \'text\': \'Il Rifugio di Akoum entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Akoum entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf89f329-2216-4339-95f5-fd70a8eb7a17\', \'multiverseId\': 452178}, \'multiverseid\': 452178}, {\'name\': \'アクームの隠れ家\', \'text\': \'アクームの隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアクームの隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5e7ac1-63bf-4ef7-b801-204895470f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 452426}, \'multiverseid\': 452426}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Refúgio de Akoum entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio de Akoum entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5625739e-ee10-4657-9b9f-9054a8d9a4c0\', \'multiverseId\': 452674}, \'multiverseid\': 452674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akromas Rache\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Artefakte, Kreaturen und Verzauberungen.\\nUmwandlung {3} ({3}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele müssen für den Einen sterben, der nicht hätte umkommen sollen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6051dc3b-f471-4f7c-9ccc-5884f932dd5f\', \'multiverseId\': 451265}, \'multiverseid\': 451265}, {\'name\': \'Venganza de Akroma\', \'text\': \'Destruye todos los artefactos, criaturas y encantamientos.\\nCiclo {3}. ({3}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muchos deben morir por aquella que no debería haber muerto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adaa8cd8-5217-4335-a15a-5be4334f1929\', \'multiverseId\': 451513}, \'multiverseid\': 451513}, {\'name\': \'Vengeance selon Akroma\', \'text\': \'Détruisez tous les artefacts, toutes les créatures et tous les enchantements.\\nRecyclage {3} ({3}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Beaucoup doivent mourir pour celle qui n\'aurait pas dû périr. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d083b83-74f9-4dca-8eaa-410a8c8c5946\', \'multiverseId\': 451761}, \'multiverseid\': 451761}, {\'name\': \'Vendetta di Akroma\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutti gli artefatti, le creature e gli incantesimi.\\nCiclo {3} ({3}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"In molti devono morire per colei che avrebbe dovuto restare in vita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff6d219-51f9-4212-8504-11eb659db601\', \'multiverseId\': 452009}, \'multiverseid\': 452009}, {\'name\': \'アクローマの復讐\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトとクリーチャーとエンチャントをすべて破壊する。\\nサイクリング{3}（{3}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「殺されるはずのなかったあの方のために、大勢が死なねばならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b397980a-9699-4e39-8d7f-f76e32636d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 452257}, \'multiverseid\': 452257}, {\'name\': \'Vingança de Akroma\', \'text\': \'Destrua todos os artefatos, criaturas e encantamentos.\\nReciclar {3} ({3}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Muitos precisam morrer por aquela que não deveria ter perecido."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e83fab-d399-4e66-a7e2-04d96d078978\', \'multiverseId\': 452505}, \'multiverseid\': 452505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allesfressende Hydra\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Allesfressende Hydra einem Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, fügt sie jedem anderen Gegner ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sollten von der Hydra lernen. Sie kennt keine Lieblinge, sie frisst alle."\\n—Thrass, Druidenältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451356&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0843e0f0-f874-4122-858a-1784e30e5060\', \'multiverseId\': 451356}, \'multiverseid\': 451356}, {\'name\': \'Hidra omnívora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Hidra omnívora haga daño de combate a un oponente, le hace esa misma cantidad de daño a cada otro oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"Deberíamos aprender de la hidra. No tiene favoritos; devora a todos por igual".\\n—Thrass, alto druida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ccbe8c0-1115-4c0c-aa51-9fa8ae0cba04\', \'multiverseId\': 451604}, \'multiverseid\': 451604}, {\'name\': \'Hydre omnivore\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Hydre omnivore inflige des blessures de combat à un adversaire, elle inflige autant de blessures à chaque autre adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': "« Nous devrions suivre les enseignements de l\'hydre. Elle ne fait jamais de favoritisme. Elle dévore tout le monde équitablement. »\\n—Thrass, doyen des druides", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e48b574e-5f6e-4e75-b0f7-56561c2481d5\', \'multiverseId\': 451852}, \'multiverseid\': 451852}, {\'name\': \'Idra Onnivora\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Idra Onnivora infligge danno da combattimento a un avversario, infligge altrettanti danni a ogni altro avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dovremmo imparare dall\\\'idra. Non gioca mai coi preferiti; divora tutti in modo imparziale."\\n—Thrass, druido anziano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527930e9-12d6-498b-acd5-e7244788af65\', \'multiverseId\': 452100}, \'multiverseid\': 452100}, {\'name\': \'雑食のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'雑食のハイドラが対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、これはその点数に等しい点数のダメージを、他の各対戦相手にそれぞれ与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はハイドラから学ぶべきなのだ。それは何も特別扱いせぬ。すべてを等しく飲み込むのだ。」\\n――上座ドルイド、サラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a385547-ad82-4243-9f35-b2bcd1b688c9\', \'multiverseId\': 452348}, \'multiverseid\': 452348}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Onívora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Hidra Onívora causa dano de combate a um oponente, ela causa aquela quantidade de dano a cada outro oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"Deveríamos aprender com a hidra. Ela não tem favoritos; devora todos igualmente."\\n— Thrass, druida ancião\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9cc7d74-1085-46db-b316-a6bedf01459d\', \'multiverseId\': 452596}, \'multiverseid\': 452596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aminatou die Schicksalswandlerin\', \'text\': \'+1: Ziehe eine Karte und lege dann eine Karte aus deiner Hand oben auf deine Bibliothek.\\n−1: Schicke eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du besitzt, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\\n−6: Bestimme Links oder Rechts. Jeder Spieler übernimmt die Kontrolle über alle bleibenden Nichtland-Karten, die vom nächsten Spieler in der bestimmten Richtung kontrolliert werden, außer Aminatou der Schicksalswandlerin.\\nAminatou die Schicksalswandlerin kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Aminatou\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450697&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c134860-53be-4008-85c4-7a1a6ed16096\', \'multiverseId\': 450697}, \'multiverseid\': 450697}, {\'name\': \'Aminatou, la Alteradestinos\', \'text\': \'+1: Roba una carta, luego pon una carta de tu mano en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n−1: Exilia otro permanente objetivo del cual eres propietario, luego regrésalo al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\\n−6: Elige izquierda o derecha. Cada jugador gana el control de todos los permanentes que no sean tierra y que no sean Aminatou, la Alteradestinos controlados por el siguiente jugador en la dirección elegida.\\nAminatou, la Alteradestinos puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Aminatou\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ceee30-8fb4-447a-b311-7f32a486405f\', \'multiverseId\': 450756}, \'multiverseid\': 450756}, {\'name\': \'Aminatou, la façonneuse de destin\', \'text\': "+1 : Piochez une carte, puis mettez une carte de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n-1 : Exilez un autre permanent ciblé que vous possédez, puis renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.\\n-6 : Choisissez gauche ou droite. Chaque joueur acquiert le contrôle de tous les permanents non-terrain autres qu\'Aminatou, la façonneuse de destin contrôlés par le joueur suivant dans la direction choisie.\\nAminatou, la façonneuse de destin peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Aminatou\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a24f4c3-8172-4866-8034-4f1b5eed84b4\', \'multiverseId\': 450815}, \'multiverseid\': 450815}, {\'name\': \'Aminatou, la Plasmatrice del Fato\', \'text\': \'+1: Pesca una carta, poi metti una carta dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio.\\n-1: Esilia un altro permanente bersaglio che possiedi, poi rimettilo sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.\\n-6: Scegli sinistra o destra. Ogni giocatore prende il controllo di tutti i permanenti non terra diversi da Aminatou, la Plasmatrice del Fato controllati dal successivo giocatore nella direzione scelta.\\nAminatou, la Plasmatrice del Fato può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Aminatou\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b6fd621-c297-46bc-82e5-28bb70a6eef7\', \'multiverseId\': 450874}, \'multiverseid\': 450874}, {\'name\': \'運命を変える者、アミナトゥ\', \'text\': \'+1：カードを１枚引き、その後あなたの手札からカード１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\\n-1：あなたがオーナーである他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放し、その後それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n-6：「左」か「右」のいずれかを選ぶ。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、その選ばれた方向にいる次のプレイヤーがコントロールしていて、土地でなく、運命を変える者、アミナトゥでもないパーマネントすべてのコントロールを得る。\\n運命を変える者、アミナトゥは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アミナトゥ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b5dd63-29b5-49ad-9244-9243323a0ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 450933}, \'multiverseid\': 450933}, {\'name\': \'Aminatou, a Forjadora de Destinos\', \'text\': \'+1: Compre um card. Em seguida, coloque um card de sua mão no topo de seu grimório.\\n−1: Exile outra permanente alvo sua. Em seguida, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o seu controle.\\n−6: Escolha esquerda ou direita. Cada jogador ganha o controle de todas as permanentes que não sejam terrenos, exceto Aminatou, a Forjadora de Destinos, controladas pelo próximo jogador no sentido escolhido.\\nAminatou, a Forjadora de Destinos, pode ser sua comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Aminatou\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72749c7-b24a-449a-9406-89685308ba3c\', \'multiverseId\': 450992}, \'multiverseid\': 450992}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aminatous Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten acht Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte ins Spiel bringen. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du für jeden Kartentyp außer Land von den ins Exil geschickten Karten eine Karte jenes Typs wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450666&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a8b926-cbd0-4a08-b35a-8109e88f78b8\', \'multiverseId\': 450666}, \'multiverseid\': 450666}, {\'name\': \'Augurio de Aminatou\', \'text\': \'Exilia las ocho primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Hasta el final del turno, por cada tipo de carta que no sea tierra, puedes lanzar una carta de ese tipo de entre las cartas exiliadas sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80123831-b1a4-43f0-acf8-b43be64384e9\', \'multiverseId\': 450725}, \'multiverseid\': 450725}, {\'name\': "Augure d\'Aminatou", \'text\': "Exilez les huit cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain parmi elles. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, pour chaque type de carte non-terrain, vous pouvez lancer une carte de ce type parmi les cartes exilées sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450784&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210365c0-bc3b-4325-a119-baf4b8d8e1e3\', \'multiverseId\': 450784}, \'multiverseid\': 450784}, {\'name\': \'Vaticinio di Aminatou\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime otto carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra scelta tra esse. Fino alla fine del turno, per ogni tipo di carta non terra, puoi lanciare una carta di quel tipo scelta tra quelle esiliate senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe2cc251-1870-45a5-bc8e-04725af43234\', \'multiverseId\': 450843}, \'multiverseid\': 450843}, {\'name\': \'アミナトゥの占い\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを８枚追放する。あなたはその中から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。ターン終了時まで、土地でないカード・タイプ１つにつき、あなたはその追放されたカードの中からそのタイプのカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b18bc44d-17a9-4e8b-8fa8-b6e660423938\', \'multiverseId\': 450902}, \'multiverseid\': 450902}, {\'name\': \'Augúrio de Aminatou\', \'text\': \'Exile os oito cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de terreno dentre eles no campo de batalha. Até o final do turno, para cada tipo de card que não seja terreno, você pode conjurar um card daquele tipo dentre os cards exilados sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc8a8ab8-4a46-46e3-aec6-f46b370d1536\', \'multiverseId\': 450961}, \'multiverseid\': 450961}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Bant\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\\n• Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bant ist eine Welt, in der Tod und Chaos keinerlei Macht haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c37c89c1-36e7-4cc1-a175-cb0787db5a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 451372}, \'multiverseid\': 451372}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto bantiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Pon la criatura objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo instantáneo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant es un mundo donde la muerte y el caos no tienen lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b626a05-40a3-47fa-a295-076565594a91\', \'multiverseId\': 451620}, \'multiverseid\': 451620}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Bant\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.\\n• Mettez la créature ciblée au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\n• Contrecarrez le sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bant est un monde où la mort et le chaos n\'ont pas prise.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8fc9ee-1d22-46b4-8893-faedadac029a\', \'multiverseId\': 451868}, \'multiverseid\': 451868}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Bant\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Metti una creatura bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\\n• Neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant è un mondo in cui morte e caos non hanno alcun potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50742d3f-499f-4133-83f2-339b59ecd029\', \'multiverseId\': 452116}, \'multiverseid\': 452116}, {\'name\': \'バントの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n• インスタント・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'バントは死と混沌の支配が及ばない世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc9bcf4f-b0ba-48cd-957b-b22ec7d3367e\', \'multiverseId\': 452364}, \'multiverseid\': 452364}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Bant\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Coloque a criatura alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\\n• Anule a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Bant é um mundo onde a morte e o caos não têm vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ef2e52-ad8f-494a-86f2-3ebb8dcd3177\', \'multiverseId\': 452612}, \'multiverseid\': 452612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Esper\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Ziehe zwei Karten.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2ea1af-4d55-47ed-b353-9c3bf0d32236\', \'multiverseId\': 451382}, \'multiverseid\': 451382}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto esperiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Roba dos cartas.\\n• El jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266d68fb-f517-495a-9f3d-5d0da81f9472\', \'multiverseId\': 451630}, \'multiverseid\': 451630}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Esper", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.\\n• Piochez deux cartes.\\n• Le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57bda68a-2246-42bd-870f-2362c5c9ca65\', \'multiverseId\': 451878}, \'multiverseid\': 451878}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Esper\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Pesca due carte.\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89cba593-0e54-43b9-8f82-9744823bd86c\', \'multiverseId\': 452126}, \'multiverseid\': 452126}, {\'name\': \'エスパーの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• カードを２枚引く。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a8bec1-8a7b-47e3-adfe-80831c504ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 452374}, \'multiverseid\': 452374}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Esper\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Compre dois cards.\\n• O jogador alvo descarta dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5835510-493e-4fd9-8e95-64c15ba3f816\', \'multiverseId\': 452622}, \'multiverseid\': 452622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrufung der Engel\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 4/4 weiße Engel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nMirakulum {X}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd364af5-1588-4988-a4b4-135758dfde6a\', \'multiverseId\': 451270}, \'multiverseid\': 451270}, {\'name\': \'Rogar a los ángeles\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Ángel blancas 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nMilagro {X}{W}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be331c7-b840-419a-bd7d-182c27685d07\', \'multiverseId\': 451518}, \'multiverseid\': 451518}, {\'name\': \'Implorez les anges\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nMiracle {X}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9aae08-eec6-45af-a322-ad97c7981199\', \'multiverseId\': 451766}, \'multiverseid\': 451766}, {\'name\': \'Supplicare gli Angeli\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare.\\nMiracolo {X}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e153133-0364-416d-bbe7-f28550bb85cc\', \'multiverseId\': 452014}, \'multiverseid\': 452014}, {\'name\': \'天使への願い\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。\\n奇跡{X}{W}{W}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれの奇跡コストを支払うことでこれを唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcf29d6-8f75-4703-a72e-44664943d433\', \'multiverseId\': 452262}, \'multiverseid\': 452262}, {\'name\': \'Súplica aos Anjos\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar.\\nMilagre {X}{W}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73553621-7e27-4d0c-b0ad-2b9554aacf0e\', \'multiverseId\': 452510}, \'multiverseid\': 452510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrufung der Toten\', \'text\': \'Bringe X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nMirakulum {X}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450675&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d6c8f6-5b65-455c-ba2a-bf6a3be45664\', \'multiverseId\': 450675}, \'multiverseid\': 450675}, {\'name\': \'Rogar a los muertos\', \'text\': \'Regresa X cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nMilagro {X}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b94c733-c3d9-4e0a-9a5e-56f8fc44b981\', \'multiverseId\': 450734}, \'multiverseid\': 450734}, {\'name\': \'Implorez les morts\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière.\\nMiracle {X}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3da072e-2f6e-4be2-ba9d-bcbc30d3b91b\', \'multiverseId\': 450793}, \'multiverseid\': 450793}, {\'name\': \'Appellarsi ai Morti\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia X carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nMiracolo {X}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e09b33b-dfc2-42a5-8a31-253b9893dba4\', \'multiverseId\': 450852}, \'multiverseid\': 450852}, {\'name\': \'死者への嘆願\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードＸ枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\\n奇跡{X}{B}{B}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードであるこれをその直後に公開したとき、あなたはこれの奇跡コストでこれを唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ce80ba-521b-40ec-9623-9904b8e421d5\', \'multiverseId\': 450911}, \'multiverseid\': 450911}, {\'name\': \'Rogar aos Mortos\', \'text\': \'Devolva X cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nMilagre {X}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b37735-88af-45e3-aace-6dba7a06e455\', \'multiverseId\': 450970}, \'multiverseid\': 450970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anwesenheit der Blütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Weisen lernen sowohl aus ihren Fehlern wie aus ihren Erfolgen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d70353-7dc9-40f1-8f33-cbe30ec9b0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 451344}, \'multiverseid\': 451344}, {\'name\': \'Presencia de la encantadora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los sabios aprenden de los éxitos tanto como de los errores".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ec0642-c628-4f34-9235-373f8b1a7f17\', \'multiverseId\': 451592}, \'multiverseid\': 451592}, {\'name\': "Présence de l\'enchanteresse", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Le sage apprend de ses réussites autant que de ses erreurs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb74d86a-6f93-4a39-b482-76e44288377c\', \'multiverseId\': 451840}, \'multiverseid\': 451840}, {\'name\': "Presenza dell\'Incantatrice", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I saggi imparano dai successi oltre che dagli errori."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b843daa-cd87-4a8c-acd8-11a94656cf44\', \'multiverseId\': 452088}, \'multiverseid\': 452088}, {\'name\': \'女魔術師の存在\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「賢者は失敗だけでなく成功からも学ぶものですわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b3b688-13c4-48ce-bf01-f4f1b99b5439\', \'multiverseId\': 452336}, \'multiverseid\': 452336}, {\'name\': \'Presença da Encantadora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de encantamento, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O sábio aprende tanto com os erros quanto com os acertos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8800e206-4db5-4670-a252-a4e75aa32464\', \'multiverseId\': 452584}, \'multiverseid\': 452584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arixmethes, die schlummernde Insel\', \'text\': \'Arixmethes, die schlummernde Insel, kommt getappt mit fünf Schlummermarken ins Spiel.\\nSolange Arixmethes mindestens eine Schlummermarke auf sich liegen hat, ist sie ein Land. (Sie ist keine Kreatur.)\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Schlummermarke von Arixmethes entfernen.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450698&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc6e703-b1ed-4ae1-a796-4f5704ef2352\', \'multiverseId\': 450698}, \'multiverseid\': 450698}, {\'name\': \'Arixmetes, la Isla Dormida\', \'text\': \'Arixmetes, la Isla Dormida entra al campo de batalla girado con cinco contadores de letargo sobre él.\\nMientras Arixmetes tenga un contador de letargo sobre él, es una tierra. (No es una criatura.)\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo, puedes remover un contador de letargo de Arixmetes.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8567754a-4834-4a22-926c-3c35c1da6bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 450757}, \'multiverseid\': 450757}, {\'name\': "Arixméthès, l\'île assoupie", \'text\': "Arixméthès, l\'île assoupie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé avec cinq marqueurs « sommeil » sur lui.\\nTant qu\'Arixméthès a un marqueur « sommeil » sur lui, c\'est un terrain. (Ce n\'est pas une créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez retirer un marqueur « sommeil » d\'Arixméthès.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6719d0-9676-4f3a-ae3b-32da42cdff44\', \'multiverseId\': 450816}, \'multiverseid\': 450816}, {\'name\': \'Arixmetes, Isola Sopita\', \'text\': \'Arixmetes, Isola Sopita entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato con cinque segnalini sopore.\\nFintanto che Arixmetes ha un segnalino sopore, è una terra. (Non è una creatura.)\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi rimuovere un segnalino sopore da Arixmetes.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a67e421-c348-4217-a827-396394072933\', \'multiverseId\': 450875}, \'multiverseid\': 450875}, {\'name\': \'まどろむ島、アリクスメテス\', \'text\': \'まどろむ島、アリクスメテスはタップ状態でまどろみカウンターが５個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nまどろむ島、アリクスメテスの上にまどろみカウンターが置かれているかぎり、これは土地である。（これはクリーチャーではない。）\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはまどろむ島、アリクスメテスの上からまどろみカウンターを１個取り除いてもよい。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba101fc7-25bd-4ae5-9ffc-a9eb2ddcc0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 450934}, \'multiverseid\': 450934}, {\'name\': \'Arixmetes, Ilha Hibernante\', \'text\': \'Arixmetes, Ilha Hibernante, entra no campo de batalha virado com cinco marcadores de hibernação.\\nEnquanto Arixmetes tiver um marcador de hibernação, ele é um terreno. (Não é uma criatura.)\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você pode remover um marcador de hibernação de Arixmetes.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709cce34-1f6a-45d8-9818-0b9c6347ab95\', \'multiverseId\': 450993}, \'multiverseid\': 450993}]', "[{'name': 'Armee der Verdammten', 'text': 'Erzeuge dreizehn getappte 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nRückblende {7}{B}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Manchmal klopft der Tod an. Manchmal reißt er auch Wände ein.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451316&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '028874a9-75ce-4955-bfd1-69fadf2c16e3', 'multiverseId': 451316}, 'multiverseid': 451316}, {'name': 'Ejército de los condenados', 'text': 'Crea trece fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2 giradas.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{B}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'A veces la muerte golpea a tu puerta. A veces tira abajo las paredes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451564&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '843baaf3-b454-4a77-80b3-0045ce49a9a0', 'multiverseId': 451564}, 'multiverseid': 451564}, {'name': 'Armée des damnés', 'text': 'Créez treize jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie engagés.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Parfois la mort vient frapper à votre porte. Parfois, elle défonce les murs.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451812&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '629e5d28-20b9-48d6-b763-437a05a7ea2f', 'multiverseId': 451812}, 'multiverseid': 451812}, {'name': 'Esercito dei Dannati', 'text': 'Crea tredici pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere TAPpate.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'A volte la morte viene bussando. A volte sfonda le pareti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452060&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df1507d4-5e78-4d9e-9c57-a11f5b495ea4', 'multiverseId': 452060}, 'multiverseid': 452060}, {'name': '忌むべき者の軍団', 'text': '黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを13体タップ状態で生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{B}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ときに死は扉を叩く。ときに死は壁をぶち破る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452308&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87d1df03-7cbe-4bf1-8cfa-73e7f338d2e8', 'multiverseId': 452308}, 'multiverseid': 452308}, {'name': 'Exército dos Malditos', 'text': 'Crie treze fichas de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi viradas.\\nRecapitular {7}{B}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Algumas vezes, a morte bate na porta. Outras vezes, ela derruba a parede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452556&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e0bdb32-7c82-4595-9e7c-7f8cc0854558', 'multiverseId': 452556}, 'multiverseid': 452556}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auge der Pilger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kor schicken ihre Thopter vor, um zu schauen, ob das Land gerade gute Laune hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b50e8a3-9de3-4620-98a0-98441e34bd35\', \'multiverseId\': 451417}, \'multiverseid\': 451417}, {\'name\': \'Ojo del peregrino\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor envían a sus tópteros cometa para ver si la tierra está de humor para una visita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab90143b-f8da-4d6e-9066-de2b06e9d5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 451665}, \'multiverseid\': 451665}, {\'name\': \'Œil du pèlerin\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Œil du pèlerin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Les kor envoient leurs voiles mécanoptères en éclaireur pour déterminer si la terre est d\'humeur accueillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90fdb345-a688-4cda-93f0-08a08679ea6a\', \'multiverseId\': 451913}, \'multiverseid\': 451913}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Pellegrino\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Occhio del Pellegrino entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'I kor spediscono sempre i loro alianti totteri per verificare se la terra è di buonumore o meno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5891c0c1-e884-471f-941b-67ad9724ff1e\', \'multiverseId\': 452161}, \'multiverseid\': 452161}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者の目\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'コーは飛行凧を送り込んで、地が歓迎しているかどうかを見る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54841ed-87b1-4580-aec9-d7d4e5b6a568\', \'multiverseId\': 452409}, \'multiverseid\': 452409}, {\'name\': \'Olho do Peregrino\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Olho do Peregrino entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo na sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Os kor enviam seus topteroveleiros para verificar se a terra está receptiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59157649-5c2d-43f6-9e0b-4df9fdb41b08\', \'multiverseId\': 452657}, \'multiverseid\': 452657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aura-Knurrer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die des Aura-Knurrers, können ihn nicht blocken.\\nDer Aura-Knurrer erhält +1/+1 für jede Aura im Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du einen Knurrer nicht mit dem ersten Schlag tötest, zeigt er dir begierig, wie man es macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebe0df2-6ad8-4ca1-b842-04429df7d049\', \'multiverseId\': 451331}, \'multiverseid\': 451331}, {\'name\': \'Gnárlido de aura\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza menor que el Gnárlido de aura no pueden bloquearlo.\\nEl Gnárlido de aura obtiene +1/+1 por cada Aura en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Si no acabas con un gnárlido con tu primer golpe, él te enseñará gustoso cómo se hace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a86250b-ff06-45ba-8334-cbb5b62cd230\', \'multiverseId\': 451579}, \'multiverseid\': 451579}, {\'name\': "Gnarlide d\'aura", \'text\': "Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Gnarlide d\'aura ne peuvent pas le bloquer.\\nLe Gnarlide d\'aura gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Il faut tuer un gnarlide du premier coup ou il se fera un plaisir de vous montrer comment s\'y prendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92bbbd5b-2f76-469b-b005-dbbc6578c16b\', \'multiverseId\': 451827}, \'multiverseid\': 451827}, {\'name\': "Gnarlid dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Le creature con forza inferiore a quella del Gnarlid dell\'Aura non possono bloccarlo.\\nIl Gnarlid dell\'Aura prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Uccidi un gnarlid al primo colpo o ti mostrerà volentieri come si fa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f23465-4348-434b-b52b-69d114ab66e1\', \'multiverseId\': 452075}, \'multiverseid\': 452075}, {\'name\': \'オーラのナーリッド\', \'text\': \'オーラのナーリッドよりもパワーの小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\\nオーラのナーリッドは、戦場にあるオーラ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ナーリッドを殺すなら一撃で仕留めろ。さもなくば、そいつは喜んでその効き目を教えてくれるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4e5bbb-24c2-40e4-81a0-d1b9d76c9130\', \'multiverseId\': 452323}, \'multiverseid\': 452323}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlid de Aura\', \'text\': \'As criaturas com poder menor que o de Gnarlid de Aura não podem bloqueá-lo.\\nGnarlid de Aura recebe +1/+1 para cada Aura no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Mate um gnarlid com seu primeiro golpe ou ele lhe mostrará com satisfação como se faz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a277b4c-0444-4df9-998e-a8567f503a04\', \'multiverseId\': 452571}, \'multiverseid\': 452571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus und vorbei\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kam auf der Suche nach einer Herausforderung. Alles, was ich fand, warst du."\\n—Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451396&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6cbae12-b8a7-463d-924b-e03c283685db\', \'multiverseId\': 451396}, \'multiverseid\': 451396}, {\'name\': \'Fin absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vine en busca de un desafío... pero solo te he encontrado a ti".\\n—Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da62e20-f051-46b9-a1df-941a4e81e67d\', \'multiverseId\': 451644}, \'multiverseid\': 451644}, {\'name\': \'Destruction totale\', \'text\': \'Exilez le permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je venais en quête de défi. Mais je n\'ai trouvé que toi. »\\n—Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23dce365-a0c9-465d-a627-c389078c7e28\', \'multiverseId\': 451892}, \'multiverseid\': 451892}, {\'name\': \'Fine Assoluta\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono giunto in cerca di una sfida, ma non ho trovato che te."\\n—Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f7d449-b6ed-4749-8ed4-6e13a133cda0\', \'multiverseId\': 452140}, \'multiverseid\': 452140}, {\'name\': \'完全なる終わり\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺は挑戦を求めて来たというのに。ここにいたのはお前だけというわけか。」\\n――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b1ae92-d02d-463d-904c-3956f881f40d\', \'multiverseId\': 452388}, \'multiverseid\': 452388}, {\'name\': \'Fim Absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vim em busca de um desafio. Tudo o que encontrei foi você."\\n— Zurgo, khan dos Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6509eda5-924b-41b0-b1f9-19308faa2b67\', \'multiverseId\': 452636}, \'multiverseid\': 452636}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgenutzte Zeit\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine der Karten auf deine Hand und lege eine auf und eine unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist meisterlich, wenn man der Zeit sagen kann, was sie tun soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'466af095-e647-4671-9e73-2811af2580c3\', \'multiverseId\': 451308}, \'multiverseid\': 451308}, {\'name\': \'Contar el tiempo\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de esas cartas en tu mano, una en la parte superior de tu biblioteca y una en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La maestría se alcanza cuando "contar el tiempo" se convierte en "contarle al tiempo qué debe hacer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f61bdee-d95d-43e7-97a1-4bfcd3755835\', \'multiverseId\': 451556}, \'multiverseid\': 451556}, {\'name\': \'Heure révélatrice\', \'text\': \'Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez une de ces cartes dans votre main, une autre au-dessus de votre bibliothèque et la dernière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La maîtrise est atteinte quand « l\'heure révélatrice » devient « l\'heure révélatrice de ce qu\'il faut faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5b0969-f581-400b-b2db-bac8ca716de3\', \'multiverseId\': 451804}, \'multiverseid\': 451804}, {\'name\': \'Predire il Tempo\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi una di quelle carte alla tua mano, mettine una in cima al tuo grimorio e una in fondo al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La padronanza viene raggiunta quando si passa da "predire il tempo" a "controllare il tempo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e6b25a-cf56-4842-a237-f3360ec7e190\', \'multiverseId\': 452052}, \'multiverseid\': 452052}, {\'name\': \'時間の把握\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置き、１枚をあなたのライブラリーの１番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「時間の把握」が「時間の掌握」になった時が熟達したと言える時だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b430190-00af-4238-9e94-ea98d9db4e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 452300}, \'multiverseid\': 452300}, {\'name\': \'Dizer as Horas\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um daqueles cards em sua mão, um no topo de seu grimório e o outro no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A maestria é alcançada quando "dizer as horas" se torna "controlar as horas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fff6e8-f400-4704-a7d8-a01766f80bae\', \'multiverseId\': 452548}, \'multiverseid\': 452548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Azorius-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Wie ein großes Auge starrt das Symbol der Azorius auf die Besucher hinab und erinnert sie an die wachsame Gegenwart von Isperia und ihren Gesetzesmagiern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a585dd15-8f52-4c1e-b7f7-9267eac12de5\', \'multiverseId\': 451437}, \'multiverseid\': 451437}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Azorio\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'El símbolo azorio observa como un gran ojo, recordando a los visitantes de la atenta presencia de Isperia y sus magos de la ley.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f494adf-1d17-4f8a-8ed4-f0a97ecf382d\', \'multiverseId\': 451685}, \'multiverseid\': 451685}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': "Le symbole d\'Azorius contemple la foule de son regard, rappelant aux visiteurs l\'omniprésence d\'Isperia et de ses magelois.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db00e276-21f0-4298-9f9c-6edd9c8bc4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 451933}, \'multiverseid\': 451933}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Il simbolo Azorius osserva come un grande occhio, per ricordare ai visitatori la presenza vigile di Isperia e dei cauti maghi della legge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baf7b8ee-f16d-4c04-aac0-ad40a1d4f7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 452181}, \'multiverseid\': 452181}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'アゾリウスの印が大きな目のように睨み下ろし、来訪する者にイスペリアと彼女の擁する法魔道士の存在を思い出させる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0161b95b-5b59-4264-95db-561ad4603c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 452429}, \'multiverseid\': 452429}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'O símbolo dos Azorius é como um grande olho, lembrando aos visitantes da presença vigilante de Isperia e seus magos legistas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f215379-9862-424a-a403-6f0696627cbe\', \'multiverseId\': 452677}, \'multiverseid\': 452677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451436&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658e9491-bb19-48a2-a80c-2efcf3fc70b0\', \'multiverseId\': 451436}, \'multiverseid\': 451436}, {\'name\': \'Tribunal azorio\', \'text\': \'El Tribunal azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Tribunal azorio entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef041ee-814a-4433-8b71-a4e3e8329245\', \'multiverseId\': 451684}, \'multiverseid\': 451684}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba072d2d-3232-4d28-8d1d-250bd3fbfd72\', \'multiverseId\': 451932}, \'multiverseid\': 451932}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34ed324-a626-45d6-95c9-aca982364328\', \'multiverseId\': 452180}, \'multiverseid\': 452180}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7256049d-bd9c-4b0e-b656-3c2793fcbd0c\', \'multiverseId\': 452428}, \'multiverseid\': 452428}, {\'name\': \'Chancelaria Azorius\', \'text\': \'Chancelaria Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Chancelaria Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edac9585-8ce0-4ff1-aece-4324fee9915b\', \'multiverseId\': 452676}, \'multiverseid\': 452676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53680e5-901b-4f48-a9be-ae339e0d0694\', \'multiverseId\': 451399}, \'multiverseid\': 451399}, {\'name\': \'Sello azorio\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El diseño, similar a un laberinto, representa el corazón de la ley azoria; una estructura rígida diseñada para desafiar voluntades y retrasar el cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c39ea91b-5115-43db-bd4c-75e3b4cec125\', \'multiverseId\': 451647}, \'multiverseid\': 451647}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451895&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38050ea5-70ea-42c6-9741-f98962ef6e53\', \'multiverseId\': 451895}, \'multiverseid\': 451895}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lo stile labirintico rappresenta l\'essenza della legge Azorius: una rigida struttura progettata per mettere alla prova la determinazione e per impedire i cambiamenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf383f6-8898-4881-adf2-5ea30523bf33\', \'multiverseId\': 452143}, \'multiverseid\': 452143}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444c2cf6-474d-44ea-836b-98ee10999542\', \'multiverseId\': 452391}, \'multiverseid\': 452391}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu desenho labiríntico expressa os fundamentos da lei Azorius — uma estrutura rígida projetada para testar a determinação e procrastinar mudanças.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac0bbbad-9ff2-449e-9df4-776c41b19da6\', \'multiverseId\': 452639}, \'multiverseid\': 452639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannender Hieb\', \'text\': \'Lege ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek seines bzw. ihres Besitzers.\\nMirakulum {W} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451266&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e777bb-b520-425a-99df-3c8d2d764bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 451266}, \'multiverseid\': 451266}, {\'name\': \'Golpe de destierro\', \'text\': \'Pon el artefacto, criatura o encantamiento objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\\nMilagro {W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbce516d-eb32-4e40-9bde-941beec0f0a8\', \'multiverseId\': 451514}, \'multiverseid\': 451514}, {\'name\': \'Frappe de bannissement\', \'text\': "Mettez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée ou l\'enchantement ciblé au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\nMiracle {W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b78050-c056-4ed1-b9d7-6a9efab4e2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 451762}, \'multiverseid\': 451762}, {\'name\': \'Bandire a Forza\', \'text\': \'Metti un artefatto, una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\\nMiracolo {W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd56ffcc-1cb0-4b42-b792-c1ed975d049c\', \'multiverseId\': 452010}, \'multiverseid\': 452010}, {\'name\': \'払拭の一撃\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n奇跡{W}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれの奇跡コストを支払うことでこれを唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9276c0cc-8c6e-4108-9193-9ad91299eb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 452258}, \'multiverseid\': 452258}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Banidor\', \'text\': \'Coloque o artefato, criatura ou encantamento alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\\nMilagre {W} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0366a4d-a94e-42a8-98f4-d88273d4dd4d\', \'multiverseId\': 452506}, \'multiverseid\': 452506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4575829-ee17-4e17-bdda-11113e0c15c2\', \'multiverseId\': 451443}, \'multiverseid\': 451443}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329a48d0-4ba4-4c71-8287-2b4d534dd894\', \'multiverseId\': 451691}, \'multiverseid\': 451691}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451939&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82485630-b876-46fd-a333-e588078767ae\', \'multiverseId\': 451939}, \'multiverseid\': 451939}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9ad3f6-0956-4433-ab16-7a9d9bda9cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 452187}, \'multiverseid\': 452187}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea8e550-0ae0-4ef0-91b3-7b67bdfe46e2\', \'multiverseId\': 452435}, \'multiverseid\': 452435}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a derrota está próxima e as orientações são escassas, todos os olhos miram uma direção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ea5bce-fb4e-42c3-8f88-0d99452c71b2\', \'multiverseId\': 452683}, \'multiverseid\': 452683}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begehrtes Juwel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Begehrte Juwel ins Spiel kommt, ziehe drei Karten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dich angreifen und nicht geblockt werden, zieht der Spieler drei Karten und übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Begehrte Juwel. Enttappe es.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c879545a-db57-48ce-94ed-a921fd761039\', \'multiverseId\': 450714}, \'multiverseid\': 450714}, {\'name\': \'Joya codiciada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Joya codiciada entre al campo de batalla, roba tres cartas.\\n{T}: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controla un oponente te ataquen y no sean bloqueadas, ese jugador roba tres cartas y gana el control de la Joya codiciada. Enderézala.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecd972c0-28bd-47cf-a004-83f56dc611cb\', \'multiverseId\': 450773}, \'multiverseid\': 450773}, {\'name\': \'Joyau convoité\', \'text\': "Quand le Joyau convoité arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes.\\n{T} : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous attaque et n\'est pas bloquée, ce joueur pioche trois cartes et acquiert le contrôle du Joyau convoité. Dégagez-le.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4ea703-b52c-426a-a3be-2bc3eeceb9d1\', \'multiverseId\': 450832}, \'multiverseid\': 450832}, {\'name\': \'Gioiello Ambito\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gioiello Ambito entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte.\\n{T}: Aggiungi tre mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature controllate da un avversario ti attaccano e non vengono bloccate, quel giocatore pesca tre carte e prende il controllo del Gioiello Ambito. STAPpalo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfca97a-d2b5-47f9-88a2-a27b0c141ba7\', \'multiverseId\': 450891}, \'multiverseid\': 450891}, {\'name\': \'切望の宝石\', \'text\': \'切望の宝石が戦場に出たとき、カードを３枚引く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。\\n対戦相手１人がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体以上があなたを攻撃してブロックされないたび、そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引いて切望の宝石のコントロールを得る。これをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5734db2-85e8-4f8f-ba1f-bfd1a8b510fb\', \'multiverseId\': 450950}, \'multiverseid\': 450950}, {\'name\': \'Joia Cobiçada\', \'text\': \'Quando Joia Cobiçada entrar no campo de batalha, compre três cards.\\n{T}: Adicione três manas de qualquer cor.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que um oponente controla atacarem você e não forem bloqueadas, aquele jogador comprará três cards e ganhará o controle de Joia Cobiçada. Desvire-a.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c71a57-f3fd-4e07-b577-c23e51eb8f93\', \'multiverseId\': 451009}, \'multiverseid\': 451009}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berührung des Äthermagiers\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte ins Spiel bringen. Sie erhält „Bringe diese Kreatur zu Beginn deines Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück." Lege dann den Rest der aufgedeckten Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451371&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a80b1d-0111-4a9e-956d-7c9d75a0b040\', \'multiverseId\': 451371}, \'multiverseid\': 451371}, {\'name\': \'Toque del mago etéreo\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de criatura que se encuentre entre ellas. Gana "Al comienzo de tu paso final, regresa esta criatura a la mano de su propietario". Luego pon el resto de las cartas mostradas de esta manera en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88236a62-b459-45cd-9dd1-79f1d8644e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 451619}, \'multiverseid\': 451619}, {\'name\': "Toucher de l\'Éthermage", \'text\': "Révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature parmi elles. Elle acquiert « Au début de votre étape de fin, renvoyez cette créature dans la main de son propriétaire. » Mettez ensuite le reste des cartes révélées de cette manière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba36eacf-d087-413f-b11d-2a3834ffe76d\', \'multiverseId\': 451867}, \'multiverseid\': 451867}, {\'name\': \'Tocco di Etermago\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura scelta tra esse. Ha "All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, fai tornare questa creatura in mano al suo proprietario". Poi metti le rimanenti carte rivelate in questo modo in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1f39be4-27fc-421c-a592-799663edaa8a\', \'multiverseId\': 452115}, \'multiverseid\': 452115}, {\'name\': \'霊気魔道士の接触\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。それは「あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。」を得る。その後、これにより公開された残りのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f442be-6194-48a9-b980-3ec8c2415e3f\', \'multiverseId\': 452363}, \'multiverseid\': 452363}, {\'name\': \'Toque da Maga Etérea\', \'text\': \'Revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de criatura dentre eles no campo de batalha. Ele ganha "No início da sua etapa final, devolva esta criatura para a mão de seu dono." Depois, coloque o restante dos cards revelados desta forma no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c3c0c1-99f6-4d9f-b673-48fa5e3d5d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 452611}, \'multiverseid\': 452611}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beste Zeit\', \'text\': \'Edelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält die Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift und falls es die erste Kampfphase des Zuges ist, enttappe die Kreatur. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451383&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e846e6-5b70-4e2e-b3f5-495dd04e12ba\', \'multiverseId\': 451383}, \'multiverseid\': 451383}, {\'name\': \'El mejor momento\', \'text\': \'Exaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, si es la primera fase de combate del turno, endereza esa criatura. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76adbe58-682b-4aa9-b9f5-007e33b644fb\', \'multiverseId\': 451631}, \'multiverseid\': 451631}, {\'name\': \'Heure de gloire\', \'text\': "Exaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, si c\'est la première phase de combat du tour, dégagez cette créature. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451879&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c128eb-0961-4143-a395-166cf09b5518\', \'multiverseId\': 451879}, \'multiverseid\': 451879}, {\'name\': \'Momento di Gloria\', \'text\': "Esaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, se è la prima fase di combattimento del turno, STAPpa quella creatura. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ecf6c59-a668-406f-808d-4089962dbda8\', \'multiverseId\': 452127}, \'multiverseid\': 452127}, {\'name\': \'最高の時\', \'text\': \'賛美（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が単独で攻撃するたび、このターンの最初の戦闘フェイズである場合、そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズを１つ加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef575d10-c0a7-4c08-9b21-efab643c5f29\', \'multiverseId\': 452375}, \'multiverseid\': 452375}, {\'name\': \'Melhor Momento\', \'text\': \'Exaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, se for a primeira fase de combate do turno, desvire aquela criatura. Depois dessa fase, há uma fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05465834-2c7f-42e1-9c20-d4de0004d4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 452623}, \'multiverseid\': 452623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem."\\n—Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd045d5a-8b81-4e99-99a6-a8be90b3d337\', \'multiverseId\': 451323}, \'multiverseid\': 451323}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada".\\n—Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f98a64e-08e2-4955-a670-0e713bcafca1\', \'multiverseId\': 451571}, \'multiverseid\': 451571}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. »\\n—Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c99500-e98c-4725-93e8-62f5eeb4ea17\', \'multiverseId\': 451819}, \'multiverseid\': 451819}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla."\\n—Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c72bdbc1-0cd8-4480-bbd5-356a339b3460\', \'multiverseId\': 452067}, \'multiverseid\': 452067}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでにあらゆるものにとっての安住の地ではありません。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7bfdab-2c88-4e63-a5ad-5be00dd3e766\', \'multiverseId\': 452315}, \'multiverseid\': 452315}, {\'name\': \'Ato Blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura no campo de batalha.\\nAto Blasfemo causa 13 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lugares sagrados não são mais refúgios contra a morte, e a morte não é mais refúgio contra nada."\\n— Thalia, Cátara Cavaleira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3031b763-c3c0-4dd8-a23d-600e33e040e0\', \'multiverseId\': 452563}, \'multiverseid\': 452563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinkmottenurne\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn der Hauptphase vor dem Kampf jedes Spielers und falls die Blinkmottenurne ungetappt ist, erzeugt jener Spieler {C} für jedes Artefakt, das er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Vedalken bauen solche Urnen gerne in ihre lebenden Artefaktkreationen ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c93d9340-bc30-4d4c-83f2-3ed6dd431498\', \'multiverseId\': 451400}, \'multiverseid\': 451400}, {\'name\': \'Urna de polillas titilantes\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de la fase principal precombate de cada jugador, si la Urna de polillas titilantes está enderezada, ese jugador agrega {C} por cada artefacto que controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los vedalken incrustan estas urnas en sus artefactos vivientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac4cc26-b96f-4485-9f97-e68009daeede\', \'multiverseId\': 451648}, \'multiverseid\': 451648}, {\'name\': \'Urne à scintimite\', \'text\': "Au début de la première phase principale de chaque joueur, si l\'Urne à scintimite est dégagée, ce joueur ajoute {C} pour chaque artefact qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les vedalkens scellent ces urnes dans tous les artefacts vivants qu\'ils fabriquent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae497b73-443c-4916-8b88-a40c23ac7e17\', \'multiverseId\': 451896}, \'multiverseid\': 451896}, {\'name\': \'Urna di Lampidotteri\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della fase principale pre-combattimento di ogni giocatore, se l\'Urna di Lampidotteri è STAPpata, quel giocatore aggiunge {C} per ogni artefatto che controlla.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I vedalken incastonano queste urne in tutti gli artefatti viventi che creano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3d45e9-c091-4a66-b9d6-eb6b077faeef\', \'multiverseId\': 452144}, \'multiverseid\': 452144}, {\'name\': \'ちらつき蛾の甕\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーの戦闘前メイン・フェイズの開始時に、ちらつき蛾の甕がアンタップ状態である場合、そのプレイヤーは自分がコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ヴィダルケンは、この手の甕を生命を持つアーティファクトの中に埋め込んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca811f46-5a81-4ab9-8d70-c551fa25c957\', \'multiverseId\': 452392}, \'multiverseid\': 452392}, {\'name\': \'Urna de Mosco-lumes\', \'text\': \'No início da fase principal pré-combate de cada jogador, se Urna de Mosco-lumes estiver desvirada, aquele jogador adiciona {C} para cada artefato que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os vedalkeanos inserem essas urnas nos artefatos vivos que criam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd56299-f313-43eb-8164-418c665a281f\', \'multiverseId\': 452640}, \'multiverseid\': 452640}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutspurensucher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutspurensucher.\\nWenn der Blutspurensucher das Spiel verlässt, ziehe für jede +1/+1-Marke auf ihm eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Lauf schnell davon. Je mehr du dich verausgabst, desto stärker spüre ich deinen Herzschlag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f5f991-d342-4aaa-b721-ef38ed4bd2e5\', \'multiverseId\': 450674}, \'multiverseid\': 450674}, {\'name\': \'Rastreasangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{B}, pagar 2 vidas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Rastreasangre.\\nCuando el Rastreasangre deje el campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada contador +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Huye todo lo que quieras. Cuanto más corres, mejor se oye el latido de tu corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'790a8921-c90d-4c01-b9d8-d662e19c0976\', \'multiverseId\': 450733}, \'multiverseid\': 450733}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur de sang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{B}, payez 2 points de vie : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Traqueur de sang.\\nQuand le Traqueur de sang quitte le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Fuyez si vous voulez. Plus vous courez, plus je sens battre votre cœur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28466b88-ecc5-4d6a-8932-ee2f96d90c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 450792}, \'multiverseid\': 450792}, {\'name\': \'Braccasangue\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{B}, Paga 2 punti vita: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Braccasangue.\\nQuando il Braccasangue lascia il campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Scappa pure... Più lontano corri, più chiaramente avverto il battito del tuo cuore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1df5d93-5267-42eb-beca-6114a54cedce\', \'multiverseId\': 450851}, \'multiverseid\': 450851}, {\'name\': \'心臓追い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{B}, ２点のライフを支払う：心臓追いの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n心臓追いが戦場を離れたとき、これの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンター１個につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「どこへなりと逃げるがいい。遠くまで走るほど、お前の鼓動をはっきり感じるからな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca9911f-3726-47f6-9300-68ae3b882f16\', \'multiverseId\': 450910}, \'multiverseid\': 450910}, {\'name\': \'Hemorrastreador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{B}, pague 2 pontos de vida: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hemorrastreador.\\nQuando Hemorrastreador deixar o campo de batalha, compre um card para cada marcador +1/+1 nele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuja o quanto quiser. Quanto mais você corre, mais forte eu sinto sua pulsação."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'437a1592-a2ff-42d3-b28f-31f4a02a4d39\', \'multiverseId\': 450969}, \'multiverseid\': 450969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodensiegel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bodensiegel ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nKarten in Friedhöfen können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Mögen alle, die wir begraben haben, auf ewig begraben bleiben."\\n—Seton, Zentauren-Druide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451352&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d89d564-5cd9-4d6c-9efd-f66f91471be8\', \'multiverseId\': 451352}, \'multiverseid\': 451352}, {\'name\': \'Sello terrestre\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sello terrestre entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLas cartas de los cementerios no pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que todo lo que hemos enterrado esté enterrado eternamente".\\n—Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffbeb97d-cae9-4baa-8bc4-83791b5bc26f\', \'multiverseId\': 451600}, \'multiverseid\': 451600}, {\'name\': \'Sceau cthonien\', \'text\': \'Quand le Sceau cthonien arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLes cartes des cimetières ne peuvent pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Que ceux qui sont enterrés le restent à jamais. »\\n—Selton, druide centaure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b89d73-5fc9-4ed9-8ef5-2a6aab628927\', \'multiverseId\': 451848}, \'multiverseid\': 451848}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Terreno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sigillo Terreno entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLe carte nei cimiteri non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciamo che tutto ciò che abbiamo sepolto resti sepolto per sempre."\\n—Seton, druido centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a736e6e7-216c-4944-8e3a-5ae0e6817fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 452096}, \'multiverseid\': 452096}, {\'name\': \'地の封印\', \'text\': \'地の封印が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\n墓地にあるカードは呪文や能力の対象にならない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「我らが地に埋めたものすべて、永遠に放置するのだ。」\\n――ケンタウルスのドルイド、シートン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba225522-c574-42b1-9814-50a52189f11c\', \'multiverseId\': 452344}, \'multiverseid\': 452344}, {\'name\': \'Selo da Terra\', \'text\': \'Quando Selo da Terra entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nOs cards nos cemitérios não podem ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que todos os que nós enterramos fiquem enterrados para sempre."\\n— Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1af27e0-016b-4d85-841b-1e8824bd7efc\', \'multiverseId\': 452592}, \'multiverseid\': 452592}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e812c93-814e-41fa-82b2-9debdd42f589\', \'multiverseId\': 451441}, \'multiverseid\': 451441}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9373919-35f3-4960-94f5-dd588b0f0d43\', \'multiverseId\': 451689}, \'multiverseid\': 451689}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière du joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451937&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a07488d-5b6f-4f2c-90c5-4f1d36733203\', \'multiverseId\': 451937}, \'multiverseid\': 451937}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b30226-da56-48e8-8961-c7e22e4f97e4\', \'multiverseId\': 452185}, \'multiverseid\': 452185}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地からカードをすべて追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c865889b-ced8-4f71-9656-4853a83481e6\', \'multiverseId\': 452433}, \'multiverseid\': 452433}, {\'name\': \'Pântano de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Pântano de Bojuka entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Pântano de Bojuka entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9578026-21a1-4623-8ddf-d8ccb0460d44\', \'multiverseId\': 452681}, \'multiverseid\': 452681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boreas-Streitross\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Boreas-Streitross das Spiel verlässt, bestimme einen Gegner, der mehr Länder kontrolliert als du. Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach so vielen Ebene-Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt, und zeige sie offen vor. Bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel und nimm den Rest auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450661&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f565d8-f97f-443c-9ac7-e75f20b1936d\', \'multiverseId\': 450661}, \'multiverseid\': 450661}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso boreal\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Pegaso boreal deje el campo de batalla, elige un oponente que controla más tierras que tú. Busca en tu biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de Llanura igual a la diferencia y muéstralas. Pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y el resto en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19274c1-b687-4e5f-b7f3-1b86ae284a77\', \'multiverseId\': 450720}, \'multiverseid\': 450720}, {\'name\': \'Batailleur de borée\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Batailleur de borée quitte le champ de bataille, choisissez un adversaire qui contrôle plus de terrains que vous. Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de plaine égal à la différence et révélez-les. Mettez l\'une d\'elles sur le champ de bataille engagée et le reste dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b072b43-4b86-4b85-87a6-17d423984324\', \'multiverseId\': 450779}, \'multiverseid\': 450779}, {\'name\': \'Destriero della Tramontana\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Destriero della Tramontana lascia il campo di battaglia, scegli un avversario che controlla più terre di te. Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un numero di carte Pianura pari alla differenza e rivelale. Mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi le altre alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86867731-b72a-4d9f-916b-4b55bed7b3fc\', \'multiverseId\': 450838}, \'multiverseid\': 450838}, {\'name\': \'ボレアスの軍馬\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nボレアスの軍馬が戦場を離れたとき、土地をあなたよりも多くコントロールしている対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーから、その差に等しい枚数の平地・カードを探して公開する。そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'009d31c2-5a69-4341-a6e4-a8649f0e9fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 450897}, \'multiverseid\': 450897}, {\'name\': \'Corcel de Bóreas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Corcel de Bóreas deixar o campo de batalha, escolha um oponente que controla mais terrenos que você. Procure em seu grimório um número de cards de Planície igual à diferença e revele-os. Coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o restante em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c24435-3907-43c5-8e38-9f816aa75549\', \'multiverseId\': 450956}, \'multiverseid\': 450956}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bosh der Eisengolem\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{3}{R}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bosh der Eisengolem fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten des geopferten Artefakts zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Während Glissa nach der Wahrheit über Memnarch sucht, will Bosh die tief in seinem Gedächtnis vergrabenen Geheimnisse erforschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e2e669d-6283-4644-ae34-7f7c30aa2ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 451401}, \'multiverseid\': 451401}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, gólem de hierro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{3}{R}, sacrificar un artefacto: Bosh, gólem de hierro hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual al coste de maná convertido del artefacto sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Glissa busca la verdad sobre Memnarch, Bosh trata de desenterrar los secretos de su pasado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'438a99f9-579b-463e-b8b8-cebd06cd850d\', \'multiverseId\': 451649}, \'multiverseid\': 451649}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, golem de fer\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{3}{R}, sacrifiez un artefact : Bosh, golem de fer inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de l\'artefact sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': \'Alors que Glissa cherche à savoir la vérité sur Memnarch, Bosh cherche à déchiffrer les secrets enfouis au fond de sa mémoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec9db469-26d1-4d6e-b132-bac64d334dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 451897}, \'multiverseid\': 451897}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, Golem di Ferro\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Bosh, Golem di Ferro infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al costo di mana convertito dell\'artefatto sacrificato.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre Glissa cerca la verità su Memnarch, Bosh cerca di far riemergere i segreti sepolti negli abissi del suo passato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c5c867-7ab0-45d0-ace9-c01ed1b79e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 452145}, \'multiverseid\': 452145}, {\'name\': \'鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{3}{R}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュはそれに、その生け贄に捧げられたアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'グリッサがメムナークに関する真実を探すのと同じように、ボッシュも自分の記憶の奥深く埋もれた秘密を探そうとしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6920d5e8-41e8-466f-a8be-293d5c1fd6c2\', \'multiverseId\': 452393}, \'multiverseid\': 452393}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, Golem de Ferro\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\n{3}{R}, sacrifique um artefato: Bosh, Golem de Ferro, causa dano igual ao custo de mana convertido do artefato sacrificado a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto Glissa busca a verdade sobre o Memnarca, Bosh busca resgatar os segredos enterrados nas profundezas de sua memória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f95b80-c2c9-47d6-b902-c22748df71c1\', \'multiverseId\': 452641}, \'multiverseid\': 452641}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botschaft\', \'text\': \'Ziehe vier Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch wenn der Brief viele Seiten lang war, wusste ich alles, was ich wissen musste, nach einem Blick auf das Gesicht des Überbringers."\\n—Barrin, Meisterzauberer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02eddc7-b757-4158-b398-578f423c1266\', \'multiverseId\': 451311}, \'multiverseid\': 451311}, {\'name\': \'Informes\', \'text\': \'Roba cuatro cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aunque la carta tenía varias páginas, puedo afirmar que todo lo que necesitaba saber lo supe con mirar la cara del mensajero".\\n—Barrin, mago experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5153a9ba-50f6-47da-90c2-a4df5b600dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 451559}, \'multiverseid\': 451559}, {\'name\': \'Nouvelles\', \'text\': \'Piochez quatre cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les bonnes nouvelles sont toujours retardées, et les mauvaises ont des ailes. »\\n—Voltaire\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9f7f41-a787-4ef7-bb65-ee8006ea1356\', \'multiverseId\': 451807}, \'multiverseid\': 451807}, {\'name\': \'Novelle\', \'text\': \'Pesca quattro carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Nonostante la lettera contenesse diverse pagine, mi bastò uno sguardo al volto del messaggero per capire tutto."\\n—Barrin, mago insegnante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8814992b-23dc-4e8c-8ce5-fa3814988078\', \'multiverseId\': 452055}, \'multiverseid\': 452055}, {\'name\': \'連絡\', \'text\': \'カードを４枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「手紙は何枚にも渡っていたけど、知りたかったことはすべて使者の顔を一目見ればわかったよ。」\\n――練達の魔術師バリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d8290a-301a-4bde-8ede-8c588484a174\', \'multiverseId\': 452303}, \'multiverseid\': 452303}, {\'name\': \'Novidades\', \'text\': \'Compre quatro cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Embora a carta se estendesse por muitas e muitas páginas, fiquei sabendo de tudo o que precisava com apenas um olhar para o rosto do mensageiro."\\n— Barrin, mago mestre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b686581-2cfb-48a1-8635-53eccf2ab21d\', \'multiverseId\': 452551}, \'multiverseid\': 452551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bottich der Nachäffung\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du jene Karte ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, lege alle anderen Karten, die du mit dem Bottich der Nachäffung ins Exil geschickt hast, auf den Friedhof ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\n{3}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer mit dem Bottich der Nachäffung ins Exil geschickten Karte ist. Er hat Eile. Schicke ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e356e7b-76d0-476a-b7cc-661827997459\', \'multiverseId\': 451412}, \'multiverseid\': 451412}, {\'name\': \'Tanque mímico\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Siempre que una criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes exiliar esa carta. Si lo haces, regresa cada una de las otras cartas exiliadas con el Tanque mímico al cementerio de su propietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de una carta exiliada con el Tanque mímico. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01403c2-7fa9-4702-a1dc-4fbf63ca7ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 451660}, \'multiverseid\': 451660}, {\'name\': \'Cuve de mimétisme\', \'text\': "Empreinte — À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez exiler cette carte. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez chaque autre carte exilée par la Cuve de mimétisme dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\\n{3}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la carte exilée par la Cuve de mimétisme. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4390fbce-ada0-4915-97ec-55cdbd4b703d\', \'multiverseId\': 451908}, \'multiverseid\': 451908}, {\'name\': \'Vasca del Mimic\', \'text\': "Imprimere — Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina muore, puoi esiliare quella carta. Se lo fai, fai tornare ogni altra carta esiliata con la Vasca del Mimic nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di una carta esiliata con la Vasca del Mimic. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba51ee1-88b9-4b1f-8f03-b3b4ebaa742f\', \'multiverseId\': 452156}, \'multiverseid\': 452156}, {\'name\': \'ミミックの大桶\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― トークンでないクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたはそのカードを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、ミミックの大桶によって追放された他の各カードをオーナーの墓地に戻す。\\n{3}, {T}：ミミックの大桶によって追放されたカードのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f0c7a2-061b-4aef-8512-66d2ce4885c9\', \'multiverseId\': 452404}, \'multiverseid\': 452404}, {\'name\': \'Barril de Mímica\', \'text\': \'Estampar — Toda vez que uma criatura que não seja ficha morrer, você poderá exilar aquele card. Se fizer isso, devolva cada outro card exilado com Barril de Mímica ao cemitério de seu dono.\\n{3}, {T}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de um card exilado com Barril de Mímica. Ela ganha ímpeto. Exile-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28367f9-5cfd-4276-abe8-efc16b1a3c24\', \'multiverseId\': 452652}, \'multiverseid\': 452652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandrodung\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Fleck der Erde ist wirklich unfruchtbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451353&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48da117e-1a69-44d4-90bd-e175b7eb3377\', \'multiverseId\': 451353}, \'multiverseid\': 451353}, {\'name\': \'Gradar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza no hay lugares del todo yermos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af00488-8fee-4c28-890f-45b358b4ce6b\', \'multiverseId\': 451601}, \'multiverseid\': 451601}, {\'name\': \'Hersage\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne renonce jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e704cc8-ade5-4f5b-a175-ae357124c428\', \'multiverseId\': 451849}, \'multiverseid\': 451849}, {\'name\': \'Erpice\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una terra.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'In natura nessun luogo è realmente spoglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f471a1-7b38-468f-958c-35328d501a53\', \'multiverseId\': 452097}, \'multiverseid\': 452097}, {\'name\': \'砕土\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらを戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の中には、真の意味で不毛の地などはないのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'059e96ee-8f49-49b6-a53b-02855f633ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 452345}, \'multiverseid\': 452345}, {\'name\': \'Estorrar\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique um terreno.\\nProcure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhum lugar na natureza é verdadeiramente estéril.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b78df1-befb-4abd-9b32-c3a0eb769d90\', \'multiverseId\': 452593}, \'multiverseid\': 452593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brudiclad, Telchor-Ingenieur\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nErzeuge zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug einen 2/1 blauen Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. Du kannst dann einen Spielstein bestimmen, den du kontrollierst. Falls du dies tust, wird jeder andere Spielstein, den du kontrollierst, zu einer Kopie des bestimmten Spielsteins.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891441d7-d24d-4864-934a-46c38dc83137\', \'multiverseId\': 450699}, \'multiverseid\': 450699}, {\'name\': \'Brúdiclad, ingeniero telchor\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Myr azul 2/1. Luego puedes elegir una ficha que controlas. Si lo haces, cada otra ficha que controlas se convierte en una copia de esa ficha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Artífice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0acbf97a-b366-40f9-a7f2-9744902251e0\', \'multiverseId\': 450758}, \'multiverseid\': 450758}, {\'name\': \'Brudiclad, ingénieur telchor\', \'text\': \'Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/1 bleue Myr. Vous pouvez ensuite choisir un jeton que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque autre jeton que vous contrôlez devient une copie de ce jeton.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ca6495-04b8-48d1-ad48-ee89fa36d06c\', \'multiverseId\': 450817}, \'multiverseid\': 450817}, {\'name\': \'Brudiclad, Ingegnere Telchor\', \'text\': "Le pedine creatura che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Myr 2/1 blu. Poi puoi scegliere una pedina che controlli. Se lo fai, ogni altra pedina che controlli diventa una copia di quella pedina.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Artefice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa660143-aee2-4b4b-8b0b-37b938fa9067\', \'multiverseId\': 450876}, \'multiverseid\': 450876}, {\'name\': \'テルカーの技師、ブルーディクラッド\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークンは速攻を持つ。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、青の２/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。その後、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているトークン１つを選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたがコントロールしている他の各トークンはそれぞれ、そのトークンのコピーになる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7588dd8-00ee-42c5-9159-23781a8219c1\', \'multiverseId\': 450935}, \'multiverseid\': 450935}, {\'name\': \'Brudiclad, Engenheiro Telchoriano\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla têm ímpeto.\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato azul 2/1 do tipo Myr. Em seguida, você pode escolher uma ficha que você controla. Se fizer isso, cada outra ficha que você controla se torna uma cópia daquela ficha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bea9a76-dafa-4003-9e68-b6bedfb8b32d\', \'multiverseId\': 450994}, \'multiverseid\': 450994}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruna vom Alabasterschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Bruna vom Alabasterschwarm angreift oder blockt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Auren im Spiel an sie anlegen und eine beliebige Anzahl an Aura-Karten, die sie verzaubern könnten, aus deinem Friedhof und/oder deiner Hand an sie angelegt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e1ebf23-a221-4590-8093-ca0e85e4bbdb\', \'multiverseId\': 451373}, \'multiverseid\': 451373}, {\'name\': \'Bruna, Luz de Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nSiempre que Bruna, Luz de Alabastro ataque o bloquee, puedes anexarle cualquier cantidad de Auras que haya en el campo de batalla y puedes poner en el campo de batalla, anexadas a ella, cualquier cantidad de cartas de Aura que puedan encantarla desde tu cementerio y/o tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0006009b-cbea-4636-a5df-8d7328afab19\', \'multiverseId\': 451621}, \'multiverseid\': 451621}, {\'name\': "Bruna, Lumière d\'albâtre", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Bruna, Lumière d\'albâtre attaque ou bloque, vous pouvez lui attacher n\'importe quel nombre d\'auras sur le champ de bataille et vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, attachées à elle, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'aura qui pourraient l\'enchanter depuis votre cimetière et/ou votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc109b8f-29ff-4760-940b-c9677f224d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 451869}, \'multiverseid\': 451869}, {\'name\': \'Bruna, Luce di Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\\nOgniqualvolta Bruna, Luce di Alabastro attacca o blocca, puoi assegnarle un qualsiasi numero di Aure sul campo di battaglia e puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia a lei assegnate un qualsiasi numero di carte Aura che possono incantarla dal tuo cimitero e/o dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01465b04-0591-4c6b-a93a-a3c9c16a2bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 452117}, \'multiverseid\': 452117}, {\'name\': \'雪花石を率いる者、ブルーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n雪花石を率いる者、ブルーナが攻撃かブロックするたび、あなたは戦場にあるオーラ望む数をこれにつけてもよく、あなたの墓地や手札からこれをエンチャントできるオーラ・カード望む数を、これにつけられた状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd612b0-f54a-4a05-bf83-9572edce12e8\', \'multiverseId\': 452365}, \'multiverseid\': 452365}, {\'name\': \'Bruna, Luz do Bando Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\nToda vez que Bruna, Luz do Bando Alabastro, ataca ou bloqueia, você pode anexar a ela um número qualquer de Auras do campo de batalha, e pode colocar no campo de batalha anexado a ela qualquer número de cards de Aura que poderiam encantá-la vindos de seu cemitério e/ou de sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ba77fd-632c-4ebe-a0b0-32e552fdd64b\', \'multiverseId\': 452613}, \'multiverseid\': 452613}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutstätte\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Erzeuge einen 5/5 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist die einzige Wasserquelle inmitten der Wüste, doch die örtlichen Stämme meiden sie um jeden Preis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f60e8f-ef32-49f2-89fe-f9d20ea6a954\', \'multiverseId\': 451366}, \'multiverseid\': 451366}, {\'name\': \'Suelos natales\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 5/5 con la habilidad de arrollar".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Es la única fuente de agua que hay en kilómetros de desierto, pero las tribus locales la evitan a toda costa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a65dd403-945e-4807-8d9b-c278f1b452a8\', \'multiverseId\': 451614}, \'multiverseid\': 451614}, {\'name\': \'Terrains de prolifération\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 5/5 verte Bête avec le piétinement. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la seule source d\'eau du désert à des lieues à la ronde, mais les tribus locales l\'évitent à tout prix.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf213861-372b-4899-9e8b-1e869fc7c9b3\', \'multiverseId\': 451862}, \'multiverseid\': 451862}, {\'name\': \'Terreno di Proliferazione\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Crea una pedina creatura Bestia 5/5 verde con travolgere".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "È l\'unica fonte d\'acqua in chilometri di deserto, ma le tribù locali la evitano a ogni costo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d0f8602-aa7a-4ecd-93d6-e43bd9f5cbec\', \'multiverseId\': 452110}, \'multiverseid\': 452110}, {\'name\': \'繁殖場\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地は「{T}：トランプルを持つ緑の５/５のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'それは何里も続く砂漠の中にある唯一の水源地ではあるが、周辺の部族は決してそこに近づこうとしない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a78ecc-8f7e-43fd-99c0-875f9806ffdf\', \'multiverseId\': 452358}, \'multiverseid\': 452358}, {\'name\': \'Área de Reprodução\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nO terreno encantado tem "{T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 5/5 do tipo Besta com atropelar."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A única fonte de água em quilômetros de deserto, mas as tribos locais a evitam a todo custo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36fb4fab-30f9-4ab2-a0a0-451cd73767c6\', \'multiverseId\': 452606}, \'multiverseid\': 452606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brütende Drachenmutter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/2 roten Drache-Ei-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verteidiger und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und ‚{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450684&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91b1cc5-eb34-41f9-9941-0c14df4266bf\', \'multiverseId\': 450684}, \'multiverseid\': 450684}, {\'name\': \'Dragona en anidación\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Huevo Dragón roja 0/2 con la habilidad de defensor y "Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar y \\\'{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'289c6daf-4ea8-4d82-b67e-57bcfbde0c4b\', \'multiverseId\': 450743}, \'multiverseid\': 450743}, {\'name\': \'Dragonne nidifiante\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\\\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 0/2 rouge Dragon et Œuf avec le défenseur et « Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol et "{R} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\\\'à la fin du tour" ».\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc4eeece-3fcf-4d12-bfde-ad1acd1591ae\', \'multiverseId\': 450802}, \'multiverseid\': 450802}, {\'name\': \'Drago in Cova\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Uovo di Drago 0/2 rossa con difensore e "Quando questa creatura muore, crea una pedina creatura Drago 2/2 rossa con volare e \\\'{R}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ba69328-094d-4fdd-84d0-2cb72e87d487\', \'multiverseId\': 450861}, \'multiverseid\': 450861}, {\'name\': \'巣ごもりドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、防衛と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行と『{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。』を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ赤の０/２のドラゴン・卵・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c7ce4e-674c-4d0f-a9a2-54d3c8343c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 450920}, \'multiverseid\': 450920}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Aninhador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 0/2 do tipo Ovo de Dragão com defensor e "Quando esta criatura morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 2/2 do tipo Dragão com voar e \\\'{R}: Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fb4124-3062-47d8-aaa5-bffbc28aa56d\', \'multiverseId\': 450979}, \'multiverseid\': 450979}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt diese in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb17d32b-9f65-45ec-92b7-ea81096d820b\', \'multiverseId\': 451325}, \'multiverseid\': 451325}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22bdc9b7-a1d0-4b5e-a5c2-7eab21adb2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 451573}, \'multiverseid\': 451573}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire du permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce733072-09b8-4571-a0d8-af93e9c0b35d\', \'multiverseId\': 451821}, \'multiverseid\': 451821}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020e6ddc-a64b-489d-91da-2a454b4d0cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 452069}, \'multiverseid\': 452069}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f99ca84d-4635-41bd-a804-804551e4ebc6\', \'multiverseId\': 452317}, \'multiverseid\': 452317}, {\'name\': \'Distorção Caótica\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo a embaralha no próprio grimório e depois revela o card do topo do próprio grimório. Se for um card de permanente, ele o coloca no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6319fd2-00f9-473f-a5c6-4227354c7eb3\', \'multiverseId\': 452565}, \'multiverseid\': 452565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daxos von Meletis\', \'text\': \'Daxos von Meletis kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder größer nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn Daxos von Meletis einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten der ins Exil geschickten Karte dazu. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fb4194-1040-496f-b5c0-3b5e51c23da2\', \'multiverseId\': 451376}, \'multiverseid\': 451376}, {\'name\': \'Daxos de Meletis\', \'text\': \'Daxos de Meletis no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 3 o más.\\nSiempre que Daxos de Meletis haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Ganas vidas igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes gastar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73975fca-95d5-4720-ae4d-2bc0e32a56e9\', \'multiverseId\': 451624}, \'multiverseid\': 451624}, {\'name\': \'Daxos de Mélétis\', \'text\': "Daxos de Mélétis ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 3.\\nÀ chaque fois que Daxos de Mélétis inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que le coût converti de mana de cette carte. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241dce0e-7652-4b4b-80ab-4e043653335d\', \'multiverseId\': 451872}, \'multiverseid\': 451872}, {\'name\': \'Daxos di Meletis\', \'text\': \'Daxos di Meletis non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o superiore a 3.\\nOgniqualvolta Daxos di Meletis infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di quel giocatore. Guadagni punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare quella carta e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa76eadf-ff28-4a0b-8ea0-598b77b35fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 452120}, \'multiverseid\': 452120}, {\'name\': \'メレティスのダクソス\', \'text\': \'メレティスのダクソスは、パワーが３以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\nメレティスのダクソスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。あなたはそのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを得る。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、あなたはその呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0586e1c7-fa50-414f-91ed-74fcee85c28d\', \'multiverseId\': 452368}, \'multiverseid\': 452368}, {\'name\': \'Daxos de Meletis\', \'text\': \'Daxos de Meletis não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas de poder igual ou superior a 3.\\nToda vez que Daxos de Meletis causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile o card do topo do grimório daquele jogador. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar aquele card e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para fazê-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66da73f3-8faa-4f55-83c6-10954daf941c\', \'multiverseId\': 452616}, \'multiverseid\': 452616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dem Zerfall überlassen\', \'text\': \'Streben — Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{G} mehr.\\nZerstöre eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefakten und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451339&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5944ba06-39bc-44d7-b143-a8699494faf9\', \'multiverseId\': 451339}, \'multiverseid\': 451339}, {\'name\': \'Entregar al polvo\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Te cuesta {2}{G} más lanzar este hechizo por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nDestruye cualquier cantidad de artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c178015-7bf0-4eec-9cc4-797ad0813f05\', \'multiverseId\': 451587}, \'multiverseid\': 451587}, {\'name\': \'Vouer à la poussière\', \'text\': "Obstination — Ce sort coûte {2}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nDétruisez n\'importe quel nombre d\'artefacts et/ou d\'enchantements ciblés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d2c324-3dae-4839-993e-28a5114a64fe\', \'multiverseId\': 451835}, \'multiverseid\': 451835}, {\'name\': \'Relegare nella Polvere\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Questa magia costa {2}{G} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nDistruggi un qualsiasi numero di artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccfa66c4-4236-4633-8cb0-8e571598d804\', \'multiverseId\': 452083}, \'multiverseid\': 452083}, {\'name\': \'塵への回帰\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{G}多くなる。\\nアーティファクトやエンチャント望む数を対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13bd02b-fa88-4d8b-85e8-9b1a4434c786\', \'multiverseId\': 452331}, \'multiverseid\': 452331}, {\'name\': \'Entregar ao Pó\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Esta mágica custa {2}{G} a mais para ser conjurada para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nDestrua qualquer número de artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3772c22c-7772-4d18-b6cb-a1b5fc9dbffc\', \'multiverseId\': 452579}, \'multiverseid\': 452579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele Arten von Anarchie: sozial, individuell, Gruul …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b59cd7-3cfa-48e8-aa0a-d0a3eb1fb500\', \'multiverseId\': 451378}, \'multiverseid\': 451378}, {\'name\': \'Diezmar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo, la criatura objetivo, el encantamiento objetivo y la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La anarquía llega de muchas formas: social, individual, gruul...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2f5a37-ddd5-4f3d-8ce6-69f6868aa801\', \'multiverseId\': 451626}, \'multiverseid\': 451626}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée, l\'enchantement ciblé et le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchie se présente sous bien des formes : sociale, individuelle, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'997e42bb-6620-4277-8c7e-75d8c98f94f4\', \'multiverseId\': 451874}, \'multiverseid\': 451874}, {\'name\': \'Decimare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio, una creatura bersaglio, un incantesimo bersaglio e una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchia può assumere diverse forme: sociale, individuale, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b547c1a7-cdb6-4e81-9d34-65c18cf4bc2c\', \'multiverseId\': 452122}, \'multiverseid\': 452122}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つと、クリーチャー１体と、エンチャント１つと、土地１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序とはさまざまな形態で存在する。社会、個人、グルール、……。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2215bc-b9e4-4489-b9fd-d7d6756883a4\', \'multiverseId\': 452370}, \'multiverseid\': 452370}, {\'name\': \'Dizimar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo, a criatura alvo, o encantamento alvo e o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A anarquia tem muitas formas: social, individual, Gruul...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef70bfc-8883-41ab-9eab-41bd8b8aab1d\', \'multiverseId\': 452618}, \'multiverseid\': 452618}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451445&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b62ff5c-e8df-4f7f-bfc7-61ebdac08dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 451445}, \'multiverseid\': 451445}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49550a0-d64e-4b3e-a35b-02c5b8c70b11\', \'multiverseId\': 451693}, \'multiverseid\': 451693}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451941&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a419b16f-671d-4812-a2ed-f0ba623570b2\', \'multiverseId\': 451941}, \'multiverseid\': 451941}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca379057-1aad-40b9-ad9a-dd6c9e2aab90\', \'multiverseId\': 452189}, \'multiverseid\': 452189}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4407a10f-76dc-4377-85b0-31db8eefe24a\', \'multiverseId\': 452437}, \'multiverseid\': 452437}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduto Dimir\', \'text\': \'Aqueduto Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Aqueduto Dimir entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1451ddc9-7929-4201-be01-5bed1ea0ea87\', \'multiverseId\': 452685}, \'multiverseid\': 452685}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'In den kalten Korridoren der Unterstadt verbreiten sich von Dämmerhülle aus Fehlinformationen wie auslaufendes Öl.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451446&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5b026f-d94a-496c-8f58-733d492aba69\', \'multiverseId\': 451446}, \'multiverseid\': 451446}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'En los fríos corredores de la subciudad, la desinformación desde Mantoscuro se extiende como una mancha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e85785fc-c16e-42a3-bb2d-202bfaab2f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 451694}, \'multiverseid\': 451694}, {\'name\': \'Porte de la guilde de Dimir\', \'text\': \'La Porte de la guilde de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': "Dans les couloirs froids de la Citerraine, la mésinformation s\'épand telle une tache autour de Manteaubrune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451942&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9af4a3c-14bf-4855-b996-e93a15fc0d10\', \'multiverseId\': 451942}, \'multiverseid\': 451942}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': "Nei freddi tunnel della città sepolta, le false notizie si diffondono da Mantoscuro come macchie d\'olio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b82f1ef-3b1b-4a76-81d9-e81eb3dfde00\', \'multiverseId\': 452190}, \'multiverseid\': 452190}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのギルド門\', \'text\': \'ディミーアのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'地下の寒い回廊で、ダスクマントルからの誤報が染みのように伝播し、広がっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98159e08-5c45-4dc3-898e-25dc5a69c90e\', \'multiverseId\': 452438}, \'multiverseid\': 452438}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Nos frios corredores do submundo, a desinformação alastra-se de Manto do Crepúsculo como uma doença.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbcfda48-30b5-476c-9701-8818aa5097e0\', \'multiverseId\': 452686}, \'multiverseid\': 452686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Symbol der Dimir bekommen nur die eigenen Mitglieder als Erkennungszeichen der geheimen Gilde zu sehen — und die Verdammten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451406&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32dbeb7-a707-4466-a30b-8d41e456e94b\', \'multiverseId\': 451406}, \'multiverseid\': 451406}, {\'name\': \'Sello dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Como emblema de un gremio secreto, la insignia dimir solo la conocen sus propios miembros... y los condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78662662-db2d-43b2-bbf6-a4d9be37bf90\', \'multiverseId\': 451654}, \'multiverseid\': 451654}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'insigne de Dimir est l\'emblème d\'une guilde secrète, et seuls ses membres le voient — ses membres, mais aussi ses victimes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333c5f66-b793-48f3-abe0-f238180c674c\', \'multiverseId\': 451902}, \'multiverseid\': 451902}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema di una gilda segreta, le insegne dei Dimir possono essere viste solo dai suoi membri e da coloro che sono condannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a4dbdb-0158-4641-828e-0211cb2cd4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 452150}, \'multiverseid\': 452150}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち、そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9bf537-5f73-428a-9685-d5408353183a\', \'multiverseId\': 452398}, \'multiverseid\': 452398}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema de uma guilda secreta, a insígnia Dimir só é vista por seus próprios membros — e pelos condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3957c39-1f74-4b58-a851-1ccb9db3f37f\', \'multiverseId\': 452646}, \'multiverseid\': 452646}]', "[{'name': 'Dornwaldfälle', 'text': 'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451490&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e634388c-9019-4cb3-a756-62bb676d64fd', 'multiverseId': 451490}, 'multiverseid': 451490}, {'name': 'Cascadas bosquespinoso', 'text': 'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451738&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28b968f6-3025-45b9-ace6-349104d63c40', 'multiverseId': 451738}, 'multiverseid': 451738}, {'name': 'Chutes de Boisépine', 'text': 'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451986&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a88ae4b2-2757-48ef-9777-79d3900dc45a', 'multiverseId': 451986}, 'multiverseid': 451986}, {'name': 'Cascate di Boscorovo', 'text': 'Le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452234&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '481eeeb4-54e9-4dbd-8b10-b5ed92e4af30', 'multiverseId': 452234}, 'multiverseid': 452234}, {'name': '茨森の滝', 'text': '茨森の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n茨森の滝が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452482&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4622975-511b-4e5f-ab64-0aae05945532', 'multiverseId': 452482}, 'multiverseid': 452482}, {'name': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos', 'text': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452730&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6231036d-a8aa-4fb6-a746-442432029766', 'multiverseId': 452730}, 'multiverseid': 452730}]", "[{'name': 'Dschinn der Wünsche', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Dschinn der Wünsche kommt mit drei Wunschmarken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{U}{U}, entferne eine Wunschmarke vom Dschinn der Wünsche: Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst die Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, schicke sie ins Exil.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dschinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451290&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7810292-7dfa-43de-9278-872a0067b91d', 'multiverseId': 451290}, 'multiverseid': 451290}, {'name': 'Djinn de los deseos', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nEl Djinn de los deseos entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de deseo sobre él.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remover un contador de deseo del Djinn de los deseos: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lo haces, exíliala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451538&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea87ad00-f10e-479b-8908-b2bc4075f801', 'multiverseId': 451538}, 'multiverseid': 451538}, {'name': 'Djinn aux souhaits', 'text': 'Vol\\nLe Djinn aux souhaits arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « souhait ».\\n{2}{U}{U}, retirez un marqueur « souhait » du Djinn aux souhaits : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne le faites pas, exilez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451786&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c58f6c27-4c91-45a5-ad4a-5c2c6e24dd5d', 'multiverseId': 451786}, 'multiverseid': 451786}, {'name': 'Genio dei Desideri', 'text': 'Volare\\nIl Genio dei Desideri entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini desiderio.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino desiderio dal Genio dei Desideri: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lo fai, esiliala.', 'type': 'Creatura — Genio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452034&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc3e7902-f97c-4e8c-a9b0-8e39a2dcd138', 'multiverseId': 452034}, 'multiverseid': 452034}, {'name': '願いのジン', 'text': '飛行\\n願いのジンは、願いカウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{U}{U}, 願いのジンの上から願いカウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。そうしないなら、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452282&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdf4b673-e7ee-46fb-aa3c-70e5dd3868bf', 'multiverseId': 452282}, 'multiverseid': 452282}, {'name': 'Gênio dos Desejos', 'text': 'Voar\\nGênio dos Desejos entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores de desejo.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remova um marcador de desejo de Gênio dos Desejos: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se não fizer isso, exile-o.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gênio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452530&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f9ac27b-df4b-44a7-8ce8-0c6ff4705a66', 'multiverseId': 452530}, 'multiverseid': 452530}]", "[{'name': 'Dschungellichtung', 'text': 'Die Dschungellichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dschungellichtung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451462&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db27244b-0f3b-4b26-84c8-6e00ae32e68a', 'multiverseId': 451462}, 'multiverseid': 451462}, {'name': 'Hondonada selvática', 'text': 'La Hondonada selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Hondonada selvática entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451710&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '654264df-5028-496c-a1a5-f9305ef053f0', 'multiverseId': 451710}, 'multiverseid': 451710}, {'name': 'Dépression de jungle', 'text': 'La Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451958&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '061449b2-4501-462a-8afa-6f49b2462ee9', 'multiverseId': 451958}, 'multiverseid': 451958}, {'name': 'Conca nella Giungla', 'text': 'La Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452206&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76a5586d-9dd0-4c60-8ae1-2bd6379e0cdd', 'multiverseId': 452206}, 'multiverseid': 452206}, {'name': 'ジャングルのうろ穴', 'text': 'ジャングルのうろ穴はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルのうろ穴が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452454&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9303393-6466-4cb7-aa8a-db6e01962501', 'multiverseId': 452454}, 'multiverseid': 452454}, {'name': 'Clareira na Selva', 'text': 'Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452702&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3d69049-3ad0-4104-81e8-fa4589739a40', 'multiverseId': 452702}, 'multiverseid': 452702}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duplikant\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn der Duplikant ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken.\\nSolange eine Karte, die mit dem Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde, eine Kreaturenkarte ist, hat der Duplikant die Stärke, Widerstandskraft und Kreaturentypen der letzten Kreaturenkarte, die mit dem Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde. Er ist immer noch ein Gestaltwandler.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f11101f-9315-4e5c-8b30-7caa581c376b\', \'multiverseId\': 451408}, \'multiverseid\': 451408}, {\'name\': \'Duplicante\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Cuando el Duplicante entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo que no sea ficha.\\nMientras la carta exiliada con el Duplicante sea una carta de criatura, el Duplicante tiene la fuerza, resistencia y tipos de criatura de la última criatura exiliada con el Duplicante. Aún se considera un metamorfo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41dd586c-6998-4471-8a44-9280829f4606\', \'multiverseId\': 451656}, \'multiverseid\': 451656}, {\'name\': \'Répliquant\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand le Répliquant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une créature non-jeton ciblée.\\nTant que la carte exilée par le Répliquant est une carte de créature, le Répliquant a la force, l\'endurance et les types de créature de la dernière carte de créature exilée par le Répliquant. C\'est toujours un changeforme.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35fd2ac3-31d8-417a-9329-07721b39943c\', \'multiverseId\': 451904}, \'multiverseid\': 451904}, {\'name\': \'Replicatore\', \'text\': "Imprimere — Quando il Replicatore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una creatura non pedina bersaglio.\\nFintanto che una carta esiliata con il Replicatore è una carta creatura, il Replicatore ha la forza, la costituzione e i tipi di creatura dell\'ultima carta creatura esiliata con il Replicatore. È ancora un Polimorfo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367116cf-6f06-4bf8-b03f-d4f673741329\', \'multiverseId\': 452152}, \'multiverseid\': 452152}, {\'name\': \'映し身人形\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 映し身人形が戦場に出たとき、トークンでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\n映し身人形によって追放されたカードがクリーチャー・カードであるかぎり、映し身人形は、映し身人形によって最後に追放されたクリーチャー・カードのパワーとタフネスとクリーチャー・タイプを持つ。これは多相の戦士でもある。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036e0191-ea7f-401f-bd0b-e791a6813910\', \'multiverseId\': 452400}, \'multiverseid\': 452400}, {\'name\': \'Duplicante\', \'text\': \'Estampar — Quando Duplicante entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar a criatura alvo que não seja uma ficha.\\nEnquanto um card exilado com Duplicante for um card de criatura, Duplicante terá o poder, a resistência e todos os tipos de criatura do último card de criatura exilado com Duplicante. Ele ainda é um Metamorfo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe09cdc-d973-4091-b212-1098b6b73693\', \'multiverseId\': 452648}, \'multiverseid\': 452648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerhüllenseher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckt jeder Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf, verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten der aufgedeckten Karte und nimmt sie dann auf seine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7538f2a-cb7b-4bf4-931b-c4e0ff39ed5b\', \'multiverseId\': 451379}, \'multiverseid\': 451379}, {\'name\': \'Vidente de Mantoscuro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl principio de tu mantenimiento, cada jugador muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca, pierde una cantidad de vidas igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta y luego la pone en su mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f325dac-aabc-43f4-8542-9291c1825318\', \'multiverseId\': 451627}, \'multiverseid\': 451627}, {\'name\': \'Voyant de Manteaubrune\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque, perd un nombre de points de vie égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte puis la met dans sa main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13e5616-e5a1-4ca4-b3cf-0219d1e576d7\', \'multiverseId\': 451875}, \'multiverseid\': 451875}, {\'name\': \'Veggente di Mantoscuro\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni giocatore rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio, perde punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta, poi la aggiunge alla propria mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6552e535-596b-4d58-a85d-46b8d582e5fe\', \'multiverseId\': 452123}, \'multiverseid\': 452123}, {\'name\': \'ダスクマントルの予見者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開し、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを失い、その後それを自分の手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'877da0b1-ee11-41f5-a267-2987c4a3b4f4\', \'multiverseId\': 452371}, \'multiverseid\': 452371}, {\'name\': \'Vidente do Manto do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, cada jogador revela o card do topo do próprio grimório, perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card e depois o coloca na própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14d52951-263a-432f-bc8b-a1b4dc282e1a\', \'multiverseId\': 452619}, \'multiverseid\': 452619}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451496&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79d42a0b-5403-4f3f-a068-a0b433e3590e', 'multiverseId': 451496}, 'multiverseid': 451496}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451744&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9d02674-97dd-4f22-8912-79d9c753acf4', 'multiverseId': 451744}, 'multiverseid': 451744}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451992&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4834aa45-807b-4ac8-b842-88bd02d29553', 'multiverseId': 451992}, 'multiverseid': 451992}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452240&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e00556f-117e-47fd-8cb5-12c576fcc247', 'multiverseId': 452240}, 'multiverseid': 452240}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452488&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62d85f99-771a-4dcd-bcd1-f4bcce5b110e', 'multiverseId': 452488}, 'multiverseid': 452488}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452736&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6387aae7-a29a-4c19-a844-246a0c64bd6b', 'multiverseId': 452736}, 'multiverseid': 452736}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451497&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aaa7ccf-d380-4a17-8b72-be790887d947', 'multiverseId': 451497}, 'multiverseid': 451497}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451745&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3f25810-9a56-4118-b1f5-0652d6fdc98e', 'multiverseId': 451745}, 'multiverseid': 451745}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451993&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14cbe9c6-b82e-4e8b-adae-9e910d21b2df', 'multiverseId': 451993}, 'multiverseid': 451993}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452241&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7da0b4c0-febd-4c07-9072-f21d13a0eae1', 'multiverseId': 452241}, 'multiverseid': 452241}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452489&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fb8a8be-4bdb-4f87-99c5-47208a2578e2', 'multiverseId': 452489}, 'multiverseid': 452489}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452737&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b97c7975-cca6-4c13-8910-9965588f759e', 'multiverseId': 452737}, 'multiverseid': 452737}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451498&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90dea586-7f37-4e37-9561-2eed03788c74', 'multiverseId': 451498}, 'multiverseid': 451498}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451746&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dd5c0c3-0f09-45af-9b1b-27dd069dcb29', 'multiverseId': 451746}, 'multiverseid': 451746}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451994&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe8dba7b-da23-43a1-b2c8-78dac2d1f96d', 'multiverseId': 451994}, 'multiverseid': 451994}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452242&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a61c3f0f-ac09-4f4e-a832-d9835ac444b6', 'multiverseId': 452242}, 'multiverseid': 452242}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452490&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '668a8f9b-e860-429b-aeed-45332423f371', 'multiverseId': 452490}, 'multiverseid': 452490}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452738&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34e2e623-369c-46d0-8793-169601a3b4be', 'multiverseId': 452738}, 'multiverseid': 452738}]", '[{\'name\': \'Echosturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du in dieser Partie deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\\nErzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Artefakts deiner Wahl ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Eine organisierte und methodische Vervielfältigung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450667&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b62a4632-aa49-4e24-a957-f202d4040674\', \'multiverseId\': 450667}, \'multiverseid\': 450667}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta de ecos\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que lanzaste a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.\\nCrea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una reproducción organizada y metódica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a177ee0-8905-4790-a20f-9f879c5911ee\', \'multiverseId\': 450726}, \'multiverseid\': 450726}, {\'name\': "Déluge d\'échos", \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez déjà lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.\\nCréez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une reproduction méthodique et structurée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598357b4-2338-4051-a6bb-0573b0bc4c11\', \'multiverseId\': 450785}, \'multiverseid\': 450785}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta di Echi\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai lanciato il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.\\nCrea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Una riproduzione organizzata e metodica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09dde747-d23d-4009-890e-6f2e932f8aac\', \'multiverseId\': 450844}, \'multiverseid\': 450844}, {\'name\': \'残響の嵐\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、これを１回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nアーティファクト１つを対象とし、それのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'組織的系統的複製。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1558861-2345-4c14-89e6-23704498fd78\', \'multiverseId\': 450903}, \'multiverseid\': 450903}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade do Eco\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada vez que você conjurou seu comandante da zona de comando neste jogo. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.\\nCrie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma reprodução organizada e metódica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c265937-94cc-4086-8d02-fd1df2d9b006\', \'multiverseId\': 450962}, \'multiverseid\': 450962}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Blüten\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn das Eidolon der Blüten oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Verlorene Seelen werden vom emotionalen Widerhall der Dryaden-Versammlungen magisch angezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451343&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe01333a-3682-47a6-a1d6-1279b7241137\', \'multiverseId\': 451343}, \'multiverseid\': 451343}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de flores\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Eidolón de flores u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Los ecos emotivos de las reuniones de dríadas atraen a las almas perdidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e9beed-52ce-4240-81d1-be38a4c6e082\', \'multiverseId\': 451591}, \'multiverseid\': 451591}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon des fleurs\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que l\'Eidôlon des fleurs ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "L\'écho émotionnel des rassemblements de dryades attire les âmes perdues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1196493-3b27-4e58-be00-d4b453ddeb85\', \'multiverseId\': 451839}, \'multiverseid\': 451839}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione dei Boccioli\', \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Apparizione dei Boccioli o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "L\'eco emotivo dei concili di driadi attrae le anime perdute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a566a6e-ec00-4822-ac36-4be92d83bc13\', \'multiverseId\': 452087}, \'multiverseid\': 452087}, {\'name\': \'開花の幻霊\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 開花の幻霊か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'ドライアドの集会から発せられる叙情的な残響が、迷いし魂たちを引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bb3aaa-287d-4974-85c4-8028fab8c9b9\', \'multiverseId\': 452335}, \'multiverseid\': 452335}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Florescência\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Eidolon da Florescência ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Os ecos emocionais das reuniões de dríades atraem almas perdidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84bec4c-5925-4f50-a9f5-47d91f49071f\', \'multiverseId\': 452583}, \'multiverseid\': 452583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblicke des Kruphix\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm davon bis zu drei Verzauberungskarten auf deine Hand und lege den Rest der aufgedeckten Karten auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verheißung des Horizonts ist eine Mischung aus Ungewissheit und Hoffnung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c65504-bfe8-489a-a6e5-59f252c23300\', \'multiverseId\': 451358}, \'multiverseid\': 451358}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de Krufix\', \'text\': \'Muestra las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon hasta tres cartas de encantamiento que se encuentren entre ellas en tu mano y el resto de las cartas mostradas en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El horizonte es tentador tanto por su incertidumbre como por su potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db5b81b6-10ff-4661-8807-969b64823945\', \'multiverseId\': 451606}, \'multiverseid\': 451606}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité de Kruphix\', \'text\': "Révélez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez jusqu\'à trois cartes d\'enchantement parmi elles dans votre main et les autres cartes révélées dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'horizon est attirant, tant par son incertitude que par son potentiel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c578fca6-0899-41c9-adba-8b067de57a08\', \'multiverseId\': 451854}, \'multiverseid\': 451854}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione di Krufix\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano fino a tre carte incantesimo scelte tra esse e metti le altre carte rivelate nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'orizzonte è affascinante sia per la sua incertezza che per il suo potenziale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a153be77-4271-40da-a85d-b5df3036b77c\', \'multiverseId\': 452102}, \'multiverseid\': 452102}, {\'name\': \'クルフィックスの洞察力\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを６枚公開する。その中からエンチャント・カード最大３枚をあなたの手札に加え、公開された残りのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'地平の彼方は、その不確実性と可能性の両方において、人の興味をかき立てる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df94cacd-43e4-49e7-84ea-55842fca2651\', \'multiverseId\': 452350}, \'multiverseid\': 452350}, {\'name\': \'Visão de Crufix\', \'text\': \'Revele os seis cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque até três cards de encantamento dentre eles na sua mão e o restante dos cards revelados no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O horizonte é tentador, tanto por sua incerteza quanto por seu potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11161fa-08c9-4978-bff9-8ff26a0589f4\', \'multiverseId\': 452598}, \'multiverseid\': 452598}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451467&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f38914b2-a54a-47f5-9572-08e2c0983f7b', 'multiverseId': 451467}, 'multiverseid': 451467}, {'name': 'Banco de arena solitario', 'text': 'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451715&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08840f28-9651-4782-a778-bc449ac75d4c', 'multiverseId': 451715}, 'multiverseid': 451715}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451963&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2146969a-15b1-470e-be20-a719ee13f383', 'multiverseId': 451963}, 'multiverseid': 451963}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452211&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff6b7fd2-304b-47ee-8f88-04bae6f6bbb8', 'multiverseId': 452211}, 'multiverseid': 452211}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452459&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f9a5fa0-d7bf-431f-af1b-44bb28974db5', 'multiverseId': 452459}, 'multiverseid': 452459}, {'name': 'Banco de Areia Isolado', 'text': 'Banco de Areia Isolado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452707&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55468ad2-a528-40e7-83c0-e8cf45766d3c', 'multiverseId': 452707}, 'multiverseid': 452707}]", "[{'name': 'Einzelgängerischer Thopterist', 'text': 'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nWenn der Einzelgängerische Thopterist ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451388&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '992487c5-a018-4aa7-aaf0-0ed1a5d2a138', 'multiverseId': 451388}, 'multiverseid': 451388}, {'name': 'Topterista inconformista', 'text': 'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nCuando el Topterista inconformista entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451636&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f47c5cf1-382f-4890-a7f5-10d10e34969b', 'multiverseId': 451636}, 'multiverseid': 451636}, {'name': 'Mécanoptériste dissident', 'text': 'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nQuand le Mécanoptériste dissident arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451884&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '924c31bd-3946-4010-bd15-dda647d1e3cc', 'multiverseId': 451884}, 'multiverseid': 451884}, {'name': 'Totterista Dissidente', 'text': 'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nQuando il Totterista Dissidente entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452132&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e188b2e3-3ec9-4645-8594-756a1fcd4e49', 'multiverseId': 452132}, 'multiverseid': 452132}, {'name': '異端の飛行機械職人', 'text': '即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n異端の飛行機械職人が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452380&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '379ab79a-c284-413f-8005-d95699b520f2', 'multiverseId': 452380}, 'multiverseid': 452380}, {'name': 'Topterista Dissidente', 'text': 'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nQuando Topterista Dissidente entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolores 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452628&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c471f20-33be-4335-ae86-7da0c1c22875', 'multiverseId': 452628}, 'multiverseid': 452628}]", '[{\'name\': \'Endloser Atlas\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Länder mit demselben Namen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Behütet von Kartografen, verachtet von Kriegsfürsten, begehrt von Abenteurern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f35095-17f1-4f8d-bebd-070f7264e8d1\', \'multiverseId\': 450715}, \'multiverseid\': 450715}, {\'name\': \'Atlas sin fin\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Roba una carta. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas tres o más tierras con el mismo nombre.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Custodiado por los cartógrafos, desdeñado por los señores guerreros, codiciado por los aventureros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727aa541-dfeb-4387-a30d-c879954334c1\', \'multiverseId\': 450774}, \'multiverseid\': 450774}, {\'name\': \'Atlas infini\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins trois terrains du même nom.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Jalousement gardé par les cartographes, dédaigné par les seigneurs de guerre, convoité par les aventuriers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47b1b07-e925-4421-a943-5c7edd0fdb77\', \'multiverseId\': 450833}, \'multiverseid\': 450833}, {\'name\': \'Atlante Sconfinato\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli tre o più terre con lo stesso nome.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Custodito dai cartografi, disprezzato dai signori della guerra, ambito dagli avventurieri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a572dc-b22f-4075-9ea6-98f830954311\', \'multiverseId\': 450892}, \'multiverseid\': 450892}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき地図帳\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：カードを１枚引く。この能力は、あなたが同じ名前の土地を３つ以上コントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'地図作りは護持し、大将軍は軽蔑し、冒険者は切望する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993e893b-4dc0-4756-ad90-111eb3c8057f\', \'multiverseId\': 450951}, \'multiverseid\': 450951}, {\'name\': \'Atlas Infinito\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Compre um card. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar três ou mais terrenos com o mesmo nome.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os cartógrafos o guardam, os senhores da guerra o desdenham, os aventureiros o cobiçam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dec7abf-14a6-4683-b6f3-2cc302ac3076\', \'multiverseId\': 451010}, \'multiverseid\': 451010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endpunkt\', \'text\': \'Lege alle Kreaturen unter die Bibliotheken ihrer Besitzer.\\nMirakulum {W} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa66ae9-9065-41fa-aca3-b4e7b93bfb61\', \'multiverseId\': 451280}, \'multiverseid\': 451280}, {\'name\': \'Términus\', \'text\': \'Pon todas las criaturas en el fondo de las bibliotecas de sus propietarios.\\nMilagro {W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2e0a665-acd2-4d5a-932d-c158af42eb9f\', \'multiverseId\': 451528}, \'multiverseid\': 451528}, {\'name\': \'Terminus\', \'text\': "Mettez toutes les créatures au-dessous des bibliothèques de leurs propriétaires.\\nMiracle {W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9760d3b9-e96b-494a-ba9e-0703742d8d02\', \'multiverseId\': 451776}, \'multiverseid\': 451776}, {\'name\': \'Capolinea\', \'text\': \'Metti tutte le creature in fondo ai grimori dei rispettivi proprietari.\\nMiracolo {W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ded96d4-e558-4f9a-ba85-919ea2eddd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 452024}, \'multiverseid\': 452024}, {\'name\': \'終末\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべてオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n奇跡{W}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれの奇跡コストを支払うことでこれを唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94afb74e-d88d-4cef-9b48-8ea0c8c74dde\', \'multiverseId\': 452272}, \'multiverseid\': 452272}, {\'name\': \'Terminus\', \'text\': \'Coloque todas as criaturas no fundo dos grimórios de seus donos.\\nMilagre {W} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799778b1-fdb7-405f-b05e-f651566f5c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 452520}, \'multiverseid\': 452520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesselter Mythos\', \'text\': \'Dein Kommandeur kostet beim Wirken für jedes Mal, das du ihn in dieser Partie bereits aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast, {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn dein Kommandeur von irgendwoher in die Kommandozone gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt nur wenige Namen, deren Echo durch das ganze Multiversum hallt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450692&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83638162-71fd-451c-8724-3fd592c72cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 450692}, \'multiverseid\': 450692}, {\'name\': \'Mito desbocado\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar a tu comandante por cada vez que fue lanzado desde la zona de mando este juego.\\nSiempre que tu comandante vaya a la zona de mando desde cualquier parte, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Solo los nombres de unos pocos elegidos resuenan por el Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89989b97-57eb-47a1-a2dd-ab192479248a\', \'multiverseId\': 450751}, \'multiverseid\': 450751}, {\'name\': \'Mythe libéré\', \'text\': "Votre commandant coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque fois qu\'il a déjà été lancé depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.\\nÀ chaque fois que votre commandant est mis dans la zone de commandement d\'où qu\'il vienne, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Il existe quelques rares noms qui résonnent d\'un bout à l\'autre du Multivers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b71863f-115f-4cdd-ae65-97d0e2957733\', \'multiverseId\': 450810}, \'multiverseid\': 450810}, {\'name\': \'Leggenda Senza Confini\', \'text\': \'Il tuo comandante costa {1} in meno per essere lanciato per ogni volta che è stato lanciato dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\\nOgniqualvolta il tuo comandante viene messo nella zona di comando da qualsiasi zona, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Sono ben pochi i nomi che riecheggiano in tutto il Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4776712-18b8-4ec6-9052-448ad0fed48d\', \'multiverseId\': 450869}, \'multiverseid\': 450869}, {\'name\': \'神話解放\', \'text\': \'あなたの統率者を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からそれを唱えた回数１回につき{1}少なくなる。\\nいずれかの領域からあなたの統率者が統率領域に置かれるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'多元宇宙全体に響く重要な名前がごく僅かに存在する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8b634c-71c4-410c-aacc-6f1dc1cc4f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 450928}, \'multiverseid\': 450928}, {\'name\': \'Mito Liberto\', \'text\': \'Seu comandante custa {1} a menos para ser conjurado para cada vez que foi conjurado da sua zona de comando neste jogo.\\nToda vez que seu comandante for colocado na zona de comando vindo de qualquer lugar, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Há uns poucos nomes preciosos que ecoam pelo Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3202a066-c747-472c-ab93-3945aaf7e000\', \'multiverseId\': 450987}, \'multiverseid\': 450987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Epische Proportionen\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +5/+5 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mächtig statt schmächtig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ef6733-e4c4-4ea7-8c74-23fdb1edc85c\', \'multiverseId\': 451345}, \'multiverseid\': 451345}, {\'name\': \'Proporciones épicas\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +5/+5 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'De ratón a león.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c71f5e7f-b6d5-4944-b461-895d3947678a\', \'multiverseId\': 451593}, \'multiverseid\': 451593}, {\'name\': \'Proportions épiques\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +5/+5 et a le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'De la puce à la puissance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ace2660-d647-450c-b8db-47dabbdbc8ae\', \'multiverseId\': 451841}, \'multiverseid\': 451841}, {\'name\': \'Proporzioni Epiche\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +5/+5 e ha travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Dalla pulce all\'elefante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac27a060-1333-4395-a728-5d419850ca5a\', \'multiverseId\': 452089}, \'multiverseid\': 452089}, {\'name\': \'勇壮な体形\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋５/＋５の修整を受け、トランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'幼児も勇士に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be22d9c9-9d59-4689-9f9e-f324c7a115f4\', \'multiverseId\': 452337}, \'multiverseid\': 452337}, {\'name\': \'Proporções Épicas\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +5/+5 e tem atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'De medroso a poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58036f40-c687-423b-afc7-b11a4f825b41\', \'multiverseId\': 452585}, \'multiverseid\': 452585}]', "[{'name': 'Erblühender Sand', 'text': 'Der Erblühende Sand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Erblühende Sand ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451440&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f00b1711-8b8c-4c0e-987d-7deb78890b7f', 'multiverseId': 451440}, 'multiverseid': 451440}, {'name': 'Arenas florecientes', 'text': 'Las Arenas florecientes entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Arenas florecientes entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451688&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f60b7809-2090-41b9-bf71-26a786cdd353', 'multiverseId': 451688}, 'multiverseid': 451688}, {'name': 'Sables verdoyants', 'text': 'Les Sables verdoyants arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nQuand les Sables verdoyants arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451936&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1e5c124-baae-4808-b185-e102e077422d', 'multiverseId': 451936}, 'multiverseid': 451936}, {'name': 'Sabbie Verdeggianti', 'text': 'Le Sabbie Verdeggianti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Sabbie Verdeggianti entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452184&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82405151-6089-40b0-970c-c096033a8cf4', 'multiverseId': 452184}, 'multiverseid': 452184}, {'name': '花咲く砂地', 'text': '花咲く砂地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n花咲く砂地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452432&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82a8ea18-760a-4a55-925e-eb83974eb8be', 'multiverseId': 452432}, 'multiverseid': 452432}, {'name': 'Areias Verdejantes', 'text': 'Areias Verdejantes entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Areias Verdejantes entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452680&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad667e7e-caea-419b-9b70-03512dcfbb33', 'multiverseId': 452680}, 'multiverseid': 452680}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erkunden\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in diesem Zug ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Belohnung für einen Entdecker ist ein Blick auf die Möglichkeiten der Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a423064-b130-4cba-a55d-d23dea108063\', \'multiverseId\': 451346}, \'multiverseid\': 451346}, {\'name\': \'Explorar\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La recompensa de un explorador es una visión de las posibilidades del mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a338f4b0-69d1-43fa-b636-6bad4a6eaef6\', \'multiverseId\': 451594}, \'multiverseid\': 451594}, {\'name\': \'Explorer\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La récompense de l\'explorateur est la vision des possibilités du lendemain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e3c2af-0674-4d8c-988e-31f6c2fcf4ad\', \'multiverseId\': 451842}, \'multiverseid\': 451842}, {\'name\': \'Esplorare\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare una terra addizionale in questo turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La ricompensa di un esploratore? La certezza delle possibilità di domani.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'121530cb-7186-4a7b-a364-89448215c4e1\', \'multiverseId\': 452090}, \'multiverseid\': 452090}, {\'name\': \'探検\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたは追加の土地を１つプレイしてもよい。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'探検家にとっての報奨とは、明日の可能性への見通しである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b14ce2f-ef58-49c3-bede-118b47e4f3ba\', \'multiverseId\': 452338}, \'multiverseid\': 452338}, {\'name\': \'Explorar\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar um terreno adicional neste turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A recompensa de um explorador é a visão das possibilidades de amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7f5425-cabe-447c-b8df-72057ded7159\', \'multiverseId\': 452586}, \'multiverseid\': 452586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Estrid die Maskenträgerin\', \'text\': \'+2: Enttappe alle verzauberten bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\\n−1: Erzeuge einen weißen Aura-Verzauberungsspielstein namens Maske, angelegt an eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Der Spielstein hat „Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte" und Totembeistand.\\n−7: Lege die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Bringe alle Verzauberungskarten, die keine Auren sind, aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Mache dann dasselbe mit Aurakarten.\\nEstrid die Maskenträgerin kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Estrid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450700&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b21a8c4-d401-4e6c-8e57-ed57c31a052c\', \'multiverseId\': 450700}, \'multiverseid\': 450700}, {\'name\': \'Estrid, la Enmascarada\', \'text\': \'+2: Endereza cada permanente encantado que controlas.\\n−1: Crea una ficha de encantamiento Aura blanca llamada Máscara anexada a otro permanente objetivo. La ficha tiene las habilidades de encantar permanente y armadura tótem.\\n−7: Pon las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Regresa todas las cartas de encantamiento que no sean Aura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Luego, haz lo mismo con las cartas de Aura.\\nEstrid, la Enmascarada puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Estrid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d165bad-7f2f-4f60-bc79-c3dc230a869d\', \'multiverseId\': 450759}, \'multiverseid\': 450759}, {\'name\': \'Estrid, la femme aux masques\', \'text\': "+2 : Dégagez chaque permanent enchanté que vous contrôlez.\\n-1 : Créez un jeton d\'enchantement blanc Aura appelé Masque attaché à un autre permanent ciblé. Le jeton a enchanter : permanent et l\'armure totémique.\\n-7 : Mettez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière. Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes d\'enchantement non-aura depuis votre cimetière, puis faites de même avec les cartes d\'aura.\\nEstrid, la femme aux masques peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Estrid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d13172-5785-406c-a138-4aa0e01aed98\', \'multiverseId\': 450818}, \'multiverseid\': 450818}, {\'name\': \'Estrid, la Mascherata\', \'text\': \'+2: STAPpa ogni permanente incantato che controlli.\\n-1: Crea una pedina incantesimo Aura bianca chiamata Maschera assegnata a un altro permanente bersaglio. La pedina ha incanta permanente e armatura totem.\\n-7: Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte incantesimo non Aura dal tuo cimitero, poi fai lo stesso per le carte Aura.\\nEstrid, la Mascherata può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Estrid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e18668f5-0f69-4c03-8bec-4c7723f0e09a\', \'multiverseId\': 450877}, \'multiverseid\': 450877}, {\'name\': \'仮面使い、エストリッド\', \'text\': \'+2：あなたがコントロールしていてエンチャントされている各パーマネントをアンタップする。\\n-1：他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。「仮面」という名前の白のオーラ・エンチャント・トークンを１つ、それにつけられた状態で生成する。そのトークンはエンチャント（パーマネント）と族霊鎧を持つ。\\n-7：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを７枚あなたの墓地に置く。あなたの墓地からオーラでないエンチャント・カードをすべて戦場に戻し、その後同じことをオーラ・カードについて行う。\\n仮面使い、エストリッドは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エストリッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1011772a-5d9b-4bf4-b86e-44cd02407b29\', \'multiverseId\': 450936}, \'multiverseid\': 450936}, {\'name\': \'Estrid, a Mascarada\', \'text\': \'+2: Desvire cada permanente encantada que você controla.\\n−1: Crie uma ficha de encantamento branco do tipo Aura com o nome Máscara anexada a outra permanente alvo. A ficha tem encantar permanente e armadura de totem.\\n−7: Coloque os sete cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Devolva todos os cards de encantamento que não sejam Auras de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Em seguida, faça o mesmo com os cards de Aura.\\nEstrid, a Mascarada, pode ser sua comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Estrid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b16fdd-bff8-4a43-a4b7-4270da869f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 450995}, \'multiverseid\': 450995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Estrids Anrufung\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Estrids Anrufung als Kopie einer beliebigen Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, ins Spiel bringen, außer dass sie „Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du diese Verzauberung ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, bringe sie unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück" hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Verzauberer fügen der sie umgebenden Welt Schicht auf Schicht Komplexität hinzu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450668&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d7b28e-3ffb-4784-8cd2-7488ed533966\', \'multiverseId\': 450668}, \'multiverseid\': 450668}, {\'name\': \'Invocación de Estrid\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que la Invocación de Estrid entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier encantamiento que controlas, excepto que gana "Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes exiliar este encantamiento. Si lo haces, regrésalo al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los encantadores agregan capas y capas de complejidad al mundo que les rodea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07acd5f8-e166-4f84-9d95-15100e13eb12\', \'multiverseId\': 450727}, \'multiverseid\': 450727}, {\'name\': "Invocation d\'Estrid", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Invocation d\'Estrid arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'un enchantement que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'il acquiert « Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez exiler cet enchantement. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les enchanteurs ajoutent plusieurs couches de complexité au monde qui les entoure.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ea0749-e506-4010-9668-8ee4d6cf5518\', \'multiverseId\': 450786}, \'multiverseid\': 450786}, {\'name\': \'Evocazione di Estrid\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare l\\\'Evocazione di Estrid nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi incantesimo che controlli, tranne che ha "All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi esiliare questo incantesimo. Se lo fai, rimettilo sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli incantatori aggiungono strati su strati di complessità al mondo che li circonda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5382e3-33ac-4818-a475-5acbc7e2e60a\', \'multiverseId\': 450845}, \'multiverseid\': 450845}, {\'name\': \'エストリッドの祈祷\', \'text\': \'あなたはエストリッドの祈祷を、これが「あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはこのエンチャントを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、これをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。」を得ることを除き、あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'結界師は周囲の世界に幾層もの複雑性を加える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c79b1c18-1e02-4a8c-926a-5d8651b36496\', \'multiverseId\': 450904}, \'multiverseid\': 450904}, {\'name\': \'Invocação de Estrid\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Invocação de Estrid entre no campo de batalha como cópia de qualquer encantamento que você controla, com a exceção de ganhar "No início de sua manutenção, você pode exilar este encantamento. Se fizer isso, devolva-o ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.".\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os encantadores acrescentam camadas e mais camadas de complexidade ao mundo à volta deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5962bfa-208f-405a-9a39-848da4029e77\', \'multiverseId\': 450963}, \'multiverseid\': 450963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf die Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen legen.\\nEntferne drei Quest-Marken von der Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen und opfere sie: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451357&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34a7f95-562c-4307-9395-fdbd7231ace4\', \'multiverseId\': 451357}, \'multiverseid\': 451357}, {\'name\': \'Expedición al Corazón de Khalni\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni.\\nRemover tres contadores de búsqueda de la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni y sacrificarla: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d1b4de-b420-4db5-96b6-775a90f1cd09\', \'multiverseId\': 451605}, \'multiverseid\': 451605}, {\'name\': \'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni.\\nRetirez trois marqueurs « quête » de l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni et sacrifiez-la : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f156cc9-7c95-4215-8622-a8526d931d4d\', \'multiverseId\': 451853}, \'multiverseid\': 451853}, {\'name\': \'Spedizione al Cuore Khalni\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi mettere un segnalino ricerca sulla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni.\\nRimuovi tre segnalini ricerca dalla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni e sacrificala: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2612c2c3-8779-45f4-9e0b-68712531145a\', \'multiverseId\': 452101}, \'multiverseid\': 452101}, {\'name\': \'カルニの心臓の探検\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカルニの心臓の探検の上に探索カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\nカルニの心臓の探検の上から探索カウンターを３個取り除き、これを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ed59ca-6bec-437a-b0ee-c6129ece3b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 452349}, \'multiverseid\': 452349}, {\'name\': \'Expedição ao Coração de Khalni\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode colocar um marcador de busca +1/+1 em Expedição ao Coração de Khalni.\\nRemova três marcadores de busca de Expedição ao Coração de Khalni e sacrifique-o: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2087eaa1-917c-4360-9cce-518d2c676085\', \'multiverseId\': 452597}, \'multiverseid\': 452597}]', '[{\'name\': \'Explosive Vegetation\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es würde keinen Sinn machen, Krosa abzufackeln. Dieser Wald wächst schneller, als er brennt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca7421a-7a0c-4df2-815f-446bfe456589\', \'multiverseId\': 451347}, \'multiverseid\': 451347}, {\'name\': \'Vegetación explosiva\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quemar Krosa no tendría sentido. Crece más rápido de lo que se quema.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a68cf4d6-4871-43e3-8647-8bc3c2408fda\', \'multiverseId\': 451595}, \'multiverseid\': 451595}, {\'name\': \'Végétation explosive\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Incendier la Krosia n\'aurait aucun effet. La végétation y pousse plus vite qu\'elle ne se consume.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20db236-7ba2-444a-9a62-38b0f4289b42\', \'multiverseId\': 451843}, \'multiverseid\': 451843}, {\'name\': \'Vegetazione Esplosiva\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dare fuoco a Krosa sarebbe inutile. Cresce più velocemente di quanto bruci.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51cead13-67bf-4cf4-8113-593ecd01f1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 452091}, \'multiverseid\': 452091}, {\'name\': \'爆発的植生\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'クローサの森に火を放っても無駄なことだ。そいつは燃えるよりも速く成長する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee150a9-9c90-4871-9f6a-8012d693f565\', \'multiverseId\': 452339}, \'multiverseid\': 452339}, {\'name\': \'Vegetação Explosiva\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Incendiar Krosa não teria sentido. Ela cresce mais rápido do que queima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad174e8-0d97-4513-a9da-8b5bca22e89a\', \'multiverseId\': 452587}, \'multiverseid\': 452587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenstoß-Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Flammenstoß-Drache angreift, kannst du {X}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, fügt der Flammenstoß-Drache einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Er markiert sein Territorium mit zornigem Feuer, indem er sein Mal in das Gestein einbrennt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451326&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18bb9f6b-099f-4ece-b10a-03e74f206d60\', \'multiverseId\': 451326}, \'multiverseid\': 451326}, {\'name\': \'Dragón ráfaga de llamas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Dragón ráfaga de llamas ataque, puedes pagar {X}{R}. Si lo haces, el Dragón ráfaga de llamas hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Marca su territorio con ira y fuego, grabando la montaña con su aliento ardiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49487324-2be2-453a-8533-3462e1a38fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 451574}, \'multiverseid\': 451574}, {\'name\': \'Dragon à la salve de flammes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon à la salve de flammes attaque, vous pouvez payer {X}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, le Dragon à la salve de flammes inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Il marque son territoire avec le feu et la rage, calcinant le flanc des montagnes de son souffle incandescent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e1c4a38-f0e2-4aa9-ba95-a38708f587ec\', \'multiverseId\': 451822}, \'multiverseid\': 451822}, {\'name\': \'Drago Esplosivo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Drago Esplosivo attacca, puoi pagare {X}{R}. Se lo fai, il Drago Esplosivo infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Segna il territorio con fuoco e furia, incidendo il lato della montagna col suo soffio ardente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cc78edd-e4ae-4428-9f13-21744f334169\', \'multiverseId\': 452070}, \'multiverseid\': 452070}, {\'name\': \'炎破のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n炎破のドラゴンが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは{X}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、炎破のドラゴンはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'それは火と怒りで縄張りを印し、焼き焦がす息で山肌を刻む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8babd4c2-7c9d-4b47-ad28-61a1aa0cc942\', \'multiverseId\': 452318}, \'multiverseid\': 452318}, {\'name\': \'Dragão da Explosão Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Dragão da Explosão Flamejante ataca, você pode pagar {X}{R}. Se fizer isso, Dragão da Explosão Flamejante causará X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele marca seu território com fogo e ira, entalhando as encostas das montanhas com seu sopro carbonizante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80be270c-c01f-48a9-8273-e24745d4aae9\', \'multiverseId\': 452566}, \'multiverseid\': 452566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet ist."\\n—Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4fee8d-62cb-4415-adf9-c2e1c5736cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 451428}, \'multiverseid\': 451428}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado".\\n—Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f7e3e11-3fea-46f6-80fc-587f7ca8f2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 451676}, \'multiverseid\': 451676}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. »\\n—Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23334a0d-5778-4acc-9692-4d587046a235\', \'multiverseId\': 451924}, \'multiverseid\': 451924}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati."\\n—Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f587dedc-ed8e-4025-b0db-d1135f685040\', \'multiverseId\': 452172}, \'multiverseid\': 452172}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ。ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」\\n――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a359d961-fa81-4d6c-9cea-c02ec08eb1bd\', \'multiverseId\': 452420}, \'multiverseid\': 452420}, {\'name\': \'Botas Pé-ligeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem resistência a magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há grande sabedoria em correr e entrar de cabeça no combate... se você estiver preparado."\\n— Kenjek, capitão das Mil Espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654d2ef7-9598-4a19-9e19-0d1938ea5380\', \'multiverseId\': 452668}, \'multiverseid\': 452668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluggelübde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Flugfähigkeit und kann weder dich noch einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Schweben muss man den Geflügelten nicht mehr beibringen."\\n—Edric, Meisterspion von Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451313&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de9eb88-f5ad-411d-9376-9d9850bc20d3\', \'multiverseId\': 451313}, \'multiverseid\': 451313}, {\'name\': \'Promesa de vuelo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2, vuela y no puede atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Flotar es un desperdicio de las alas".\\n—Edric, maestro espía de Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36ea074-6ff1-482c-828d-9dc4fa55c024\', \'multiverseId\': 451561}, \'multiverseid\': 451561}, {\'name\': \'Vœu de vol\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2, a le vol et elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ceux qui ont des ailes prennent le vol comme un acquis. »\\n—Edric, maître espion de Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5d1bbf-c6af-4140-aa9d-5e28c4b2d9e3\', \'multiverseId\': 451809}, \'multiverseid\': 451809}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento del Volo\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2, ha volare e non può attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Librarsi è sprecato per gli alati."\\n—Edric, Capospia di Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d493672-19d6-4f0d-b6d6-249841bd04a6\', \'multiverseId\': 452057}, \'multiverseid\': 452057}, {\'name\': \'飛行の誓約\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、飛行を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「飛ぶように早い者にとって、高く飛ぶのは無駄なことだ。」\\n――トレストの密偵長、エドリック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208c3051-a186-4ccc-973c-7765466e48b5\', \'multiverseId\': 452305}, \'multiverseid\': 452305}, {\'name\': \'Voto de Voo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2, tem voar e não pode atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Planar é um desperdício para quem tem asas."\\n— Edric, espião-mestre de Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e03e98d1-1c1e-47ed-a067-0b3a77acd67f\', \'multiverseId\': 452553}, \'multiverseid\': 452553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Forstzertrampelnder Baloth\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Forstzertrampelnde Baloth +4/+4 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Sein unersättlicher Hunger sorgt dafür, dass in seiner Umgebung keine Beute übrig bleibt. Er muss immer weiterziehen, um seinen dicken Bauch zu füllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505c8418-7788-4e1a-bfbb-abf3130f013c\', \'multiverseId\': 451333}, \'multiverseid\': 451333}, {\'name\': \'Báloth aplastamadera\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Báloth aplastamadera obtiene +4/+4 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Su hambre insaciable rápidamente vacía una región de presas. Debe migrar de lado a lado para alimentar su inmenso cuerpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed3ba5d-fbaa-408c-95ea-793d1fbbf838\', \'multiverseId\': 451581}, \'multiverseid\': 451581}, {\'name\': \'Baloth écrasebois\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Baloth écrasebois gagne +4/+4 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Sa faim insatiable vide rapidement une région de proies. Il doit aller d\'un endroit à un autre pour nourrir son énorme masse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755b5cde-66a0-4b93-9d76-fe8ec0d22e48\', \'multiverseId\': 451829}, \'multiverseid\': 451829}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Schiantaboschi\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Baloth Schiantaboschi prende +4/+4 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': "La sua fame insaziabile svuota rapidamente una regione dalle prede. Deve migrare da un posto all\'altro per nutrire la sua mole massiccia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24e6706-4bb8-4c7f-98af-61c9d77e38f4\', \'multiverseId\': 452077}, \'multiverseid\': 452077}, {\'name\': \'ベイロスの林壊し\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、ベイロスの林壊しは＋４/＋４の修整を受け、トランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'その飽くことの無い飢えは、あっという間に一帯の餌食を食い尽くしてしまう。それは巨体を支えるために、各地を渡っていくのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4785ec-5c7f-4918-8081-45585c871538\', \'multiverseId\': 452325}, \'multiverseid\': 452325}, {\'name\': \'Rompe-bosque Baloth\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, Rompe-bosque Baloth recebe +4/+4 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Sua fome insaciável esgota rapidamente uma região de presas. Ele precisa migrar de um lugar para o outro para alimentar seu enorme corpanzil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f2c1a6-9b73-4a20-90ef-35c4b70141bf\', \'multiverseId\': 452573}, \'multiverseid\': 452573}]', "[{'name': 'Friedliche Bucht', 'text': 'Die Friedliche Bucht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Friedliche Bucht ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451491&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e0fdf06-d2f1-4552-9e9f-6458c6a7e886', 'multiverseId': 451491}, 'multiverseid': 451491}, {'name': 'Cala tranquila', 'text': 'La Cala tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cala tranquila entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451739&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c498256b-0cdc-46d6-913a-249da16666dc', 'multiverseId': 451739}, 'multiverseid': 451739}, {'name': 'Crique tranquille', 'text': 'La Crique tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Crique tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451987&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8132d4db-dc05-4d5d-8312-25326873a60b', 'multiverseId': 451987}, 'multiverseid': 451987}, {'name': 'Baia Tranquilla', 'text': 'La Baia Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Baia Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452235&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb493e41-c21f-43f8-a312-fd14b9ec7d42', 'multiverseId': 452235}, 'multiverseid': 452235}, {'name': '平穏な入り江', 'text': '平穏な入り江はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n平穏な入り江が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452483&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56d7561a-f9df-4dca-9bc1-f24242e0c15b', 'multiverseId': 452483}, 'multiverseid': 452483}, {'name': 'Angra Tranquila', 'text': 'Angra Tranquila entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Angra Tranquila entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452731&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05d7286f-7c9b-4648-94d6-8dc455ad6cae', 'multiverseId': 452731}, 'multiverseid': 452731}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fruchtbarer Boden\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein zusätzliches Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die wahre Macht der Natur ist kein tosender Sturm und kein anstürmendes Nashorn, sondern die unaufhaltsame Vitalität des Lebens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c643b9a8-fda6-46fe-a920-e1e1c6ffe1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 451350}, \'multiverseid\': 451350}, {\'name\': \'Tierra fértil\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná adicional de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La verdadera fuerza de la naturaleza no es una tormenta furiosa ni un rinoceronte en carga, sino el inexorable ímpetu de la vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'718a491f-eeff-46e9-a553-3b12f8c8204c\', \'multiverseId\': 451598}, \'multiverseid\': 451598}, {\'name\': \'Terrain fertile\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un mana supplémentaire de la couleur de son choix.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "La véritable force de la nature ne réside pas dans la violence de l\'orage ou la fougue du rhinocéros, mais dans la vitalité inexorable de la vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e209d4-6de9-448d-8d65-19543b78c301\', \'multiverseId\': 451846}, \'multiverseid\': 451846}, {\'name\': \'Terreno Fertile\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge un mana addizionale di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La vera forza della natura non risiede nella furia della tempesta né nel rinoceronte alla carica, bensì nell\'inesorabile prosperità della vita.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8498e924-5128-446f-9038-5390f2e53115\', \'multiverseId\': 452094}, \'multiverseid\': 452094}, {\'name\': \'肥沃な大地\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'自然の真の強さというのは、荒れ狂う嵐でもなく、突進するサイでもなく、容赦無い生命力だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7eb34c-e7fc-4fb4-ac46-74e7b6e07fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 452342}, \'multiverseid\': 452342}, {\'name\': \'Solo Fértil\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona um mana extra de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A verdadeira força da natureza não está na fúria da tormenta, nem na carga do rinoceronte, mas no vigor inexorável da vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb11fa5-eafd-4089-8b58-3007dfba3da8\', \'multiverseId\': 452590}, \'multiverseid\': 452590}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furiensturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du in dieser Partie deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\\nKopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450682&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de68c58b-7855-4c8b-a504-7e0beb2039ae\', \'multiverseId\': 450682}, \'multiverseid\': 450682}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta de furia\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que lanzaste a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.\\nCopia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4e2448-00d7-46be-933b-6f5067ec9457\', \'multiverseId\': 450741}, \'multiverseid\': 450741}, {\'name\': \'Déluge de fureur\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez déjà lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.\\nCopiez le sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670c3ca2-7461-487b-a27c-63eddc56853d\', \'multiverseId\': 450800}, \'multiverseid\': 450800}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta di Furia\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai lanciato il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.\\nCopia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d58dbdd-7bdc-4dd5-9c36-1b39be9f0ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 450859}, \'multiverseid\': 450859}, {\'name\': \'憤怒の嵐\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、これを１回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nインスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とし、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31d7bb8-fba0-4a12-9acd-c31bf11ed539\', \'multiverseId\': 450918}, \'multiverseid\': 450918}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade de Fúria\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada vez que você conjurou seu comandante da zona de comando neste jogo. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.\\nCopie a mágica instantânea ou o feitiço alvo. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9db84e1-0774-4c60-bd70-23ebe0c46464\', \'multiverseId\': 450977}, \'multiverseid\': 450977}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451505&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc443160-d01f-4675-840e-22c6f809977e', 'multiverseId': 451505}, 'multiverseid': 451505}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451753&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'faffdd41-9657-4e1d-bb39-4ed9434e3838', 'multiverseId': 451753}, 'multiverseid': 451753}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452001&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a759274b-a2d2-49b7-b0ae-379f6704118f', 'multiverseId': 452001}, 'multiverseid': 452001}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452249&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '483fbde5-019c-400a-a002-b8068f39feaa', 'multiverseId': 452249}, 'multiverseid': 452249}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452497&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '404ffb53-f89d-4683-90d7-8fc4ca8741fe', 'multiverseId': 452497}, 'multiverseid': 452497}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452745&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf2386ab-a039-4898-b369-cbe9dd1377ff', 'multiverseId': 452745}, 'multiverseid': 452745}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451506&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cb0fa7f-c2ee-418f-b6a5-d42e3c05e566', 'multiverseId': 451506}, 'multiverseid': 451506}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451754&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8f89a94-daaf-42f8-8ce8-d7f5068702b1', 'multiverseId': 451754}, 'multiverseid': 451754}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452002&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38448ebc-a172-42ee-a3d0-01425ef5b45d', 'multiverseId': 452002}, 'multiverseid': 452002}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452250&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4808b2f5-c393-4e44-9cf2-ef0445bc5717', 'multiverseId': 452250}, 'multiverseid': 452250}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452498&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0655d412-3588-4f5a-ab38-7f3830dfb9fa', 'multiverseId': 452498}, 'multiverseid': 452498}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452746&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52f6771a-7394-46cc-8bff-4062be11da9b', 'multiverseId': 452746}, 'multiverseid': 452746}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451507&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a91a9f57-f0d7-47d8-8cbb-aa10ed025c66', 'multiverseId': 451507}, 'multiverseid': 451507}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451755&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9da3b1d5-8f37-4317-bae7-215f54e9bc8c', 'multiverseId': 451755}, 'multiverseid': 451755}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452003&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4ed3130-4408-4fb5-804b-79bc55431e43', 'multiverseId': 452003}, 'multiverseid': 452003}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452251&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3060857-647b-4624-9120-fe0f01720a2c', 'multiverseId': 452251}, 'multiverseid': 452251}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452499&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '806f4783-3f8c-4bc6-b237-8cba20586052', 'multiverseId': 452499}, 'multiverseid': 452499}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452747&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dc6c43e-1009-4c07-bf22-0a42e99b86ea', 'multiverseId': 452747}, 'multiverseid': 452747}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirgstal', 'text': 'Das Gebirgstal kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere das Gebirgstal: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge- oder Wald-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451471&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cf38406-4116-4361-b8d3-e5b17d0b29ab', 'multiverseId': 451471}, 'multiverseid': 451471}, {'name': 'Valle de montaña', 'text': 'El Valle de montaña entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Valle de montaña: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Montaña o Bosque, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451719&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82412112-5759-4f05-9d4b-977c86da06df', 'multiverseId': 451719}, 'multiverseid': 451719}, {'name': 'Vallée forestière', 'text': 'La Vallée forestière arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Vallée forestière : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne ou de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451967&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '763e4b70-eba9-40d1-8e8f-bafd4bf8e0e3', 'multiverseId': 451967}, 'multiverseid': 451967}, {'name': 'Vallata di Montagna', 'text': 'La Vallata di Montagna entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Vallata di Montagna: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Montagna o Foresta, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452215&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e3a7258-d589-47eb-972b-f881aa23af74', 'multiverseId': 452215}, 'multiverseid': 452215}, {'name': '山峡', 'text': '山峡はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 山峡を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから山か森であるカード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452463&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f03d9de-4fcc-4681-9d65-d88ecba0e965', 'multiverseId': 452463}, 'multiverseid': 452463}, {'name': 'Desfiladeiro', 'text': 'Desfiladeiro entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}, sacrifique Desfiladeiro: Procure um card de Montanha ou Floresta em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452711&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c32e11f-fb83-48b0-8b5f-a1f458f5d63e', 'multiverseId': 452711}, 'multiverseid': 452711}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gebot des Kruphix\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nZu Beginn des Ziehsegments jedes Spielers zieht jener Spieler eine zusätzliche Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist grausam. Es wird dir das Herz brechen und deine Loyalität auf die Probe stellen. Bist du sicher, dass du mit diesem Fluch belegt werden möchtest?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf18b137-33a3-4848-8d2c-c1064255890f\', \'multiverseId\': 451289}, \'multiverseid\': 451289}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Krufix\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nAl comienzo del paso de robar de cada jugador, ese jugador roba una carta adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El conocimiento es cruel. Te romperá el corazón y pondrá a prueba tus lealtades. ¿Seguro que quieres esa maldición?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ad947a-ffd3-45f2-a31c-b841a4a24a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 451537}, \'multiverseid\': 451537}, {\'name\': \'Précepte de Kruphix\', \'text\': "Flash\\nAu début de l\'étape de pioche de chaque joueur, ce joueur pioche une carte supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La connaissance est cruelle. Elle vous brisera le cœur et mettra votre loyauté à l\'épreuve. Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir cette malédiction ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3f5a86-8e4b-4527-a71d-ef6062093c58\', \'multiverseId\': 451785}, \'multiverseid\': 451785}, {\'name\': \'Dettami di Krufix\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nAll\'inizio dell\'acquisizione di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore pesca una carta addizionale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La conoscenza è crudele. Ti spezzerà il cuore e metterà alla prova la tua fedeltà. Sei certo di desiderare questa sciagura?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f42654-afa6-4df9-9206-4962e3641190\', \'multiverseId\': 452033}, \'multiverseid\': 452033}, {\'name\': \'クルフィックスの指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n各プレイヤーのドロー・ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカードを追加で１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「知識は残酷である。それはお前の心を挫き、忠誠心を試すことになる。お前は本当にこの呪いを求めるのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f653ac9-22df-450b-ba79-ac39aa44e791\', \'multiverseId\': 452281}, \'multiverseid\': 452281}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Crufix\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nNo início da etapa de compra de cada jogador, aquele jogador compra um card adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O conhecimento é cruel. Ele vai partir seu coração e testar suas alianças. Tem certeza de que deseja esta maldição?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4042b9c9-62d0-4ca0-b6e3-36e3f984a9a2\', \'multiverseId\': 452529}, \'multiverseid\': 452529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451413&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb52681-c5b4-47c8-b0ae-c4261327dfa4\', \'multiverseId\': 451413}, \'multiverseid\': 451413}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65144eb3-cbb2-47ad-8c09-56064a6eed77\', \'multiverseId\': 451661}, \'multiverseid\': 451661}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d600345-0f7c-474a-836e-8d8dc681c064\', \'multiverseId\': 451909}, \'multiverseid\': 451909}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03671526-bcd3-4739-a27b-5223c9100c45\', \'multiverseId\': 452157}, \'multiverseid\': 452157}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b875630d-a3aa-445d-99c0-154e7b724648\', \'multiverseId\': 452405}, \'multiverseid\': 452405}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é o mana senão o possível, uma ideia à qual ainda não se deu forma?"\\n— Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2fe7ce2-e201-4dec-b4bb-a685c79c30c1\', \'multiverseId\': 452653}, \'multiverseid\': 452653}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenwirbel\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Mizzium-Sphärenfeld trug ihren Geist tief in das Gedankenfeld, in dem man nur die seltensten Genius-Partikel — reifen Früchten gleich — pflücken konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e18f79-7ea7-498c-b490-482a9cdbd193\', \'multiverseId\': 451285}, \'multiverseid\': 451285}, {\'name\': \'Inspiración súbita\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas y luego pon dos cartas de tu mano en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El conjunto de esferas de mízzium hundió su mente en las profundidades del campo del pensamiento, donde solo se pueden encontrar las más raras motas de ingenio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffc2342-ddb0-4120-8f9a-f890d1e757b5\', \'multiverseId\': 451533}, \'multiverseid\': 451533}, {\'name\': \'Remue-méninges\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes et mettez ensuite deux cartes de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'cphémère\', \'flavor\': "La batterie de sphères de mizzium conduisit son esprit dans les profondeurs du champ mental, où attendent d\'être cueillis les rarissimes éclairs de génie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a7f093-531d-4d7f-aa57-89d907d957dd\', \'multiverseId\': 451781}, \'multiverseid\': 451781}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'arsenale delle sfere di Mizzium fece volare i suoi pensieri lontano, in un luogo dove solo i granelli più rari della ricchezza d\'ingegno possono essere estirpati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d37a1d7-0f28-40ec-b6af-fb355df50230\', \'multiverseId\': 452029}, \'multiverseid\': 452029}, {\'name\': \'渦まく知識\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引き、その後あなたの手札からカード２枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'あるかないかの光明を求め、彼女の精神はミジウム球配列によって思考場の深みへと誘われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c654b1e-b7ad-4f74-a711-d960c4543065\', \'multiverseId\': 452277}, \'multiverseid\': 452277}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade Cerebral\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards. Depois, coloque dois cards de sua mão no topo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A matriz de mizzium-esfera levou sua mente às profundezas do campo das ideias, de onde somente as partículas mais raras de genialidade podem ser colhidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744da977-9831-4715-9d68-3ab2ce3fad65\', \'multiverseId\': 452525}, \'multiverseid\': 452525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefäß der endlosen Ruhe\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Gefäß der endlosen Ruhe ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9bf41f-feb5-41a9-a111-86cde90b44b9\', \'multiverseId\': 451432}, \'multiverseid\': 451432}, {\'name\': \'Vasija del descanso eterno\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Vasija del descanso eterno entre al campo de batalla, pon la carta objetivo de un cementerio en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac9153e-bb3a-4f96-a443-0dbef0719bac\', \'multiverseId\': 451680}, \'multiverseid\': 451680}, {\'name\': \'Urne du repos sans fin\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Urne du repos sans fin arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez une carte ciblée d\'un cimetière au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ead0ab-bd35-441c-a31c-df02900fd9fc\', \'multiverseId\': 451928}, \'multiverseid\': 451928}, {\'name\': \'Vaso del Riposo Eterno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Vaso del Riposo Eterno entra nel campo di battaglia, metti una carta bersaglio da un cimitero in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83041a68-d0e5-4901-9d6e-e0528c529b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 452176}, \'multiverseid\': 452176}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき休息の器\', \'text\': \'終わりなき休息の器が戦場に出たとき、墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf5dc90-44c6-4b93-9cc5-84229462c204\', \'multiverseId\': 452424}, \'multiverseid\': 452424}, {\'name\': \'Vaso do Descanso Eterno\', \'text\': \'Quando Vaso do Descanso Eterno entrar no campo de batalha, coloque o card alvo de um cemitério no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441e3bc8-eecf-460c-bb0c-0cba0c54fa39\', \'multiverseId\': 452672}, \'multiverseid\': 452672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genesissturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du in dieser Partie deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast.\\nDecke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine bleibende Karte aufdeckst, die kein Land ist. Du kannst die Karte ins Spiel bringen. Lege dann alle auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten, die nicht ins Spiel gebracht wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450690&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09aff6a1-4020-4912-b9cd-dd70678cb248\', \'multiverseId\': 450690}, \'multiverseid\': 450690}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta del génesis\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que lanzaste a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\\nMuestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de permanente que no sea tierra. Puedes poner esa carta en el campo de batalla. Luego, pon en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera que no fueron puestas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b3df09-e0bf-4fd0-9802-b1fbbfbe426a\', \'multiverseId\': 450749}, \'multiverseid\': 450749}, {\'name\': \'Déluge de genèse\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez déjà lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.\\nRévélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de permanent non-terrain. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille. Mettez ensuite toutes les cartes révélées de cette manière qui n\'ont pas été mises sur le champ de bataille au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3c52ca-5d51-4e96-9981-1a8074b27d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 450808}, \'multiverseid\': 450808}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta della Genesi\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai lanciato il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\\nRivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta permanente non terra. Puoi mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia. Poi metti in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale tutte le carte rivelate in questo modo che non sono state messe sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836497c7-88f4-4354-8e73-aafd2a890e54\', \'multiverseId\': 450867}, \'multiverseid\': 450867}, {\'name\': \'起源の嵐\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、これを１回コピーする。\\n土地でないパーマネント・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。あなたはそのカードを戦場に出してもよい。その後、これにより公開し戦場に出さなかったカードをすべてあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690ef052-a872-406b-9fb5-222ddb4eae95\', \'multiverseId\': 450926}, \'multiverseid\': 450926}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade da Gênese\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada vez que você conjurou seu comandante da zona de comando neste jogo.\\nRevele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de permanente que não seja um terreno. Você pode colocar aquele card no campo de batalha. Em seguida, coloque no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória todos os cards revelados dessa forma que não tenham sido colocados no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5576d70b-adb3-4bd4-bfd3-78ddefdf9d26\', \'multiverseId\': 450985}, \'multiverseid\': 450985}]', "[{'name': 'Geoden-Golem', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Geoden-Golem einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Du bezahlst weiterhin alle zusätzlichen Kosten.)', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450716&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12ec62f5-5fc0-452a-8421-c1bbdf1227f4', 'multiverseId': 450716}, 'multiverseid': 450716}, {'name': 'Gólem de geoda', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Gólem de geoda haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes lanzar a tu comandante desde la zona de mando sin pagar su coste de maná. (Sigues pagando los costes adicionales.)', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450775&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f826cf9-49a7-486a-9932-5c8b27fb3e83', 'multiverseId': 450775}, 'multiverseid': 450775}, {'name': 'Golem de géode', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Golem de géode inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez lancer votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement sans payer son coût de mana. (Vous payez toujours les coûts supplémentaires.)', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450834&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0cec1fe-b75f-406a-9c3c-f5eb7b53e9b2', 'multiverseId': 450834}, 'multiverseid': 450834}, {'name': 'Golem del Geode', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Golem del Geode infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi lanciare il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando senza pagare il suo costo di mana. (Paghi comunque eventuali costi addizionali.)', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450893&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1375feb3-d6c8-485b-aae4-f59380c47343', 'multiverseId': 450893}, 'multiverseid': 450893}, {'name': '晶洞ゴーレム', 'text': 'トランプル\\n晶洞ゴーレムがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは統率領域からあなたの統率者をそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。（追加コストは支払う必要がある。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450952&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fcec69c-5e60-4d6a-a8f0-da579c88453f', 'multiverseId': 450952}, 'multiverseid': 450952}, {'name': 'Golem do Geodo', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Golem do Geodo causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode conjurar seu comandante da zona de comando sem pagar seu custo de mana. (Você ainda paga quaisquer custos adicionais.)', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451011&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce9b59ab-b52a-4fad-85a8-d7d46c935f42', 'multiverseId': 451011}, 'multiverseid': 451011}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geröll-Moloch\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Geröll-Molochs sind gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\\nBlutrausch — {1}{R}{G}, wirf den Geröll-Moloch ab: Eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ländern ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0323f991-d724-41d4-a0d5-9c9b70c7b45d\', \'multiverseId\': 451392}, \'multiverseid\': 451392}, {\'name\': \'Titán de escombros\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Titán de escombros son iguales al número de tierras que controlas.\\nEmpujón — {1}{R}{G}, descartar el Titán de escombros: La criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es el número de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18944a4-9715-4ce5-b816-5a265c079105\', \'multiverseId\': 451640}, \'multiverseid\': 451640}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse de gravois\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance de la Carcasse de gravois sont chacune égales au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.\\nCoup de sang — {1}{R}{G}, défaussez-vous de la Carcasse de gravois : La créature attaquante ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93134e3a-cdff-4e8f-bae8-f034df9c78d4\', \'multiverseId\': 451888}, \'multiverseid\': 451888}, {\'name\': \'Colosso di Macerie\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione del Colosso di Macerie sono pari al numero di terre che controlli.\\nImpeto sanguinario — {1}{R}{G}, Scarta il Colosso di Macerie: Una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9863a01b-4b18-46a0-b08a-efc2e8766995\', \'multiverseId\': 452136}, \'multiverseid\': 452136}, {\'name\': \'瓦礫鬼\', \'text\': \'瓦礫鬼のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい。\\n湧血 ― {1}{R}{G}, 瓦礫鬼を捨てる：攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09621db-3c50-4951-8772-974868d95c50\', \'multiverseId\': 452384}, \'multiverseid\': 452384}, {\'name\': \'Brutamontes de Escombros\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Brutamontes de Escombros são ambos iguais ao número de terrenos que você controla.\\nImpulso sanguinário — {1}{R}{G}, descarte Brutamontes de Escombros: A criatura atacante alvo recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff5a91d-c4fc-4d93-b4f2-399c5abadfac\', \'multiverseId\': 452632}, \'multiverseid\': 452632}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesandter des Grolls\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nSowie der Gesandte des Grolls ins Spiel kommt, bestimme geheim einen Gegner.\\nOffenbare den bestimmten Spieler: Bestimme neue Ziele für einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, falls er bzw. sie von dem bestimmten Spieler kontrolliert wird und dich oder eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, als Ziel hat. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ifrit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450680&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6467c8-11e5-4694-b0b7-7612639ac42d\', \'multiverseId\': 450680}, \'multiverseid\': 450680}, {\'name\': \'Emisario de rencores\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nEn cuanto el Emisario de rencores entre al campo de batalla, elige un oponente en secreto.\\nMostrar el jugador que elegiste: Elige nuevos objetivos para la habilidad o el hechizo objetivo si están controlados por el jugador elegido y si te hacen objetivo a ti o a un permanente que controlas. Activa esta habilidad solo una vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Efrit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'434af7f9-32c1-4bfe-ba6f-ae62097dfa07\', \'multiverseId\': 450739}, \'multiverseid\': 450739}, {\'name\': \'Émissaire des rancœurs\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nAu moment où l\'Émissaire des rancœurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez secrètement un adversaire.\\nRévélez le joueur choisi : Choisissez de nouvelles cibles pour le sort ciblé ou la capacité ciblée s\'ils sont contrôlés par le joueur choisi et s\'ils vous ciblent ou ciblent un permanent que vous contrôlez. N\'activez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature : éfrit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f169f138-5e5a-4438-a18f-ec85fba18a9d\', \'multiverseId\': 450798}, \'multiverseid\': 450798}, {\'name\': \'Emissario del Rancore\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nMentre l\'Emissario del Rancore entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli segretamente un avversario.\\nRivela il giocatore che hai scelto: Scegli nuovi bersagli per una magia o abilità bersaglio se è controllata dal giocatore scelto e se bersaglia te o un permanente che controlli. Attiva questa abilità solo una volta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Efreet\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553953e2-0dcb-4cda-bc7e-a6fa1eb7593b\', \'multiverseId\': 450857}, \'multiverseid\': 450857}, {\'name\': \'遺恨の使者\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n遺恨の使者が戦場に出るに際し、秘密裏に対戦相手１人を選ぶ。\\nあなたが選んだプレイヤーを公開する：呪文か能力１つを対象とする。それをその選ばれたプレイヤーがコントロールしていて、それがあなたやあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントを対象としているなら、それの新しい対象を選ぶ。この能力は、１回のみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イフリート\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db0f9ff2-7216-4c16-b9be-d78b42c51447\', \'multiverseId\': 450916}, \'multiverseid\': 450916}, {\'name\': \'Emissário do Ressentimento\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nConforme Emissário do Ressentimento entrar no campo de batalha, escolha secretamente um oponente.\\nRevele o jogador escolhido: Escolha novos alvos para a mágica ou habilidade alvo se ela for controlada pelo jogador escolhido e tiver como alvo você ou uma permanente que você controla. Ative esta habilidade apenas uma vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Efrite\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af12a72a-15c8-4ce9-83e0-ba764048892a\', \'multiverseId\': 450975}, \'multiverseid\': 450975}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gieriger Schleim\', \'text\': \'Der Gierige Schleim kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nFalls eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil und lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Gierigen Schleim, wie die Stärke jener Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Irgendwann kommt der Tod auf jeden von uns zugeschwabbelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450694&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f54dfb-010e-46b0-a0a2-80eb263d601e\', \'multiverseId\': 450694}, \'multiverseid\': 450694}, {\'name\': \'Fango voraz\', \'text\': \'El Fango voraz no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nSi una criatura que controla un oponente fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala y pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Fango voraz igual a la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'Al final, la muerte avanza contoneándose hacia todos nosotros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43263f3f-7ba7-4293-926c-6f60c9532b80\', \'multiverseId\': 450753}, \'multiverseid\': 450753}, {\'name\': \'Boue vorace\', \'text\': "La Boue vorace ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nSi une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle devait mourir, à la place, exilez-la et mettez un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la force de cette créature sur la Boue vorace.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': "La mort finit toujours par s\'insinuer jusqu\'à nous.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c108f0d-f68d-41aa-923b-0b335dba18c3\', \'multiverseId\': 450812}, \'multiverseid\': 450812}, {\'name\': \'Melma Famelica\', \'text\': \'La Melma Famelica non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nSe una creatura controllata da un avversario sta per morire, invece esiliala e metti sulla Melma Famelica un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'Prima o poi, la morte si avvicina tremolante a tutti noi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3cf297-5def-4207-bd46-19c1a390931c\', \'multiverseId\': 450871}, \'multiverseid\': 450871}, {\'name\': \'貪欲なスライム\', \'text\': \'貪欲なスライムは、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりに、それを追放して、そのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを貪欲なスライムの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'いずれ死はすべての者に這い寄る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2db5087-2bcc-4eb2-8943-6db69c01d3f2\', \'multiverseId\': 450930}, \'multiverseid\': 450930}, {\'name\': \'Limo Voraz\', \'text\': \'Limo Voraz não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas de poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nSe uma criatura que um oponente controla morreria, em vez disso, exile-a e coloque em Limo Voraz uma quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao poder daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Em algum momento a morte chega, tremelicante, para todos nós.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16497d60-d73e-44fb-b016-acda23b5b69e\', \'multiverseId\': 450989}, \'multiverseid\': 450989}]', "[{'name': 'Gießerei der Konsule', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, opfere die Gießerei der Konsule: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Überall um die Gießerei herum koppelten sich Maschinenwesen von ihren Halterungen ab und richteten sich auf Chandra aus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451451&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3db1c94-fea4-45f5-82bd-68961b01b26c', 'multiverseId': 451451}, 'multiverseid': 451451}, {'name': 'Fundición de los cónsules', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrificar la Fundición de los cónsules: crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Por toda la fundición, los autómatas se desenganchaban de sus soportes y rotaban para estar de cara a Chandra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451699&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dd37e54-f186-4795-a914-ac48fab7ca46', 'multiverseId': 451699}, 'multiverseid': 451699}, {'name': 'Fonderie des consuls', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrifiez la Fonderie des consuls : Créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Dans toute la fonderie, les automates se décrochèrent de leurs montures et pivotèrent pour faire face à Chandra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451947&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9f01baa-ea9c-4b1c-adf1-f298181c57ae', 'multiverseId': 451947}, 'multiverseid': 451947}, {'name': 'Fonderia dei Consoli', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifica la Fonderia dei Consoli: Crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Tutto intorno alla fonderia, gli automi si sganciarono dai propri destrieri e ruotarono per affrontare Chandra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452195&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a951ca8-6e04-453d-9962-a485339328a4', 'multiverseId': 452195}, 'multiverseid': 452195}, {'name': '領事の鋳造所', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{5}, {T}, 領事の鋳造所を生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '鋳造所のあちらこちらで、自動機械たちは自らを台座から取り外し、旋回してチャンドラの方を向いた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452443&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f160b1b4-93b1-4978-97cd-9a8bb33ea366', 'multiverseId': 452443}, 'multiverseid': 452443}, {'name': 'Fundição dos Cônsules', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrifique Fundição dos Cônsules: Crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Por toda a forja, os autômatos se soltaram de seus encaixes e se viraram na direção de Chandra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452691&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6cd8b23-4a1a-42d3-8ac7-016ab22739ec', 'multiverseId': 452691}, 'multiverseid': 452691}]", "[{'name': 'Golgari-Verrottungsfarm', 'text': 'Die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451452&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2b5f4b3-0364-4cca-8996-5b406d9da5f2', 'multiverseId': 451452}, 'multiverseid': 451452}, {'name': 'Granja de podredumbre golgari', 'text': 'La Granja de podredumbre golgari entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Granja de podredumbre golgari entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451700&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51ac6cf7-d28c-49de-9211-213720d06c26', 'multiverseId': 451700}, 'multiverseid': 451700}, {'name': 'Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari', 'text': 'La Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451948&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56644db2-82e4-4a7e-82b9-ecd24830c110', 'multiverseId': 451948}, 'multiverseid': 451948}, {'name': 'Mortificio Golgari', 'text': 'Il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452196&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bf5176d-14b8-49ce-a541-d8bf1807bf15', 'multiverseId': 452196}, 'multiverseid': 452196}, {'name': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場', 'text': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nゴルガリの腐敗農場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452444&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9b2e45c-23b2-4f6e-84f4-3286e4bb3d0f', 'multiverseId': 452444}, 'multiverseid': 452444}, {'name': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari', 'text': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452692&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df65242c-1757-462a-b025-ac70adc5be54', 'multiverseId': 452692}, 'multiverseid': 452692}]", '[{\'name\': \'Granitblick\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind und deren umgewandelte Manakosten X oder weniger betragen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Golgari-Wiederverwerter verachten die Gorgos, da ihretwegen so viele gute Nährstoffe zu Stein werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91304679-a780-49d1-b111-c82fea038145\', \'multiverseId\': 451384}, \'multiverseid\': 451384}, {\'name\': \'Mirada de granito\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de X o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los recobradores golgari desprecian a las gorgonas, ofendidos por la pérdida de tantos nutrientes encerrados en piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28919b84-2790-4a22-b3fb-0eefa7f9781c\', \'multiverseId\': 451632}, \'multiverseid\': 451632}, {\'name\': \'Regard de granit\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les récupérateurs de Golgari n\'ont que mépris pour les gorgones au nom de tous ces précieux nutriments sottement pétrifiés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda551b9-5d00-4fdb-84c7-c2b73cadb04e\', \'multiverseId\': 451880}, \'multiverseid\': 451880}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo di Granito\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I recuperatori Golgari non sopportano le gorgoni, infastiditi dalla perdita di tutto quel nutrimento rinchiuso in pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c805d9fc-31ef-4740-ae93-d75875e7ecf8\', \'multiverseId\': 452128}, \'multiverseid\': 452128}, {\'name\': \'花崗岩の凝視\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下で土地でない各パーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリの回収者達はゴルゴンのことを不愉快に思っている。大量の良質な栄養分が石にされてしまったことが勿体なく、口惜しいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6870a9e-15c1-4d83-bb2d-2074cfa8efd1\', \'multiverseId\': 452376}, \'multiverseid\': 452376}, {\'name\': \'Olhar de Granito\', \'text\': \'Destrua cada permanente que não seja um terreno com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os recuperadores Golgari detestam as górgonas, lamentando a perda de tantos nutrientes bons encerrados em pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ef8b1c-b2d6-4988-a613-ab93fbcb8ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 452624}, \'multiverseid\': 452624}]', "[{'name': 'Grauenhafte Bergung', 'text': 'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Für die Golgari ist alles, was vergraben ist, ein Schatz.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451385&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f049a1ce-6216-4402-8e43-751943c3dfb5', 'multiverseId': 451385}, 'multiverseid': 451385}, {'name': 'Recuperación truculenta', 'text': 'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de criatura o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Para los golgari, todo lo que está enterrado es un tesoro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451633&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0b6a510-edd1-48c7-9d96-9f0f16f7e196', 'multiverseId': 451633}, 'multiverseid': 451633}, {'name': 'Horrible récupération', 'text': 'Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Aux yeux des Golgari, tout ce qui est enterré est un trésor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451881&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '022a9d6b-b6b0-496c-9616-ea6defb789ad', 'multiverseId': 451881}, 'multiverseid': 451881}, {'name': 'Recupero Raccapricciante', 'text': 'Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Per i Golgari, tutto ciò che è sepolto è un tesoro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452129&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4973037-4784-4a76-808a-f24d6067734b', 'multiverseId': 452129}, 'multiverseid': 452129}, {'name': '忌まわしい回収', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ゴルガリにとって、埋められているものはすべて宝である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452377&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71414c67-96b2-4dda-a60c-4986acb8e892', 'multiverseId': 452377}, 'multiverseid': 452377}, {'name': 'Salvamento Macabro', 'text': 'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de criatura ou terreno dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Para os Golgari, qualquer coisa enterrada é um tesouro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452625&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4876201b-d393-4565-b6a6-8fc262e433c1', 'multiverseId': 452625}, 'multiverseid': 452625}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Erforscher\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grenzland-Erforscher ins Spiel kommt, kann jeder Spieler eine Karte abwerfen. Jeder Spieler, der auf diese Weise eine Karte abgeworfen hat, kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf seine Hand nehmen und dann seine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e53502-38d0-42a0-8fe9-0bb5314f96f2\', \'multiverseId\': 451336}, \'multiverseid\': 451336}, {\'name\': \'Reconocedor de fronteras\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Reconocedor de fronteras entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador puede descartar una carta. Cada jugador que descartó una carta de esta manera puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en su mano y luego barajar su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7c7e0a-d65f-4653-a7b1-0c1913789eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 451584}, \'multiverseid\': 451584}, {\'name\': \'Explorateur des frontières\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Explorateur des frontières arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur peut se défausser d\'une carte. Chaque joueur qui s\'est défaussé d\'une carte de cette manière peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans sa main, puis mélanger sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975a2604-4da7-47cc-9a01-f1f42ff4aba1\', \'multiverseId\': 451832}, \'multiverseid\': 451832}, {\'name\': \'Esploratore delle Terre di Confine\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esploratore delle Terre di Confine entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore può scartare una carta. Ogni giocatore che ha scartato una carta in questo modo può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla propria mano e rimescolare il proprio grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20110e88-391d-4501-a670-2430a3faee3a\', \'multiverseId\': 452080}, \'multiverseid\': 452080}, {\'name\': \'国境探検者\', \'text\': \'国境探検者が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨ててもよい。これによりカードを捨てた各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開して自分の手札に加え、その後自分のライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ef077d-200d-492e-87cf-11b5d1fa987a\', \'multiverseId\': 452328}, \'multiverseid\': 452328}, {\'name\': \'Explorador da Fronteira\', \'text\': \'Quando Explorador da Fronteira entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador pode descartar um card. Cada jogador que descartou um card dessa forma pode procurar no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo na própria mão e, em seguida, embaralhar o próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c23e52-df9f-44a5-ad7d-f0115322cfa9\', \'multiverseId\': 452576}, \'multiverseid\': 452576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Hinterwald\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich mag, was sie mit dem Ort gemacht haben."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451454&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b628d30f-3f80-4257-91d3-b3399aae28b8\', \'multiverseId\': 451454}, \'multiverseid\': 451454}, {\'name\': \'Montes siniestros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Me encanta lo que hicieron con el lugar".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3379ac61-744d-469c-8d86-8aeb88f74c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 451702}, \'multiverseid\': 451702}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre forêt sauvage\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« J\'adore ! Auriez-vous le nom de leur jardinier ? »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451950&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eaa287c-78c7-43b3-9168-06c2d96cb833\', \'multiverseId\': 451950}, \'multiverseid\': 451950}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Orrenda\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi piace come hanno sistemato questo posto."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb10b5b2-ff4c-4fd7-b932-b113c827b147\', \'multiverseId\': 452198}, \'multiverseid\': 452198}, {\'name\': \'不気味な辺境林\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「いいね。奴らがこの地にしでかした事は。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60a4240-1ef2-4a0d-b00b-382dce74b633\', \'multiverseId\': 452446}, \'multiverseid\': 452446}, {\'name\': \'Mata Sinistra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Adorei o que fizeram com esse lugar."\\n— Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c8bb18c-47f1-4a0f-929d-47deef69d9d2\', \'multiverseId\': 452694}, \'multiverseid\': 452694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Große Schmelze\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, Urquell des geschmolzenen Metalls, Tempel der Goblinhorde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451453&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a47760-c75e-4e08-86aa-ee75a25ed62c\', \'multiverseId\': 451453}, \'multiverseid\': 451453}, {\'name\': \'Gran horno\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, manantial del metal fundido, templo de la horda de trasgos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c3f7e2-9604-4244-a066-582c3af9ea3a\', \'multiverseId\': 451701}, \'multiverseid\': 451701}, {\'name\': \'Grand Fourneau\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, puits sourcier de métal en fusion, temple des hordes gobelines.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb161553-2716-4204-a68c-f9ac92347336\', \'multiverseId\': 451949}, \'multiverseid\': 451949}, {\'name\': \'Grande Fornace\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Kuldotha, fonte del metallo fuso, tempio dell\'orda dei goblin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d8fd80b-75fe-49d2-9eac-e5c23c093f71\', \'multiverseId\': 452197}, \'multiverseid\': 452197}, {\'name\': \'大焼炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'カルドーサ、溶けた金属の噴き出すゴブリンの群落の寺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa74bebc-65e3-44ee-bb4f-920334f67a98\', \'multiverseId\': 452445}, \'multiverseid\': 452445}, {\'name\': \'Grande Fornalha\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, a fonte do metal fundido, o templo da horda goblin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08ca971-17f3-45fa-8388-7a18036ae8d1\', \'multiverseId\': 452693}, \'multiverseid\': 452693}]', "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451455&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0d80462-df9f-4130-a34f-a9dbfc7162d9', 'multiverseId': 451455}, 'multiverseid': 451455}, {'name': 'Territorio gruul', 'text': 'El Territorio gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Territorio gruul entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451703&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eca8b93e-0456-4379-93db-1f63ff43b97c', 'multiverseId': 451703}, 'multiverseid': 451703}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451951&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50689387-8a63-4415-a0e2-ed7fd92c20eb', 'multiverseId': 451951}, 'multiverseid': 451951}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452199&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35216126-73f6-46f0-bfac-48e40e4221b7', 'multiverseId': 452199}, 'multiverseid': 452199}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452447&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '687ae741-61e5-4f8d-aef0-03354ef0983b', 'multiverseId': 452447}, 'multiverseid': 452447}, {'name': 'Gleba Gruul', 'text': 'Gleba Gruul entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Gleba Gruul entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452695&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3930e40b-2768-4854-be38-91968d25ae6e', 'multiverseId': 452695}, 'multiverseid': 452695}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grübelschlängler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Grübelschlängler ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nHerbeirufen {2}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff0f5390-9e59-4ae2-a8f0-d06ea9dfae08\', \'multiverseId\': 451297}, \'multiverseid\': 451297}, {\'name\': \'Errante meditabundo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Errante meditabundo entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas.\\nEvocar {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543cc139-1748-4f00-9530-064ebc1be03d\', \'multiverseId\': 451545}, \'multiverseid\': 451545}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des pensées\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Vagabond des pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉvocation {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698e76d2-a5a4-4910-91e2-5c461fcb61d5\', \'multiverseId\': 451793}, \'multiverseid\': 451793}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo Pensoso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Vagabondo Pensoso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\\nApparire {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1a883b-2c4e-4bd6-a767-2b0a7c905955\', \'multiverseId\': 452041}, \'multiverseid\': 452041}, {\'name\': \'熟考漂い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n熟考漂いが戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引く。\\n想起{2}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e07493-cbb4-4c57-8ea0-fb38e3f7c2c6\', \'multiverseId\': 452289}, \'multiverseid\': 452289}, {\'name\': \'Vaga-pensador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Vaga-pensador entrar no campo de batalha, compre dois cards.\\nEvocar {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355d8df4-d72b-46c6-9fcf-e4f4407f482d\', \'multiverseId\': 452537}, \'multiverseid\': 452537}]', "[{'name': 'Gyrus, Erwecker der Kadaver', 'text': 'Gyrus, Erwecker der Kadaver, kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie Mana bezahlt wurde, um ihn zu wirken.\\nImmer wenn Gyrus angreift, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit niedrigerer Stärke aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Karte ist. Schicke den Spielstein am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Hydra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450701&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aac71729-4ec0-4c9e-8180-75b490187de0', 'multiverseId': 450701}, 'multiverseid': 450701}, {'name': 'Gyrus, Despertador de Cadáveres', 'text': 'Gyrus, Despertador de Cadáveres entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre él igual a la cantidad de maná usada para lanzarlo.\\nSiempre que Gyrus ataque, puedes exiliar la carta de criatura objetivo con menor fuerza de tu cementerio. Si lo haces, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa carta y que está girada y atacando. Exilia la ficha al final del combate.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hidra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450760&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fd7a643-6ec2-4236-bd89-e5a18252749b', 'multiverseId': 450760}, 'multiverseid': 450760}, {'name': 'Gyrus, éveilleur de cadavres', 'text': 'Gyrus, éveilleur de cadavres arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la quantité de mana dépensée pour le lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que Gyrus attaque, vous pouvez exiler une carte de créature ciblée de force inférieure depuis votre cimetière. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette carte, engagé et attaquant. Exilez ce jeton à la fin du combat.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : hydre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450819&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2f32c2a-c857-4191-91d2-3448ea5fabfe', 'multiverseId': 450819}, 'multiverseid': 450819}, {'name': 'Gyrus, Risvegliatore di Cadaveri', 'text': 'Gyrus, Risvegliatore di Cadaveri entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al mana speso per lanciarlo.\\nOgniqualvolta Gyrus attacca, puoi esiliare una carta creatura bersaglio con forza inferiore dal tuo cimitero. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia di quella carta ed è TAPpata e attaccante. Esilia la pedina alla fine del combattimento.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Idra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450878&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '625dad18-6790-4b3d-9b40-448311e7f7fa', 'multiverseId': 450878}, 'multiverseid': 450878}, {'name': '死体起こし、ジャイラス', 'text': '死体起こし、ジャイラスは、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの点数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n死体起こし、ジャイラスが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地からパワーがこれよりも小さいクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードのコピーであるトークンを１体、タップ状態で攻撃している状態で生成する。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450937&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7355793-3427-41a2-80eb-28e392bff696', 'multiverseId': 450937}, 'multiverseid': 450937}, {'name': 'Gyrus, Despertador de Cadáveres', 'text': 'Gyrus, Despertador de Cadáveres, entra no campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual à quantidade de mana gasta para conjurá-lo.\\nToda vez que Gyrus ataca, você pode exilar o card de criatura alvo com o menor poder dentre os de seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquele card e que esteja virada e atacando. Exile a ficha no final do combate.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Hidra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450996&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f793b17-bd76-46e5-b780-1c666f08b64d', 'multiverseId': 450996}, 'multiverseid': 450996}]", '[{\'name\': \'Halimar-Untiefe\', \'text\': \'Die Halimar-Untiefe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Halimar-Untiefe ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451456&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'614dd4ea-b059-42d8-8163-ebfddc5d3c21\', \'multiverseId\': 451456}, \'multiverseid\': 451456}, {\'name\': \'Abismos de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Los Abismos de Halimar entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Abismos de Halimar entren al campo de batalla, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y regrésalas en cualquier orden.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3fb724-ad95-4c40-b7cc-22f12f7a11ed\', \'multiverseId\': 451704}, \'multiverseid\': 451704}, {\'name\': \'Profondeurs de Halimar\', \'text\': "Les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451952&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784a385f-ac7c-4c11-a192-3ff0d4a910f1\', \'multiverseId\': 451952}, \'multiverseid\': 451952}, {\'name\': \'Abissi di Halimar\', \'text\': \'Gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b15570ec-1695-452c-8849-f80d7289205c\', \'multiverseId\': 452200}, \'multiverseid\': 452200}, {\'name\': \'ハリマーの深み\', \'text\': \'ハリマーの深みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nハリマーの深みが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、それらを望む順番で戻す。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30c9ca1-75ab-4dd4-af99-6c4168292278\', \'multiverseId\': 452448}, \'multiverseid\': 452448}, {\'name\': \'Profundezas de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Profundezas de Halimar entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Profundezas de Halimar entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32df7d71-4467-4d27-936f-122eab2446d1\', \'multiverseId\': 452696}, \'multiverseid\': 452696}]', "[{'name': 'Heimgesuchtes Sumpfgrab', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere das Heimgesuchte Sumpfgrab: Bringe eine zufällig bestimmte Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der Spielplatz der Ghulrufer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451457&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2c1bf60-08d1-402e-bf2e-9ddf9eeee871', 'multiverseId': 451457}, 'multiverseid': 451457}, {'name': 'Tumbanegada embrujada', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar la Tumbanegada embrujada: Regresa una carta de criatura al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'El jardín de un llamamuertos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451705&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b06a6005-6372-42fb-aec0-a7e64af48baf', 'multiverseId': 451705}, 'multiverseid': 451705}, {'name': 'Paludgraf hanté', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paludgraf hanté : Renvoyez une carte de créature au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Le terrain de jeu du meneur de goule.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451953&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e034afd6-5477-4456-be6b-33360d157369', 'multiverseId': 451953}, 'multiverseid': 451953}, {'name': 'Cimitero Palustre Infestato', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica il Cimitero Palustre Infestato: Riprendi in mano una carta creatura a caso dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Il parco giochi di un evocaghoul.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452201&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd29948c-9a51-48ff-b3bd-1de700de0bbc', 'multiverseId': 452201}, 'multiverseid': 452201}, {'name': '憑依された沼墓', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}, 憑依された沼墓を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'グール呼びの遊び場。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452449&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e93d015-776d-4734-b84f-1d13a77d0c4b', 'multiverseId': 452449}, 'multiverseid': 452449}, {'name': 'Cemitério Pantanoso Assombrado', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifique Cemitério Pantanoso Assombrado: Devolva um card de criatura aleatório de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'O parque de diversões de um invocador de carniçais.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452697&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fd49313-9bdb-4777-b48a-c618cd1f1321', 'multiverseId': 452697}, 'multiverseid': 452697}]", '[{\'name\': \'Heroldin des Pantheons\', \'text\': \'Verzauberungszauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auszeichnung, zum Bannerträger der Götter auserkoren zu werden, ist nichts verglichen mit der Ehre, Nyx näher sein zu dürfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451354&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bec489f-72ee-4933-aa1c-b00c17999d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 451354}, \'multiverseid\': 451354}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del panteón\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de encantamiento.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán centauro\', \'flavor\': \'La distinción de portar el estandarte de los dioses no es nada comparada con la gloria de estar más cerca de Nyx.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e259842d-349a-4bd8-8a8c-815e06462572\', \'multiverseId\': 451602}, \'multiverseid\': 451602}, {\'name\': \'Héraut du panthéon\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'enchantement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Porter l\'étendard des dieux n\'est rien comparé à la gloire d\'être plus proche de Nyx.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416388b5-660d-4f7c-ab62-01da7f34b8af\', \'multiverseId\': 451850}, \'multiverseid\': 451850}, {\'name\': \'Messaggera del Pantheon\', \'text\': \'Le magie incantesimo che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Centauro\', \'flavor\': "L\'onore di portare il vessillo degli dei non è nulla se paragonato alla gloria di essere più vicini a Nyx.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7004755-53fe-4c67-a5df-4b61a762b0f6\', \'multiverseId\': 452098}, \'multiverseid\': 452098}, {\'name\': \'万神殿の伝令\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'神々の戦旗を掲げることができる栄誉など、ニクスに近づくことの栄光と比べたら何でもない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefde447-fadb-48d4-bfcd-ecca3ab31ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 452346}, \'multiverseid\': 452346}, {\'name\': \'Arauto do Panteão\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de encantamentos que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de encantamento, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'A honra de carregar o estandarte dos deuses não é nada comparado à glória de estar mais perto de Nyx.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'426beee9-bc83-4e42-9b72-0c99b3ce66f0\', \'multiverseId\': 452594}, \'multiverseid\': 452594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelssturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du in dieser Partie deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast.\\nErzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein inspirierender und glorreicher Aufstieg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450662&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ae01e6-2acd-4816-ba97-f68a3c484c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 450662}, \'multiverseid\': 450662}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta empírea\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que lanzaste a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\\nCrea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una ascensión inspiradora y gloriosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93627df5-ae63-41e0-8cd5-e8bc752c5777\', \'multiverseId\': 450721}, \'multiverseid\': 450721}, {\'name\': "Déluge de l\'empyrée", \'text\': \'Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez déjà lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.\\nCréez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une ascension glorieuse et exaltante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e50c8d-1401-445c-8ee7-4d690ad69ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 450780}, \'multiverseid\': 450780}, {\'name\': "Tempesta dell\'Empireo", \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai lanciato il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\\nCrea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Un\'ascesa gloriosa e ispiratrice.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739a4273-b64d-4fa0-9fbd-899ccffae3ff\', \'multiverseId\': 450839}, \'multiverseid\': 450839}, {\'name\': \'浄火の嵐\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、これを１回コピーする。\\n飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'鼓舞的威風的上昇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c6e72e-f629-48f7-b0f8-86a17ef3a074\', \'multiverseId\': 450898}, \'multiverseid\': 450898}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade Empírea\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada vez que você conjurou seu comandante da zona de comando neste jogo.\\nCrie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma ascensão inspiradora e gloriosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f91f16-fe9f-4637-82d5-4ccbcb699042\', \'multiverseId\': 450957}, \'multiverseid\': 450957}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlische Klingenmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Doppelschlag\\nWenn die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Auren und Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an sie anlegen.\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Aura und für jede Ausrüstung, die an die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin angelegt ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450663&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b0f7ca-ea02-4e6f-a432-9e60819e3b37\', \'multiverseId\': 450663}, \'multiverseid\': 450663}, {\'name\': \'Maestra de filo celestial\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña dos veces.\\nCuando la Maestra de filo celestial entre al campo de batalla, puedes anexarle cualquier cantidad de Auras y Equipos que controlas.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a la Maestra de filo celestial.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d490559-bd0d-4e2b-9641-a51d4afbb924\', \'multiverseId\': 450722}, \'multiverseid\': 450722}, {\'name\': "Maîtresse d\'épée céleste", \'text\': "Vol, double initiative\\nQuand la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez lui attacher n\'importe quel nombre d\'auras et d\'équipements que vous contrôlez.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque aura et chaque équipement attachés à la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a8d0ce1-66c5-47d9-9b11-8d479f6de30d\', \'multiverseId\': 450781}, \'multiverseid\': 450781}, {\'name\': \'Maestra di Spada Celestiale\', \'text\': \'Volare, doppio attacco\\nQuando la Maestra di Spada Celestiale entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi assegnarle un qualsiasi numero di Aure ed Equipaggiamenti che controlli.\\nLe altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 per ogni Aura ed Equipaggiamento assegnati alla Maestra di Spada Celestiale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77586fbd-55d9-4ab6-88fb-d93d5adf05f3\', \'multiverseId\': 450840}, \'multiverseid\': 450840}, {\'name\': \'天の刃使い\', \'text\': \'飛行、二段攻撃\\n天の刃使いが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールしている望む数のオーラや装備品をこれにつけてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーは、天の刃使いにつけられているオーラや装備品１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34aec8c0-6e0c-4696-ba79-8b581f51a2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 450899}, \'multiverseid\': 450899}, {\'name\': \'Espadachim-mestra Celestial\', \'text\': \'Voar, golpe duplo\\nQuando Espadachim-mestra Celestial entra no campo de batalha, você pode anexar a ela qualquer número de Auras e Equipamentos que você controla.\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 para cada Aura e Equipamento anexado a Espadachim-mestra Celestial.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8041424e-7c4c-4577-899e-2098ed7843f6\', \'multiverseId\': 450958}, \'multiverseid\': 450958}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlischer Archon\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {5}{W}{W} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nFliegend, Erstschlag\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+4 und hat Flugfähigkeit und Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6cbee06-de40-4a97-a788-179acf01b5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 451267}, \'multiverseid\': 451267}, {\'name\': \'Arconte celestial\', \'text\': \'Concesión {5}{W}{W}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de Aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nVuela, daña primero.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+4 y tiene las habilidades de volar y dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a986872-25c6-4e97-8bdd-a1572e9514cb\', \'multiverseId\': 451515}, \'multiverseid\': 451515}, {\'name\': \'Archonte céleste\', \'text\': "Grâce {5}{W}{W} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nVol, initiative\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+4 et a le vol et l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d43e99-8a1d-4bcc-bc6b-d30d442303b7\', \'multiverseId\': 451763}, \'multiverseid\': 451763}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Celeste\', \'text\': \'Conferire {5}{W}{W} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nVolare, attacco improvviso\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+4 e ha volare e attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3a068f-3808-4470-ba01-ee703ca6a067\', \'multiverseId\': 452011}, \'multiverseid\': 452011}, {\'name\': \'天界の執政官\', \'text\': \'授与{5}{W}{W}（このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ・呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n飛行、先制攻撃\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋４の修整を受け、飛行と先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3005bc99-83a4-4014-9638-aea5b4201f84\', \'multiverseId\': 452259}, \'multiverseid\': 452259}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Celestial\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {5}{W}{W} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nVoar, iniciativa\\nA criatura encantada recebe +4/+4 e tem voar e iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd694bea-d4d5-41e6-a20b-6230ff263647\', \'multiverseId\': 452507}, \'multiverseid\': 452507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochlandsee\', \'text\': \'Der Hochlandsee kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„An Orten wie diesen frage ich mich oft, ob das Leben noch mehr zu bieten hat als nur Blut und Schätze … Ach, auch egal."\\n—Boyl Bocksalz, Sturmflotten-Matrose\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451458&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a8701a-1a69-4760-9317-4aae4e05837b\', \'multiverseId\': 451458}, \'multiverseid\': 451458}, {\'name\': \'Lago de las tierras altas\', \'text\': \'El Lago de las tierras altas entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Un lugar así hace que me pregunte si hay algo más en la vida que la sangre y los tesoros... Bah, no".\\n—Boyl Cubosalado, lobo de mar de la Flota Tempestuosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3217674d-7f77-4be5-8e41-85c9c9c7b902\', \'multiverseId\': 451706}, \'multiverseid\': 451706}, {\'name\': \'Lac des hautes terres\', \'text\': \'Le Lac des hautes terres arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand on voit un lieu tel que celui-ci, on se dit que la vie ne se limite pas au sang et aux trésors... Si, en fait. »\\n—Boyl Grindessel, mathurin de la Flotte de la tempête\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90e659a9-9e1a-4345-842c-0a3c436034fc\', \'multiverseId\': 451954}, \'multiverseid\': 451954}, {\'name\': "Lago dell\'Altopiano", \'text\': "Il Lago dell\'Altopiano entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Davanti a un posto del genere, mi chiedo se nella vita ci sia qualcosa di più che zuffe e bottini... Noo."\\n—Boyl Zucca Salata, mozzo della Flotta Fendiburrasca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d893626d-e735-4164-ba3f-f8506cbd163e\', \'multiverseId\': 452202}, \'multiverseid\': 452202}, {\'name\': \'高地の湖\', \'text\': \'高地の湖はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「こういう風景を見ると考えちまうんだよなぁ……、人生には血と宝物より大事なものがあるかも……。まぁ、ないな。」\\n――風雲艦隊の船方、ボイル・バックソルト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764baf0d-44fa-4f3f-a6b7-3814f9384ede\', \'multiverseId\': 452450}, \'multiverseid\': 452450}, {\'name\': \'Lago Montanhês\', \'text\': \'Lago Montanhês entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Um lugar como esse faz com que eu me pergunte se a vida não é mais do que sangue e tesouros... Nah."\\n— Boyl Ferrassal, marinheiro da Frota da Tormenta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3aaf6d-6bfb-4017-b4ba-30c3f176e32d\', \'multiverseId\': 452698}, \'multiverseid\': 452698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hohepriester der Buße\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dem Hohepriester der Buße Schaden zugefügt wird, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verlange doch nur Glauben, Treue, Gehorsam, Vertrauen und vollständige und totale Ergebenheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea537e3-c00c-479a-832d-66d3c965e7c4\', \'multiverseId\': 451386}, \'multiverseid\': 451386}, {\'name\': \'Gran sacerdote de la penitencia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Gran sacerdote de la penitencia reciba daño, puedes destruir el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo pido fe, lealtad, obediencia, confianza y una devoción total y absoluta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2edaaed-815e-453d-b57a-e0e780808f77\', \'multiverseId\': 451634}, \'multiverseid\': 451634}, {\'name\': \'Grand prêtre de la pénitence\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Grand prêtre de la pénitence subit des blessures, vous pouvez détruire un permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne demande que foi, loyauté, obéissance, confiance et dévotion absolue. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9c4d3a-71e8-4f31-9c9e-adfb6420619d\', \'multiverseId\': 451882}, \'multiverseid\': 451882}, {\'name\': \'Gran Sacerdote della Penitenza\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno al Gran Sacerdote della Penitenza, puoi distruggere un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutto ciò che chiedo è fede, lealtà, obbedienza, fiducia e devozione totale e assoluta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'219b7749-b9fd-46b8-8c82-36a784dae218\', \'multiverseId\': 452130}, \'multiverseid\': 452130}, {\'name\': \'贖罪の高僧\', \'text\': \'贖罪の高僧にダメージが与えられるたび、土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「私が求めるのは信仰心と忠誠と従順さと信頼と有無を言わさぬ完全なる献身だけです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61e9318-5faa-48bb-9756-f70415eb8410\', \'multiverseId\': 452378}, \'multiverseid\': 452378}, {\'name\': \'Alto Sacerdote de Penitência\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Alto Sacerdote de Penitência sofre dano, você pode destruir a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo que eu exijo é fé, lealdade, obediência, confiança e devoção total e completa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c86239b-1b7f-47b4-8a81-51d17db8c820\', \'multiverseId\': 452626}, \'multiverseid\': 452626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429e85ee-1355-4b9f-b26d-a4e1774fd205\', \'multiverseId\': 451489}, \'multiverseid\': 451489}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65032ca6-98bb-4d73-9150-abe00f262090\', \'multiverseId\': 451737}, \'multiverseid\': 451737}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b02c39-1f48-4d3b-9c28-671c7903f6e6\', \'multiverseId\': 451985}, \'multiverseid\': 451985}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2978f8ee-c400-4316-adcc-659e5ceeb588\', \'multiverseId\': 452233}, \'multiverseid\': 452233}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6340163e-cc2d-4037-97d2-c3c74cffc570\', \'multiverseId\': 452481}, \'multiverseid\': 452481}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Morfoterrena\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Vastidão Morfoterrena: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8278e9-0acf-4432-94d4-b0ad07fbdfaa\', \'multiverseId\': 452729}, \'multiverseid\': 452729}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Betracht ziehen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück. Du kannst danach deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer sich heute vorbereitet, gewinnt morgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451299&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bbf6c0b-99f3-4968-a614-2920381f3b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 451299}, \'multiverseid\': 451299}, {\'name\': \'Reflexionar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego regrésalas en cualquier orden. Puedes barajar tu biblioteca.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El mañana pertenece a quienes hoy se preparan para él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c34fb71-0ad6-4825-8cd0-7a0f3c8d6a3d\', \'multiverseId\': 451547}, \'multiverseid\': 451547}, {\'name\': \'Contemplation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous pouvez mélanger votre bibliothèque.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'avenir appartient à ceux qui s\'y préparent la veille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38633fe-0602-473c-8363-4226d040ed93\', \'multiverseId\': 451795}, \'multiverseid\': 451795}, {\'name\': \'Ponderare\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine. Puoi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il domani appartiene a quelli che oggi si preparano per esso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79e66d6-e1a7-4028-8ad5-3759fda768a6\', \'multiverseId\': 452043}, \'multiverseid\': 452043}, {\'name\': \'思案\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、その後それらを望む順番で戻す。あなたはあなたのライブラリーを切り直してもよい。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'明日という日は、今日それを迎える準備をしている者のためにある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66376e47-01e5-4e59-9860-a8f58529b7c9\', \'multiverseId\': 452291}, \'multiverseid\': 452291}, {\'name\': \'Ponderar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem. Você pode embaralhar seu grimório.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O amanhã pertence aos que se preparam para ele hoje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4c2325-29a4-459b-887d-932b000bd788\', \'multiverseId\': 452539}, \'multiverseid\': 452539}]', '[{\'name\': \'In die Turbulenz hinein\', \'text\': \'Bonus {1}{U} (Du kannst zusätzlich {1}{U} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nBringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Turbulenz kommt! Die Turbulenz kommt! Bindet euch fest!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451295&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13889292-2c36-43f6-bdd8-3e6c6420aec0\', \'multiverseId\': 451295}, \'multiverseid\': 451295}, {\'name\': \'Dentro de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {1}{U}. (Puedes pagar {1}{U} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nRegresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Marea de Turbulencia! ¡Marea de Turbulencia! ¡Sujétense!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a23d666d-039c-4f76-8f3d-042f3e0cbbea\', \'multiverseId\': 451543}, \'multiverseid\': 451543}, {\'name\': \'En plein Roulis\', \'text\': \'Kick {1}{U} (Vous pouvez payer {1}{U} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nRenvoyez le permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire. Si ce sort a été kické, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vague de Roulis ! Vague de Roulis ! Attachez-vous ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed1d7be7-e1ae-4449-8cac-8156fc1d1e1a\', \'multiverseId\': 451791}, \'multiverseid\': 451791}, {\'name\': \'Nel Torbido\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {1}{U} (Puoi pagare {1}{U} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nFai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Marea torbida! Marea torbida! Tenetevi stretti!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde0840a-a80a-4f92-891f-6db2dec885ab\', \'multiverseId\': 452039}, \'multiverseid\': 452039}, {\'name\': \'乱動への突入\', \'text\': \'キッカー{1}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{U}を支払ってもよい。）\\n土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「乱動の潮目だ！乱動の潮目だ！どこかに身体を縛り付けろ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6736302-51cb-4e6c-99eb-de9403af0562\', \'multiverseId\': 452287}, \'multiverseid\': 452287}, {\'name\': \'Adentrar o Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {1}{U} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1}{U} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nDevolva a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno para a mão de seu dono. Se esta mágica foi reforçada, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Maré de Turbilhão! Maré de Turbilhão! Amarrem-se ao chão!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f32809d-66b9-44f6-b8ba-777458158680\', \'multiverseId\': 452535}, \'multiverseid\': 452535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inkarnation Zendikars\', \'text\': \'Die Stärke der Inkarnation Zendikars ist gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr Volk verärgerte Zendikar und erntete den Zorn des Landes. Deshalb ist Nissa die letzte der Animisten."\\n—Numa, Joraga-Häuptling\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451398&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2650d9f8-646a-4141-b078-c1fde856abe4\', \'multiverseId\': 451398}, \'multiverseid\': 451398}, {\'name\': \'Encarnación de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'La fuerza de la Encarnación de Zendikar es igual a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Su pueblo irritó a Zendikar y sufrió la ira de la tierra. Por eso Nissa es la última de los animistas".\\n—Numa, cacique joraga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ba8cb2-50a8-4167-acd8-5d174c3f3bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 451646}, \'multiverseid\': 451646}, {\'name\': \'Zendikar incarné\', \'text\': \'La force de Zendikar incarné est égale au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Son peuple a enragé Zendikar et a été la victime de sa colère. C\'est pourquoi Nissa est la dernière animiste. »\\n—Numa, chef de clan de Joraga", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23aea5b3-202d-4403-8b3a-4a06c6449824\', \'multiverseId\': 451894}, \'multiverseid\': 451894}, {\'name\': \'Incarnazione di Zendikar\', \'text\': "La forza dell\'Incarnazione di Zendikar è pari al numero di terre che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua gente suscitò la collera di Zendikar e dovette affrontare l\\\'ira della terra. Per questo motivo Nissa è l\\\'ultima degli animisti."\\n—Numa, capitano Joraga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e059e044-04e4-4d15-8543-ba6d8839a7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 452142}, \'multiverseid\': 452142}, {\'name\': \'ゼンディカーの具現\', \'text\': \'ゼンディカーの具現のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の民はゼンディカーを怒らせ、大地の報いを受けることとなった。ニッサが最後の精霊信者であるのは、その理由からだ。」\\n――ジョラーガの酋長、ヌーマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1bc53e-4e88-4913-9769-c08c71c8e8da\', \'multiverseId\': 452390}, \'multiverseid\': 452390}, {\'name\': \'Zendikar Incarnada\', \'text\': \'O poder de Zendikar Incarnada é igual ao número de terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"O povo dela enfureceu Zendikar e eles enfrentaram a fúria da terra. É por isso que Nissa é a última dos animistas."\\n— Numa, líder de Joraga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb2e6654-8ddf-4660-9724-af52031c388c\', \'multiverseId\': 452638}, \'multiverseid\': 452638}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inkarnation der Nacht\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn die Inkarnation der Nacht das Spiel verlässt, erhalten alle Kreaturen -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nHerbeirufen {3}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450677&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c113649d-56be-46de-8501-267caf16eef9\', \'multiverseId\': 450677}, \'multiverseid\': 450677}, {\'name\': \'Encarnación de la noche\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando la Encarnación de la noche deje el campo de batalla, todas las criaturas obtienen -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\\nEvocar {3}{B}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c388fc39-384f-4f60-ae1c-772082a9a401\', \'multiverseId\': 450736}, \'multiverseid\': 450736}, {\'name\': \'Nuit incarnée\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand la Nuit incarnée quitte le champ de bataille, toutes les créatures gagnent -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÉvocation {3}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4b8a45-a0f0-411b-ba44-845176e67ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 450795}, \'multiverseid\': 450795}, {\'name\': \'Incarnazione della Notte\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nQuando l\'Incarnazione della Notte lascia il campo di battaglia, tutte le creature prendono -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\\nApparire {3}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a61476-1678-4e28-a510-ba6c1a8ada42\', \'multiverseId\': 450854}, \'multiverseid\': 450854}, {\'name\': \'夜の具現\', \'text\': \'接死\\n夜の具現が戦場を離れたとき、ターン終了時まで、クリーチャーはすべて－３/－３の修整を受ける。\\n想起{3}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f212918e-579c-4293-829b-4a67696cccd7\', \'multiverseId\': 450913}, \'multiverseid\': 450913}, {\'name\': \'Noite Incarnada\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Noite Incarnada deixa o campo de batalha, todas as criaturas recebem -3/-3 até o final do turno.\\nEvocar {3}{B} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89eadb02-5501-466e-b6c6-89d8eed0479d\', \'multiverseId\': 450972}, \'multiverseid\': 450972}]', "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451499&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fb31608-c7ed-4d01-b81b-9d62e08a601e', 'multiverseId': 451499}, 'multiverseid': 451499}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451747&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1109cfc2-0abd-47ae-8e2c-38c046e2724e', 'multiverseId': 451747}, 'multiverseid': 451747}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451995&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7fa5691-842c-4185-a137-913219d64be7', 'multiverseId': 451995}, 'multiverseid': 451995}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452243&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '949d70de-f02d-4201-bea5-4decc55d5efa', 'multiverseId': 452243}, 'multiverseid': 452243}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452491&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '732638cc-3bc5-4aa0-95b0-202a707a7488', 'multiverseId': 452491}, 'multiverseid': 452491}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452739&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc043d40-adb2-4f7c-abbe-ae87f259205a', 'multiverseId': 452739}, 'multiverseid': 452739}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451500&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98887008-5ef1-4f54-8248-4459b2dd6f11', 'multiverseId': 451500}, 'multiverseid': 451500}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451748&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55a17dd8-4571-4334-a49f-4c8c792dafdf', 'multiverseId': 451748}, 'multiverseid': 451748}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451996&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70cdf497-a4e8-49c0-ad7c-8d41a1d91a0f', 'multiverseId': 451996}, 'multiverseid': 451996}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452244&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97750302-7c26-48c1-be85-1c023d37cc7a', 'multiverseId': 452244}, 'multiverseid': 452244}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452492&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01ac43d5-cc01-4342-8436-0c5edd886cd9', 'multiverseId': 452492}, 'multiverseid': 452492}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452740&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57b7d7b4-10dd-4198-af0e-ce2b51802898', 'multiverseId': 452740}, 'multiverseid': 452740}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451501&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '954edfae-9d56-4880-aff3-9472d3a12baa', 'multiverseId': 451501}, 'multiverseid': 451501}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451749&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f24dabd3-899c-4ee6-bbe3-6756535f223d', 'multiverseId': 451749}, 'multiverseid': 451749}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451997&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd176b7ce-0bcf-4ab4-854c-48eee4765f1f', 'multiverseId': 451997}, 'multiverseid': 451997}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452245&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa95d3a8-a8f6-48ee-8e99-62efcf9dcb77', 'multiverseId': 452245}, 'multiverseid': 452245}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452493&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c986b69-b596-49e3-bfdd-d34b3ea5f6d0', 'multiverseId': 452493}, 'multiverseid': 452493}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452741&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab1a753d-948a-4f7b-976f-b5b9f757c31b', 'multiverseId': 452741}, 'multiverseid': 452741}]", '[{\'name\': \'Instabiler Obelisk\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, opfere den Instabilen Obelisken: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Zerfall ist wie das letzte Aufbäumen einer längst vergangenen Zivilisation, die es nicht ertragen kann, in Vergessenheit zu geraten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451430&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae442282-b7cd-4cc7-87d3-219d6d47a936\', \'multiverseId\': 451430}, \'multiverseid\': 451430}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco inestable\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar el Obelisco inestable: Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su derrumbamiento es como la insolencia de una civilización largo tiempo extinta y ofendida por haber sido olvidada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee0604a-4e28-4c49-bd85-0a9efc778ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 451678}, \'multiverseid\': 451678}, {\'name\': \'Obélisque instable\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Obélisque instable : Détruisez le permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Son effondrement est l\'ultime attaque d\'une civilisation disparue qui refuse de sombrer dans l\'oubli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1ac93c-ae63-423f-98b7-e4d58544882e\', \'multiverseId\': 451926}, \'multiverseid\': 451926}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instabile\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Obelisco Instabile: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo crollo è il monito stizzito di una civiltà scomparsa da tempo che non sopporta di essere dimenticata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e51029dd-c463-41f2-a62a-592d953ae907\', \'multiverseId\': 452174}, \'multiverseid\': 452174}, {\'name\': \'不安定なオベリスク\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{7}, {T}, 不安定なオベリスクを生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その崩壊は、遠い昔に死に絶えた文明が忘れ去られることへの不満を表す足掻きのようであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec2e633-d164-47b5-b5fd-5a57afe76f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 452422}, \'multiverseid\': 452422}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instável\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifique Obelisco Instável: Destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu colapso é como o fustigar de uma civilização há muito morta que ressente o esquecimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef97d2c-44df-4d5d-9b09-a43017d1c750\', \'multiverseId\': 452670}, \'multiverseid\': 452670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Dampfwerk\', \'text\': \'Das Izzet-Dampfwerk kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Izzet-Dampfwerk ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f2dda4-232d-473f-96f6-1dafe94264d1\', \'multiverseId\': 451459}, \'multiverseid\': 451459}, {\'name\': \'Calderas ízzet\', \'text\': \'Las Calderas ízzet entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Calderas ízzet entren al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669dc08b-a0ba-46b3-86d6-792694dbc757\', \'multiverseId\': 451707}, \'multiverseid\': 451707}, {\'name\': "Chaufferie d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b727ffe0-b048-4104-bdef-1fc78a21f410\', \'multiverseId\': 451955}, \'multiverseid\': 451955}, {\'name\': \'Ebollitori Izzet\', \'text\': \'Gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4f4f12-60c5-4eb3-953d-9907b68c168b\', \'multiverseId\': 452203}, \'multiverseid\': 452203}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの煮沸場\', \'text\': \'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddfbc367-3af1-4491-89ce-c74ac4b5fed5\', \'multiverseId\': 452451}, \'multiverseid\': 452451}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet\', \'text\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1edd1ef-f2d4-4ac5-9f42-e251c08c91af\', \'multiverseId\': 452699}, \'multiverseid\': 452699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Izzet-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Eingang für die mit einer Vision und dem Mut, diese zu erschaffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c40957-1df6-4781-b40c-6982aa9238f9\', \'multiverseId\': 451460}, \'multiverseid\': 451460}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Ízzet\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Ízzet entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete a aquellos con mente abierta para crear y audacia para liberar a sus creaciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292c66ca-da9d-44f6-9573-5832e600e535\', \'multiverseId\': 451708}, \'multiverseid\': 451708}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': \'Entrez, vous qui possédez la vision créatrice et la témérité pour lâcher vos créations dans la nature.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'131adc6f-812b-444f-9adb-b3064887913c\', \'multiverseId\': 451956}, \'multiverseid\': 451956}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Izzet\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Izzet entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrino coloro che hanno la fantasia per creare e il coraggio di dare vita alle loro creazioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95610e5-50df-4253-abdb-e5c819942cb3\', \'multiverseId\': 452204}, \'multiverseid\': 452204}, {\'name\': \'イゼットのギルド門\', \'text\': \'イゼットのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'創造する意志と己の創造物を解き放つ無謀さを持つ者は、この中へ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02cfdd18-5cc9-4ecf-ab92-8326ed92a116\', \'multiverseId\': 452452}, \'multiverseid\': 452452}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Izzet\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Izzet entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entrem aqueles com a visão para criar e a temeridade para libertar suas criações.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fac0c0c-503f-4117-9c68-94ca8acf115d\', \'multiverseId\': 452700}, \'multiverseid\': 452700}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Petschaft der Izzet erhält immer wieder ein neues Aussehen, und jedes Mal wird es einem schmeichelnden Portrait von Niv-Mizzet ähnlicher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26b9b01-4299-4999-8bdb-f8fb0df9d558\', \'multiverseId\': 451410}, \'multiverseid\': 451410}, {\'name\': \'Sello ízzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Sello ízzet se rediseña a menudo, y cada vez se parece más a un retrato de Niv-Mízzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67dfd209-1533-4d00-8d1f-9e4684fe636e\', \'multiverseId\': 451658}, \'multiverseid\': 451658}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Izzet", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cachet d\'Izzet est régulièrement modifié pour ressembler de plus en plus à un portrait miniature de Niv-Mizzet.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bff592cc-f7c4-404a-a825-9dc6ef857adf\', \'multiverseId\': 451906}, \'multiverseid\': 451906}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il sigillo Izzet viene ridisegnato spesso, ogni volta più simile a un vanesio ritratto di Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209bfef5-c8d3-440d-990c-0e02c0701ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 452154}, \'multiverseid\': 452154}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの印鑑はしばしばデザインし直され、そのたびにニヴ＝ミゼットの虚栄に満ちた肖像に近づいていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29941a9c-4f7e-42d3-83a3-32e3050e6587\', \'multiverseId\': 452402}, \'multiverseid\': 452402}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O Sinete Izzet é freqüentemente reformulado, cada vez assemelhando-se mais a um prepotente retrato de Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76cdff20-41ec-4650-a66f-e6548feb6c25\', \'multiverseId\': 452650}, \'multiverseid\': 452650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Bonus {3}{G} (Du kannst zusätzlich {3}{G} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Wald-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\nFalls die Bonuskosten für diesen Zauberspruch bezahlt wurden, enttappe alle Wälder, die auf diese Weise ins Spiel gebracht wurden. Sie werden zu 3/3 grünen Kreaturen mit Eile, die immer noch Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451355&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c1c65f-8ca4-4f12-961c-b8ee92ee5087\', \'multiverseId\': 451355}, \'multiverseid\': 451355}, {\'name\': \'Terreno de caza\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {3}{G}. (Puedes pagar {3}{G} adicional al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de Bosque, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nSi este hechizo fue estimulado, endereza todos los Bosques puestos en el campo de batalla de esta manera. Se convierten en criaturas verdes 3/3 con la habilidad de prisa que siguen siendo tierras.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7319b029-aad1-4678-a3ab-de930207eeb1\', \'multiverseId\': 451603}, \'multiverseid\': 451603}, {\'name\': \'Étendues de chasse\', \'text\': "Kick {3}{G} (Vous pouvez payer {3}{G} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de forêt, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nSi ce sort a été kické, dégagez toutes les forêts mises sur le champ de bataille de cette manière. Elles deviennent des créatures 3/3 vertes avec la célérité qui sont toujours des terrains.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b53bcf-8c45-4b6b-aea1-333a5f815eba\', \'multiverseId\': 451851}, \'multiverseid\': 451851}, {\'name\': \'Terreni di Caccia\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {3}{G} (Puoi pagare {3}{G} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte Foresta, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nSe questa magia è stata potenziata, STAPpa tutte le Foreste messe sul campo di battaglia in questo modo. Diventano creature 3/3 verdi con rapidità che sono ancora terre.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b305c3dc-d732-4e57-93dd-612ca944b30c\', \'multiverseId\': 452099}, \'multiverseid\': 452099}, {\'name\': \'未開の狩り\', \'text\': \'キッカー{3}{G}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{3}{G}を支払ってもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから森・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nこの呪文がキッカーされていたなら、これにより戦場に出た森をすべてアンタップする。それらは速攻を持つ緑の３/３のクリーチャーになる。それらは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16244ad-b122-445f-a439-7831c515c721\', \'multiverseId\': 452347}, \'multiverseid\': 452347}, {\'name\': \'Regiões de Caça\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {3}{G} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {3}{G} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nProcure até dois cards de Floresta em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\\nSe esta mágica tiver sido reforçada, desvire todas as Florestas colocadas no campo de batalha desta maneira. Elas se tornam criaturas verdes 3/3 com ímpeto que ainda são terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c013949c-fb51-4614-9a26-a3b516c9c1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 452595}, \'multiverseid\': 452595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jeskai-Infiltratorin\', \'text\': \'Die Jeskai-Infiltratorin kann nicht geblockt werden, solange du keine anderen Kreaturen kontrollierst.\\nWenn die Jeskai-Infiltratorin einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke sie zusammen mit der obersten Karte deiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil, mische diese beiden Karten und manifestiere sie dann. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa2f35a-be60-400c-9f1b-8ae5f05c1f81\', \'multiverseId\': 451296}, \'multiverseid\': 451296}, {\'name\': \'Espía jeskai\', \'text\': \'La Espía jeskai no puede ser bloqueada mientras no controles ninguna otra criatura.\\nCuando la Espía jeskai haga daño de combate a un jugador, exíliala junto con la primera carta de tu biblioteca en una pila boca abajo, baraja esa pila y luego manifiesta esas cartas. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c985ce6-41f4-45b7-8e6b-a7c14154b82b\', \'multiverseId\': 451544}, \'multiverseid\': 451544}, {\'name\': \'Infiltratrice jeskaï\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltratrice jeskaï ne peut pas être bloquée tant que vous ne contrôlez pas d\'autre créature.\\nQuand l\'Infiltratrice jeskaï inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez-la ainsi que la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un tas face cachée, mélangez-le, puis manifestez ces cartes. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b89374-eab2-455d-bd08-9c079f08e6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 451792}, \'multiverseid\': 451792}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrata Jeskai\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrata Jeskai non può essere bloccata fintanto che non controlli altre creature.\\nQuando l\'Infiltrata Jeskai infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esiliala con la prima carta del tuo grimorio in una pila a faccia in giù, rimescola quella pila, poi manifesta quelle carte. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f4b2a46-ceb6-4c15-8398-f9527e711432\', \'multiverseId\': 452040}, \'multiverseid\': 452040}, {\'name\': \'ジェスカイの浸透者\', \'text\': \'あなたが他のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、ジェスカイの浸透者はブロックされない。\\nジェスカイの浸透者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これとあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを裏向きの束にして追放し、その束を切り直し、その後それらのカードを予示する。（カードを予示するとは、「それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。」ということである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d001c2-5d24-4718-ab25-d90f68158b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 452288}, \'multiverseid\': 452288}, {\'name\': \'Infiltradora Jeskai\', \'text\': \'Infiltradora Jeskai não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto você não controlar outras criaturas.\\nQuando Infiltradora Jeskai causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile-a junto com o card do topo de seu grimório em um monte voltado para baixo, embaralhe o monte e manifeste os dois cards. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d83cc6-fa1a-493a-9e5a-2a69397436c9\', \'multiverseId\': 452536}, \'multiverseid\': 452536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jwar-Insel-Refugium\', \'text\': \'Das Jwar-Insel-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Jwar-Insel-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86dccce1-fc49-4ff4-8eef-95cabc139c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 451463}, \'multiverseid\': 451463}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de la Isla Jwar\', \'text\': \'El Refugio de la Isla Jwar entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de la Isla Jwar entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed93f4c8-d0c6-4d47-8e69-e33fb2f15cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 451711}, \'multiverseid\': 451711}, {\'name\': "Refuge de l\'île de Jwar", \'text\': "Le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1424230-ae45-45d3-ae1f-4275a4f49be8\', \'multiverseId\': 451959}, \'multiverseid\': 451959}, {\'name\': "Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar", \'text\': "Il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ac8e401-3829-4e8f-b357-7808e54d61ef\', \'multiverseId\': 452207}, \'multiverseid\': 452207}, {\'name\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家\', \'text\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジュワー島の隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54540b2-e78c-410f-9087-5b5b98ec7f82\', \'multiverseId\': 452455}, \'multiverseid\': 452455}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar\', \'text\': \'Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70df8e17-cbdc-4c87-800c-87d83f3f6349\', \'multiverseId\': 452703}, \'multiverseid\': 452703}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaltäugiger Selkie\', \'text\': \'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nImmer wenn der Kaltäugige Selkie einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Er wandert die alten Nebenflüsse hinauf, die angelegt worden waren, als sich die Merrow noch um die Gezeiten kümmerten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9db45dfb-f14f-46c2-88db-0adcb87bd4a0\', \'multiverseId\': 451375}, \'multiverseid\': 451375}, {\'name\': \'Selkie de ojos fríos\', \'text\': \'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nSiempre que la Selkie de ojos fríos haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Ella sigue las viejas tradiciones de cuando los merrow todavía daban forma a las mareas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd56d7bb-b276-4c88-a68c-29c8b2786a19\', \'multiverseId\': 451623}, \'multiverseid\': 451623}, {\'name\': \'Selkie aux yeux glacés\', \'text\': \'Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Selkie aux yeux glacés inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher autant de cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Elle utilise les anciens chenaux construits quand les suires façonnaient encore les marées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d0783b-7830-483f-82cb-98038421c0fc\', \'multiverseId\': 451871}, \'multiverseid\': 451871}, {\'name\': \'Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio\', \'text\': "Passa-Isole (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla un\'Isola.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare altrettante carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Segue i vecchi affluenti creati quando i merrow ancora modellavano le maree.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948f102e-d89a-4354-bb1f-0c1f08926de7\', \'multiverseId\': 452119}, \'multiverseid\': 452119}, {\'name\': \'冷淡なセルキー\', \'text\': \'島渡り（このクリーチャーは防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎりブロックされない。）\\n冷淡なセルキーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'メロウがまだ潮汐を形作っていた頃、彼女は古き支流に従っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b0a599-d1c3-4e24-ab52-9ae795eff7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 452367}, \'multiverseid\': 452367}, {\'name\': \'Selkie Olhos-frios\', \'text\': \'Travessia de ilha (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Ilha.)\\nToda vez que Selkie Olhos-frios causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Ela segue os antigos afluentes construídos quando os sirenídeos ainda moldavam as marés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'301fa13e-efd5-4dce-b188-02117a5acbf2\', \'multiverseId\': 452615}, \'multiverseid\': 452615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karnerhort-Wurm\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Karnerhort-Wurm einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Die Drachen auf Jund horten nur Sangritkristalle. Die niederen Würmer sind nicht so wählerisch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cb0ef5-ba23-4483-b58a-952f814d0c5d\', \'multiverseId\': 451374}, \'multiverseid\': 451374}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe atesorahuesos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que la Sierpe atesorahuesos haga daño a un oponente, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Los dragones de Jund acumulan solo cristales de sangrita. Sus sierpes no son tan selectivas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ee2caa9-789b-4cf7-adcb-87c4795080b3\', \'multiverseId\': 451622}, \'multiverseid\': 451622}, {\'name\': \'Guivre du charnier\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que la Guivre du charnier inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous pouvez renvoyer la carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "Sur Jund, les dragons n\'accumulent que les cristaux de sangrite. Les guivres, par contre, ne sont pas aussi difficiles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba5044f-9196-4623-97a0-f309535ebc5b\', \'multiverseId\': 451870}, \'multiverseid\': 451870}, {\'name\': "Wurm della Tana d\'Osso", \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Wurm della Tana d\'Osso infligge danno a un avversario, puoi riprendere in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'I draghi di Jund raccolgono unicamente cristalli di sangrite. Ma i suoi wurm non sono così esigenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dee8de7-7427-4515-979a-a96bfa2efab1\', \'multiverseId\': 452118}, \'multiverseid\': 452118}, {\'name\': \'納骨蔵のワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n納骨蔵のワームが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドのドラゴンは、サングライト水晶しか集めない。ワームは、そこまで選り好みはしない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4a0e86-f6f9-441a-a111-c25f13ae0adc\', \'multiverseId\': 452366}, \'multiverseid\': 452366}, {\'name\': \'Vorme do Ossuário\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Vorme do Ossuário causar dano a um oponente, você pode devolver o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Os dragões de Jund acumulam apenas cristais de sangrite. Já os vormes não são tão exigentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af4ff4bc-3d23-49f6-99d3-e8e500d98b67\', \'multiverseId\': 452614}, \'multiverseid\': 452614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kasteiung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Viele jener, die Sorin über den Weg laufen, erleiden das gleiche, so plötzliche wie fatale Einem-Jahrtausende-alten-Vampir-im-Weg-sein-Schicksal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf8997eb-eaa7-410e-a065-5c57007088c9\', \'multiverseId\': 451389}, \'multiverseid\': 451389}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Muchos de los que se cruzan en el camino de Sorin mueren repentinamente debido a un caso mortal de "intromisión-en-los-asuntos-de-un-vampiro-de-un-milenio-de-edad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc87020-d1fd-437b-af9c-ea853045be1d\', \'multiverseId\': 451637}, \'multiverseid\': 451637}, {\'name\': \'Mortification\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Beaucoup de ceux qui croisent le chemin de Sorin succombent à un cas soudain de « mieux vaut éviter d\'agacer un vampire millénaire ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff5cef45-1a2a-43e7-9fa1-57bb3e6e9634\', \'multiverseId\': 451885}, \'multiverseid\': 451885}, {\'name\': \'Mortificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Molti di coloro che incrociano il cammino di Sorin soffrono di una condizione improvvisa e fatale: quella di trovarsi-tra-i-piedi-di-un-vampiro-millenario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0487078-6578-48e4-ab49-85ce249475af\', \'multiverseId\': 452133}, \'multiverseid\': 452133}, {\'name\': \'屈辱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ソリンの邪魔をする者の多くは、「何千年も生きた吸血鬼にとって邪魔」という突発的かつ致命的な症例に見舞われる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9b14036-7b19-408b-a3e4-46b3a15dc830\', \'multiverseId\': 452381}, \'multiverseid\': 452381}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Muitos dos que cruzam o caminho de Sorin acabam sofrendo de um mal fatal conhecido como "estar no caminho de um vampiro de mil anos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8620fa-32bd-4261-8f66-e197037c95b3\', \'multiverseId\': 452629}, \'multiverseid\': 452629}]', "[{'name': 'Kazandu-Refugium', 'text': 'Das Kazandu-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Kazandu-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451464&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '294e920c-506d-4771-ada6-056fd65bc14a', 'multiverseId': 451464}, 'multiverseid': 451464}, {'name': 'Refugio de Kazandu', 'text': 'El Refugio de Kazandu entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Kazandu entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451712&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c49ecf09-d6f4-4669-a189-d370ea878c10', 'multiverseId': 451712}, 'multiverseid': 451712}, {'name': 'Refuge du Kazandou', 'text': 'Le Refuge du Kazandou arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge du Kazandou arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451960&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd9f52fb-39fe-4632-9840-d4a4bed4278e', 'multiverseId': 451960}, 'multiverseid': 451960}, {'name': 'Rifugio di Kazandu', 'text': 'Il Rifugio di Kazandu entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Kazandu entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452208&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd413f96-1277-4a89-8811-0ecd4a29457b', 'multiverseId': 452208}, 'multiverseid': 452208}, {'name': 'カザンドゥの隠れ家', 'text': 'カザンドゥの隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nカザンドゥの隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452456&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e30b749-d279-4c88-9e58-07b53ccdbfac', 'multiverseId': 452456}, 'multiverseid': 452456}, {'name': 'Refúgio de Kazandu', 'text': 'Refúgio de Kazandu entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio de Kazandu entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452704&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '079f539c-a54e-4fa9-a762-078cc27632c5', 'multiverseId': 452704}, 'multiverseid': 452704}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kestia die Nährerin\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {3}{G}{W}{U} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+4.\\nImmer wenn eine verzauberte Kreatur oder Verzauberungskreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450702&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09aff753-8c2c-4b66-937c-0c1846615481\', \'multiverseId\': 450702}, \'multiverseid\': 450702}, {\'name\': \'Kestia, la Cultivadora\', \'text\': \'Concesión {3}{G}{W}{U}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de Aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+4.\\nSiempre que una criatura encantada o una criatura encantamiento que controlas ataque, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e831957-e132-4ea5-a0a9-3bf03890945c\', \'multiverseId\': 450761}, \'multiverseid\': 450761}, {\'name\': \'Kestia, la cultivatrice\', \'text\': "Grâce {3}{G}{W}{U} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+4.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature enchantée ou une créature-enchantement que vous contrôlez attaque, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : nymphe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c533327d-4825-4268-acdb-985f67fda932\', \'multiverseId\': 450820}, \'multiverseid\': 450820}, {\'name\': \'Kestia, la Coltivatrice\', \'text\': \'Conferire {3}{G}{W}{U} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+4.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura incantata o una creatura incantesimo che controlli attaccano, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49e3982-da76-4995-8ef6-0972b7792aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 450879}, \'multiverseid\': 450879}, {\'name\': \'耕作者、ケスティア\', \'text\': \'授与{3}{G}{W}{U}（このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ・呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて、エンチャントされているかエンチャントであるクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4092d034-ab52-4ef5-993f-99b98b20568f\', \'multiverseId\': 450938}, \'multiverseid\': 450938}, {\'name\': \'Quéstia, a Cultivatora\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {3}{G}{W}{U} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada recebe +4/+4.\\nToda vez que uma criatura encantada ou uma criatura encantamento que você controla atacar, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5d9901-bff0-4a0c-80b6-5d298574ac10\', \'multiverseId\': 450997}, \'multiverseid\': 450997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kettenreaktion\', \'text\': \'Die Kettenreaktion fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir bereiten uns auch auf das Unwahrscheinliche vor, falls mal der Blitz an einem Ort doppelt oder überall gleichzeitig einschlägt."\\n—Nundari, Hauptmann der Miliz von Seetor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a66eee9-1152-44f2-9291-e5d20a4629f8\', \'multiverseId\': 451324}, \'multiverseid\': 451324}, {\'name\': \'Reacción en cadena\', \'text\': \'La Reacción en cadena hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Entrenamos para lo improbable, como un relámpago cayendo dos veces en el mismo lugar, o cayendo en todos lados al mismo tiempo".\\n—Nundari, capitán de la milicia de Portal Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a94f09-be63-4bbe-ac06-950a7426f2eb\', \'multiverseId\': 451572}, \'multiverseid\': 451572}, {\'name\': \'Réaction en chaîne\', \'text\': \'La Réaction en chaîne inflige X blessures à chaque créature, X étant le nombre de créatures sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous entraînons à confronter l\'improbable, comme la foudre frappant deux fois au même endroit, ou partout à la fois. »\\n—Nundari, capitaine de la milice de Porte des Mers", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f619aa89-4267-47fc-95a3-96e738bf2623\', \'multiverseId\': 451820}, \'multiverseid\': 451820}, {\'name\': \'Reazione a Catena\', \'text\': \'La Reazione a Catena infligge X danni a ogni creatura, dove X è il numero di creature sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci addestriamo per affrontare l\\\'improbabile, come un fulmine che colpisca lo stesso luogo due volte od ogni luogo contemporaneamente."\\n—Nundari, capitano di milizia di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ad205c-d2c4-4063-8f51-0806ad8c7897\', \'multiverseId\': 452068}, \'multiverseid\': 452068}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反応\', \'text\': \'連鎖反応は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは戦場にあるクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はありえなさそうなことに対して訓練をしています。雷が同じ場所に二度落ちるとか、そこらじゅうに同時に落ちるとか。」\\n――海門の民兵隊長、ナンダーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d0d36c-25c3-4055-ace0-00ef9b695dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 452316}, \'multiverseid\': 452316}, {\'name\': \'Reação em Cadeia\', \'text\': \'Reação em Cadeia causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura, sendo X o número de criaturas no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós treinamos para o improvável, como um raio atingir o mesmo lugar duas vezes ou atingir todos os lugares de uma vez só."\\n— Nundari, capitão da milícia do Portão Marinho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d69b972-f079-4fc4-91b4-e20fff85c3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 452564}, \'multiverseid\': 452564}]', "[{'name': 'Khalni-Garten', 'text': 'Der Khalni-Garten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Khalni-Garten ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/1 grünen Pflanze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451465&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '924f7b95-c757-4e9a-9f00-d78ed9ea03fc', 'multiverseId': 451465}, 'multiverseid': 451465}, {'name': 'Jardines de Khalni', 'text': 'Los Jardines de Khalni entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Jardines de Khalni entren al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Planta verde 0/1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451713&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27c77de6-b5cb-40ef-ab87-835bbad192af', 'multiverseId': 451713}, 'multiverseid': 451713}, {'name': 'Jardin de Khalni', 'text': 'Le Jardin de Khalni arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Jardin de Khalni arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/1 verte Plante.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451961&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fb95c5e-db77-4197-8110-7e65668bdf23', 'multiverseId': 451961}, 'multiverseid': 451961}, {'name': 'Giardino di Khalni', 'text': 'Il Giardino di Khalni entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Giardino di Khalni entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Pianta 0/1 verde.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452209&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da84457f-2068-479a-ba2c-87b2b67c49b6', 'multiverseId': 452209}, 'multiverseid': 452209}, {'name': 'カルニの庭', 'text': 'カルニの庭はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nカルニの庭が戦場に出たとき、緑の０/１の植物・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452457&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd81d8156-1f2b-4062-808f-f32c5b2e9a61', 'multiverseId': 452457}, 'multiverseid': 452457}, {'name': 'Jardim de Khalni', 'text': 'Jardim de Khalni entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Jardim de Khalni entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 0/1 do tipo Planta.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452705&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e8c45f4-8e28-402a-86f0-4d57f694aaff', 'multiverseId': 452705}, 'multiverseid': 452705}]", '[{\'name\': \'Koloss der Nylea\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Koloss der Nylea oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verdopple Stärke und Widerstandskraft einer Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer meinen Schutz begehrt, soll ihn erhalten."\\n—Nylea, Göttin der Jagd\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e99ed2-36c3-464b-8b89-fff87293df6b\', \'multiverseId\': 450693}, \'multiverseid\': 450693}, {\'name\': \'Coloso de Nylea\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Coloso de Nylea u otro encantamiento entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, duplica la fuerza y resistencia de la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Doy mi protección a aquellos que la buscan".\\n—Nylea, diosa de la caza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba8c9af9-14ca-46c5-97bf-46b268017a94\', \'multiverseId\': 450752}, \'multiverseid\': 450752}, {\'name\': \'Colosse de Nyléa\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que le Colosse de Nyléa ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, doublez la force et l\'endurance de la créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : géant\', \'flavor\': \'« Ceux qui sollicitent ma protection la recevront. »\\n—Nyléa, déesse de la Chasse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5266c05e-b391-4c57-9d78-347f160f0b15\', \'multiverseId\': 450811}, \'multiverseid\': 450811}, {\'name\': \'Colosso di Nylea\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Colosso di Nylea o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, raddoppia la forza e la costituzione di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Coloro che cercano la mia protezione la ricevono."\\n—Nylea, dea della caccia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b14bc8a-e300-4daa-9198-1ae9f4dd708c\', \'multiverseId\': 450870}, \'multiverseid\': 450870}, {\'name\': \'ナイレアの巨人\', \'text\': \'星座 ― ナイレアの巨人か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのパワーとタフネスを２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「私の保護を求めるものはそれを得るであろう。」\\n――狩猟の神、ナイレア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c2b114-71e4-4952-9cab-fcd24f58c7a8\', \'multiverseId\': 450929}, \'multiverseid\': 450929}, {\'name\': \'Colosso de Nilea\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Colosso de Nilea ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, duplique o poder e a resistência da criatura alvo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Os que buscam minha proteção a recebem."\\n— Nilea, deusa da caça\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4123bddc-ab7a-4a3e-a259-37251eb6dfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 450988}, \'multiverseid\': 450988}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelnde Verschrottungsmaschine\', \'text\': \'Die Krabbelnde Verschrottungsmaschine kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nWenn die Krabbelnde Verschrottungsmaschine stirbt, fügt sie einem Gegner oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Meisterwerk der Tücke, durch Wahnsinn inspiriert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d77635a-f8b9-4702-838e-d91d6a205030\', \'multiverseId\': 451422}, \'multiverseid\': 451422}, {\'name\': \'Máquina de matar rastrera\', \'text\': \'La Máquina de matar rastrera no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nCuando la Máquina de matar rastrera muera, hace 6 puntos de daño al oponente o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Una obra maestra del desprecio inspirada por la demencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bdc7f9c-355b-4d16-9df2-8e69bc12d5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 451670}, \'multiverseid\': 451670}, {\'name\': \'Machine de mort galopante\', \'text\': \'La Machine de mort galopante ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nQuand la Machine de mort galopante meurt, elle inflige 6 blessures à une cible, adversaire ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Un chef-d\'œuvre de malveillance inspiré par la démence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09d7ee0-1380-4c3a-b250-a75338fdeca8\', \'multiverseId\': 451918}, \'multiverseid\': 451918}, {\'name\': \'Macchina Devastatrice Sferragliante\', \'text\': \'La Macchina Devastatrice Sferragliante non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nQuando la Macchina Devastatrice Sferragliante muore, infligge 6 danni a un avversario o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Un capolavoro di odio, ispirato dalla follia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83126534-6d9d-4cbf-807c-3e83818a4fea\', \'multiverseId\': 452166}, \'multiverseid\': 452166}, {\'name\': \'小走り破滅エンジン\', \'text\': \'小走り破滅エンジンは、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n小走り破滅エンジンが死亡したとき、対戦相手１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれに６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'狂気の発想、悪意の傑作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df5be9d-2b1b-41c3-8982-0501cc7cf99d\', \'multiverseId\': 452414}, \'multiverseid\': 452414}, {\'name\': \'Máquina da Destruição Ambulante\', \'text\': \'Máquina da Destruição Ambulante não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas de poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nQuando morre, Máquina da Destruição Ambulante causa 6 pontos de dano ao oponente ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Uma obra-prima do ódio, inspirada pela loucura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd918b37-b4b2-4aee-bd93-68584efc089a\', \'multiverseId\': 452662}, \'multiverseid\': 452662}]', "[{'name': 'Kriechende Wiedergeburt', 'text': 'Bestimme einen Typ bleibender Karten. Bringe alle Karten des bestimmten Typs aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nRückblende {5}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451340&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0463933-b2c2-4dc6-87f3-3a7678bf014c', 'multiverseId': 451340}, 'multiverseid': 451340}, {'name': 'Renacimiento reptante', 'text': 'Elige un tipo de permanente. Regresa todas las cartas del tipo elegido de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{G}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451588&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c294bb45-891b-4201-8b6b-86d76eb7cec6', 'multiverseId': 451588}, 'multiverseid': 451588}, {'name': 'Renaissance rampante', 'text': 'Choisissez un type de permanent. Renvoyez toutes les cartes du type choisi depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nFlashback {5}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-le ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451836&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69475f1f-6b35-4db1-84a5-c47ea06eca41', 'multiverseId': 451836}, 'multiverseid': 451836}, {'name': 'Rinascita Strisciante', 'text': 'Scegli un tipo di permanente. Riprendi in mano tutte le carte del tipo scelto dal tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {5}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452084&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1500fe30-e01e-4f92-aea3-9f273f45478f', 'multiverseId': 452084}, 'multiverseid': 452084}, {'name': '迫り来る復興', 'text': 'パーマネント・タイプ１つを選ぶ。あなたの墓地からその選ばれたタイプのカードをすべてあなたの手札に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地からこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452332&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd649686-c106-46c5-8fac-18a27c95945d', 'multiverseId': 452332}, 'multiverseid': 452332}, {'name': 'Renascimento Rastejante', 'text': 'Escolha um tipo de permanente. Devolva todos os cards do tipo escolhido de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nRecapitular {5}{G}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452580&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b9663ec-7844-4085-8136-fb5c859fcc27', 'multiverseId': 452580}, 'multiverseid': 452580}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kriegscoup\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls X 5 oder mehr beträgt, zerstöre alle anderen Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Nationen von Bant legten ihren Krieg bei und vereinigten sich gegen die gemeinsame Bedrohung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1149929a-7356-47e0-acaf-6d3fd0e85f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 451272}, \'multiverseid\': 451272}, {\'name\': \'Golpe marcial\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1. Si X es 5 o más, destruye todas las otras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Olvidando sus guerras, las naciones de Bant se unieron para enfrentar una amenaza común.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979ef146-dae5-43f8-8f15-a6e8d1273fac\', \'multiverseId\': 451520}, \'multiverseid\': 451520}, {\'name\': "Coup d\'état militaire", \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, détruisez toutes les autres créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Oubliant leur guerre, les nations de Bant s\'unirent face à une menace commune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8069e5-8667-4411-88ca-721f86e5a13e\', \'multiverseId\': 451768}, \'multiverseid\': 451768}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Militare\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, distruggi tutte le altre creature.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dimenticata la guerra in atto, i popoli di Bant si schierarono fianco a fianco per contrastare la minaccia comune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f85dc6-6941-4696-8b93-fd19e7edf41d\', \'multiverseId\': 452016}, \'multiverseid\': 452016}, {\'name\': \'軍部政変\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘが５以上であるなら、他のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'バントの国々は自らの戦争を忘れ、共に面した敵に対して一体となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499ed9da-8ad2-4609-bcb4-deb6c581aa05\', \'multiverseId\': 452264}, \'multiverseid\': 452264}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Marcial\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, destrua todas as outras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Esquecendo-se de sua guerra, as nações de Bant uniram-se para enfrentar uma ameaça comum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4183109-9cb4-4616-9994-e399b1e8e571\', \'multiverseId\': 452512}, \'multiverseid\': 452512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kristallkugel\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Hellsicht 2. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 2 die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie glitzert mit arkanem Wissen für diejenigen, die wissen, wie man es erhascht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0d31a2-994c-41f6-8a5a-4e2111bb06c0\', \'multiverseId\': 451404}, \'multiverseid\': 451404}, {\'name\': \'Bola de cristal\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adivina 2. (Para adivinar 2, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Brilla con verdades arcanas para aquellos que saben cómo vislumbrarlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a2a7ab-dfa9-43ac-aef2-adccfa140e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 451652}, \'multiverseid\': 451652}, {\'name\': \'Boule de cristal\', \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Regard 2. (Pour appliquer regard 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Elle brille de mille vérités arcanes pour ceux qui savent les déchiffrer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b054c0-9a59-4e17-a227-9596b35c3583\', \'multiverseId\': 451900}, \'multiverseid\': 451900}, {\'name\': \'Palla di Cristallo\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Profetizza 2. (Per profetizzare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Brilla di verità arcane per quelli che sanno come intravederle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ad4e7f-618d-4c28-b40b-f14333de47b8\', \'multiverseId\': 452148}, \'multiverseid\': 452148}, {\'name\': \'水晶球\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：占術２を行う。（占術２を行うとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚見て、そのうちの望む枚数を望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'然りと受け止める者に、それは秘儀の光を映す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2dde681-8739-4fce-b9f5-486251944985\', \'multiverseId\': 452396}, \'multiverseid\': 452396}, {\'name\': \'Bola de Cristal\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Vidência 2. (Para usar vidência 2, olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o resto no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela reluz verdades arcanas aos que sabem como vislumbrá-las.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0613cbb2-ac3c-4384-ba40-3964a197f7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 452644}, \'multiverseid\': 452644}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5594c1ff-9af3-450a-93e5-6a48a74aaac3\', \'multiverseId\': 451466}, \'multiverseid\': 451466}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y una carta de Llanura, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd4f002d-ca55-47ff-9769-aaeee8867508\', \'multiverseId\': 451714}, \'multiverseid\': 451714}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451962&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94cb8ef-261f-4b60-8133-497c2ed74abd\', \'multiverseId\': 451962}, \'multiverseid\': 451962}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f281d3-7622-4718-8aae-9606802a61e8\', \'multiverseId\': 452210}, \'multiverseid\': 452210}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ebab9db-bdd5-470e-b67d-0989ca5f1742\', \'multiverseId\': 452458}, \'multiverseid\': 452458}, {\'name\': \'Orla Krosana\', \'text\': \'Orla Krosana entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Orla Krosana: Procure um card de Floresta e um de Planície em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492a9d96-7de9-48e6-b83c-4cc1ed673043\', \'multiverseId\': 452706}, \'multiverseid\': 452706}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel und nimm die andere auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4979c1-955d-41b5-9444-0b74c2de18f8\', \'multiverseId\': 451341}, \'multiverseid\': 451341}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04bb661e-0cc2-40ea-9ab2-ce736102588c\', \'multiverseId\': 451589}, \'multiverseid\': 451589}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes et mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée, et l\'autre dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127e8b3f-f10f-4df0-8879-85493b1f7e03\', \'multiverseId\': 451837}, \'multiverseid\': 451837}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4bb77d-b62a-480e-aa58-4e6f78a6a693\', \'multiverseId\': 452085}, \'multiverseid\': 452085}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらのカードを公開し、１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245bf8c3-8e5d-4aef-ab06-8bd6bf23b438\', \'multiverseId\': 452333}, \'multiverseid\': 452333}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as sementes possuem um elo em comum que as une através da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d623445-8964-471f-9cca-06d56ebbcf3d\', \'multiverseId\': 452581}, \'multiverseid\': 452581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laterne des Sehers\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Licht, das in düsteren Zeiten Hoffnung weckt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23da06fc-71ff-4d5b-ad2a-1e4dd509446d\', \'multiverseId\': 451423}, \'multiverseid\': 451423}, {\'name\': \'Farol del vidente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Una luz de esperanza en tiempos oscuros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f40d5f27-74af-4039-9a6a-972ede664136\', \'multiverseId\': 451671}, \'multiverseid\': 451671}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne du voyant\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Une lumière pour faire naître l\'espoir dans les ténèbres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1846fe9d-b33c-486d-9ece-2fb40364947c\', \'multiverseId\': 451919}, \'multiverseid\': 451919}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna del Veggente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Una luce per portare speranza in tempi di oscurità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00de32bb-3143-4c78-8b1e-07f176f34add\', \'multiverseId\': 452167}, \'multiverseid\': 452167}, {\'name\': \'予見者のランタン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'暗黒の世に希望を灯す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae1b1ed6-e53c-4a69-ae6e-efeb9b79f463\', \'multiverseId\': 452415}, \'multiverseid\': 452415}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna do Vidente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma luz para trazer esperança em tempos sombrios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6a17903-292c-4a9e-b080-7ab3bdb45259\', \'multiverseId\': 452663}, \'multiverseid\': 452663}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavalawine\', \'text\': \'Die Lavalawine fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl und jeder Kreatur, die der Spieler bzw. der Beherrscher des Planeswalkers kontrolliert, X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das brennende Blut Alaras kann von bloßem Stein und Erde nicht aufgehalten werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b4b7af-e6c8-42bc-80f6-c96c01c8e6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 451387}, \'multiverseid\': 451387}, {\'name\': \'Lavalancha\', \'text\': \'La Lavalancha hace X puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo y a cada criatura que controla ese jugador o que controla el controlador de ese planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La sangre hirviente de Alara no puede ser contenida simplemente con tierra y piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aacf7ed-7a1e-411d-b031-ad75d88d2418\', \'multiverseId\': 451635}, \'multiverseid\': 451635}, {\'name\': \'Lavalanche\', \'text\': \'La Lavalanche inflige X blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker, et à chaque créature que ce joueur ou que le contrôleur de ce planeswalker contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le sang bouillonnant d\'Alara ne peut être retenu ni par la terre ni par la pierre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d22ece-29fc-4aa0-82d0-cefa36970448\', \'multiverseId\': 451883}, \'multiverseid\': 451883}, {\'name\': \'Lavalanga\', \'text\': \'La Lavalanga infligge X danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio e a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore o dal controllore di quel planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il sangue ardente di Alara non può essere contenuto da un semplice ammasso di sassi e terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa27e870-2baa-4cc9-ae2d-77e0b385d43a\', \'multiverseId\': 452131}, \'multiverseid\': 452131}, {\'name\': \'溶岩崩れ\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。溶岩崩れは、そのプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーと、そのプレイヤーかそのプレインズウォーカーのコントローラーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーに、それぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'アラーラの燃える血には、単なる土や石など含まれはしない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fbf972-ff3a-4e4a-961a-73a16aafee5a\', \'multiverseId\': 452379}, \'multiverseid\': 452379}, {\'name\': \'Lavalanche\', \'text\': \'Lavalanche causa X pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo e a cada criatura que aquele jogador controle ou que o controlador daquele planeswalker controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O sangue em chamas de Alara não pode ser contido somente com terra e pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37eae1db-6a91-48e6-abd1-9ef172df9a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 452627}, \'multiverseid\': 452627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lichtform\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lichtform ins Spiel kommt, wird sie zu einer Aura und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek und lege die Lichtform daran an. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451271&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfafa34-b335-480e-89dc-6bdde560e24a\', \'multiverseId\': 451271}, \'multiverseid\': 451271}, {\'name\': \'Forma de luz\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Forma de luz entre al campo de batalla, se convierte en un Aura con encantar criatura. Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca y anexa la Forma de luz a ella. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\\nLa criatura encantada tiene las habilidades de volar y vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7deb9c2-38ed-4ab4-af62-5e6b45a4afa1\', \'multiverseId\': 451519}, \'multiverseid\': 451519}, {\'name\': \'Forme lumineuse\', \'text\': "Quand la Forme lumineuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle devient une aura avec enchanter : créature. Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et attachez-lui la Forme lumineuse. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée a le vol et le lien de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f02c87-b0ab-41e5-9b8c-4db348ad9d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 451767}, \'multiverseid\': 451767}, {\'name\': \'Forma di Luce\', \'text\': "Quando la Forma di Luce entra nel campo di battaglia, diventa un\'Aura con incanta creatura. Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio e assegnale la Forma di Luce. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nLa creatura incantata ha volare e legame vitale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59bf8471-7bc8-4311-bf9c-69a0475e9bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 452015}, \'multiverseid\': 452015}, {\'name\': \'光変化\', \'text\': \'光変化が戦場に出たとき、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラになる。あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示し、それに光変化をつける。（カードを予示するとは、「それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。」ということである。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行と絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a90ab8-0f58-44fb-9775-c696bcf593c5\', \'multiverseId\': 452263}, \'multiverseid\': 452263}, {\'name\': \'Lumiforme\', \'text\': \'Quando Lumiforme entra no campo de batalha, ele se torna uma Aura com encantar criatura. Manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório e anexe Lumiforme a ele. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada tem voar e vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d4200f-257c-4d7c-aa07-dfb3afb7d848\', \'multiverseId\': 452511}, \'multiverseid\': 452511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lord Windgrace\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte. Falls auf diese Weise eine Länderkarte abgeworfen wurde, ziehe eine zusätzliche Karte.\\n−3: Bringe bis zu zwei Länderkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−11: Zerstöre bis zu sechs bleibende Karten deiner Wahl, die keine Länder sind, und erzeuge dann sechs 2/2 grüne Katze-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Waldtarnung.\\nLord Windgrace kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Windgrace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3387d3bb-c826-4eef-ad10-81db52540673\', \'multiverseId\': 450703}, \'multiverseid\': 450703}, {\'name\': \'Lord Windgrace\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarta una carta, luego roba una carta. Si se descarta una carta de tierra de esta manera, roba una carta adicional.\\n−3: Regresa hasta dos cartas de tierra objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−11: Destruye hasta seis permanentes objetivo que no sean tierra. Luego, crea seis fichas de criatura Guerrero Felino verdes 2/2 con la habilidad de cruzar bosques.\\nLord Windgrace puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Windgrace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c93e1f4-50b0-4c26-aaab-0100fbd31603\', \'multiverseId\': 450762}, \'multiverseid\': 450762}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur Vent des vertus\', \'text\': "+2 : Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte. Si une carte de terrain est défaussée de cette manière, piochez une carte supplémentaire.\\n-3 : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain ciblées depuis votre cimetière.\\n-11 : Détruisez jusqu\'à six permanents non-terrain ciblés, puis créez six jetons de créature 2/2 verte Chat et Guerrier avec la traversée des forêts.\\nSeigneur Vent des vertus peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Vent des vertus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82a6c01f-6388-41d2-af1d-9eae3215ff9b\', \'multiverseId\': 450821}, \'multiverseid\': 450821}, {\'name\': \'Lord Windgrace\', \'text\': \'+2: Scarta una carta, poi pesca una carta. Se una carta terra viene scartata in questo modo, pesca una carta addizionale.\\n-3: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a due carte terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n-11: Distruggi fino a sei permanenti non terra bersaglio, poi crea sei pedine creatura Guerriero Felino 2/2 verdi con passa-Foreste.\\nLord Windgrace può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Windgrace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3077a6e5-4e2f-4406-b176-b76aaf271605\', \'multiverseId\': 450880}, \'multiverseid\': 450880}, {\'name\': \'ウィンドグレイス卿\', \'text\': \'+2：カード１枚を捨て、その後カードを１枚引く。これにより土地・カードが捨てられたなら、カードを追加で１枚引く。\\n-3：あなたの墓地から土地・カード最大２枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\\n-11：土地でないパーマネント最大６つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。その後、森渡りを持つ緑の２/２の猫・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを６体生成する。\\nウィンドグレイス卿は統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ウィンドグレイス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f0fe1f-f38c-4412-827d-78b1bef59ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 450939}, \'multiverseid\': 450939}, {\'name\': \'Lorde Windgrace\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarte um card e depois compre um card. Se um card de terreno for descartado dessa forma, compre um card adicional.\\n−3: Devolva até dois cards de terreno alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n−11: Destrua até seis permanentes alvo que não sejam terrenos. Em seguida, crie seis fichas de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Felino Guerreiro com travessia de floresta.\\nLorde Windgrace pode ser seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Windgrace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3abc65e0-2f1b-483b-860a-4d7bdc04e7d0\', \'multiverseId\': 450998}, \'multiverseid\': 450998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Lehrling\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Der Spielstein erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Weise Gelehrte hören auf diejenigen, die über Vorstellungskraft verfügen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccfa4a08-f926-47d7-86c2-c32a75a3afab\', \'multiverseId\': 450683}, \'multiverseid\': 450683}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz leal\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los que poseen el conocimiento harían bien en escuchar a quienes tienen el don de la imaginación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3edb12ae-93c4-429c-822c-257ca733d42b\', \'multiverseId\': 450742}, \'multiverseid\': 450742}, {\'name\': \'Apprentie loyale\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui ont des connaissances ont tout intérêt à écouter ceux qui ont de l\'imagination.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13a922db-de9b-4945-99f4-ab144cf9d6ae\', \'multiverseId\': 450801}, \'multiverseid\': 450801}, {\'name\': \'Apprendista Fedele\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare. Quella pedina ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Chi ha il dono della sapienza è abbastanza saggio da ascoltare chi ha il dono dell\'immaginazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df377f3-aebc-442d-adbc-679f06316ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 450860}, \'multiverseid\': 450860}, {\'name\': \'忠実な弟子\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'知識ある者は賢明にして、創意ある者に耳を傾ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f41ac2-4296-4e2a-9f03-eaedba0c6a03\', \'multiverseId\': 450919}, \'multiverseid\': 450919}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz Leal\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os dotados de inteligência são sábios o bastante para ouvir os dotados de imaginação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc7a060-0956-473d-a5fc-e050ab83b395\', \'multiverseId\': 450978}, \'multiverseid\': 450978}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Brieftauben wird keine Beachtung geschenkt. Wenn ich eine Nachricht sende, muss sie schon Biss haben."\\n—Aeschel, Diplomat des Königs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cb6a91-3f25-4035-af07-06e1180c1758\', \'multiverseId\': 450670}, \'multiverseid\': 450670}, {\'name\': \'Draco leal\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"Las palomas son demasiado sutiles. Yo, cuando envío un mensaje, quiero que tenga garra".\\n—Eschel, diplomático real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8333ffe1-ff6c-493f-8a73-5eea86bf4104\', \'multiverseId\': 450729}, \'multiverseid\': 450729}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn loyal\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "« Les colombes et les pigeons sont trop subtils. Quand j\'envoie un message, je veux qu\'il ait du mordant. »\\n—Aeschel, diplomate royal", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450788&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a411c51-bbe6-4cf6-90be-3f9fbcec1ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 450788}, \'multiverseid\': 450788}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto Fedele\', \'text\': "Volare\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Colombe e piccioni sono troppo timidi. Quando invio un messaggio, preferisco che abbia del mordente."\\n—Aeschel, diplomatico di corte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475b18ef-b381-40fb-b265-4b276d6729bd\', \'multiverseId\': 450847}, \'multiverseid\': 450847}, {\'name\': \'忠実なドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「ハトではおとなし過ぎる。私の伝書には噛み付く獰猛さが必要なのだ。」\\n――勅命外交官、イーシェル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea82218-7d30-441f-8824-275cf11549bf\', \'multiverseId\': 450906}, \'multiverseid\': 450906}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Leal\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'"Pombos são sutis demais. Quando mando uma mensagem, quero que ela seja pungente."\\n— Aeschel, diplomata real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eece223e-2d1d-4efc-b966-36b6c7dd30e8\', \'multiverseId\': 450965}, \'multiverseid\': 450965}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Untergebener\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, verliert jeder Gegner 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Zombies funktionieren am besten, wenn sie satt sind. Es empfiehlt sich also, sie bei der Arbeit fressen zu lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ae3836-ffd4-4c60-acd0-d63862272a31\', \'multiverseId\': 450676}, \'multiverseid\': 450676}, {\'name\': \'Subordinado leal\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, cada oponente pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los zombies son más eficientes cuando se les alimenta adecuadamente, así que no es descabellado permitir que coman mientras trabajan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f92eec-8423-4f07-812e-98e1c16499a0\', \'multiverseId\': 450735}, \'multiverseid\': 450735}, {\'name\': \'Sous-fifre loyal\', \'text\': \'Menace\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, chaque adversaire perd 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Les zombies travaillent mieux l\'estomac plein, mieux vaut donc les laisser manger quand ils sont en mission.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605e7ddf-acc6-4325-89d9-e31e47316d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 450794}, \'multiverseid\': 450794}, {\'name\': \'Subordinato Fedele\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, ogni avversario perde 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Gli zombie sono più produttivi se adeguatamente nutriti, quindi è consigliabile lasciarli mangiare durante il lavoro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e0e74f-8222-415c-92de-5400d6b888fb\', \'multiverseId\': 450853}, \'multiverseid\': 450853}, {\'name\': \'忠実な下僕\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'ゾンビというものは、適切に給餌した方が良く働く。だから仕事中に食べさせるのが賢明だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb6c9f0-6607-411c-bc24-ef31574c6069\', \'multiverseId\': 450912}, \'multiverseid\': 450912}, {\'name\': \'Subordinado Leal\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, cada oponente perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Os zumbis trabalham melhor quando alimentados adequadamente. Assim, é prudente permitir que se alimentem no trabalho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85991b97-1b6d-42e5-b092-c83f16c88234\', \'multiverseId\': 450971}, \'multiverseid\': 450971}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Wächter\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Narbe auf seiner Panzerhaut ist eine Tapferkeitsmedaille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450691&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1504679-eb39-4dd6-aed3-d8dae307c749\', \'multiverseId\': 450691}, \'multiverseid\': 450691}, {\'name\': \'Guardián leal\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Cada cicatriz en su piel es una insignia de honor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81bcce3-b617-4354-b97d-9c9ac73ed9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 450750}, \'multiverseid\': 450750}, {\'name\': \'Vigile loyal\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque cicatrice sur sa peau est un insigne de fierté.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e2696b-24df-4015-a616-258bc2090211\', \'multiverseId\': 450809}, \'multiverseid\': 450809}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano Fedele\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni cicatrice sulla sua pelle è una medaglia al valore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb8058a-ceaa-4dab-ae1e-3c1b8948d0b8\', \'multiverseId\': 450868}, \'multiverseid\': 450868}, {\'name\': \'忠実な守護者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ\', \'flavor\': \'皮に残った傷一つ一つが名誉の勲章である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'503c2d88-cf2d-4236-8197-340ad96a77eb\', \'multiverseId\': 450927}, \'multiverseid\': 450927}, {\'name\': \'Guardião Leal\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Cada cicatriz em seu couro é uma insígnia de honra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d22a77e-cd2d-4fc5-9b99-a106f05ee8e2\', \'multiverseId\': 450986}, \'multiverseid\': 450986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyales Einhorn\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde. Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450664&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c53fbdd-536c-4c00-b255-caf6e0fc0aba\', \'multiverseId\': 450664}, \'multiverseid\': 450664}, {\'name\': \'Unicornio leal\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, prevén todo el daño de combate que fuera a hacerse a las criaturas que controlas este turno. Las otras criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6181659b-fd60-4cca-81b7-c7ffe791fe83\', \'multiverseId\': 450723}, \'multiverseid\': 450723}, {\'name\': \'Licorne loyale\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures que vous contrôlez ce tour-ci. Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be797437-3c53-4478-8329-d19c23e4906a\', \'multiverseId\': 450782}, \'multiverseid\': 450782}, {\'name\': \'Unicorno Fedele\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alle creature che controlli in questo turno. Le altre creature che controlli hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4dc14b7-d60a-45de-b817-637a47726981\', \'multiverseId\': 450841}, \'multiverseid\': 450841}, {\'name\': \'忠実なユニコーン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、このターン、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーに与えられる戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減し、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b008c13-39d1-4162-a519-75ea224e9d75\', \'multiverseId\': 450900}, \'multiverseid\': 450900}, {\'name\': \'Unicórnio Leal\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, previna todo o dano de combate que seria causado a criaturas que você controla neste turno. As outras criaturas que você controla ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicórnio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7100f07c-4249-459a-8a16-389314c4f25e\', \'multiverseId\': 450959}, \'multiverseid\': 450959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmabeben\', \'text\': \'Das Magmabeben fügt jedem Planeswalker und jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wohin willst du fliehen, wenn ich dich mit eben dem Boden bestrafe, auf dem du fliehst?"\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21c62175-3284-4f60-bf9a-976e7c76322f\', \'multiverseId\': 451328}, \'multiverseid\': 451328}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'El Magmamoto hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura que no tenga la habilidad de volar y a cada planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Adónde huirás cuando te castigue con el mismo suelo sobre el que corres?".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d48512-9a19-4dd3-a311-78573b8a4c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 451576}, \'multiverseid\': 451576}, {\'name\': \'Tremblement de lave\', \'text\': \'Le Tremblement de lave inflige X blessures à chaque créature sans le vol et à chaque planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Où fuir, quand je te châtie à l\'aide du sol sur lequel tu prends appui pour courir ? »\\n—Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451824&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2ed7b3-5e5e-4379-9b8f-4853c8cd0a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 451824}, \'multiverseid\': 451824}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'Il Magmamoto infligge X danni a ogni creatura senza volare e a ogni planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dove potrai mai fuggire quando ti punisco con lo stesso terreno su cui stai correndo?"\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'589f9e67-ed28-4311-a1fe-2f878d3e3432\', \'multiverseId\': 452072}, \'multiverseid\': 452072}, {\'name\': \'溶岩震\', \'text\': \'溶岩震は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「貴様が落ち延びた先の大地そのもので罰してやるというのに、どこへ逃げるつもりだ？」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea5e2a0-97e9-44e9-a2a2-abb2dc9525ab\', \'multiverseId\': 452320}, \'multiverseid\': 452320}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'Magmamoto causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar e a cada planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Para onde você correrá quando eu usar o próprio chão onde pisa para puní-lo?"\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ebfa18-e9ba-4800-920e-e1b7db546917\', \'multiverseId\': 452568}, \'multiverseid\': 452568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus der Balance\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}, {T}, opfere den Magus der Balance: Jeder Spieler bestimmt eine Anzahl an Ländern, die er kontrolliert, in Höhe der Anzahl an Ländern, die der Spieler mit den wenigsten Ländern kontrolliert, und opfert dann den Rest. Spieler werfen auf die gleiche Weise Karten ab und opfern Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450665&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ac2e09-1871-48e1-8e53-5d1b64849203\', \'multiverseId\': 450665}, \'multiverseid\': 450665}, {\'name\': \'Mago del equilibrio\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}, {T}, sacrificar al Mago del equilibrio: Cada jugador elige una cantidad de tierras que controla igual a la cantidad de tierras controladas por el jugador que controla menos tierras, luego sacrifica el resto. Los jugadores descartan cartas y sacrifican criaturas de la misma manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8bd3ddb-31dc-4052-97aa-d86028bf979a\', \'multiverseId\': 450724}, \'multiverseid\': 450724}, {\'name\': "Mage de l\'équilibre", \'text\': "{4}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mage de l\'équilibre : Chaque joueur choisit un nombre de terrains qu\'il contrôle égal au nombre de terrains contrôlés par le joueur qui en contrôle le moins, puis sacrifie les autres. Les joueurs se défaussent de cartes et sacrifient des créatures de la même manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b2621c1-df2e-460f-82f5-6955ae53a8fd\', \'multiverseId\': 450783}, \'multiverseid\': 450783}, {\'name\': "Magus dell\'Equilibrio", \'text\': "{4}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica il Magus dell\'Equilibrio: Ogni giocatore sceglie un numero di terre che controlla pari al numero di terre controllate dal giocatore che ne controlla di meno, poi sacrifica quelle rimanenti. I giocatori scartano le carte e sacrificano le creature allo stesso modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f1687d-80aa-479e-a122-7531e52cbe25\', \'multiverseId\': 450842}, \'multiverseid\': 450842}, {\'name\': \'天秤の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}, {T}, 天秤の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしている土地を、いずれかのプレイヤーがコントロールしている土地の総数のうち最も小さい数に等しい数選び、その後残りを生け贄に捧げる。プレイヤーは同様にカードを捨て、同様にクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0125bc37-5083-4bfd-afc4-7624a3c1e388\', \'multiverseId\': 450901}, \'multiverseid\': 450901}, {\'name\': \'Magus do Equilíbrio\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}, {T}, sacrifique Magus do Equilíbrio: Cada jogador escolhe uma quantidade de terrenos que controla\\nequivalente ao número de terrenos controlados pelo jogador que controla menos e, em seguida, sacrifica os restantes. Os jogadores descartam cards e sacrificam criaturas da mesma forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214e1a9f-2e96-416f-a412-a66881bc1ac0\', \'multiverseId\': 450960}, \'multiverseid\': 450960}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4bac204-9e87-4a5b-b865-b30eb7500ce6\', \'multiverseId\': 451472}, \'multiverseid\': 451472}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c5754c1-8532-4b9c-a70d-a71142d270ad\', \'multiverseId\': 451720}, \'multiverseid\': 451720}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451968&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e4ab58-f066-44e7-9caa-b24f4ffc6305\', \'multiverseId\': 451968}, \'multiverseid\': 451968}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e2ead1-bde9-48f0-bfca-60b9731f31e6\', \'multiverseId\': 452216}, \'multiverseid\': 452216}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから互いに共通の土地タイプを持つ基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab7b140-8926-47bd-971f-5483d33fc57d\', \'multiverseId\': 452464}, \'multiverseid\': 452464}, {\'name\': \'Paisagem Infinita\', \'text\': \'Paisagem Infinita entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Infinita: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico que compartilhem um tipo de terreno, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47eee06d-6abc-4e9d-9033-e985a1d0f4e9\', \'multiverseId\': 452712}, \'multiverseid\': 452712}]', "[{'name': 'Meditation der Weisen', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Meditation der Weisen ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jede Aura, die du kontrollierst und die an eine Kreatur angelegt ist, eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Aura, die du kontrollierst und die an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451275&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28ea60f4-ca5f-49c6-baaa-c2a9a3444305', 'multiverseId': 451275}, 'multiverseid': 451275}, {'name': 'Ensueño de la sabia', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Ensueño de la sabia entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada Aura que controlas que esté anexada a una criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Aura que controlas que esté anexada a una criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451523&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75621188-4412-45e3-992f-00f2287caeca', 'multiverseId': 451523}, 'multiverseid': 451523}, {'name': 'Rêverie du sage', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Rêverie du sage arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque aura que vous contrôlez qui est attachée à une créature.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura que vous contrôlez qui est attachée à une créature.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451771&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40f7568e-92aa-42f4-9fb5-c4d05ae9bde0', 'multiverseId': 451771}, 'multiverseid': 451771}, {'name': 'Visione del Saggio', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Visione del Saggio entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni Aura che controlli assegnata a una creatura.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura che controlli assegnata a una creatura.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452019&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6501b872-a8f7-42b1-9058-b9511501ebc0', 'multiverseId': 452019}, 'multiverseid': 452019}, {'name': '賢人の夢想', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n賢人の夢想が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーにつけられているオーラ１つにつきカードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーにつけられているオーラ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452267&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d970342-84b4-4028-9925-0c40319cb127', 'multiverseId': 452267}, 'multiverseid': 452267}, {'name': 'Devaneio do Sábio', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Devaneio do Sábio entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card para cada Aura que você controla que estiver anexada a uma criatura.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Aura que você controla anexada a uma criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452515&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64a6bc22-5658-4941-8628-f4c1869f1bfc', 'multiverseId': 452515}, 'multiverseid': 452515}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mit der Vergangenheit hadern\', \'text\': \'Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Dann kannst du eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul lässt keine Wünsche wahr werden. Die Wünsche gleichen sich einfach ihrem Willen an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bedc475-7139-4bec-b4d6-b2df7920c91f\', \'multiverseId\': 451351}, \'multiverseid\': 451351}, {\'name\': \'Asir el pasado\', \'text\': \'Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Luego, puedes regresar una carta de criatura o de tierra de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul no concede deseos. Los deseos, simplemente, se pliegan a su voluntad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a50c339-83aa-4940-9b4b-67439f35202c\', \'multiverseId\': 451599}, \'multiverseid\': 451599}, {\'name\': \'Lutter contre le passé\', \'text\': \'Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature ou de terrain depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Emrakul n\'exauce pas les vœux. Les désirs se plient simplement à sa volonté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68aa439f-b55d-45cb-829c-59d38341f31a\', \'multiverseId\': 451847}, \'multiverseid\': 451847}, {\'name\': \'Lottare con il Passato\', \'text\': \'Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura o terra dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul non esaudisce desideri. Piuttosto, i desideri si allineano alla sua volontà.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c45e6e9-61e8-4671-9ff0-5db634c2910e\', \'multiverseId\': 452095}, \'multiverseid\': 452095}, {\'name\': \'過去との取り組み\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚あなたの墓地に置く。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'エムラクールは願いを叶えたりしない。ただ、人々の望みがエムラクールの意志に沿ったものになるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c32a09-e1a2-4e53-a84b-079afa6e1151\', \'multiverseId\': 452343}, \'multiverseid\': 452343}, {\'name\': \'Lutar com o Passado\', \'text\': \'Coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Depois, você pode devolver um card de criatura ou terreno de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul não concede desejos. Esses simplesmente se alinham a sua vontade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fabd54c-5c8e-4731-adc0-c59016e3586d\', \'multiverseId\': 452591}, \'multiverseid\': 452591}]', '[{\'name\': \'Modergrab-Monstrosität\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn die Modergrab-Monstrosität stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil und bringe dann zwei zufällig bestimmte Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Grenze zwischen Leben und Tod ist so dünn wie die Grasnarbe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451359&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeff54cd-bc73-46cd-8bf1-5806e7d688f0\', \'multiverseId\': 451359}, \'multiverseid\': 451359}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosidad de la tumbamohosa\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando la Monstruosidad de la tumbamohosa muera, exíliala, luego regresa dos cartas de criatura al azar de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'El límite entre la vida y la muerte es fino como una capa de tierra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffee4c03-0f9b-4395-9272-3c526072e3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 451607}, \'multiverseid\': 451607}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosité du moldgraf\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nQuand la Monstruosité du moldgraf meurt, exilez-la, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille deux cartes de créature choisies au hasard depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "La frontière qui sépare la vie et la mort est aussi fine qu\'une couche de terreau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d82a55-bdf2-466b-88e1-21877d56bea2\', \'multiverseId\': 451855}, \'multiverseid\': 451855}, {\'name\': \'Mostruosità Ammuffita\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando la Mostruosità Ammuffita muore, esiliala, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia due carte creatura a caso dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Il confine tra la vita e la morte è sottile come uno strato di terriccio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76e41d3-294f-447f-b2b4-028b0ce828de\', \'multiverseId\': 452103}, \'multiverseid\': 452103}, {\'name\': \'黴墓の大怪物\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n黴墓の大怪物が死亡したとき、それを追放し、その後あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード２枚を無作為に選んで戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'生と死の境目は、表土の層ほどに薄い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1eefe6b-bfa2-47e4-b43e-b9a741dadbe3\', \'multiverseId\': 452351}, \'multiverseid\': 452351}, {\'name\': \'Monstro do Cemitério Bolorento\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Monstro do Cemitério Bolorento morrer, exile-o e depois devolva dois cards de criatura aleatoriamente de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'A fronteira entre a vida e a morte é fina como a camada superficial do solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ffde807-e2f3-4281-8e97-6ca4369fcc0a\', \'multiverseId\': 452599}, \'multiverseid\': 452599}]', "[{'name': 'Mooswurz-Brücke', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Falls die Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, eine Gesamtstärke von 10 oder mehr haben, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451470&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e284edd-ebbf-4f73-bc4d-bd1c400ef26d', 'multiverseId': 451470}, 'multiverseid': 451470}, {'name': 'Puente de hierba musgo', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza total de 10 o más.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451718&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b1fe390-0a51-451d-9734-9d1ab83fd370', 'multiverseId': 451718}, 'multiverseid': 451718}, {'name': 'Pont de fangemousse', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force totale supérieure ou égale à 10.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451966&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f4dc9f-88ae-4385-8f7c-864cd3d4105f', 'multiverseId': 451966}, 'multiverseid': 451966}, {'name': 'Ponte Muscoso', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se le creature che controlli hanno una forza totale pari o superiore a 10.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452214&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd94a211a-5ed6-41be-8c3b-6df6e5d60fed', 'multiverseId': 452214}, 'multiverseid': 452214}, {'name': '苔汁の橋', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計が10以上であるなら、あなたはその追放されたカードを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9021e6c1-c7b0-4c89-97cd-6897fbd02452', 'multiverseId': 452462}, 'multiverseid': 452462}, {'name': 'Ponte Musgomosto', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando ele entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo, e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se as criaturas que você controla tiverem poder total igual ou superior a 10.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452710&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d151675-7b2b-40a3-9a5a-92bde243ce99', 'multiverseId': 452710}, 'multiverseid': 452710}]", '[{\'name\': \'Myr-Kampfkugel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 farblose Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel angreift, kannst du X ungetappte Myr, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Myr-Kampfkugel +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges und fügt dem Spieler oder Planeswalker, den sie angreift, X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Myr, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451415&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd6e4b6-291d-4ed2-91df-5425bba38920\', \'multiverseId\': 451415}, \'multiverseid\': 451415}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de batalla myr\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esfera de batalla myr entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura artefacto Myr incoloras 1/1.\\nSiempre que la Esfera de batalla myr ataque, puedes girar X Myr enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, la Esfera de batalla myr obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno y hace X puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker al que está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7b1e84-25dd-4cdc-a123-cb86c1ae0722\', \'multiverseId\': 451663}, \'multiverseid\': 451663}, {\'name\': \'Sphère de bataille myr\', \'text\': "Quand la Sphère de bataille myr arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sphère de bataille myr attaque, vous pouvez engager X myrs dégagés que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, la Sphère de bataille myr gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et inflige X blessures au joueur ou planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : myr et construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d88dd22-d443-479e-a241-568f89e36b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 451911}, \'multiverseid\': 451911}, {\'name\': \'Sfera da Battaglia Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sfera da Battaglia Myr entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfera da Battaglia Myr attacca, puoi TAPpare X Myr STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, la Sfera da Battaglia Myr prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno e infligge X danni al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ec9c04-0df5-4ea7-ab16-d61ff0cc7e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 452159}, \'multiverseid\': 452159}, {\'name\': \'マイアの戦闘球\', \'text\': \'マイアの戦闘球が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを４体生成する。\\nマイアの戦闘球が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のマイアＸ体をタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、マイアの戦闘球は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア・構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc89b0e4-dccd-473b-bec4-fe7b6f003a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 452407}, \'multiverseid\': 452407}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de Batalha Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando Esfera de Batalha Myr entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura artefato incolores 1/1 do tipo Myr.\\nToda vez que Esfera de Batalha Myr ataca, você pode virar X Myr desvirados que você controla. Se fizer isso, Esfera de Batalha Myr receberá +X/+0 até o final do turno e causará X pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Myr Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95818109-d72f-4695-851a-196d154b8811\', \'multiverseId\': 452655}, \'multiverseid\': 452655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mysteriöses Sanktum\', \'text\': \'Das Mysteriöse Sanktum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir müssen uns auf unser eigenes Wissen verlassen, nicht auf das Dogma der Suchenden oder das Gemurmel der Sphingen."\\n—Tullus von Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5915614a-6bdb-4883-897e-ab06fd9756ca\', \'multiverseId\': 451435}, \'multiverseid\': 451435}, {\'name\': \'Santuario arcano\', \'text\': \'El Santuario arcano entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos confiar en nuestro conocimiento, no en el dogma de los buscadores o los balbuceos de las esfinges".\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7582ec08-fa5c-4e35-83cd-5a1d901e6cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 451683}, \'multiverseid\': 451683}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire ésotérique\', \'text\': \'Le Sanctuaire ésotérique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons nous fier à notre connaissance, pas au dogme des chercheurs ou aux murmures des sphinx. »\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5e5e0d-ab74-424c-8aa2-e03f2bab780f\', \'multiverseId\': 451931}, \'multiverseid\': 451931}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Arcano\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario Arcano entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo confidare nelle nostre conoscenze, non nel dogma dei cercatori o nei mormorii delle sfingi."\\n—Tullus di Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa05f5fe-1b97-4f41-988b-7cbb5f15caf7\', \'multiverseId\': 452179}, \'multiverseid\': 452179}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の聖域\', \'text\': \'秘儀の聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は求道者の教義やスフィンクスのぼやきなどではなく、自らの知識を礎としなければならない。」\\n――パランディウスのタラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa3237b-880d-4382-90ba-c78475870d48\', \'multiverseId\': 452427}, \'multiverseid\': 452427}, {\'name\': \'Santuário Arcano\', \'text\': \'Santuário Arcano entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}, {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Precisamos contar com nosso próprio conhecimento, não com o dogma dos buscadores nem com a ladainha das esfinges."\\n— Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e37543-5194-4181-bf6b-c68af6d67c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 452675}, \'multiverseid\': 452675}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mäanderstrom\', \'text\': \'Der Mäanderstrom kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Strom teilt sich in zahllose Arme, die alle ins Halimar-Meer münden. Nur wenige Reisende finden zweimal denselben Weg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3b5847-98bf-47c3-ab74-83a3862fd62f\', \'multiverseId\': 451468}, \'multiverseid\': 451468}, {\'name\': \'Río serpenteante\', \'text\': \'El Río serpenteante entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El río se bifurcaba en muchos canales hasta llegar al mar de Halimar. Pocos eran los viajeros que podían seguir el mismo canal dos veces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836eb50d-55e3-43f4-aaa3-a22685b90ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 451716}, \'multiverseid\': 451716}, {\'name\': \'Rivière sinueuse\', \'text\': \'La Rivière sinueuse arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rivière se scindait en plusieurs canaux en s\'écoulant vers la mer de Halimar. Peu de voyageurs parvenaient à suivre le même deux fois.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0a6b9d-ec73-4bf3-a53f-dff2c94e8b85\', \'multiverseId\': 451964}, \'multiverseid\': 451964}, {\'name\': \'Fiume Serpeggiante\', \'text\': \'Il Fiume Serpeggiante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Il fiume si divideva in molti canali fluendo verso il Mare di Halimar. Pochi viaggiatori sapevano percorrere lo stesso due volte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a8d72e-ba2c-494d-bfe6-700b31e0d786\', \'multiverseId\': 452212}, \'multiverseid\': 452212}, {\'name\': \'曲がりくねる川\', \'text\': \'曲がりくねる川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'川は幾度も分岐を繰り返しハリマーの海に注ぎ込む。旅人が同じ川筋をふたたび辿ることは難しかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ac9f7f-8b2d-4867-aea9-746c379edaf2\', \'multiverseId\': 452460}, \'multiverseid\': 452460}, {\'name\': \'Rio Sinuoso\', \'text\': \'Rio Sinuoso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'O rio dividia-se em vários canais ao fluir para o Mar de Halimar. Poucos viajantes conseguiam seguir o mesmo canal duas vezes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60735a55-e425-4861-bc34-b5b5286c6880\', \'multiverseId\': 452708}, \'multiverseid\': 452708}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachkonstruieren\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der „Frachtraum" — ein illegales Forschungslabor im Wrack eines Handelsschiffes — wurde für die Renegaten zu einem Quell von Informationen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d26cbd6-acd9-4e37-bd99-fc0659cd0190\', \'multiverseId\': 451302}, \'multiverseid\': 451302}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniería inversa\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La Bodega, un laboratorio de investigación ilegal situado en un barco mercante abandonado, se convirtió en fuente de innovación para los renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5b5a8d1-8abd-4eaf-8dad-025a1cbc3c8f\', \'multiverseId\': 451550}, \'multiverseid\': 451550}, {\'name\': \'Rétro-ingénieur\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Centre de recherche illégal dissimulé dans un vaisseau marchand abandonné, la Forteresse devint une importante source de renseignements pour les renégats.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04426843-d9ef-4426-a919-b121e078cc87\', \'multiverseId\': 451798}, \'multiverseid\': 451798}, {\'name\': \'Ingegneria Inversa\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nPesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La Stiva, un centro di ricerca illegale in una nave mercantile abbandonata, divenne una fonte inesauribile di informazioni per i rinnegati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f345f8-5bbb-4bf9-86ae-a2b1a3e95863\', \'multiverseId\': 452046}, \'multiverseid\': 452046}, {\'name\': \'解析調査\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nカードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'船倉とは、廃棄された商船の内部にある非合法な研究施設の名である。そこは改革派の情報拠点になっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693f5eda-389c-4537-a44c-135bd935a94f\', \'multiverseId\': 452294}, \'multiverseid\': 452294}, {\'name\': \'Engenharia Reversa\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nCompre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O Porão, uma instalação de pesquisa ilegal em um navio mercante abandonado, tornou-se um centro de inteligência dos renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7045ce-1898-4677-a8f2-ad28b7cee860\', \'multiverseId\': 452542}, \'multiverseid\': 452542}]', "[{'name': 'Nachtstahl-Zitadelle', 'text': 'Unzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.', 'type': 'Artefakt, Land', 'flavor': 'Bauten aus Nachtstahl werden weder durch Angriffe noch durch Alterung geschwächt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451444&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3ab65be-e493-46ee-9b72-0e89e15f419b', 'multiverseId': 451444}, 'multiverseid': 451444}, {'name': 'Ciudadela de acero oscuro', 'text': 'Indestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.', 'type': 'Tierra artefacto', 'flavor': 'Las estructuras construidas con acero oscuro no ceden ante el asalto ni ante el paso del tiempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451692&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67506265-aac4-4d57-b593-0a46499ae3af', 'multiverseId': 451692}, 'multiverseid': 451692}, {'name': 'Citadelle de sombracier', 'text': 'Indestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.', 'type': 'Terrain-artefact', 'flavor': 'Les édifices en sombracier défient les assauts et le temps.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451940&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '852f49ed-8b11-4875-9fbe-f84de6ec4cbe', 'multiverseId': 451940}, 'multiverseid': 451940}, {'name': 'Roccaforte di Darksteel', 'text': 'Indistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.', 'type': 'Terra Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Le strutture di darksteel sono impervie sia agli attacchi sia al passare del tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452188&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7387e1e1-917e-4aa2-8371-7702b5e216c4', 'multiverseId': 452188}, 'multiverseid': 452188}, {'name': 'ダークスティールの城塞', 'text': '破壊不能\\n{T}：{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・土地', 'flavor': 'ダークスティールで造られた構造物は、攻撃にも年月にも屈することはない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452436&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3962636e-fa2e-44f5-8e55-dde1adcbe928', 'multiverseId': 452436}, 'multiverseid': 452436}, {'name': 'Cidadela de Aço Negro', 'text': 'Indestrutível\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.', 'type': 'Terreno Artefato', 'flavor': 'As estruturas construídas de aço negro não cedem a ataques nem ao tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452684&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ba561de-fdc6-4d3b-a692-446f09c3a238', 'multiverseId': 452684}, 'multiverseid': 452684}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachtstahljuggernaut\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Nachtstahljuggernauten sind gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\\nDer Nachtstahljuggernaut greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'Teils unaufhaltsame Kraft, teils unbewegliches Objekt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07747e40-f836-4889-8974-357f66afa24c\', \'multiverseId\': 451405}, \'multiverseid\': 451405}, {\'name\': \'Destructor de acero oscuro\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nLa fuerza y resistencia del Destructor de acero oscuro son iguales a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\\nEl Destructor de acero oscuro ataca cada combate si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Destructor\', \'flavor\': \'Mitad fuerza imparable, mitad objeto inamovible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa2c1bf-7a90-4172-834f-586fe0bd9460\', \'multiverseId\': 451653}, \'multiverseid\': 451653}, {\'name\': \'Djaggernaut de sombracier\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Djaggernaut de sombracier sont chacune égales au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\nLe Djaggernaut de sombracier attaque à chaque combat si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : djaggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'À la fois force invincible et objet inébranlable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9344665c-3c7f-45b3-8ee0-88d8ac3ccbcc\', \'multiverseId\': 451901}, \'multiverseid\': 451901}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut di Darksteel\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Juggernaut di Darksteel sono pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\\nIl Juggernaut di Darksteel attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'Una parte forza inarrestabile, una parte oggetto inamovibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1863868d-6803-4e5d-b3dc-9c36811f035a\', \'multiverseId\': 452149}, \'multiverseid\': 452149}, {\'name\': \'ダークスティールの巨大戦車\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nダークスティールの巨大戦車のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\\n各戦闘で、ダークスティールの巨大戦車は可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車\', \'flavor\': \'止められない力であり、動かざる物体でもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c63319-b583-4522-bfa3-2632a5568dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 452397}, \'multiverseid\': 452397}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut de Aço Negro\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nO poder e a resistência de Juggernaut de Aço Negro são ambos iguais ao número de artefatos que você controla.\\nJuggernaut de Aço Negro ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'Parte força irrefreável, parte objeto inamovível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d42ad1d-3a3b-4c85-a949-3ed787cbc337\', \'multiverseId\': 452645}, \'multiverseid\': 452645}]', "[{'name': 'Neu-Benalia', 'text': 'Neu-Benalia kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn Neu-Benalia ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451473&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a711ec85-5884-4bf8-8dd6-9f922e92fcd0', 'multiverseId': 451473}, 'multiverseid': 451473}, {'name': 'Nueva Benalia', 'text': 'Nueva Benalia entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando Nueva Benalia entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451721&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59aa6986-733f-4f45-9b7a-dbfe3833ef34', 'multiverseId': 451721}, 'multiverseid': 451721}, {'name': 'Nouvelle Bénalia', 'text': 'La Nouvelle Bénalia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Nouvelle Bénalia arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a90cbeb-b6d9-4b1f-be56-7d99128f1c1f', 'multiverseId': 451969}, 'multiverseid': 451969}, {'name': 'Nuova Benalia', 'text': 'Nuova Benalia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando Nuova Benalia entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452217&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4447eb32-2ef6-42aa-bc7f-52e1361d265e', 'multiverseId': 452217}, 'multiverseid': 452217}, {'name': '新ベナリア', 'text': '新ベナリアはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n新ベナリアが戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\n{T}：{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452465&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d306c33-53c2-4cc4-a86b-1e39679b723a', 'multiverseId': 452465}, 'multiverseid': 452465}, {'name': 'Nova Benália', 'text': 'Nova Benália entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Nova Benália entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452713&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fa8bdc0-eb0a-4a72-a038-ac84d01222a3', 'multiverseId': 452713}, 'multiverseid': 452713}]", "[{'name': 'Ninja der späten Stunden', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Ninja der späten Stunden einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451298&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7178a1b0-c0ba-4414-b690-66faae90617c', 'multiverseId': 451298}, 'multiverseid': 451298}, {'name': 'Ninja de las horas tardías', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Ninja de las horas tardías haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451546&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c479ff74-e5ad-430e-a26c-272fde00d49d', 'multiverseId': 451546}, 'multiverseid': 451546}, {'name': 'Ninja des heures noires', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ninja des heures noires inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451794&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '423ec2e3-f3ec-4261-af5f-826d63504f41', 'multiverseId': 451794}, 'multiverseid': 451794}, {'name': 'Ninja della Notte Fonda', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Ninja della Notte Fonda infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452042&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcdeaad5-3cd3-40ed-8108-aed34a1c5e04', 'multiverseId': 452042}, 'multiverseid': 452042}, {'name': '深き刻の忍者', 'text': '忍術{1}{U}（{1}{U}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n深き刻の忍者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452290&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d795b1b-5a5c-4f73-84a6-59a4f7cc9326', 'multiverseId': 452290}, 'multiverseid': 452290}, {'name': 'Ninja das Horas Tardias', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que Ninja das Horas Tardias causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452538&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd307801-e4da-4e03-847b-ed107240c3d1', 'multiverseId': 452538}, 'multiverseid': 452538}]", '[{\'name\': \'Oni der lautlosen Klinge\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Oni der lautlosen Klinge einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand jenes Spielers an. Du kannst eine Karte darunter, die kein Land ist, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82a9e5bb-84aa-4426-a7b2-83623648cd96\', \'multiverseId\': 451394}, \'multiverseid\': 451394}, {\'name\': \'Oni hoja silenciosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B}. ({4}{U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Oni hoja silenciosa haga daño de combate a un jugador, mira la mano de ese jugador. Puedes lanzar una carta que no sea tierra de allí sin pagar el coste de maná de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a66900b-41ab-4558-a439-3b8ca09f7e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 451642}, \'multiverseid\': 451642}, {\'name\': \'Oni à la lame silencieuse\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Oni à la lame silencieuse inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la main de ce joueur. Vous pouvez lancer une carte non-terrain qui s\'y trouve sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac73e0a-a57a-4d53-bf81-2f735e13addf\', \'multiverseId\': 451890}, \'multiverseid\': 451890}, {\'name\': \'Oni Lama Silenziosa\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Oni Lama Silenziosa infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, guarda la mano di quel giocatore. Puoi lanciare una carta non terra da quella mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb2970f-e997-47cf-9c80-4aef4e4ae94f\', \'multiverseId\': 452138}, \'multiverseid\': 452138}, {\'name\': \'静刃の鬼\', \'text\': \'忍術{4}{U}{B}（{4}{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n静刃の鬼がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーの手札を見る。あなたはその中の土地でないカード１枚を、そのカードのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c79c410-1564-48bd-b719-3a7a186c4f87\', \'multiverseId\': 452386}, \'multiverseid\': 452386}, {\'name\': \'Oni da Lâmina Silenciosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B}, ({4}{U}{B}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que Oni da Lâmina Silenciosa causa dano de combate a um jogador, olhe a mão daquele jogador. Você pode conjurar um card que não seja um terreno da mão daquele jogador sem pagar o custo de mana daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8cae316-f6b1-4671-be83-4865a7319024\', \'multiverseId\': 452634}, \'multiverseid\': 452634}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Basilika\', \'text\': \'Die Orzhov-Basilika kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Orzhov-Basilika ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451474&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27472625-73f0-4b85-9b54-220074a21f98\', \'multiverseId\': 451474}, \'multiverseid\': 451474}, {\'name\': \'Basílica orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basílica orzhov entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Basílica orzhov entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b11cd1e-0c6d-49e3-b507-2f37c7ee185e\', \'multiverseId\': 451722}, \'multiverseid\': 451722}, {\'name\': "Basilique d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6478d084-70af-44c3-a0cc-a1608e9caae9\', \'multiverseId\': 451970}, \'multiverseid\': 451970}, {\'name\': \'Basilica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1f6b6e-1586-4161-886f-fefd540bab74\', \'multiverseId\': 452218}, \'multiverseid\': 452218}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの聖堂\', \'text\': \'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa97573d-3b1c-47fa-980b-ff1307e4304b\', \'multiverseId\': 452466}, \'multiverseid\': 452466}, {\'name\': \'Basílica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Basílica Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Basílica Orzhov entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca61de2f-d574-4543-a354-a935c82516a6\', \'multiverseId\': 452714}, \'multiverseid\': 452714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Orzhov-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir halten nichts davon, unseren Wohlstand zu verbergen. Wir sind die Orzhov, und so wird bei uns Größe belohnt!"\\n—Teysa Karlov, Große Gesandte der Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798762b2-65cc-4616-89a5-9e02c462cae4\', \'multiverseId\': 451475}, \'multiverseid\': 451475}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Orzhov\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Orzhov entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'"No escondemos nuestra riqueza en las sombras. Esto es Orzhov, y así recompensamos la grandeza".\\n—Teysa Karlov, Gran Enviada de Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb10e575-5481-4d71-8453-0ff4ee5958b2\', \'multiverseId\': 451723}, \'multiverseid\': 451723}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': "« Il nous serait inconcevable de consigner notre richesse à l\'obscurité, croyez-le. À Orzhov, c\'est ainsi que nous célébrons la grandeur. »\\n—Teysa Karlov, plénipotentiaire d\'Orzhov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451971&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c175b8b-1c23-4849-89cb-5d4b86166fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 451971}, \'multiverseid\': 451971}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'"Non pensiamo di dover nascondere le nostre ricchezze nell\\\'ombra. Questi sono gli Orzhov ed è così che premiamo la grandezza."\\n—Teysa Karlov, Gran Delegata degli Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23d611b3-e102-4d34-9af7-3609eaf35340\', \'multiverseId\': 452219}, \'multiverseid\': 452219}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフのギルド門\', \'text\': \'オルゾフのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの富を闇に隠そうとは思いません。これがオルゾフで、これが偉大さを賞賛する方法なのです。」\\n――オルゾフの大特使、テイサ・カルロフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d0b2a3f-e6c9-486d-b9dd-2dc7cd8dbddc\', \'multiverseId\': 452467}, \'multiverseid\': 452467}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'"Não acreditamos em esconder nossa riqueza nas sombras. Esta é Orzhov, e para nós é justo recompensar assim a grandeza."\\n— Teysa Karlov, Grande Enviada dos Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a87324-e79b-49c3-85c3-147319e4bc5b\', \'multiverseId\': 452715}, \'multiverseid\': 452715}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Form des Siegels ist genauso wichtig wie das Siegel selbst. Wenn es als Anhänger getragen wird, ist sein Träger ein Herr. Wenn es auf den Körper tätowiert ist, ist sein Träger ein Sklave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a1605dc-afa9-4b51-b8f0-854cdfd0bcf2\', \'multiverseId\': 451416}, \'multiverseid\': 451416}, {\'name\': \'Sello orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La forma del sello es tan importante como el sello mismo. Si se lleva en un medallón, su portador es un amo. Si está tatuado en el cuerpo, su portador es un esclavo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d1f59e8-db4c-438f-890f-7f86c14ae56b\', \'multiverseId\': 451664}, \'multiverseid\': 451664}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Orzhov", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La forme du cachet est aussi importante que le cachet en lui-même. S\'il est sur un médaillon, son porteur est un maître. S\'il est tatoué, son porteur est un esclave.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90e7e760-c63d-41c0-8225-414accf231b3\', \'multiverseId\': 451912}, \'multiverseid\': 451912}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La forma del sigillo è importante quanto il sigillo stesso. Se viene portato su un medaglione, chi lo porta è un maestro. Se è tatuato sul corpo, chi lo porta è uno schiavo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a194498d-1f39-41c5-b1ed-a0218909695d\', \'multiverseId\': 452160}, \'multiverseid\': 452160}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'紋章が何にあるかは、紋章自身と同じぐらい重要だ。それが大メダルにあるなら、持ち主は主だ。それが身体の刺青なら、持ち主は奴隷だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e71b373-a7d8-4d1f-8c50-9c831c012b07\', \'multiverseId\': 452408}, \'multiverseid\': 452408}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A forma do símbolo é tão importante quanto o próprio símbolo. Se é carregado em um medalhão, seu portador é um mestre. Se é tatuado no corpo, seu portador é um escravo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8629e99c-766e-4d9b-b490-0b7ac7d427fe\', \'multiverseId\': 452656}, \'multiverseid\': 452656}]', "[{'name': 'Panorama von Jund', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Panorama von Jund: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Sumpf-, Gebirge- oder Wald-Standardlandkarte und bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der Himmel ist der Thron des Drachen, von wo aus er seine flammenden Anweisungen gibt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451461&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43135597-cb12-42a6-97db-2795fadf30dc', 'multiverseId': 451461}, 'multiverseid': 451461}, {'name': 'Panorama de Jund', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Panorama de Jund: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Pantano, Montaña o Bosque básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'El cielo es el trono del dragón, desde donde dicta sus decretos ígneos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451709&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19e18435-837b-46a8-94bb-e107b1d04b18', 'multiverseId': 451709}, 'multiverseid': 451709}, {'name': 'Panorama de Jund', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Panorama de Jund : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de marais, de montagne ou de forêt de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Le ciel est le trône du dragon, le siège depuis lequel il impose ses lois incendiaires.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451957&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbc7f5bc-2c61-4879-87df-469fdfef8bc1', 'multiverseId': 451957}, 'multiverseid': 451957}, {'name': 'Panorama di Jund', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Panorama di Jund: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Palude, Montagna o Foresta base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Il cielo è il trono del drago, il posto in cui emana i suoi decreti infuocati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452205&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aff892bc-6503-42d5-957b-d7d638c22186', 'multiverseId': 452205}, 'multiverseid': 452205}, {'name': 'ジャンドの全景', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, ジャンドの全景を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本であり沼か山か森であるカード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '空は竜の王宮であり、炎の命じを下す玉座である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452453&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a0e8d2f-9b5c-48c2-b433-c54e6506c7e4', 'multiverseId': 452453}, 'multiverseid': 452453}, {'name': 'Panorama de Jund', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Panorama de Jund: Procure um card de terreno básico do tipo Pântano, Montanha ou Floresta em seu grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'O céu é o trono do dragão, o assento do qual promulga seus decretos flamejantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452701&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd0ba291-bd0b-4c56-9274-8d5d9f650bc9', 'multiverseId': 452701}, 'multiverseid': 452701}]", '[{\'name\': \'Peitschenzungen-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn die Peitschenzungen-Hydra ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre alle fliegenden Kreaturen. Lege für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurde, eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Peitschenzungen-Hydra.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse, Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'„Wohin sind all die Vögel verschwunden?"\\n—Kaldrin, Dschungel-Reisender\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450696&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2047526-5a9f-4975-ab27-68bd58e1f993\', \'multiverseId\': 450696}, \'multiverseid\': 450696}, {\'name\': \'Hidra lengua de látigo\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando la Hidra lengua de látigo entre al campo de batalla, destruye todas las criaturas con la habilidad de volar. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra lengua de látigo por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Adónde fueron todos los pájaros?".\\n—Kaldrin, excursionista de la jungla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f18986-ea19-4874-baab-369a14515dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 450755}, \'multiverseid\': 450755}, {\'name\': \'Hydre à langue de fouet\', \'text\': "Portée\\nQuand l\'Hydre à langue de fouet arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez toutes les créatures avec le vol. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre à langue de fouet pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard et hydre\', \'flavor\': \'« Mais où sont passés les oiseaux ? »\\n—Kaldrin, touriste de la jungle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b361c6fa-966d-44b9-8b10-45a29bec61b6\', \'multiverseId\': 450814}, \'multiverseid\': 450814}, {\'name\': \'Idra Linguafrusta\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\nQuando l\'Idra Linguafrusta entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi tutte le creature con volare. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra Linguafrusta per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'"Dove sono finiti tutti gli uccelli?"\\n—Kaldrin, visitatore della giungla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134e96d3-dc62-4fce-a3e4-1a26c9efbd1b\', \'multiverseId\': 450873}, \'multiverseid\': 450873}, {\'name\': \'舌長ハイドラ\', \'text\': \'到達\\n舌長ハイドラが戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき、舌長ハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'「鳥たちはみなどこに行ってしまったのだろう？」\\n――ジャングル観光者、カルドリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba33995-d376-4e51-bec5-e4254e027e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 450932}, \'multiverseid\': 450932}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Língua-de-chicote\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Hidra Língua-de-chicote entrar no campo de batalha, destrua todas as criaturas com voar. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hidra Língua-de-chicote para cada criatura destruída dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"Para onde foram todos os pássaros?"\\n— Kaldrin, turista na selva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62180439-28b5-4791-bd4e-24a1df069204\', \'multiverseId\': 450991}, \'multiverseid\': 450991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianische Wiedergeburt\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen und erzeuge dann einen X/X farblosen Schrecken-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Solange noch ein Tropfen Öl existiert, geht es fröhlich weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224420bc-0968-44e9-8268-8af846a7ff70\', \'multiverseId\': 451273}, \'multiverseid\': 451273}, {\'name\': \'Renacimiento pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas, luego crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Horror incolora X/X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas destruidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras exista una gota de ese aceite, la dichosa labor continúa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0db34b0-eaa4-4764-9173-662084aea69a\', \'multiverseId\': 451521}, \'multiverseid\': 451521}, {\'name\': \'Renaissance phyrexiane\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures, puis créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Horreur, X étant le nombre de créatures détruites de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tant qu\'il subsistera une goutte de pétrole, notre mission de joie continuera.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b841acfe-8bb6-4094-b990-21fca8fa9c95\', \'multiverseId\': 451769}, \'multiverseid\': 451769}, {\'name\': \'Rinascita di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature, poi crea una pedina creatura artefatto Orrore X/X incolore, dove X è il numero di creature distrutte in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Finché esiste una goccia dell\'olio, l\'allegro lavoro continua.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58bb82ce-405c-4456-a8e2-33a440afbf33\', \'multiverseId\': 452017}, \'multiverseid\': 452017}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの再誕\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべて破壊し、その後無色のＸ/Ｘのホラー・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。Ｘはこれにより破壊されたクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'油が一滴でもあるかぎり、喜びに満ちた業は続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ae184e-0691-4d83-afd6-fde0a3f057b1\', \'multiverseId\': 452265}, \'multiverseid\': 452265}, {\'name\': \'Renascimento Phyrexiano\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Em seguida, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor X/X do tipo Horror, sendo X o número de criaturas destruídas desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto ainda houver uma gota do óleo, a obra jubilosa terá continuidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3235073-e32f-4ffb-a582-0e9288d0f598\', \'multiverseId\': 452513}, \'multiverseid\': 452513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianischer Schürfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Phyrexianische Schürfer ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten jener Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Weil die Toten nicht den Willen haben, sich zu widersetzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a6a841-11ef-4525-87c1-90f198f46760\', \'multiverseId\': 451318}, \'multiverseid\': 451318}, {\'name\': \'Cavador pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cavador pirexiano entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Porque los muertos no tienen voluntad para resistirse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20c2cbf5-6dd2-4323-b2ed-68308835a116\', \'multiverseId\': 451566}, \'multiverseid\': 451566}, {\'name\': \'Fouilleur phyrexian\', \'text\': \'Quand le Fouilleur phyrexian arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Vous perdez autant de points de vie que le coût converti de mana de cette carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Parce que les morts n\'ont aucune volonté pour résister.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876c562d-d055-4a72-a59c-1f8ec21b523f\', \'multiverseId\': 451814}, \'multiverseid\': 451814}, {\'name\': \'Inquisitore di Phyrexia\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Inquisitore di Phyrexia entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Perdi punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Perché i morti non hanno alcuna volontà di resistenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31906939-f14a-4850-9cd0-f91a5a3d0823\', \'multiverseId\': 452062}, \'multiverseid\': 452062}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの発掘者\', \'text\': \'ファイレクシアの発掘者が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。あなたはそのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'死者は抵抗する意思を持たないため。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6f5815-955b-45c9-bdee-22f12c67e333\', \'multiverseId\': 452310}, \'multiverseid\': 452310}, {\'name\': \'Escavador Phyrexiano\', \'text\': \'Quando Escavador Phyrexiano entrar no campo de batalha, devolva ao campo de batalha o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Porque os mortos não têm a força de vontade para resistir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a21a1a-2dad-415d-9081-477f6785e4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 452558}, \'multiverseid\': 452558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederarchiv\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Polyederarchiv: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Du beginnst, den wahren Zweck der Polyeder zu verstehen", sagte Ugin. „Die Eldrazi können eingesperrt werden."\\n„Wir wissen ja, wie gut es das letzte Mal funktioniert hat …", antwortete Jace trocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf37de6-aee3-4521-bd67-8c73950858bf\', \'multiverseId\': 451409}, \'multiverseid\': 451409}, {\'name\': \'Edro de almacenaje\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro de almacenaje: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás comenzando a entender el verdadero propósito de los edros", dijo Ugin. "Los Eldrazi pueden ser encerrados".\\n"¿Y qué tal funcionó el sistema la última vez?", preguntó Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a73ed2-d10a-45f1-ab4e-6667c73d8b2f\', \'multiverseId\': 451657}, \'multiverseid\': 451657}, {\'name\': \'Archive hèdron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Archive hèdron : Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Tu commences à comprendre le véritable rôle des hèdrons, dit Ugin. Les Eldrazi peuvent être emprisonnés. »\\n« Et comment cela s\'est-il fini la dernière fois ? » demanda Jace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'274d3fd8-7b52-4a6a-9882-f797379b8075\', \'multiverseId\': 451905}, \'multiverseid\': 451905}, {\'name\': "Archivio nell\'Edro", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Archivio nell\'Edro: Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai iniziando a comprendere la vera funzione degli edri," disse Ugin. "Gli Eldrazi possono essere imprigionati."\\n"E l\\\'ultima volta ha funzionato?" chiese Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09d337a9-c89e-4a94-9b05-a599396e2909\', \'multiverseId\': 452153}, \'multiverseid\': 452153}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の記録庫\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 面晶体の記録庫を生け贄に捧げる：カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは言った。「おぬしは面晶体の本来の目的を理解し始めておる。エルドラージを封じることができるのだ。」\\n「それで、前回はどうなったのですか？」ジェイスが訊いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596450be-74e5-4718-b863-6d12b274f721\', \'multiverseId\': 452401}, \'multiverseid\': 452401}, {\'name\': \'Arquivo de Edro\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Arquivo de Edro: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você começou a entender o verdadeiro propósito dos edros", disse Ugin. "Os Eldrazi podem ser aprisionados."\\n"E como é que isso acabou da última vez?", perguntou Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17515aec-ba64-4d7d-8057-372acea918a6\', \'multiverseId\': 452649}, \'multiverseid\': 452649}]', "[{'name': 'Prismalinse', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Sie bricht nicht Licht, sondern Mana, und formt dessen chaotische Strömungen in die festen Formen, die beim Zaubern benötigt werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451418&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '023faf7c-b3f7-4647-bc33-07763d129921', 'multiverseId': 451418}, 'multiverseid': 451418}, {'name': 'Lente prismático', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'No refracta la luz, sino el maná; alinea sus corrientes caóticas en ángulos necesarios para fines místicos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451666&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d891d0a-dbfc-4bec-ab65-ef573d976104', 'multiverseId': 451666}, 'multiverseid': 451666}, {'name': 'Lentille prismatique', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Elle ne canalise pas la lumière, mais le mana, alignant ses courants chaotiques pour obtenir les angles nécessaires aux objectifs du mystique.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451914&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b801e247-cf54-431f-a90e-b9c462c56ffd', 'multiverseId': 451914}, 'multiverseid': 451914}, {'name': 'Lente Prismatica', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Non piega la luce ma il mana, allineandone le correnti caotiche in nette svolte necessarie ai fini del mistico.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452162&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7551a550-b1a3-41a1-b063-ff300eb3dccd', 'multiverseId': 452162}, 'multiverseid': 452162}, {'name': '虹色のレンズ', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'それは光ではなくマナを曲げ、乱れた流れを神秘的な目的のために鋭い角度へと整列させる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d652f25-57a6-4135-a058-48c0611651cd', 'multiverseId': 452410}, 'multiverseid': 452410}, {'name': 'Lente Prismática', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Ela refrata não luz, mas mana, alinhando suas correntes caóticas nos ângulos precisos necessários para os propósitos do místico.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452658&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5ff2f70-ba92-4a27-a6c9-d1490fba9a7e', 'multiverseId': 452658}, 'multiverseid': 452658}]", '[{\'name\': \'Prototyp-Portal\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn das Prototyp-Portal ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefaktkarte aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken.\\n{X}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist. X sind die umgewandelten Manakosten jener Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3888e6e-57ae-4f14-be4c-70c0e8ff6863\', \'multiverseId\': 451419}, \'multiverseid\': 451419}, {\'name\': \'Portal prototipo\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Cuando el Portal prototipo entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar una carta de artefacto de tu mano.\\n{X}, {T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de la carta exiliada. X es el coste de maná convertido de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9abf5ae2-1636-4f87-b348-efb25fd516ad\', \'multiverseId\': 451667}, \'multiverseid\': 451667}, {\'name\': \'Portail prototype\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand le Portail prototype arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une carte d\'artefact depuis votre main.\\n{X}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la carte exilée. X est le coût converti de mana de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ec8321-5bec-4fa7-afe1-ebd2278733be\', \'multiverseId\': 451915}, \'multiverseid\': 451915}, {\'name\': \'Portale Prototipo\', \'text\': \'Imprimere — Quando il Portale Prototipo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una carta artefatto dalla tua mano.\\n{X}, {T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta esiliata. X è il costo di mana convertito di quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b4d0ed3-2cde-422e-894a-196c6470a894\', \'multiverseId\': 452163}, \'multiverseid\': 452163}, {\'name\': \'試作品の扉\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 試作品の扉が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの手札からアーティファクト・カード１枚を追放してもよい。\\n{X}, {T}：その追放されたカードのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。Ｘはそのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e6e7c7-f0fb-41e5-8dec-38bed3ef3de1\', \'multiverseId\': 452411}, \'multiverseid\': 452411}, {\'name\': \'Portal de Protótipos\', \'text\': \'Estampar — Quando Portal de Protótipos entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar um card de artefato da sua mão.\\n{X}, {T}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do card exilado. X é o custo de mana convertido daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c36676a-0528-42f4-8696-edbdceaaae83\', \'multiverseId\': 452659}, \'multiverseid\': 452659}]', '[{\'name\': \'Psychosenkrabbler\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Psychosenkrabblers sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls dieses Gehirn nicht das Geheimnis des Serums entschlüsseln kann, dann füge noch mehr Gehirn dazu."\\n—Rhmir, Hand des Augurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5132448-d01b-4560-b94e-f31c087a6d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 451420}, \'multiverseid\': 451420}, {\'name\': \'Rondador de psicosis\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Rondador de psicosis son iguales a la cantidad de cartas que haya en tu mano.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Si ese cerebro no puede descubrir el secreto del suero, entonces agreguen más cerebros".\\n—Rhmir, Mano de los presagios\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa88cb14-b910-4172-b6b6-8a647e34eeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 451668}, \'multiverseid\': 451668}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur psychotique\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Rampeur psychotique sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Si ce cerveau est incapable de découvrir le secret du sérum, ajoutez-en quelques-uns de plus. »\\n—Rhmir, Main de l\'Augure", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8678de7f-db93-4ddd-ad5a-03959f2b2da8\', \'multiverseId\': 451916}, \'multiverseid\': 451916}, {\'name\': \'Psicosi Strisciante\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Psicosi Strisciante sono pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Orrore\', \'flavor\': \'"Se quel cervello non riesce a capire il segreto del siero, allora aggiungi altro cervello."\\n—Rhmir, Mano dell\\\'Augure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b55635fa-60bb-478b-a9ea-5b368f9173b1\', \'multiverseId\': 452164}, \'multiverseid\': 452164}, {\'name\': \'精神の病を這うもの\', \'text\': \'精神の病を這うもののパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「その脳で血清の秘密が探れぬなら、もっと脳を足してやれ。」\\n――卜占の手、ルミーア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3dd69d9-7110-4020-952b-efcead03937b\', \'multiverseId\': 452412}, \'multiverseid\': 452412}, {\'name\': \'Réptil da Psicose\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Réptil da Psicose são ambos iguais ao número de cards em sua mão.\\nToda vez que você compra um card, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Se aquele cérebro não consegue decifrar o segredo do soro, adicione mais cérebros."\\n— Rhmir, Mão do Áugure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f61c65-be99-44a1-9fdf-e8515a971540\', \'multiverseId\': 452660}, \'multiverseid\': 452660}]', "[{'name': 'Rakdos-Schlachtstätte', 'text': 'Die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451476&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d330592-6311-421e-bcb6-ccfe7ac6cf3f', 'multiverseId': 451476}, 'multiverseid': 451476}, {'name': 'Carnarium rakdos', 'text': 'El Carnarium rakdos entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Carnarium rakdos entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451724&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcb70593-6eb4-4372-946d-8ec25967796c', 'multiverseId': 451724}, 'multiverseid': 451724}, {'name': 'Carnarium de Rakdos', 'text': 'Le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451972&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc9d6cb7-7ebc-4c58-8b1c-9962af625216', 'multiverseId': 451972}, 'multiverseid': 451972}, {'name': 'Carnario Rakdos', 'text': 'Il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452220&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf1a1704-fa0c-456e-a6d2-7f1ac54e9f24', 'multiverseId': 452220}, 'multiverseid': 452220}, {'name': 'ラクドスの肉儀場', 'text': 'ラクドスの肉儀場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nラクドスの肉儀場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452468&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85d22ef9-6678-4f24-b3f3-8aab4e5e39db', 'multiverseId': 452468}, 'multiverseid': 452468}, {'name': 'Carnarium Rakdos', 'text': 'Carnarium Rakdos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Carnarium Rakdos entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452716&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3e6ef4a-e79d-4444-92d5-c7e76648f84a', 'multiverseId': 452716}, 'multiverseid': 452716}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rankenschmetter-Zentaur\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Rankenschmetter-Zentaur kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie Länderkarten in allen Friedhöfen sind.\\nImmer wenn eine Länderkarte von irgendwoher auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du {G}{G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe den Rankenschmetter-Zentauren aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Zentaur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0839d9ab-132c-4fc7-bc62-1ba90d6cc165\', \'multiverseId\': 451338}, \'multiverseid\': 451338}, {\'name\': \'Centauro enredadera\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Centauro enredadera entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre él igual a la cantidad de cartas de tierra en todos los cementerios.\\nSiempre que una carta de tierra vaya a un cementerio desde cualquier lugar, puedes pagar {G}{G}. Si lo haces, regresa el Centauro enredadera de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro planta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8cd7b11-7bc0-4f96-89da-bf7a2e18f187\', \'multiverseId\': 451586}, \'multiverseid\': 451586}, {\'name\': \'Fracasseliane centaure\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Fracasseliane centaure arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de cartes de terrain dans tous les cimetières.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte de terrain est mise dans un cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, vous pouvez payer {G}{G}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez le Fracasseliane centaure depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante et centaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e8d0982-6a5d-4ea3-9e97-0fb6020fa2dd\', \'multiverseId\': 451834}, \'multiverseid\': 451834}, {\'name\': \'Centauro Spezzaliane\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nIl Centauro Spezzaliane entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al numero di carte terra in tutti i cimiteri.\\nOgniqualvolta una carta terra viene messa in un cimitero da qualsiasi zona, puoi pagare {G}{G}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano il Centauro Spezzaliane dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Centauro Pianta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105d9685-612f-49f8-9baf-7de643b9aea5\', \'multiverseId\': 452082}, \'multiverseid\': 452082}, {\'name\': \'ケンタウルスの壊し蔦\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nケンタウルスの壊し蔦は、すべての墓地にある土地・カードの総数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n土地・カードが１枚いずれかの領域から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは{G}{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からケンタウルスの壊し蔦をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ケンタウルス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37c1094-08ed-4e7c-9271-8bdad4307e95\', \'multiverseId\': 452330}, \'multiverseid\': 452330}, {\'name\': \'Centauro das Lianas Esmagadoras\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCentauro das Lianas Esmagadoras entra no campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 equivalente ao número de cards de terreno em todos os cemitérios.\\nToda vez que um card de terreno for colocado em um cemitério a partir de qualquer lugar, você pode pagar {G}{G}. Se fizer isso, devolva Centauro das Lianas Esmagadoras de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta Centauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4636fcea-48c0-4d5f-8053-af1002c0e98b\', \'multiverseId\': 452578}, \'multiverseid\': 452578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rasende Nashornkäfer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Rasenden Nashornkäfer erhalten +10/+10, solange du zehn oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn sich die Herde in Bewegung setzt, solltest du es ihr gleichtun."\\n—Yon Basrel, Überlebenskünstler aus dem Oran-Rief-Wald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450689&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0dfd6b7-2dea-408b-8a02-3c5fe9028c72\', \'multiverseId\': 450689}, \'multiverseid\': 450689}, {\'name\': \'Lucha de rinoescarabajos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nLa Lucha de rinoescarabajos obtiene +10/+10 mientras controles diez o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando la manada se mueva, muévete tú también".\\n—Yon Basrel, sobreviviente de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89122276-f582-4a0b-b511-decbaa695c25\', \'multiverseId\': 450748}, \'multiverseid\': 450748}, {\'name\': \'Déferlante de scarabées rhinocéros\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLa Déferlante de scarabées rhinocéros gagne +10/+10 tant que vous contrôlez au moins dix terrains.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "« Quand le troupeau se déplace, mieux vaut bouger aussi. »\\n—Yon Basrel, survivaliste d\'Oran-Rief", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6e8386-f454-4a67-ad6d-732ab57c48e3\', \'multiverseId\': 450807}, \'multiverseid\': 450807}, {\'name\': \'Carica di Scarabei Rinoceronte\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nLa Carica di Scarabei Rinoceronte prende +10/+10 fintanto che controlli dieci o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il branco si muove, fai altrettanto."\\n—Yon Basrel, survivalista di Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb94a95-460a-4363-af6e-8731eabf2b74\', \'multiverseId\': 450866}, \'multiverseid\': 450866}, {\'name\': \'サイ甲虫の暴走\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたが土地を10個以上コントロールしているかぎり、サイ甲虫の暴走は＋10/＋10の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「群れが動いたら、あんたも動くんだ。」\\n――オラン＝リーフの生き残り、ヨン・バスレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d382a61-6fbb-4129-8fed-ca30c8578712\', \'multiverseId\': 450925}, \'multiverseid\': 450925}, {\'name\': \'Manada de Besourocerontes\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nManada de Besourocerontes receberá +10/+10 enquanto você controlar dez ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando a manada se movimenta, é melhor fazer o mesmo."\\n— Yon Basrel, sobrevivencialista de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4debbbd-074e-48a7-b0f6-fe4fb6671e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 450984}, \'multiverseid\': 450984}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rathische Stürme\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die nicht verzaubert sind. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wird einen enormen Schrei geben, und danach eine noch enormere Stille."\\n—Das Orakel en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2bbb0d-3f00-4ce0-b988-a6f00901d492\', \'multiverseId\': 451282}, \'multiverseid\': 451282}, {\'name\': \'Vientos de Rath\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no estén encantadas. No pueden ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se oirá un enorme grito, seguido de un silencio aún más enorme".\\n—Oráculo en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309127d9-c9e8-4784-b476-511e31d813f3\', \'multiverseId\': 451530}, \'multiverseid\': 451530}, {\'name\': \'Vents de Rajh\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures qui ne sont pas enchantées. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y aura un grand cri, et puis un silence plus grand encore. »\\n—Oracle en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171fe1f6-ed06-4f5a-b743-5836ef44c696\', \'multiverseId\': 451778}, \'multiverseid\': 451778}, {\'name\': \'Venti di Rath\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non sono incantate. Non possono essere rigenerate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sarà un urlo lacerante e poi un silenzio ancor più grande."\\n—Oracolo en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc853fd4-7abb-4e93-a884-e6df805dacb0\', \'multiverseId\': 452026}, \'multiverseid\': 452026}, {\'name\': \'ラースの風\', \'text\': \'エンチャントされていないクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。それらは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大きな叫び声が上がり、その後もっと大きな静寂が訪れるだろう。」\\n――ヴェクの巫女\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1ec74e-f879-410a-958d-91711da7aba4\', \'multiverseId\': 452274}, \'multiverseid\': 452274}, {\'name\': \'Ventos de Rath\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que não estiverem encantadas. Elas não podem ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Haverá um imenso clamor, seguido de um silêncio ainda maior."\\n— Oráculo en-Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b96d4a-2d41-4cbb-b2f9-d0a549f19065\', \'multiverseId\': 452522}, \'multiverseid\': 452522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Realitätswirrwarr\', \'text\': \'Lege eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du besitzt, unter deine Bibliothek. Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die einen Kartentyp mit jener bleibenden Karte gemeinsam hat. Bringe die Karte ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450685&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f94d090f-1b2a-43da-9277-1185c6155e05\', \'multiverseId\': 450685}, \'multiverseid\': 450685}, {\'name\': \'Suplantación de realidad\', \'text\': \'Pon el permanente objetivo del cual eres propietario en el fondo de tu biblioteca. Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta que comparta un tipo de carta con ese permanente. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff20f653-8fbf-43b1-842f-e4aab259e598\', \'multiverseId\': 450744}, \'multiverseid\': 450744}, {\'name\': \'Brouillage de réalité\', \'text\': "Mettez un permanent ciblé que vous possédez au-dessous de votre bibliothèque. Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte qui partage un type de carte avec ce permanent. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4ca862-6b6d-4b0f-8486-ced80404a9f5\', \'multiverseId\': 450803}, \'multiverseid\': 450803}, {\'name\': \'Rimescolamento della Realtà\', \'text\': \'Metti un permanente bersaglio che possiedi in fondo al tuo grimorio. Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta che condivide un tipo di carta con quel permanente. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfba17b2-d787-4d74-9bcc-b1b012a3c71d\', \'multiverseId\': 450862}, \'multiverseid\': 450862}, {\'name\': \'現実混ぜ\', \'text\': \'あなたがオーナーであるパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。そのパーマネントと共通のカード・タイプを持つカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードを戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ac85d6-6968-4015-a23d-dca34b9e1430\', \'multiverseId\': 450921}, \'multiverseid\': 450921}, {\'name\': \'Mescla da Realidade\', \'text\': \'Coloque a sua permanente alvo no fundo de seu grimório. Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card que compartilhe um tipo com aquela permanente. Coloque aquele card no campo de batalha e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card do seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b363805-53b4-407d-9441-8df91a5482b6\', \'multiverseId\': 450980}, \'multiverseid\': 450980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rechtschaffene Autorität\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Karte auf der Hand ihres Beherrschers.\\nZu Beginn des Ziehsegments des Beherrschers der verzauberten Kreatur zieht jener Spieler eine zusätzliche Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9583f142-58cd-4b3a-8732-1dd4119bb187\', \'multiverseId\': 451391}, \'multiverseid\': 451391}, {\'name\': \'Autoridad justa\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada carta que haya en la mano de su controlador.\\nAl comienzo del paso de robar del controlador de la criatura encantada, ese jugador roba una carta adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87a5d6c-1360-4d13-802b-ce51ac2573c7\', \'multiverseId\': 451639}, \'multiverseid\': 451639}, {\'name\': \'Autorité vertueuse\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque carte dans la main de son contrôleur.\\nAu début de l\'étape de pioche du contrôleur de la créature enchantée, ce joueur pioche une carte supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe44dde-fce5-428f-8c24-4a8e74af6342\', \'multiverseId\': 451887}, \'multiverseid\': 451887}, {\'name\': \'Autorità Virtuosa\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni carta nella mano del suo controllore.\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase di acquisizione del controllore della creatura incantata, quel giocatore pesca una carta addizionale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'623a66d3-c223-4a57-bb52-5c7b7e63954f\', \'multiverseId\': 452135}, \'multiverseid\': 452135}, {\'name\': \'正当な権威\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの手札にあるカード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーのコントローラーのドロー・ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカードを追加で１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4844b777-dc1b-4100-9636-53d235172933\', \'multiverseId\': 452383}, \'multiverseid\': 452383}, {\'name\': \'Justa Autoridade\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada card na mão de seu controlador.\\nNo início da etapa de compra do controlador da criatura encantada, aquele jogador compra um card adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364ab4fd-1752-4635-83d1-58a89cef0279\', \'multiverseId\': 452631}, \'multiverseid\': 452631}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rätsel-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Rätsel-Sphinx aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, lege sie als dritte Karte von oben in deine Bibliothek.\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte ins Exil schickst, die kein Land ist und die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb66813d-f626-4ce8-94c1-4e0b13a4c165\', \'multiverseId\': 451381}, \'multiverseid\': 451381}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge del enigma\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Esfinge del enigma vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, ponla en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en tercer lugar.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de156e20-5fc6-4622-8968-dc9e07b94182\', \'multiverseId\': 451629}, \'multiverseid\': 451629}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx du logogriphe\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Sphinx du logogriphe est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, mettez-le en troisième position au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'859f276a-ddec-43df-8fe7-e4b7c3bb3fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 451877}, \'multiverseid\': 451877}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge degli Enigmi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Sfinge degli Enigmi viene messa nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, mettila come terza carta dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49efd230-3afe-4460-9101-c9eafc6b8c91\', \'multiverseId\': 452125}, \'multiverseid\': 452125}, {\'name\': \'謎のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n謎のスフィンクスが戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれたとき、これをあなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚目に置く。\\n続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44141fb1-ce1f-40d8-bade-9ec7d8d3b680\', \'multiverseId\': 452373}, \'multiverseid\': 452373}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge do Enigma\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Esfinge do Enigma for colocada no seu cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, coloque-a no seu grimório na terceira posição, contando a partir do topo.\\nCascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile os cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um card que não seja um terreno e que tenha custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd1bdf9-77b4-484b-94c8-4b46ce404377\', \'multiverseId\': 452621}, \'multiverseid\': 452621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Hagra\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451319&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3d6ca1-fc71-464c-a007-1b76b19149b9\', \'multiverseId\': 451319}, \'multiverseid\': 451319}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Hagra\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\\n• Cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea31fa90-ebfb-4433-a8fc-91e81940b888\', \'multiverseId\': 451567}, \'multiverseid\': 451567}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Hagra\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbb2afb-2d37-433e-b1e3-9a6294210ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 451815}, \'multiverseid\': 451815}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Hagra\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b54226f-0895-43ed-a479-f699933854cb\', \'multiverseId\': 452063}, \'multiverseid\': 452063}, {\'name\': \'ハグラへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受け、接死を得る。\\n• 各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d072d2-d6d0-47a9-8aae-221235affa5a\', \'multiverseId\': 452311}, \'multiverseid\': 452311}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Hagra\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:\\n• A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\\n• Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e1f0032-3086-447d-ab7b-188012570e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 452559}, \'multiverseid\': 452559}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saheeli die Hochbegabte\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n+1: Der nächste Zauberspruch, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst sowie du den Zauberspruch wirkst, {1} weniger.\\n−7: Erzeuge für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihm ist. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Schicke die Spielsteine zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\\nSaheeli die Hochbegabte kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Saheeli\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a56479d-7b5e-4f88-8933-7fab53e0dd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 450704}, \'multiverseid\': 450704}, {\'name\': \'Saheeli, la Habilidosa\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\\n+1: El próximo hechizo que lances este turno te cuesta {1} menos por cada artefacto que controlas en cuanto lo lanzas.\\n−7: Por cada artefacto que controlas, crea una ficha que es una copia de él. Esas fichas ganan la habilidad de prisa. Exilia esas fichas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nSaheeli, la Habilidosa puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Saheeli\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c499c40-8aa5-4a60-b455-b8902ddcd5a7\', \'multiverseId\': 450763}, \'multiverseid\': 450763}, {\'name\': \'Saheeli, la talentueuse\', \'text\': \'+1 : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\n+1 : Le prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez au moment où vous le lancez.\\n-7 : Pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez, créez un jeton qui en est une copie. Ces jetons acquièrent la célérité. Exilez ces jetons au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nSaheeli, la talentueuse peut être votre commandant.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Saheeli\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91e5ce5c-9bbf-4519-85c8-99cad94f8702\', \'multiverseId\': 450822}, \'multiverseid\': 450822}, {\'name\': \'Saheeli, la Talentuosa\', \'text\': "+1: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\\n+1: La prossima magia che lanci in questo turno costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli mentre la lanci.\\n-7: Per ogni artefatto che controlli, crea una pedina che è una copia di quel permanente. Quelle pedine hanno rapidità. Esilia quelle pedine all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nSaheeli, la Talentuosa può essere il tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Saheeli\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'677a6707-a33c-4f79-9b6f-14c84f62571d\', \'multiverseId\': 450881}, \'multiverseid\': 450881}, {\'name\': \'天智、サヒーリ\', \'text\': \'+1：無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n+1：このターンにあなたが次の呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがそれを唱える際にコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\\n-7：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき、それのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。それらのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらのトークンを追放する。\\n天智、サヒーリは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — サヒーリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'290129e2-f374-4eef-b74e-b24375ce6750\', \'multiverseId\': 450940}, \'multiverseid\': 450940}, {\'name\': \'Saheeli, a Dotada\', \'text\': \'+1: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\n+1: A próxima mágica que você conjurar neste turno custará {1} a menos para conjurar para cada artefato que você controlar conforme a conjura.\\n−7: Para cada artefato que você controlar, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele. Aquelas fichas ganham ímpeto. Exile aquelas fichas no início da próxima etapa final.\\nSaheeli, a Dotada, pode ser sua comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Saheeli\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ade72aa-c583-4617-af25-ad83fc440060\', \'multiverseId\': 450999}, \'multiverseid\': 450999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saheelis Direktive\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nDecke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefaktkarten mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger ins Spiel bringen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt und nicht ins Spiel gebracht wurden, auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450686&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0245e57c-b16b-4cef-8685-5d2ac4b6ef69\', \'multiverseId\': 450686}, \'multiverseid\': 450686}, {\'name\': \'Directiva de Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nMuestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla cualquier cantidad de cartas de artefacto con coste de maná convertido de X o menos que se encuentren entre ellas. Luego, pon en tu cementerio todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera que no fueron puestas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be5c765-f2c9-44bc-a84c-2616c79d972e\', \'multiverseId\': 450745}, \'multiverseid\': 450745}, {\'name\': \'Directive de Saheeli\', \'text\': "Improvisation (Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nRévélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Parmi elles, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X. Mettez ensuite dans votre cimetière toutes les cartes révélées de cette manière qui n\'ont pas été mises sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1883da-32bf-4731-a9d8-a67fe91d82c2\', \'multiverseId\': 450804}, \'multiverseid\': 450804}, {\'name\': \'Direttiva di Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nRivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte artefatto con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X scelte tra esse. Poi metti nel tuo cimitero tutte le carte rivelate in questo modo che non sono state messe sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78fb48af-548f-4432-ad90-550b9628e7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 450863}, \'multiverseid\': 450863}, {\'name\': \'サヒーリの指令\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを公開する。あなたはその中から、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下であるアーティファクト・カード望む枚数を戦場に出してもよい。その後、これにより公開し戦場に出さなかったカードをすべてあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f32008d-579a-4d45-8343-8a1cd443859e\', \'multiverseId\': 450922}, \'multiverseid\': 450922}, {\'name\': \'Diretriz de Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nRevele os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar qualquer número de cards de artefato com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X dentre eles no campo de batalha. Depois, coloque em seu cemitério todos os cards revelados dessa maneira que não foram colocados no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61964838-50d4-4e93-bbd2-42041b05dd6f\', \'multiverseId\': 450981}, \'multiverseid\': 450981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saheelis Kunstfertigkeit\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Artefakts deiner Wahl ist.\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schon bei der ersten Berührung weiß ich, was das Metall sein möchte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451303&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e62ceb98-b0ac-445c-8117-0f0d4fb41a09\', \'multiverseId\': 451303}, \'multiverseid\': 451303}, {\'name\': \'Maestría de Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto objetivo.\\n• Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura objetivo, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sé exactamente lo que cada metal quiere ser únicamente con tocarlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1d8583-30cc-45d3-bc62-a9ccba10dfb0\', \'multiverseId\': 451551}, \'multiverseid\': 451551}, {\'name\': \'Art de Saheeli\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact ciblé.\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la créature ciblée, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je sais exactement ce que le métal veut devenir dès l\'instant où je le touche. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb95c79b-940e-4a0d-90d6-0fd22c1fea50\', \'multiverseId\': 451799}, \'multiverseid\': 451799}, {\'name\': \'Maestria di Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Crea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura bersaglio, tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Fin dal primo tocco, capisco esattamente cosa vuole diventare il metallo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb13cd5-1d55-4bf5-ac39-a80f04069841\', \'multiverseId\': 452047}, \'multiverseid\': 452047}, {\'name\': \'サヒーリの芸術\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除きそれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「一触れすれば、その金属が何になりたがっているのかわかるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee0a99fa-1a7f-4be9-a7c7-78ac7d2fb96f\', \'multiverseId\': 452295}, \'multiverseid\': 452295}, {\'name\': \'Arte de Saheeli\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato alvo.\\n• Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura alvo, exceto que ela é um artefato além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Desde o primeiro toque, eu sei exatamente o que o metal quer ser."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ad31ef-fa19-46f3-b6f3-b183829fe5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 452543}, \'multiverseid\': 452543}]', "[{'name': 'Scharrende Klauen', 'text': '{T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl schickt eine Karte aus seinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{1}, opfere die Scharrenden Klauen: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451421&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24edfef2-eef8-47bf-ab38-110d31e46ce2', 'multiverseId': 451421}, 'multiverseid': 451421}, {'name': 'Garras escarbadoras', 'text': '{T}: El jugador objetivo exilia una carta de su cementerio.\\n{1}, sacrificar las Garras escarbadoras: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451669&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec0bc1d0-6157-4ddf-8b7f-636e9c27d825', 'multiverseId': 451669}, 'multiverseid': 451669}, {'name': 'Griffes racleuses', 'text': '{T} : Le joueur ciblé exile une carte depuis son cimetière.\\n{1}, sacrifiez les Griffes racleuses : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451917&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb632b70-7616-45e5-a52f-97ad16fde9a5', 'multiverseId': 451917}, 'multiverseid': 451917}, {'name': 'Artigli Raschianti', 'text': '{T}: Un giocatore bersaglio esilia una carta dal suo cimitero.\\n{1}, Sacrifica gli Artigli Raschianti: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452165&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6214dacb-4c0e-4a32-8153-c6f4515b69b1', 'multiverseId': 452165}, 'multiverseid': 452165}, {'name': 'ひっかき爪', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地からカード１枚を追放する。\\n{1}, ひっかき爪を生け贄に捧げる：墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452413&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b08a6ec3-d261-4235-8deb-99dbd9f35445', 'multiverseId': 452413}, 'multiverseid': 452413}, {'name': 'Garras Esmiuçadoras', 'text': '{T}: O jogador alvo exila um card do próprio cemitério.\\n{1}, sacrifique Garras Esmiuçadoras: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Compre um card.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452661&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a4ea117-8ed0-4690-bc41-07e12130f81a', 'multiverseId': 452661}, 'multiverseid': 452661}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafte Ophis\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen."\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc08d3e-6eeb-45c9-85cb-b3ef23ef803b\', \'multiverseId\': 451365}, \'multiverseid\': 451365}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de víbora\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño a un oponente, puedes robar una carta".\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4edde3aa-7dd8-4b67-8bca-18f578438185\', \'multiverseId\': 451613}, \'multiverseid\': 451613}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de serpent\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous pouvez piocher une carte. »\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3be0e5d-81a5-45c1-9c18-347fb788c5bd\', \'multiverseId\': 451861}, \'multiverseid\': 451861}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Serpente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno a un avversario, puoi pescare una carta".\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\\\'Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d05707-c7f5-480c-b0e3-8909b8fcd8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 452109}, \'multiverseid\': 452109}, {\'name\': \'蛇の陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、「このクリーチャーが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。」を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e141e8-9ed9-4f29-b6d5-b762948e5118\', \'multiverseId\': 452357}, \'multiverseid\': 452357}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Cobra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano a um oponente, você pode comprar um card."\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4b7f32-e324-44f3-b485-24894b21985b\', \'multiverseId\': 452605}, \'multiverseid\': 452605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Aal\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8273334b-ede2-4290-9cd4-99df08c2f577\', \'multiverseId\': 451292}, \'multiverseid\': 451292}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de anguila\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c80ac2a8-d27d-43dc-bbe1-1f374709e41e\', \'multiverseId\': 451540}, \'multiverseid\': 451540}, {\'name\': "Ombre d\'anguille", \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451788&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52634b22-4393-4f90-a91a-f3eb77d6263f\', \'multiverseId\': 451788}, \'multiverseid\': 451788}, {\'name\': "Essenza dell\'Anguilla", \'text\': "Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bdaa74a-711e-440b-b510-567ed29ca2ea\', \'multiverseId\': 452036}, \'multiverseid\': 452036}, {\'name\': \'長魚の陰影\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d61ad35-f5b8-444f-98dd-593a1db14675\', \'multiverseId\': 452284}, \'multiverseid\': 452284}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Enguia\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdacaae9-b918-42fb-b4c8-5e96297e3a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 452532}, \'multiverseid\': 452532}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Bär\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, enttappe alle Länder, die du kontrollierst."\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9a6948-3f41-4b66-abf9-26cc0d2cd3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 451334}, \'multiverseid\': 451334}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de oso\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, endereza todas las tierras que controlas".\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeadee63-bbe5-4cf4-b6d9-bf896393b7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 451582}, \'multiverseid\': 451582}, {\'name\': "Ombre d\'ours", \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez. »\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa2a039-021b-4a5f-921d-8cc27f8c5807\', \'multiverseId\': 451830}, \'multiverseid\': 451830}, {\'name\': "Essenza dell\'Orso", \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli".\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\\\'Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94246888-1da4-428a-a875-ac6b98534cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 452078}, \'multiverseid\': 452078}, {\'name\': \'熊の陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしている土地をすべてアンタップする。」を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8114acb-e168-4c4f-a68d-694da53b89f3\', \'multiverseId\': 452326}, \'multiverseid\': 452326}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Urso\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, desvire todos os terrenos que você controla."\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a3c287-b8aa-4565-92ce-63521faecd63\', \'multiverseId\': 452574}, \'multiverseid\': 452574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Oktopus\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 8/8 und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 8 oder weniger tappen."\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fef71c3-e81e-4c98-b0bb-34aced29f20c\', \'multiverseId\': 450671}, \'multiverseid\': 450671}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de octópodo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 8/8 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, puedes girar la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 8 o menos".\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1a7ef9-6055-4116-92ce-c6686233ca54\', \'multiverseId\': 450730}, \'multiverseid\': 450730}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de pieuvre\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a une force et une endurance de base de 8/8 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, vous pouvez engager une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 8. »\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb297751-d575-42d8-b5de-29fab293c64a\', \'multiverseId\': 450789}, \'multiverseid\': 450789}, {\'name\': \'Essenza della Piovra\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha forza e costituzione base 8/8 e "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, puoi TAPpare una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 8".\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\\\'Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0ab661-515f-4bd5-8a35-4e28ef822c03\', \'multiverseId\': 450848}, \'multiverseid\': 450848}, {\'name\': \'タコの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは基本のパワーとタフネスが８/８になり「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パワーが８以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップしてもよい。」を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443c55a9-185b-49f3-9ef7-8b67961f611e\', \'multiverseId\': 450907}, \'multiverseid\': 450907}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Polvo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada tem poder e resistência básicos 8/8 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, você pode virar a criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 8.".\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5baf40-a921-45d5-a3b0-0a2899981dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 450966}, \'multiverseid\': 450966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatzmopser\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner ein Artefakt für Mana tappt, übernimm die Kontrolle über das Artefakt bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Täuschli-Pläuschli-Gesetz wird von allen ehrenhaften Jägern glitzernder Dinge respektiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce117d58-d357-444b-924a-16a966c4f30b\', \'multiverseId\': 450687}, \'multiverseid\': 450687}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo de tesoros\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente gire un artefacto para obtener maná, gana el control de ese artefacto hasta el final de tu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Todo noble buscador de cosas brillantes respeta la regla del Trae Que Es Mío.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2915671-7666-4e85-b47f-f776a0c0d549\', \'multiverseId\': 450746}, \'multiverseid\': 450746}, {\'name\': \'Chipeur de trésor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire engage un artefact pour du mana, acquérez le contrôle de cet artefact jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "La loi du « C\'est pas ton tien » est respectée par tous les nobles chasseurs des choses qui brillent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020b13d3-ab7c-4fc6-b0ad-77df86005bb2\', \'multiverseId\': 450805}, \'multiverseid\': 450805}, {\'name\': \'Arraffatore di Tesori\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un avversario TAPpa un artefatto per attingere mana, prendi il controllo di quell\'artefatto fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'La Legge del Ridammelo è rispettata da ogni nobile cacciatore di oggetti lucenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5ce849-58b9-4dfb-9f25-1b75834b0606\', \'multiverseId\': 450864}, \'multiverseid\': 450864}, {\'name\': \'宝捕り\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がマナを引き出す目的でアーティファクトを１つタップするたび、あなたの次のターン終了時まで、そのアーティファクトのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'とったらかえすの決まりは、ぴかぴかを求める高貴な者全員が遵守している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a94394-4956-4f15-8db6-d7aa31e95941\', \'multiverseId\': 450923}, \'multiverseid\': 450923}, {\'name\': \'Batedor de Tesouros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente virar um artefato para gerar mana, ganhe o controle daquele artefato até o final do seu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'A Lei do Tomalá Dacá é respeitada por todo nobre buscador de coisas reluzentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7def0ac3-d5e1-4d0b-a263-159332c03312\', \'multiverseId\': 450982}, \'multiverseid\': 450982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatzsuche\', \'text\': \'Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die kein Land ist, und nimm dann alle auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Je länger die Reise dauert, desto mehr kann man dabei lernen."\\n—Isanke, Meerespirscherin aus Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a192383-6c2f-4fab-b2a6-22d4541b9121\', \'multiverseId\': 451312}, \'multiverseid\': 451312}, {\'name\': \'Búsqueda del tesoro\', \'text\': \'Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta que no sea tierra, luego pon todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuanto más largo el viaje, más aprendes".\\n—Isanke, acechador marino de Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3185ec6c-5e71-4b5d-8c92-c4a4542d6d04\', \'multiverseId\': 451560}, \'multiverseid\': 451560}, {\'name\': \'Chasse au trésor\', \'text\': "Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à révéler une carte non-terrain et mettez ensuite toutes les cartes révélées de cette manière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Plus le voyage est long, plus l\'enseignement est bon. »\\n—Isanke, boucanière de Halimar", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c56d1e8-2ec5-4d78-bb59-eccb8f1dcc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 451808}, \'multiverseid\': 451808}, {\'name\': \'Caccia al Tesoro\', \'text\': \'Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta non terra, poi aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte rivelate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Più lungo è il viaggio, più cose si imparano lungo il cammino."\\n—Isanke, furtiva di Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b6660b-1b0b-44bc-9040-13580d380b75\', \'multiverseId\': 452056}, \'multiverseid\': 452056}, {\'name\': \'宝物探し\', \'text\': \'土地でないカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。その後、これにより公開されたカードをすべてあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「旅が長ければ、学ぶことも多い。」\\n――ハリマーの海忍び、イサンキ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9f9d674-3e8d-4d2b-b48f-a5519726e166\', \'multiverseId\': 452304}, \'multiverseid\': 452304}, {\'name\': \'Caça ao Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Revele os cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card que não seja um terreno, depois coloque todos os cards revelados dessa maneira na sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanto mais longa a jornada, mais se aprende."\\n— Isanke, espreitadora marinha de Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24e5909-e115-4c91-8aa2-34348c7f3878\', \'multiverseId\': 452552}, \'multiverseid\': 452552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Scherzfragen-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Scherzfragen-Sphinx angreift, bestimmt jeder Spieler einen Kartennamen. Dann zeigt jeder Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Falls die vorgezeigte Karte den Namen hat, den er bestimmt hat, nimmt der Spieler sie auf seine Hand. Falls nicht, legt der Spieler sie unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50313f46-a0ab-4473-ab16-7715ad968beb\', \'multiverseId\': 451287}, \'multiverseid\': 451287}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge del acertijo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge del acertijo ataque, cada jugador elige el nombre de una carta. Luego cada jugador muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si la carta que muestra un jugador tiene el nombre que eligió, ese jugador la pone en su mano. Si no lo tiene, ese jugador la pone en el fondo de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7cc1b06-cd43-4603-9b77-6e8dae15fbb7\', \'multiverseId\': 451535}, \'multiverseid\': 451535}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx du mystère\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sphinx du mystère attaque, chaque joueur nomme une carte. Puis chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si la carte qu\'un joueur a révélée est la carte qu\'il a nommée, ce joueur la met dans sa main. Dans le cas contraire, ce joueur la met au-dessous de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f9997eb-f47d-4690-8c6b-e04126d89866\', \'multiverseId\': 451783}, \'multiverseid\': 451783}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge degli Indovinelli\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfinge degli Indovinelli attacca, ogni giocatore sceglie il nome di una carta. Poi ogni giocatore rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Se la carta rivelata da un giocatore ha il nome che ha scelto, quel giocatore la aggiunge alla sua mano. Se non lo ha, quel giocatore mette quella carta in fondo al suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0ff14c-2156-4c21-aa77-4777e6929206\', \'multiverseId\': 452031}, \'multiverseid\': 452031}, {\'name\': \'難題のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n難題のスフィンクスが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード名１つを選ぶ。その後、各プレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。プレイヤーが公開したカードが、そのプレイヤーが選んだ名前を持つなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを自分の手札に加える。そうでないなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを自分のライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359c1fbc-53c8-4c27-928d-adfa85295148\', \'multiverseId\': 452279}, \'multiverseid\': 452279}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge da Charada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Esfinge da Charada ataca, cada jogador nomeia um card. Depois, cada jogador revela o card do topo do próprio grimório. Se o card que um jogador revelar tiver o nome escolhido, aquele jogador o colocará na própria mão. Se não tiver, aquele jogador o colocará no fundo do próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'332aa20d-3077-4f2b-bebb-cdc1acb44ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 452527}, \'multiverseid\': 452527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schildkäfer-Meute\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, lege vier +1/+1-Marken auf die Schildkäfer-Meute.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Überlebensregel 781: Es gibt immer noch mehr Schildkäfer."\\n—Zurdi, Goblin-Abkürzer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7297f0f9-02b3-4ee5-baa8-afa63da7654e\', \'multiverseId\': 451364}, \'multiverseid\': 451364}, {\'name\': \'Turba de escutos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas cinco o más tierras, pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la Turba de escutos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Regla de supervivencia 781: siempre hay más bichos escuto".\\n—Zurdi, acortacaminos trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac32d01-23b0-4217-a8b9-409c3fb99386\', \'multiverseId\': 451612}, \'multiverseid\': 451612}, {\'name\': \'Foule de scalaires\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains, mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur la Foule de scalaires.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Règle de survie 781 : Il y a toujours plus de scalaires. »\\n—Zurdi, accourcisseur gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13215870-b00e-4774-9973-ad5b37486606\', \'multiverseId\': 451860}, \'multiverseid\': 451860}, {\'name\': \'Calca di Scudati\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli cinque o più terre, metti quattro segnalini +1/+1 sulla Calca di Scudati.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Regola di sopravvivenza 781: Ci sono sempre più scudati."\\n—Zurdi, goblin delle scorciatoie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec07c259-3ace-4d5f-a949-5514f526e7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 452108}, \'multiverseid\': 452108}, {\'name\': \'硬鎧の群れ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが土地を５つ以上コントロールしている場合、硬鎧の群れの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「生き残りの法則 781：硬鎧虫はいつでももっといる。」\\n――ゴブリンの近道抜け、ザーディ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce5883c-ae21-484c-94ee-4e44266e8942\', \'multiverseId\': 452356}, \'multiverseid\': 452356}, {\'name\': \'Multidão de Cascudos\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos, coloque quatro marcadores +1/+1 em Multidão de Cascudos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Regra de sobrevivência 781: Sempre há mais cascudos."\\n— Zurdi, atalhadeiro goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef24ce4-6b22-492d-9023-d8d1bddb13bc\', \'multiverseId\': 452604}, \'multiverseid\': 452604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmiede der Helden\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Bestimme einen Kommandeur deiner Wahl, der in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen ist. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn, falls er eine Kreatur ist, und eine Loyalitätsmarke, falls er ein Planeswalker ist.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Schicksal wird nicht mit feinen Fäden gesponnen. Es wird mit Feuer geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780fb704-5d1d-4730-9407-bfa74d213fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 450718}, \'multiverseid\': 450718}, {\'name\': \'Forja de héroes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Elige el comandante objetivo que entró al campo de batalla este turno. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él si es una criatura y un contador de lealtad sobre él si es un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La historia no se teje con delicadeza, se forja a fuego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b535ab2-bb13-4862-8f13-08d898e755bb\', \'multiverseId\': 450777}, \'multiverseid\': 450777}, {\'name\': \'Forge des héros\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Choisissez un commandant ciblé qui est arrivé sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si c\'est une créature et un marqueur « loyauté » si c\'est un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'histoire n\'est pas délicatement tissée. Elle est forgée dans les flammes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e56f18-5e60-4a83-8422-144de6d5a5da\', \'multiverseId\': 450836}, \'multiverseid\': 450836}, {\'name\': \'Fucina di Eroi\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Scegli un comandante bersaglio che è entrato nel campo di battaglia in questo turno. Metti su di esso un segnalino +1/+1 se è una creatura e un segnalino fedeltà se è un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La storia non è tessuta delicatamente, ma forgiata nel fuoco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad01eff4-65df-4b8f-8852-b126289b7856\', \'multiverseId\': 450895}, \'multiverseid\': 450895}, {\'name\': \'英雄の鍛錬所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：このターンに戦場に出た統率者１体を対象とする。それがクリーチャーであればそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、それがプレインズウォーカーであればそれの上に忠誠カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は静かに織りなされるわけではない。火によって鍛えられるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ea7449-e1c6-46af-96f8-8784e67f2d4d\', \'multiverseId\': 450954}, \'multiverseid\': 450954}, {\'name\': \'Forja de Heróis\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Escolha o comandante alvo que entrou no campo de batalha neste turno. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele se for uma criatura e um marcador de lealdade se for um planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A história não é tecida delicadamente. Ela é marretada a fogo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a6a74f-19a2-495c-a68e-44f27d4ae78f\', \'multiverseId\': 451013}, \'multiverseid\': 451013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schnäppchen bei Mondschein\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege davon jede Karte, für die du nicht 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlst, auf deinen Friedhof. Nimm dann den Rest auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'An jedem fünften Vollmond findet der Mondmarkt statt, auf dem Ravnicas verbotenste Waren gehandelt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c2223d-815f-4b46-93d4-09a150726978\', \'multiverseId\': 451317}, \'multiverseid\': 451317}, {\'name\': \'Trato a la luz de la luna\', \'text\': \'Mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Por cada carta, pon esa carta en tu cementerio a menos que pagues 2 vidas. Luego pon el resto en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada quinta luna llena, el Mercado Lunar atrae a los buhoneros con las mercancías más prohibidas de Rávnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54240f33-8c33-489c-a373-8f6740e4bc13\', \'multiverseId\': 451565}, \'multiverseid\': 451565}, {\'name\': \'Marché au clair de lune\', \'text\': "Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pour chacune d\'elles, mettez cette carte dans votre cimetière à moins que vous ne payiez 2 points de vie. Mettez ensuite le reste dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Toutes les cinq pleines lunes, le Marché Sélénien vend tous les produits interdits dans Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed048aa4-8073-446a-8fca-7975f4c9a23f\', \'multiverseId\': 451813}, \'multiverseid\': 451813}, {\'name\': \'Vendita al Chiaro di Luna\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Per ogni carta, metti quella carta nel tuo cimitero a meno che non paghi 2 punti vita. Poi aggiungi alla tua mano le altre.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni cinque lune piene, il Mercato Lunare si raduna per vendere le merci più proibite di Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a8c78b-bcb9-42cf-a369-4c76d95ddd9c\', \'multiverseId\': 452061}, \'multiverseid\': 452061}, {\'name\': \'月光の取り引き\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。カード１枚につき、あなたが２点のライフを支払わないかぎり、そのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。その後、残りのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'満月が五度来るたび、ラヴニカで最も禁じられている物を売るために月市が開かれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c360b4-a8e8-4bfd-aa6e-f232d3e7a47f\', \'multiverseId\': 452309}, \'multiverseid\': 452309}, {\'name\': \'Barganha do Luar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Para cada card, coloque o card em seu cemitério, a menos que você pague 2 pontos de vida. Depois, coloque o restante em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A cada quinta lua cheia, o Mercado da Lua reúne-se para negociar as mercadorias mais proibidas de Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440926dc-4ab3-40a0-ae4e-d63202b5400a\', \'multiverseId\': 452557}, \'multiverseid\': 452557}]', "[{'name': 'Seeküstenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Seeküstenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}, {W} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Um der Weisheit willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alles von oben sehen zu können. Um des Ruhmes willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um als Dokument der Macht zu dienen. Um der Stärke willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alle Angriffe abzuwehren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451480&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3cba9a5-ec70-423c-8759-139aacea2438', 'multiverseId': 451480}, 'multiverseid': 451480}, {'name': 'Ciudadela costera', 'text': 'La Ciudadela costera entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}, {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Para la sabiduría, fue construida bien alta para observarlo todo. Para la gloria, fue construida bien alta para ser un testimonio del poder. Para la fortaleza, fue construida bien alta para repeler todos los ataques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451728&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb35b2a8-977d-40f7-8975-c7ea20a46698', 'multiverseId': 451728}, 'multiverseid': 451728}, {'name': 'Citadelle maritime', 'text': 'La Citadelle maritime arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}, {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Pour la sagesse, elle fut construite haute pour tout voir. Pour la gloire, elle fut construite haute en testament de la puissance. Pour la force, elle fut construite haute pour repousser toutes les attaques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451976&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b8511a0-d632-49e5-a83a-706fc7355b13', 'multiverseId': 451976}, 'multiverseid': 451976}, {'name': 'Cittadella sul Mare', 'text': 'La Cittadella sul Mare entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}, {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Per la saggezza, è stata costruita in alto per contemplare ogni cosa. Per la gloria, è stata costruita in alto come testimonianza di potere. Per la potenza, è stata costruita in alto per respingere tutti gli attacchi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452224&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47689ae4-ecec-45cf-83ef-c0801c68553f', 'multiverseId': 452224}, 'multiverseid': 452224}, {'name': '海辺の城塞', 'text': '海辺の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '智のために、それはあらゆる物を見下ろす高さとなった。名誉のために、それは力を示す高さとなった。力のために、それはすべての攻撃を跳ね返す高さとなった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452472&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53b80c7e-76b8-40fc-bb47-2348d4688338', 'multiverseId': 452472}, 'multiverseid': 452472}, {'name': 'Cidadela à Beira-mar', 'text': 'Cidadela à Beira-mar entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}, {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Pela sabedoria, ela foi construída no alto para ver todas as coisas. Pela glória, ela foi construída no alto como um testemunho de poder. Pela força, ela foi construída no alto para repelir todos os ataques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452720&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3145e5cb-58be-4d27-b676-4c339fcf148f', 'multiverseId': 452720}, 'multiverseid': 452720}]", '[{\'name\': \'Seele von Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\n{3}{B}{B}: Bringe bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n{3}{B}{B}, schicke die Seele von Innistrad aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bringe bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f4de09d-8e92-4e79-9c03-bb8b5d9d34d5\', \'multiverseId\': 451321}, \'multiverseid\': 451321}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\n{3}{B}{B}: Regresa hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exiliar el Alma de Innistrad de tu cementerio: Regresa hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6a9ed3-7f19-4681-872d-b4cb949f520f\', \'multiverseId\': 451569}, \'multiverseid\': 451569}, {\'name\': "Âme d\'Innistrad", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\n{3}{B}{B} : Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exilez l\'Âme d\'Innistrad depuis votre cimetière : Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fdc9e96-2921-4b2b-8124-c34006c81c60\', \'multiverseId\': 451817}, \'multiverseid\': 451817}, {\'name\': \'Anima di Innistrad\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\n{3}{B}{B}: Riprendi in mano fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{3}{B}{B}, Esilia l\'Anima di Innistrad dal tuo cimitero: Riprendi in mano fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d819942c-e3c3-4de5-89f6-ee681f684152\', \'multiverseId\': 452065}, \'multiverseid\': 452065}, {\'name\': \'イニストラードの魂\', \'text\': \'接死\\n{3}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大３枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n{3}{B}{B}, あなたの墓地からイニストラードの魂を追放する：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大３枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208b5142-77a3-432a-b771-e8203176f5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 452313}, \'multiverseid\': 452313}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\n{3}{B}{B}: Devolva até três cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exile Alma de Innistrad do seu cemitério: Devolva até três cards de criatura alvo do seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'391778af-b93b-47e0-91e6-7e28bd891ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 452561}, \'multiverseid\': 452561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seele von Neu-Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{5}: Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{5}, schicke die Seele von Neu-Phyrexia aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451426&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d64f0d-3b90-408b-a8c2-764178fc99d0\', \'multiverseId\': 451426}, \'multiverseid\': 451426}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Nueva Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{5}: Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n{5}, exiliar el Alma de Nueva Phyrexia de tu cementerio: Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d560e7-0105-4bd4-8495-e0a6b6114e86\', \'multiverseId\': 451674}, \'multiverseid\': 451674}, {\'name\': \'Âme de la Nouvelle Phyrexia\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{5} : Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{5}, exilez l\'Âme de la Nouvelle Phyrexia depuis votre cimetière : Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74b4a81-bba3-4cdf-9b52-175b0b0c7d97\', \'multiverseId\': 451922}, \'multiverseid\': 451922}, {\'name\': \'Anima di Nuova Phyrexia\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\n{5}: I permanenti che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n{5}, Esilia l\'Anima di Nuova Phyrexia dal tuo cimitero: I permanenti che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7944b5ba-2ea4-45f8-aa85-413c04d4651a\', \'multiverseId\': 452170}, \'multiverseid\': 452170}, {\'name\': \'新たなるファイレクシアの魂\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{5}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\\n{5}, あなたの墓地から新たなるファイレクシアの魂を追放する：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc55041a-5c13-43b5-852a-121260656873\', \'multiverseId\': 452418}, \'multiverseid\': 452418}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Nova Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\n{5}: As permanentes que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n{5}, exile Alma de Nova Phyrexia do seu cemitério: As permanentes que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aacfa81c-6556-47d9-a31c-fc3b1e78d976\', \'multiverseId\': 452666}, \'multiverseid\': 452666}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenschlinge\', \'text\': \'{W}, opfere die Seelenschlinge: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, die dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Körper und Geist sind einander Feind. Sie nutzen jede Gelegenheit, den anderen loszuwerden."\\n—Tariel, Abwäger der Seelen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a19b0cc2-70db-44f5-b85b-94879dd40dca\', \'multiverseId\': 451279}, \'multiverseid\': 451279}, {\'name\': \'Trampa de almas\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrificar la Trampa de almas: Exilia la criatura objetivo que está atacándote a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuerpo y espíritu son enemigos irreconciliables. Usarán cualquier excusa para liberarse del otro".\\n—Tariel, Vengadora de Almas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da687dee-94b3-421c-981b-c71953cc99c9\', \'multiverseId\': 451527}, \'multiverseid\': 451527}, {\'name\': \'Collet spirituel\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrifiez le Collet spirituel : Exilez une créature ciblée qui vous attaque ou qui attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le corps et l\'esprit sont des ennemis jurés. Ils trouvent toutes les excuses pour se débarrasser l\'un de l\'autre. »\\n—Tariel, héliaste d\'âmes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd57512d-2097-4e36-a35e-6d81e20b3f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 451775}, \'multiverseid\': 451775}, {\'name\': \'Intrappolare Anima\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifica Intrappolare Anima: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando te o un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Corpo e spirito sono nemici giurati. Sfrutteranno ogni scusa per sbarazzarsi l\\\'uno dell\\\'altro."\\n—Tariel, Censore di Anime\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c2f764-0489-42ad-9fda-1f41c0e24fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 452023}, \'multiverseid\': 452023}, {\'name\': \'魂の捕獲\', \'text\': \'{W}, 魂の捕獲を生け贄に捧げる：あなたかあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「肉体と精神は不倶戴天の敵だ。互いを排除するためならどんな手段でも受け入れる。」\\n――魂を数える者、タリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54a3fb6-f76d-40b2-8602-e268fa3359db\', \'multiverseId\': 452271}, \'multiverseid\': 452271}, {\'name\': \'Armadilha para Almas\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrifique Armadilha para Almas: Exile a criatura alvo que esteja atacando você ou um planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O corpo e o espírito são inimigos jurados. Eles aproveitarão qualquer desculpa para se livrarem um do outro."\\n— Tariel, Víndice das Almas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b6615b-0aea-463d-9c31-00ee89b37223\', \'multiverseId\': 452519}, \'multiverseid\': 452519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segenspendender Satyr\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nGöttergabe {3}{G}{G} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451335&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8c5d3b-51f7-493b-bdd7-d09b2a082a46\', \'multiverseId\': 451335}, \'multiverseid\': 451335}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro de las dádivas\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nConcesión {3}{G}{G}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de Aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d51a443d-3588-4837-8b80-589d27dab056\', \'multiverseId\': 451583}, \'multiverseid\': 451583}, {\'name\': \'Satyre de faveur\', \'text\': "Flash\\nGrâce {3}{G}{G} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+2.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : satyre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1746f39f-9fab-4d8d-acb6-620a423c12e9\', \'multiverseId\': 451831}, \'multiverseid\': 451831}, {\'name\': \'Satiro Infervorato\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nConferire {3}{G}{G} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Satiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77743a70-fd95-413f-b95b-4b7df18556a6\', \'multiverseId\': 452079}, \'multiverseid\': 452079}, {\'name\': \'加護のサテュロス\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n授与{3}{G}{G}（このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ・呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c677ed-3341-4b25-ab34-e404097ba981\', \'multiverseId\': 452327}, \'multiverseid\': 452327}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro Abençoado\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nAgraciar {3}{G}{G} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada recebe +4/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ecdc116-bf5e-4dad-a3ad-eecb6a57f102\', \'multiverseId\': 452575}, \'multiverseid\': 452575}]', "[{'name': 'Sejiri-Refugium', 'text': 'Das Sejiri-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Sejiri-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451483&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41d0ad07-c366-4c5b-bca0-2ec4ca9075ab', 'multiverseId': 451483}, 'multiverseid': 451483}, {'name': 'Refugio de Sejiri', 'text': 'El Refugio de Sejiri entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Sejiri entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451731&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0d75aef-8b53-44c3-b8a3-ddc4e404ff10', 'multiverseId': 451731}, 'multiverseid': 451731}, {'name': 'Refuge de Seijiri', 'text': 'Le Refuge de Seijiri arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de Seijiri arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451979&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '521867d2-0e51-4185-b4cf-b7cb754bcd08', 'multiverseId': 451979}, 'multiverseid': 451979}, {'name': 'Rifugio di Sejiri', 'text': 'Il Rifugio di Sejiri entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Sejiri entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452227&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45efb72b-5713-404c-b1c9-f5a1402b2f8b', 'multiverseId': 452227}, 'multiverseid': 452227}, {'name': 'セジーリの隠れ家', 'text': 'セジーリの隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセジーリの隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452475&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9736eeac-b25c-4e57-9059-e6f8e667c544', 'multiverseId': 452475}, 'multiverseid': 452475}, {'name': 'Refúgio de Sejiri', 'text': 'Refúgio de Sejiri entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio de Sejiri entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452723&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f4cc68d-87a2-4752-a509-871ef7fb04da', 'multiverseId': 452723}, 'multiverseid': 452723}]", "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Heiligtum', 'text': 'Das Selesnija-Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Selesnija-Heiligtum ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451484&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bab4fbf7-7db5-4052-955e-3e67776f6fbd', 'multiverseId': 451484}, 'multiverseid': 451484}, {'name': 'Santuario selesnya', 'text': 'El Santuario selesnya entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Santuario selesnya entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451732&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2e014f7-7f67-4348-afee-11b34250b908', 'multiverseId': 451732}, 'multiverseid': 451732}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire de Selesnya', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451980&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48013e42-5e9e-4462-aaf1-6a10e8eef9b8', 'multiverseId': 451980}, 'multiverseid': 451980}, {'name': 'Santuario di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452228&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a28d1590-2faf-48c0-95e3-05ca1f8581bc', 'multiverseId': 452228}, 'multiverseid': 452228}, {'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452476&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4d7c46c-50a3-4abd-bddd-3e81b79e7834', 'multiverseId': 452476}, 'multiverseid': 452476}, {'name': 'Santuário Selesnya', 'text': 'Santuário Selesnya entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Santuário Selesnya entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452724&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5081fb83-0469-4876-9cb6-72c5eeb4fe02', 'multiverseId': 452724}, 'multiverseid': 452724}]", '[{\'name\': \'Serras Avatar\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft von Serras Avatar sind gleich deinem Lebenspunktestand.\\nWenn Serras Avatar von irgendwoher auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, mische ihn in die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Serra ist nicht tot. Sie lebt in mir weiter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451276&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ade0fbda-8f1d-4a9a-93b7-ce31017bc23a\', \'multiverseId\': 451276}, \'multiverseid\': 451276}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de Serra\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Avatar de Serra son iguales a tu total de vidas.\\nCuando el Avatar de Serra vaya a un cementerio desde cualquier parte, barájalo en la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Serra no está muerta. Sigue viviendo a través de mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87d556e-15fa-4a12-a6cc-7afc843ced48\', \'multiverseId\': 451524}, \'multiverseid\': 451524}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de Serra\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance de l\'Avatar de Serra sont chacune égales à votre total de points de vie.\\nQuand l\'Avatar de Serra est mis dans un cimetière d\'où qu\'il vienne, mélangez-le dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': "« Serra n\'est pas morte. Elle vit en moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac347c01-5309-4e23-918b-906395f186b3\', \'multiverseId\': 451772}, \'multiverseid\': 451772}, {\'name\': \'Avatar di Serra\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione dell\'Avatar di Serra sono pari ai tuoi punti vita.\\nQuando l\'Avatar di Serra viene messo in un cimitero da qualsiasi zona, rimescolalo nel grimorio del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Serra non è morta, poiché vive attraverso di me."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9ccce63-9a0a-42f2-b79f-accfcc995d08\', \'multiverseId\': 452020}, \'multiverseid\': 452020}, {\'name\': \'セラのアバター\', \'text\': \'セラのアバターのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたのライフ総量に等しい。\\nセラのアバターがいずれかの領域から墓地に置かれたとき、これをオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「セラは死んでいない。セラは私を介して生き続ける。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef7d1a88-8784-4266-81d1-ef0b8d6ca9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 452268}, \'multiverseid\': 452268}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de Serra\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Avatar de Serra são ambos iguais ao seu total de pontos de vida.\\nQuando Avatar de Serra for colocado num cemitério vindo de qualquer lugar, embaralhe-o no grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Serra não está morta. Ela vive por meu intermédio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4a06e90-3f83-43cc-9b4e-ff8a0c6a719c\', \'multiverseId\': 452516}, \'multiverseid\': 452516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sich entfaltende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne den störenden Einfluss der Zivilisation wird sich die Natur immer nach dem eigenen Bedarf formen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451448&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ec2e1e-a4c3-421e-acd2-c54ff3330adf\', \'multiverseId\': 451448}, \'multiverseid\': 451448}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos expansivos\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Sin las entrometidas manos de la civilización, la naturaleza siempre se moldeará según sus propias necesidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223592c1-4b8d-4463-8d37-2a311be56125\', \'multiverseId\': 451696}, \'multiverseid\': 451696}, {\'name\': \'Étendues sauvages en évolution\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sans interférence de la civilisation, la nature s\'adapte toujours à ses propres besoins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451944&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f9f550-506f-4fe8-95f9-ef076f69c686\', \'multiverseId\': 451944}, \'multiverseid\': 451944}, {\'name\': \'Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica le Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Senza la presenza invasiva della civiltà, la natura plasmerà se stessa a seconda dei propri bisogni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd480ffa-c12e-43b7-bcc4-526b3d4fcba0\', \'multiverseId\': 452192}, \'multiverseid\': 452192}, {\'name\': \'進化する未開地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'文明の手による介入がなければ、自然は必ずその必要に応じて自らを変容させる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c873f98-b22a-4614-947e-8d4a409bb367\', \'multiverseId\': 452440}, \'multiverseid\': 452440}, {\'name\': \'Terras em Desenvolvimento\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Terras em Desenvolvimento: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Sem a interferência das mãos da civilização, a natureza sempre se moldará às próprias necessidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43477133-f246-4a08-857f-78bb4e2a5cff\', \'multiverseId\': 452688}, \'multiverseid\': 452688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siegel des leeren Throns\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Als Asha Bant verließ, stellte sie sicher, dass die Welt auch in ihrer Abwesenheit Schutz und Ordnung haben würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451277&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046ab011-a330-4057-af7a-855fdb32d6ad\', \'multiverseId\': 451277}, \'multiverseid\': 451277}, {\'name\': \'Sello del trono vacío\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Asha dejó Bant, se aseguró de que el mundo tuviera protección y orden en su ausencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e81e664-f198-46a4-bb9e-1fce18ba49ed\', \'multiverseId\': 451525}, \'multiverseid\': 451525}, {\'name\': \'Sigille du trône vacant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Quand Asha quitta Bant, elle s\'assura que le monde connaîtrait ordre et protection en son absence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3109a1d1-955a-4bf0-8180-127aa8f87e31\', \'multiverseId\': 451773}, \'multiverseid\': 451773}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo del Trono Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, crea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Asha lasciò Bant, si assicurò che il mondo potesse beneficiare di ordine e protezione anche durante la sua assenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b849194e-2aff-4b6e-9c30-7c1243c9f793\', \'multiverseId\': 452021}, \'multiverseid\': 452021}, {\'name\': \'空位の玉座の印章\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アーシャはバントを離れる際に、彼女がいない間もこの世界に守護と秩序が失われないようにした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce8a1a9-d067-4546-926c-6e583cbce1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 452269}, \'multiverseid\': 452269}, {\'name\': \'Insígnia do Trono Vazio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de encantamento, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Asha deixou Bant, garantiu a proteção e a ordem do mundo durante sua ausência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73000bc1-08f3-475d-a73c-f99905953ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 452517}, \'multiverseid\': 452517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sigill-Seestern\', \'text\': \'{T}: Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Seestern\', \'flavor\': \'Kruphix versteckte die düstersten Prophezeiungen über die Menschheit dort, wo die Menschen sie nie finden und die Tritonier ihnen keine Beachtung schenken würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ec7788-4957-4103-be2e-e7b9cf657b19\', \'multiverseId\': 451305}, \'multiverseid\': 451305}, {\'name\': \'Estrella de mar con runas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Estrella-de-mar\', \'flavor\': \'Krufix ocultó las profecías más nefastas acerca de la humanidad donde los humanos jamás pudieran hallarlas y los tritónidos no se tomaran la molestia de leerlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b327588a-410e-42a6-b833-f28eb9de5041\', \'multiverseId\': 451553}, \'multiverseid\': 451553}, {\'name\': \'Étoile de mer sigillaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : étoile de mer\', \'flavor\': "Kruphix dissimula les prophéties les plus horribles sur l\'humanité là où les humains ne pourraient jamais les retrouver. Les tritons, eux, ne s\'y intéresseraient pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b0e297f-9171-4d4b-af4c-f4371973b8f6\', \'multiverseId\': 451801}, \'multiverseid\': 451801}, {\'name\': \'Stella Marina dei Sigilli\', \'text\': \'{T}: Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Stella Marina\', \'flavor\': "Krufix nascose le profezie più catastrofiche sull\'umanità in un luogo dove gli umani non avessero mai possibilità di trovarle, né i marinidi interesse a leggerle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d320e117-ae31-456b-924a-e8b29f746137\', \'multiverseId\': 452049}, \'multiverseid\': 452049}, {\'name\': \'印章持ちのヒトデ\', \'text\': \'{T}：占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヒトデ\', \'flavor\': \'クルフィックスは人間たちに関する最も恐ろしい予言を、人間たちに見つかることもなく、またトリトンがそれを読むほどの興味を持つことのない場所に隠した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51199c6-9cec-4b61-aa7f-9ea554b35332\', \'multiverseId\': 452297}, \'multiverseid\': 452297}, {\'name\': \'Estrela-do-mar Rúnica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Estrela-do-mar\', \'flavor\': \'Crufix escondeu as profecias mais sinistras sobre a humanidade onde os humanos nunca as encontrariam e os talassidos não se preocupariam em ler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b019f46b-f18a-432d-ab17-2c3c753de309\', \'multiverseId\': 452545}, \'multiverseid\': 452545}]', "[{'name': 'Simic-Wachstumskammer', 'text': 'Die Simic-Wachstumskammer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Simic-Wachstumskammer ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451485&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2868cf09-08b6-4af4-8c2a-6a42aa7455e2', 'multiverseId': 451485}, 'multiverseid': 451485}, {'name': 'Cámara de crecimiento simic', 'text': 'La Cámara de crecimiento simic entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cámara de crecimiento simic entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451733&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93501d4d-97b7-45f7-b746-70669f399fc6', 'multiverseId': 451733}, 'multiverseid': 451733}, {'name': 'Chambre de croissance des Simic', 'text': 'La Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451981&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a3e7715-f91f-48bd-88de-80f926fdf7ad', 'multiverseId': 451981}, 'multiverseid': 451981}, {'name': 'Camera di Coltura Simic', 'text': 'La Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452229&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed16efe0-b39e-4da9-8bb0-112cef32c1ac', 'multiverseId': 452229}, 'multiverseid': 452229}, {'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452477&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf0f2845-a639-4268-8ee1-addb21951f41', 'multiverseId': 452477}, 'multiverseid': 452477}, {'name': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic', 'text': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Câmara de Crescimento Simic entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452725&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17319c37-83d3-415f-a692-4432e3163f5a', 'multiverseId': 452725}, 'multiverseid': 452725}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sinnbild der Vorstellungskraft\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit.\\nKreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, verlieren Flugfähigkeit und können Flugfähigkeit weder haben noch erhalten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Verkörpert es nicht alles, wonach wir uns sehnen?"\\n—Prokopios, Astronom von Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33f5c52-efce-43a4-84b9-862527e02acc\', \'multiverseId\': 451284}, \'multiverseid\': 451284}, {\'name\': \'Prototipo de imaginación\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de volar.\\nLas criaturas que controlan tus oponentes pierden la habilidad de volar y no pueden tener ni ganar esa habilidad.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso no es la encarnación de nuestras aspiraciones?".\\n—Prokopios, astrónomo de Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b934a5-9e1a-445e-a137-ae27d30dff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 451532}, \'multiverseid\': 451532}, {\'name\': "Archétype de l\'imagination", \'text\': \'Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont le vol.\\nLes créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent le vol et ne peuvent pas avoir ou acquérir le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« N\'est-ce pas là l\'incarnation de nos aspirations ? »\\n—Prokopios, astronome de Mélétis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26930ba4-2889-41e0-904b-1341fe5b9f75\', \'multiverseId\': 451780}, \'multiverseid\': 451780}, {\'name\': "Archetipo dell\'Immaginazione", \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno volare.\\nLe creature controllate dai tuoi avversari perdono volare e non possono avere volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è forse l\\\'incarnazione delle nostre aspirazioni?"\\n—Filastrio, astronomo di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a710462f-2c82-41c0-8948-bfd6b6ea6839\', \'multiverseId\': 452028}, \'multiverseid\': 452028}, {\'name\': \'空想の元型\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーは飛行を失い、飛行を得ることも持つこともできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「それは我々の願望が具象化したものではないのか？」\\n――メレティスの天文学者、プロコピオス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e31e2cb-f782-4097-b126-713381819895\', \'multiverseId\': 452276}, \'multiverseid\': 452276}, {\'name\': \'Arquétipo da Imaginação\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm voar.\\nAs criaturas que seus oponentes controlam perdem voar e não podem ter nem ganhar voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é a encarnação de nossas aspirações?"\\n— Procópio, astrônomo de Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7972e058-75b4-4d9e-b2b1-1b2a40a9474b\', \'multiverseId\': 452524}, \'multiverseid\': 452524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sitz der Synode\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Lumengrid, Sitz des Wissensvorrats, Quelle der vedalkischen Geheimnisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e6cc97-ea96-4bbf-9c2a-d6153b78f9f4\', \'multiverseId\': 451481}, \'multiverseid\': 451481}, {\'name\': \'Sede del sínodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Lúmengrid, sede del Pozo del conocimiento, fuente del saber vedalken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf421a82-44b0-439b-8ec8-c1122f9ce4aa\', \'multiverseId\': 451729}, \'multiverseid\': 451729}, {\'name\': \'Siège du Synode\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Lumengrid, site du Sauvoir de Connaissance, source arcane des vedalkens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451977&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da01256-74ed-4437-b671-2e0951bee853\', \'multiverseId\': 451977}, \'multiverseid\': 451977}, {\'name\': \'Sede del Sinodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lumengrid, sito della Pozza della Conoscenza, la fonte dell\'arcana sapienza dei vedalken.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de1fd71-6377-4cbe-9b78-bccf7465f472\', \'multiverseId\': 452225}, \'multiverseid\': 452225}, {\'name\': \'教議会の座席\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'ルーメングリッド、ヴィダルケンの秘儀の源である、知恵の池のある場所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5a1eec-9e39-4ef4-ab85-84e7d95ef637\', \'multiverseId\': 452473}, \'multiverseid\': 452473}, {\'name\': \'Assento do Sínodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Lumengrid, local do Reservatório do Conhecimento, fonte da sabedoria misteriosa dos vedalkeanos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e10ecd8d-d693-4fb9-81c4-b7d2e4856ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 452721}, \'multiverseid\': 452721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenaufgangsspiegelung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher zwei zusätzliche Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nur die Magie der Sylvok kann die Vollkommenheit eines Sonnenaufgangs über Mirrodin wiedergeben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62746aab-7d60-4675-a3d6-ca13139895f5\', \'multiverseId\': 451342}, \'multiverseid\': 451342}, {\'name\': \'Reflejo del amanecer\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega dos manás adicionales de cualquier combinación de colores.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Solo la magia sylvok podía capturar la perfección de un amanecer en Mirrodin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e1391a-0f62-4167-bcab-11af92683b76\', \'multiverseId\': 451590}, \'multiverseid\': 451590}, {\'name\': "Reflets de l\'aube", \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute deux manas supplémentaires de la combinaison de manas colorés de son choix.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Seule la magie des Sylvoks parvenait à restituer la perfection d\'une aube sur Mirrodin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d83ae346-636c-470a-a184-48b0d83ca384\', \'multiverseId\': 451838}, \'multiverseid\': 451838}, {\'name\': "Riflesso dell\'Alba", \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge due mana addizionali in qualsiasi combinazione di colori.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Solo la magia Silvaca può realmente catturare la perfezione di un\'alba di Mirrodin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04099464-0700-4af5-a082-5415fe3a32c0\', \'multiverseId\': 452086}, \'multiverseid\': 452086}, {\'name\': \'夜明けの反射\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で望む色の組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'ミラディンの夜明けの完全さを受け止められるのは、シルヴォクの魔法だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd42b06-6759-4ccd-a7b4-7ac7b7de6799\', \'multiverseId\': 452334}, \'multiverseid\': 452334}, {\'name\': \'Reflexo da Aurora\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona dois manas extras em qualquer combinação de cores.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Apenas a magia dos Silvoques seria realmente capaz de captar a perfeição de um nascer do sol em Mirrodin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d47dc62-be7f-4edc-b1a3-c30c31619e90\', \'multiverseId\': 452582}, \'multiverseid\': 452582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb645eb1-07b8-4813-9ffc-32f0c679ea9b\', \'multiverseId\': 451425}, \'multiverseid\': 451425}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac397d87-5b1d-412a-9b9b-dedf2537431b\', \'multiverseId\': 451673}, \'multiverseid\': 451673}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451921&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b8ff2f-c3d1-4090-865e-1b3af3d2a19e\', \'multiverseId\': 451921}, \'multiverseid\': 451921}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e401fcfa-551c-40ac-acd2-35a75b638be2\', \'multiverseId\': 452169}, \'multiverseid\': 452169}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'781b76d0-9802-4db1-8382-7e52459ce9e9\', \'multiverseId\': 452417}, \'multiverseid\': 452417}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdida no tempo está a arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d73e7a8-1a24-45ad-8341-2e1c2bd72316\', \'multiverseId\': 452665}, \'multiverseid\': 452665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenuhr des Sehers\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schatten wandert auf den Gipfel zu. Ich schätze, dass wir bald die wahre Dunkelheit kennenlernen werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45526f10-e1d6-4c08-a57d-ca6226d508d6\', \'multiverseId\': 451424}, \'multiverseid\': 451424}, {\'name\': \'Reloj de sol del vidente\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La sombra va hacia el cenit. Predigo que pronto veremos la verdadera dimensión de la oscuridad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99534ee6-3897-4398-82de-b77f2817249b\', \'multiverseId\': 451672}, \'multiverseid\': 451672}, {\'name\': \'Cadran solaire du voyant\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ombre monte à son zénith. Je prédis que bientôt, nous connaîtrons la véritable mesure des ténèbres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1d6637-ce2e-46fa-a866-a6a749486e75\', \'multiverseId\': 451920}, \'multiverseid\': 451920}, {\'name\': \'Meridiana del Veggente\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le ombre si stanno muovendo verso la vetta. Immagino che presto ci renderemo conto della vera potenza dell\\\'oscurità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17370d60-3d2f-4e50-bae0-85463eec26e0\', \'multiverseId\': 452168}, \'multiverseid\': 452168}, {\'name\': \'予見者の日時計\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「影は頂上を指しています。おそらくもうすぐ真の闇を見ることになるでしょうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b881fa-fb65-43df-b74f-8de0d31d3fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 452416}, \'multiverseid\': 452416}, {\'name\': \'Meridiana do Vidente\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A sombra viaja na direção do ápice. Eu prevejo que logo veremos a verdadeira dimensão da escuridão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d977336-8abe-4c12-8176-f2026b4dc5db\', \'multiverseId\': 452664}, \'multiverseid\': 452664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphinx der Jwar-Insel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nVerhüllt (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nDu kannst dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen. (Du kannst dies jederzeit tun.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e5da3f-511f-4e4b-a536-456d00112564\', \'multiverseId\': 451306}, \'multiverseid\': 451306}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge de la isla Jwar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nVelo. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nPuedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Puedes hacer esto en cualquier momento.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e258a43-f044-4393-be8f-957c35724a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 451554}, \'multiverseid\': 451554}, {\'name\': "Sphinx de l\'île de Jwar", \'text\': \'Vol\\nLinceul (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nVous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Vous pouvez faire ceci à tout moment.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6343a3c0-1dce-4af7-ab0c-9e353d2f923d\', \'multiverseId\': 451802}, \'multiverseid\': 451802}, {\'name\': "Sfinge dell\'Isola Jwar", \'text\': \'Volare\\nVelo (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nPuoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Puoi farlo in qualsiasi momento.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70bae155-94da-402c-ba44-1a16ec7e1507\', \'multiverseId\': 452050}, \'multiverseid\': 452050}, {\'name\': \'ジュワー島のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n被覆（このクリーチャーは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見てもよい。（これはいつでも行ってよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84205f52-9edf-4c7e-878a-72f5d463ee1e\', \'multiverseId\': 452298}, \'multiverseid\': 452298}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge da Ilha de Jwar\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nManto (Esta criatura não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nVocê pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório. (Você pode fazer isso a qualquer momento.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19938186-7f40-461e-8af4-7df21d4c471c\', \'multiverseId\': 452546}, \'multiverseid\': 452546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphinx von Uthuun\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Sphinx von Uthuun ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt diese Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm die Karten des einen Haufens auf deine Hand und lege die anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22fd28f-17cb-4ed3-86b8-ad17da0eb089\', \'multiverseId\': 451307}, \'multiverseid\': 451307}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge de Uthuun\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Esfinge de Uthuun entre al campo de batalla, muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547ae5d7-c223-4ea8-940b-8db1b72395cb\', \'multiverseId\': 451555}, \'multiverseid\': 451555}, {\'name\': "Sphinx d\'Uthuün", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Sphinx d\'Uthuün arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5385908f-6783-4bb4-bdeb-d9e52ecaa7cf\', \'multiverseId\': 451803}, \'multiverseid\': 451803}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge di Uthuun\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando la Sfinge di Uthuun entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cfa1eed-95c1-4cf9-9b25-f416fc9a6ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 452051}, \'multiverseid\': 452051}, {\'name\': \'ウスーンのスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nウスーンのスフィンクスが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。対戦相手１人は、それらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2cb7f5-5e01-4547-8c5d-7d29b8eef446\', \'multiverseId\': 452299}, \'multiverseid\': 452299}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge de Uthuun\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Esfinge de Uthuun entrar no campo de batalha, revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Um oponente separa aqueles cards em dois montes. Você coloca um monte na própria mão e o outro no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab23ed54-5dfb-47b9-b9da-a2a76bda0adb\', \'multiverseId\': 452547}, \'multiverseid\': 452547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc8ebb4-4276-46de-9c5d-c60ebd5d541d\', \'multiverseId\': 451403}, \'multiverseid\': 451403}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eada26d-33d4-459d-9697-00e133d6ba55\', \'multiverseId\': 451651}, \'multiverseid\': 451651}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccfbc5a0-5278-4e3d-9e58-f2330ae277b6\', \'multiverseId\': 451899}, \'multiverseid\': 451899}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88351bdd-bbe9-4cb2-a136-8482de3a1c59\', \'multiverseId\': 452147}, \'multiverseid\': 452147}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c89050-d12c-45f9-bbc2-25385be155cb\', \'multiverseId\': 452395}, \'multiverseid\': 452395}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se harmoniza com a essência de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197af12a-d4bf-47aa-b591-007a7c9874e1\', \'multiverseId\': 452643}, \'multiverseid\': 452643}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spiegelwerk\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderes Nichtspielsteinartefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des Artefakts ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gesichter von Geths Leichenzerrern ähneln sich verblüffend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451414&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b26a326-a4d2-4162-abbf-65e6c4a79bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 451414}, \'multiverseid\': 451414}, {\'name\': \'Espejería\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro artefacto que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha que es una copia de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los rostros de los dragadores de cuerpos de Geth son perturbadoramente similares.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19a2159-721e-4dd5-aaa1-0483c9fff4e5\', \'multiverseId\': 451662}, \'multiverseid\': 451662}, {\'name\': \'Chantier de miroirs\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre artefact non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les visages des dragueurs de cadavres de Geth sont étrangement familiers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c54e4d6-77a8-4d54-aaa8-ae9c828460b8\', \'multiverseId\': 451910}, \'multiverseid\': 451910}, {\'name\': \'Congegno Specchiante\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un altro artefatto non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Le facce dei draga-cadaveri di Geth presentano una somiglianza inquietante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da7a7e3-0bd3-4a0c-b057-92445ef3e689\', \'multiverseId\': 452158}, \'multiverseid\': 452158}, {\'name\': \'鏡操り\', \'text\': \'トークンでない他のアーティファクトが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのアーティファクトのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ゲスの死体浚いの顔は気味悪いほど互いに似ている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c787b92-a12c-4ea8-9832-ffb606ae2405\', \'multiverseId\': 452406}, \'multiverseid\': 452406}, {\'name\': \'Engrenagem de Espelhos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro artefato que não seja uma ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você poderá pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquele artefato.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'As faces dos escavadores de cadáveres de Geth são inquietantemente semelhantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7946cb41-f363-4fe2-8376-463d5a62eef0\', \'multiverseId\': 452654}, \'multiverseid\': 452654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Splitter-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du einen 1/1 blauen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Ob es mechanischen oder biologischen Ursprungs ist, das Leben findet immer ein Mittel, um sich fortzupflanzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451304&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d4da9a-43f3-47bd-9d06-a0e9bf8205b2\', \'multiverseId\': 451304}, \'multiverseid\': 451304}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge fragmentadora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura artefacto que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes crear una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Ya sea mecánica o biológica, la vida encuentra maneras de autopropagarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6870c52-b13b-4cc5-9303-30fe04bce795\', \'multiverseId\': 451552}, \'multiverseid\': 451552}, {\'name\': \'Sphinge écailleuse\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 bleue Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Mécanique ou biologique, la vie trouve toujours le moyen de se propager.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5a7058-c65c-44e6-8d89-c2e973e1525c\', \'multiverseId\': 451800}, \'multiverseid\': 451800}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Frammentata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura artefatto che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi creare una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Che sia meccanica o biologica, la vita trova sempre il modo di propagarsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6a07ac4-8130-4556-b388-8bdb9d9a5bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 452048}, \'multiverseid\': 452048}, {\'name\': \'破片撒きのスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは飛行を持つ青の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'機械だろうと生物だろうと、生命というものは増殖の道を見つけるものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b9ed6b8-9195-48eb-a5d9-0988eaf1b0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 452296}, \'multiverseid\': 452296}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge Fragmentável\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura artefato que você controla causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura artefato azul 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Seja de forma mecânica ou biológica, a vida sempre encontra um modo de se propagar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24ca961-0b01-4274-a636-88d536c964e9\', \'multiverseId\': 452544}, \'multiverseid\': 452544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spross des Hollerwalds\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Lebensverknüpfung\\nZaubersprüche, die du wirkst und die den Spross des Hollerwalds als Ziel haben, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nZaubersprüche, die deine Gegner wirken und die den Spross des Hollerwalds als Ziel haben, kosten beim Wirken {2} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sonnengestrüppdruiden glauben, dass jedes Leben in seinem Herzen beginnt und unter seinen Hufen endet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bd0375-1a40-48dc-b172-cc536396f61d\', \'multiverseId\': 451380}, \'multiverseid\': 451380}, {\'name\': \'Vástago de Bosque Viejo\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, vínculo vital.\\nTe cuesta {2} menos lanzar hechizos que hagan objetivo al Vástago de Bosque Viejo.\\nA tus oponentes les cuesta {2} más lanzar hechizos que hagan objetivo al Vástago de Bosque Viejo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Los druidas de Zarza Solar creen que toda vida comienza en su corazón y termina bajo sus cascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdc0b5a-1278-45e6-8c50-35aaa81e8399\', \'multiverseId\': 451628}, \'multiverseid\': 451628}, {\'name\': \'Scion de Boisaïeul\', \'text\': \'Piétinement, lien de vie\\nLes sorts que vous lancez qui ciblent le Scion de Boisaïeul coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\\nLes sorts que vos adversaires lancent qui ciblent le Scion de Boisaïeul coûtent {2} de plus à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Les druides de Solronce croient que toute vie commence dans son cœur et qu\'elle se termine sous ses sabots.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9a442a-e6d7-4a6b-9555-0bb8a0184698\', \'multiverseId\': 451876}, \'multiverseid\': 451876}, {\'name\': \'Rampollo di Boscoantico\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, legame vitale\\nLe magie che lanci e che bersagliano il Rampollo di Boscoantico costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nLe magie che i tuoi avversari lanciano e che bersagliano il Rampollo di Boscoantico costano {2} in più per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'I druidi di Rovoassolato credono che ogni vita cominci nel suo cuore e termini sotto i suoi zoccoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83df689-2507-4939-862a-dd22016a7262\', \'multiverseId\': 452124}, \'multiverseid\': 452124}, {\'name\': \'老木の末裔\', \'text\': \'トランプル、絆魂\\nあなたが老木の末裔を対象として呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n対戦相手が老木の末裔を対象として呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'陽茨のドルイドは、あらゆる生命がその心臓から生まれ、その蹄の下で終わると信じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7a5f86-2497-4b5d-ba79-c81816cb520a\', \'multiverseId\': 452372}, \'multiverseid\': 452372}, {\'name\': \'Rebento da Matavelha\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, vínculo com a vida\\nAs mágicas que você conjura com Rebento da Matavelha como alvo custam {2} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nAs mágicas que seus oponentes conjuram com Rebento da Matavelha como alvo custam {2} a mais para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Os druidas Sarçassol creem que toda vida começa em seu coração e termina sob seus cascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57241dc8-4f13-498d-acc9-83ec74ce0a29\', \'multiverseId\': 452620}, \'multiverseid\': 452620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steinige Teergrube\', \'text\': \'Die Steinige Teergrube kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere die Steinige Teergrube: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c9260fc-4edb-473e-a5f6-e288b304639f\', \'multiverseId\': 451477}, \'multiverseid\': 451477}, {\'name\': \'Lodazal rocoso\', \'text\': \'El Lodazal rocoso entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Lodazal rocoso: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Pantano o Montaña, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb6237b-3da3-4bbb-bda5-179090a064f7\', \'multiverseId\': 451725}, \'multiverseid\': 451725}, {\'name\': "Fosse d\'huile de roche", \'text\': "La Fosse d\'huile de roche arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Fosse d\'huile de roche : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de marais ou de montagne, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451973&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8445bc-0ced-405f-89d2-72140b35a616\', \'multiverseId\': 451973}, \'multiverseid\': 451973}, {\'name\': \'Cava di Rocce Catramose\', \'text\': \'La Cava di Rocce Catramose entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Cava di Rocce Catramose: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Palude o Montagna, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc6f29f-fd12-4bad-845e-44bbb7986deb\', \'multiverseId\': 452221}, \'multiverseid\': 452221}, {\'name\': \'岩山のタール坑\', \'text\': \'岩山のタール坑はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 岩山のタール坑を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから沼か山であるカード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938e45c1-516a-4c59-8138-f10a559df9bb\', \'multiverseId\': 452469}, \'multiverseid\': 452469}, {\'name\': \'Poço de Piche Rochoso\', \'text\': \'Poço de Piche Rochoso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}, sacrifique Poço de Piche Rochoso: Procure um card de Pântano ou Montanha em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9572c87a-b234-40ad-af78-435ceedb4a92\', \'multiverseId\': 452717}, \'multiverseid\': 452717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stille Weite\', \'text\': \'Die Stille Weite kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Trotz der chaotischen Turbulenz und der Zerstörung durch die Eldrazi ist Zendikar eine Welt von atemberaubender Schönheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345da790-bed8-467e-8c24-c312aeb21036\', \'multiverseId\': 451492}, \'multiverseid\': 451492}, {\'name\': \'Extensión tranquila\', \'text\': \'La Extensión tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar del caos de la Turbulencia y la devastación de los Eldrazi, Zendikar es un mundo de una belleza impresionante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97e8258b-72aa-44f0-b592-fbb96d45015a\', \'multiverseId\': 451740}, \'multiverseid\': 451740}, {\'name\': \'Immensité tranquille\', \'text\': "L\'Immensité tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Malgré le chaos du Roulis et la dévastation causée par les Eldrazi, Zendikar est un monde dont la beauté vous coupera le souffle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451988&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7758f03-d684-4a83-a6c3-980652e03a23\', \'multiverseId\': 451988}, \'multiverseid\': 451988}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Tranquilla\', \'text\': \'La Distesa Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante il caos del Torbido e la devastazione degli Eldrazi, Zendikar è un mondo la cui bellezza mozza il fiato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5fac0d-2a85-4f35-81f9-cd30b742fbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 452236}, \'multiverseid\': 452236}, {\'name\': \'平穏なる広野\', \'text\': \'平穏なる広野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'乱動の混乱とエルドラージによる破壊の後もなお、ゼンディカーは美しい世界であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caf0b9a8-0efe-454c-bf37-053711991a18\', \'multiverseId\': 452484}, \'multiverseid\': 452484}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Tranquila\', \'text\': \'Vastidão Tranquila entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A despeito do caos do Turbilhão e da devastação dos Eldrazi, Zendikar é um mundo cuja beleza é de tirar o fôlego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0468a7a8-f0c8-4778-a7f5-7f142964802c\', \'multiverseId\': 452732}, \'multiverseid\': 452732}]', "[{'name': 'Stilles Dickicht', 'text': 'Das Stille Dickicht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\nUmwandlung {G} ({G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451493&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7db1752-c4b9-447d-a5a4-4b4dbba152c6', 'multiverseId': 451493}, 'multiverseid': 451493}, {'name': 'Maleza tranquila', 'text': 'La Maleza tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\nCiclo {G}. ({G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451741&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01fc5611-cfa7-415e-b713-6228ee7b3fbe', 'multiverseId': 451741}, 'multiverseid': 451741}, {'name': 'Halliers tranquilles', 'text': 'Les Halliers tranquilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\nRecyclage {G} ({G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451989&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daf2f315-a39c-487a-bbe1-c1f11ebb4cf3', 'multiverseId': 451989}, 'multiverseid': 451989}, {'name': 'Boschetto Tranquillo', 'text': 'Il Boschetto Tranquillo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\nCiclo {G} ({G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452237&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35cf696e-12b1-4c30-bee2-84ac8decf557', 'multiverseId': 452237}, 'multiverseid': 452237}, {'name': '平穏な茂み', 'text': '平穏な茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\nサイクリング{G}（{G}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452485&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af26a72d-c576-475d-96d8-bee2f1d05e08', 'multiverseId': 452485}, 'multiverseid': 452485}, {'name': 'Bosque Sereno', 'text': 'Bosque Sereno entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\nReciclar {G} ({G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452733&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6501655b-f856-4eb6-92e3-d336337dee59', 'multiverseId': 452733}, 'multiverseid': 452733}]", '[{\'name\': \'Streben nach Wissen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab, es sei denn, du wirfst eine Artefaktkarte ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Um etwas komplett zu verstehen, musst du dich hineinversetzen. Der Trick ist, auch den Rückweg zu finden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408895b7-98c5-4d48-ad11-4b7fdd4baa72\', \'multiverseId\': 451309}, \'multiverseid\': 451309}, {\'name\': \'Sed de conocimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas. Luego descarta dos cartas a menos que descartes una carta de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para conocer algo realmente, debes convertirte en ello. El truco es no perderte en el proceso".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a949c1c-8dd3-4a2a-ab46-bd0376b5f075\', \'multiverseId\': 451557}, \'multiverseid\': 451557}, {\'name\': \'Soif de connaissance\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes. Défaussez-vous ensuite de deux cartes à moins que vous ne vous défaussiez d\'une carte d\'artefact.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pour véritablement connaître quelque chose, il faut devenir cette chose. L\'important, c\'est de ne pas s\'y perdre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a74810-81b7-4f8b-b503-e7081d3cd060\', \'multiverseId\': 451805}, \'multiverseid\': 451805}, {\'name\': \'Sete di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte. Poi scarta due carte a meno che non scarti una carta artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per conoscere realmente qualcosa, devi diventarlo. Il trucco sta nel non perdersi nel farlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ace2c50-a45b-4550-880f-64aa65653bff\', \'multiverseId\': 452053}, \'multiverseid\': 452053}, {\'name\': \'知識の渇望\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引く。その後、あなたがアーティファクト・カードを１枚捨てないかぎり、カードを２枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「何かを真に知るには、お前はそれにならねばならぬ。そのためのコツは、その中で自分を失わぬことだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2111be3-0bd7-4c6c-ae3c-63e306b1a724\', \'multiverseId\': 452301}, \'multiverseid\': 452301}, {\'name\': \'Sede por Conhecimento\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards. Em seguida, descarte dois cards, a menos que você descarte um card de artefato.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Para compreender alguma coisa verdadeiramente, é preciso tornar-se ela. O truque é não se perder no processo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a4614f-965a-45c1-91aa-39184061f7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 452549}, \'multiverseid\': 452549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stummer Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Stumme Wachposten angreift, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'Er dient einer erhabenen Gerechtigkeit, die über den Launen der Götter steht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87204b44-f150-4c9b-be13-d5764665a41d\', \'multiverseId\': 451278}, \'multiverseid\': 451278}, {\'name\': \'Centinela silencioso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Centinela silencioso ataque, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Sirve a una justicia mayor que los caprichos de los dioses.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21da6e62-60b1-4960-a4ec-265473086de4\', \'multiverseId\': 451526}, \'multiverseid\': 451526}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle silencieuse\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sentinelle silencieuse attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': \'Elle sert une justice supérieure aux caprices des dieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7802c9cb-dcee-4842-a66a-34a85e225dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 451774}, \'multiverseid\': 451774}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella Silente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sentinella Silente attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'È al servizio di una giustizia al di sopra dei capricci degli dei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87c4ba6-4d59-4514-a45d-df5439cb51f6\', \'multiverseId\': 452022}, \'multiverseid\': 452022}, {\'name\': \'沈黙の歩哨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n沈黙の歩哨が攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地からエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'それは神々の気まぐれを超越した正義に仕える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e52287-39e0-43a9-b18d-563eb1a48cab\', \'multiverseId\': 452270}, \'multiverseid\': 452270}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela Silenciosa\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Sentinela Silenciosa ataca, você pode devolver o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Cumpre uma justiça mais elevada que os caprichos dos deuses.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d236acaa-c6e4-4e4f-b365-a5e66a650bac\', \'multiverseId\': 452518}, \'multiverseid\': 452518}]', "[{'name': 'Sturzbachklippen', 'text': 'Die Sturzbachklippen kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Sturzbachklippen ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451487&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '452008ba-3b91-42b3-bebe-81cbf216ed85', 'multiverseId': 451487}, 'multiverseid': 451487}, {'name': 'Acantilados aguasraudas', 'text': 'Los Acantilados aguasraudas entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Acantilados aguasraudas entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451735&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '568ee7ea-b900-4bff-922b-b963b25a3081', 'multiverseId': 451735}, 'multiverseid': 451735}, {'name': 'Falaises des eaux vives', 'text': 'Les Falaises des eaux vives arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Falaises des eaux vives arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451983&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d42ffc4-7bed-4989-ab53-ece8870c914e', 'multiverseId': 451983}, 'multiverseid': 451983}, {'name': 'Rupi di Rapidacque', 'text': 'Le Rupi di Rapidacque entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Rupi di Rapidacque entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452231&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '584c0161-9c6e-49c0-9a5d-188704043202', 'multiverseId': 452231}, 'multiverseid': 452231}, {'name': '急流の崖', 'text': '急流の崖はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n急流の崖が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452479&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '870a08b5-6eae-4c75-bf7a-f92c3dccdc1a', 'multiverseId': 452479}, 'multiverseid': 452479}, {'name': 'Cordilheiras das Cascatas', 'text': 'Cordilheiras das Cascatas entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Cordilheiras das Cascatas entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452727&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc399741-37ad-4029-92b8-c83b923312ff', 'multiverseId': 452727}, 'multiverseid': 452727}]", '[{\'name\': \'Stählerner Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}: Der Stählerne Höllendrache erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}: Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X, die kein Land ist und deren Beherrscher in diesem Zug vom Stählernen Höllendrachen Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a47da9a-0e8c-41d7-8e9b-86b24c1b8c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 451427}, \'multiverseid\': 451427}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de acero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}: El Engendro de acero obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{X}: Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de X cuyo controlador haya recibido daño de combate del Engendro de acero este turno. Activa esta habilidad solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'860c551b-e4d5-40e6-ae88-e496a2690a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 451675}, \'multiverseid\': 451675}, {\'name\': "Escouflenfer d\'acier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{2} : L\'Escouflenfer d\'acier gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X} : Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain avec un coût converti de mana de X dont le contrôleur a subi des blessures de combat par l\'Escouflenfer d\'acier ce tour-ci. N\'activez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ad629b-ea24-4103-9bef-acce9b55dea2\', \'multiverseId\': 451923}, \'multiverseid\': 451923}, {\'name\': "Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio", \'text\': "Volare\\n{2}: Il Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con costo di mana convertito pari a X al cui controllore è stato inflitto danno da combattimento dal Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio in questo turno. Attiva questa abilità solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d77c89dd-f56c-4c8f-a371-8246e928144a\', \'multiverseId\': 452171}, \'multiverseid\': 452171}, {\'name\': \'鋼のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、鋼のヘルカイトは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}：このターンに鋼のヘルカイトによって戦闘ダメージを与えられたプレイヤーがコントロールしていて、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸで、土地でない各パーマネントをそれぞれ破壊する。この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c9737b-0156-429b-828e-bca51e75a125\', \'multiverseId\': 452419}, \'multiverseid\': 452419}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Aço\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}: Dragão Avérneo de Aço recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\n{X}: Destrua cada permanente que não seja terreno com custo de mana convertido igual a X cujo controlador tenha sofrido dano de combate de Dragão Avérneo de Aço neste turno. Ative esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8105b421-6498-4901-9c88-f1dd9d2d7d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 452667}, \'multiverseid\': 452667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stürmischer Äther\', \'text\': \'Bringe sechs bleibende Karten deiner Wahl, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In Erwartung des Angriffs fand sich die Bürgerwehr auf dem Hauptplatz ein, doch die Riesen kamen nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8de3ff-6e62-4af5-a0d7-d29a39d63aea\', \'multiverseId\': 451283}, \'multiverseid\': 451283}, {\'name\': \'Vendaval del éter\', \'text\': \'Regresa seis permanentes objetivo que no sean tierra a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La milicia formó en la plaza central esperando la embestida, pero los gigantes no llegaron a cargar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87dd7eb-d566-47a8-8a7a-e684997a0763\', \'multiverseId\': 451531}, \'multiverseid\': 451531}, {\'name\': "Bourrasque d\'Éther", \'text\': \'Renvoyez six permanents non-terrains ciblés dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "En prévision de l\'assaut, la milice s\'était postée en formation sur la place centrale, mais les géants avaient disparu bien avant d\'y arriver.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c920218b-5c6e-4026-bef0-6cd9cb6fd176\', \'multiverseId\': 451779}, \'multiverseid\': 451779}, {\'name\': \'Burrasca Eterea\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare sei permanenti non terra bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "La milizia si dispose in formazione nella piazza centrale in attesa dell\'assalto, ma i giganti non la raggiunsero mai.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9570265-f972-409c-a2d0-63897b0b72fb\', \'multiverseId\': 452027}, \'multiverseid\': 452027}, {\'name\': \'霊気の突風\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント６つを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'猛攻を待つべく中央広場に集合した民兵たちであったが、巨人たちはそこに到達することはなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf7baed-5a4a-4a24-8ba1-7dff4ae68ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 452275}, \'multiverseid\': 452275}, {\'name\': \'Vendaval Etéreo\', \'text\': \'Devolva seis permanentes alvo que não sejam terrenos para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A milícia se posicionou na praça central à espera da investida, mas os gigantes nunca chegaram até lá.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7293f12-33f6-4c51-9678-d7b4ba19c227\', \'multiverseId\': 452523}, \'multiverseid\': 452523}]', "[{'name': 'Sumpf', 'type': 'Standardland — Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451502&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cf0f542-f379-445b-8bec-6928f55b0829', 'multiverseId': 451502}, 'multiverseid': 451502}, {'name': 'Pantano', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Pantano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451750&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b70633ea-1636-403d-988b-1b1197ed02d2', 'multiverseId': 451750}, 'multiverseid': 451750}, {'name': 'Marais', 'type': 'Terrain de base : marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451998&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7570c8f3-251f-436d-9565-903ccee4f3df', 'multiverseId': 451998}, 'multiverseid': 451998}, {'name': 'Palude', 'type': 'Terra Base — Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452246&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fe83df6-d577-431b-8a35-60a7b922e19f', 'multiverseId': 452246}, 'multiverseid': 452246}, {'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452494&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec97b7ac-531b-4268-9e0c-fe378360459e', 'multiverseId': 452494}, 'multiverseid': 452494}, {'name': 'Pântano', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Pântano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452742&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a3c4bcb-5826-49be-be49-c4c700a405a9', 'multiverseId': 452742}, 'multiverseid': 452742}]", "[{'name': 'Sumpf', 'type': 'Standardland — Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451503&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2618e232-81b9-4119-8409-6291d1949919', 'multiverseId': 451503}, 'multiverseid': 451503}, {'name': 'Pantano', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Pantano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451751&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '553a2ed0-bf3f-4287-8f0c-83fee004404c', 'multiverseId': 451751}, 'multiverseid': 451751}, {'name': 'Marais', 'type': 'Terrain de base : marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451999&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '166f7a8e-39d9-476b-8e3e-4fe2be7c2147', 'multiverseId': 451999}, 'multiverseid': 451999}, {'name': 'Palude', 'type': 'Terra Base — Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452247&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb2b06cf-04c3-46e9-83e3-453e2f4eadb0', 'multiverseId': 452247}, 'multiverseid': 452247}, {'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452495&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3187c97a-3f08-48dc-bd38-b2732aea194f', 'multiverseId': 452495}, 'multiverseid': 452495}, {'name': 'Pântano', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Pântano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452743&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '976084c6-ec9a-4338-b03e-17f3a734bf94', 'multiverseId': 452743}, 'multiverseid': 452743}]", "[{'name': 'Sumpf', 'type': 'Standardland — Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451504&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5aa9c619-fd89-4b4a-bc0f-792feafd5b64', 'multiverseId': 451504}, 'multiverseid': 451504}, {'name': 'Pantano', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Pantano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451752&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f8f2ea8-00ff-4257-a34c-239f1ee7be4f', 'multiverseId': 451752}, 'multiverseid': 451752}, {'name': 'Marais', 'type': 'Terrain de base : marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452000&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '851b9c01-b21e-48b3-92c4-1a272cf7b7a0', 'multiverseId': 452000}, 'multiverseid': 452000}, {'name': 'Palude', 'type': 'Terra Base — Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452248&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf985ed8-eaaa-4274-8b38-6f01e4887b3b', 'multiverseId': 452248}, 'multiverseid': 452248}, {'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452496&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c142bd63-fe6c-4022-bc27-b80c27744a03', 'multiverseId': 452496}, 'multiverseid': 452496}, {'name': 'Pântano', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Pântano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452744&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9e9f77e-d223-4f11-92d8-4e1ddb07853b', 'multiverseId': 452744}, 'multiverseid': 452744}]", '[{\'name\': \'Säer der Zwietracht\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSowie der Säer der Zwietracht ins Spiel kommt, bestimme zwei Spieler.\\nImmer wenn einem der bestimmten Spieler Schaden zugefügt wird, verliert der andere bestimmte Spieler ebenfalls entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450679&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9a02ee-0c87-4a79-a47b-fc4e95943a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 450679}, \'multiverseid\': 450679}, {\'name\': \'Sembrador de discordia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEn cuanto el Sembrador de discordia entre al campo de batalla, elige dos jugadores.\\nSiempre que se haga daño a uno de los jugadores elegidos, el otro jugador elegido también pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adcfd672-559b-4d29-8653-1935e45cab14\', \'multiverseId\': 450738}, \'multiverseid\': 450738}, {\'name\': \'Semeur de discorde\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu moment où le Semeur de discorde arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez deux joueurs.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures sont infligées à l\'un des joueurs choisis, l\'autre joueur choisi perd aussi autant de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61496b5c-a374-4c76-bc99-265ca25e05ad\', \'multiverseId\': 450797}, \'multiverseid\': 450797}, {\'name\': \'Seminatore di Discordia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nMentre il Seminatore di Discordia entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli due giocatori.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a uno dei giocatori scelti, anche l\'altro giocatore scelto perde altrettanti punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11573c7f-a091-4dab-a838-e772bcd96ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 450856}, \'multiverseid\': 450856}, {\'name\': \'不和蒔き\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n不和蒔きが戦場に出るに際し、プレイヤー２人を選ぶ。\\nその選ばれたプレイヤーのうち１人にダメージが与えられるたび、その選ばれた他のプレイヤーはそれと同じ点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72b822c-0134-466a-a3d7-f0f94291ca32\', \'multiverseId\': 450915}, \'multiverseid\': 450915}, {\'name\': \'Semeador da Discórdia\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nConforme Semeador da Discórdia entrar no campo de batalha, escolha dois jogadores.\\nToda vez que é causado dano a um dos jogadores escolhidos, o outro jogador escolhido também perde uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7bbbcc-866d-4147-9e13-3320d7a7ec56\', \'multiverseId\': 450974}, \'multiverseid\': 450974}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tawnos, Urzas Lehrling\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{U}{R}, {T}: Kopiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst und die ein Artefakt als Quelle hat. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel gewählt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Meister ist überzeugt, dass man alles erreichen kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7106a39-6748-40f0-839c-837f71aee0e6\', \'multiverseId\': 450705}, \'multiverseid\': 450705}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, aprendiz de Urza\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{U}{R}, {T}: Copia la habilidad disparada o activada objetivo que controlas de una fuente artefacto. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden hacerse objetivo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi maestro cree que es posible conseguir cualquier cosa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d02c07-97c0-4e66-8674-2d1c1553a4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 450764}, \'multiverseid\': 450764}, {\'name\': "Tavnos, apprenti d\'Urza", \'text\': "Célérité\\n{U}{R}, {T} : Copiez une capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée que vous contrôlez d\'une source artefact. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon maître pense que tout est réalisable. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e6bee0-ee04-4e90-b096-642368072e16\', \'multiverseId\': 450823}, \'multiverseid\': 450823}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, Apprendista di Urza\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\n{U}{R}, {T}: Copia un\'abilità attivata o innescata bersaglio che controlli da una fonte artefatto. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia. (Le abilità di mana non possono essere bersagliate.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio maestro crede che qualsiasi cosa sia realizzabile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07c344a-5928-468c-8c9b-6234180d38da\', \'multiverseId\': 450882}, \'multiverseid\': 450882}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの弟子、タウノス\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{U}{R}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて、アーティファクトの発生源からの起動型か誘発型である能力１つを対象とし、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「我が師は、どんなことでも成し遂げられると信じてらっしゃいます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb59e376-dbc7-438b-8891-0844dd207971\', \'multiverseId\': 450941}, \'multiverseid\': 450941}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, Aprendiz de Urza\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{U}{R}, {T}: Copie a habilidade ativada ou desencadeada alvo que você controla de uma fonte artefato. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia. (As habilidades de mana não podem ser alvo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu mestre acredita que qualquer coisa é possível."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f082043e-147f-4a48-93e1-195b436274e2\', \'multiverseId\': 451000}, \'multiverseid\': 451000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Götter teilnahmslos werden, beginnen die Leute jeden anzubeten, der sie erhört."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d0b14b2-6b28-4108-8940-14f0a5c2dca1\', \'multiverseId\': 451488}, \'multiverseid\': 451488}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando los dioses caen en la apatía, la gente venera a quienquiera que responda a sus plegarias".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef69d468-0e2e-4f50-8479-330ea164c5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 451736}, \'multiverseid\': 451736}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand les dieux deviennent indifférents, les gens vénèrent quiconque répond à leurs supplications. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea42bcc1-5637-4864-887a-a486c193d706\', \'multiverseId\': 451984}, \'multiverseid\': 451984}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Dea Fasulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando gli dei sprofondano nell\\\'apatia, il popolo inizia a venerare chiunque risponda alle sue preghiere."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6768d869-f0f6-4944-a566-283a9f6a6647\', \'multiverseId\': 452232}, \'multiverseid\': 452232}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。この能力は、あなたが土地を５つ以上コントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が無関心となった時、人々は自分たちの嘆願を聞き入れてくれる者ならば何でも崇拝するようになるのね。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169f1996-6e81-4696-93c9-8750aa9fab81\', \'multiverseId\': 452480}, \'multiverseid\': 452480}, {\'name\': \'Templo do Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando os deuses se tornam apáticos, as pessoas adoram qualquer um que responda a suas súplicas."\\n— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab927e4-638b-4285-a38c-afc0a273c093\', \'multiverseId\': 452728}, \'multiverseid\': 452728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thantis die Kriegsweberin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Reichweite\\nKreaturen greifen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Thantis die Kriegsweberin.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ihrem Netz können nur wenige widerstehen. Ihre süßen Fäden entzünden ein Feuer in jedem Herzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450706&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a595195-7d08-4b40-a113-ed89284abf56\', \'multiverseId\': 450706}, \'multiverseid\': 450706}, {\'name\': \'Thantis, la Tejeguerras\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, alcance.\\nTodas las criaturas atacan cada combate si pueden.\\nSiempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Thantis, la Tejeguerras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Teje una red que pocos pueden resistir. Su dulce aroma desata el caos en todos los corazones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c6ac36b-6f20-425d-b166-fb9db56f0f58\', \'multiverseId\': 450765}, \'multiverseid\': 450765}, {\'name\': \'Thantis, la tisseuse de guerre\', \'text\': "Vigilance, portée\\nToutes les créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Thantis, la tisseuse de guerre.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : araignée\', \'flavor\': \'Elle tisse une toile à laquelle peu sont capables de résister. Son doux parfum sème le chaos dans les cœurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450824&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3430fcfb-4615-4bae-90e9-ac166d0ffde8\', \'multiverseId\': 450824}, \'multiverseid\': 450824}, {\'name\': \'Thantis, la Tessitrice di Guerra\', \'text\': \'Cautela, raggiungere\\nTutte le creature attaccano in ogni combattimento, se possono farlo.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Thantis, la Tessitrice di Guerra.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Tesse una tela a cui pochi sanno resistere. Il suo dolce aroma semina il caos in ogni cuore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a4dbba-b882-4ac9-bb7c-96433fdb0338\', \'multiverseId\': 450883}, \'multiverseid\': 450883}, {\'name\': \'戦争織り、タンティス\', \'text\': \'警戒、到達\\n各戦闘で、クリーチャーはすべて、可能なら攻撃する。\\nクリーチャー１体が、あなたかあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、戦争織り、タンティスの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'それが紡ぐ巣網に抵抗できる者は少ない。甘い香りが心に混沌を呼び込むのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0437fb4-04f7-4092-a413-83465dac6ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 450942}, \'multiverseid\': 450942}, {\'name\': \'Tântis, a Tecedora de Guerras\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, alcance\\nTodas as criaturas atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas.\\nToda vez que uma criatura atacar você ou um planeswalker que você controla, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Tântis, a Tecedora de Guerras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Poucos são os que resistem à sua teia. Seu doce aroma instiga o caos em todos os corações.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'008c2a6f-fd7c-4508-b762-2eebf55984ed\', \'multiverseId\': 451001}, \'multiverseid\': 451001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopter-Baugruppe\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du außer der Thopter-Baugruppe keine Thopter kontrollierst, bringe die Thopter-Baugruppe auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück und erzeuge fünf 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451429&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e1786c0-1297-401e-9944-8af39fb29256\', \'multiverseId\': 451429}, \'multiverseid\': 451429}, {\'name\': \'Montaje de tópteros\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si no controlas un Tóptero distinto del Montaje de tópteros, regresa el Montaje de tópteros a la mano de su propietario y crea cinco fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dbfece9-6123-4542-ac60-9ae3e1386d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 451677}, \'multiverseid\': 451677}, {\'name\': \'Assembleur de mécanoptères\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous ne contrôlez pas de mécanoptère autre que l\'Assembleur de mécanoptères, renvoyez l\'Assembleur de mécanoptères dans la main de son propriétaire et créez cinq jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80943c0-9651-4c72-9738-e74edc853512\', \'multiverseId\': 451925}, \'multiverseid\': 451925}, {\'name\': \'Tottero Assemblato\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se l\'unico Tottero che controlli è il Tottero Assemblato, fai tornare il Tottero Assemblato in mano al suo proprietario e crea cinque pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719effe0-d9b4-4067-9485-93e79ccc3509\', \'multiverseId\': 452173}, \'multiverseid\': 452173}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械の組立工\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが飛行機械の組立工以外の飛行機械をコントロールしていない場合、飛行機械の組立工をオーナーの手札に戻し、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを５体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce5803a-97b0-47ad-b21e-35572e71c0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 452421}, \'multiverseid\': 452421}, {\'name\': \'Montagem de Tóptero\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se você não controlar nenhum Tóptero que não seja Montagem de Tóptero, devolva Montagem de Tóptero para a mão de seu dono e crie cinco fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8da4a17-b5cd-4ffa-95b3-0a367fd9760d\', \'multiverseId\': 452669}, \'multiverseid\': 452669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopter-Ingenieurin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Thopter-Ingenieurin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nArtefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451329&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6372b8-568f-402e-be92-214c0cf47ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 451329}, \'multiverseid\': 451329}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniera de tópteros\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Ingeniera de tópteros entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nLas criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799c7920-c828-48cf-a6ff-fbc43d70535b\', \'multiverseId\': 451577}, \'multiverseid\': 451577}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieur en mécanoptère\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ingénieur en mécanoptère arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nLes créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be1e2a74-c09e-404e-81fb-892ff51b1f22\', \'multiverseId\': 451825}, \'multiverseid\': 451825}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnere dei Totteri\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Ingegnere dei Totteri entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\nLe creature artefatto che controlli hanno rapidità.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c547f2-a96f-4df7-ba95-70cbe237dce1\', \'multiverseId\': 452073}, \'multiverseid\': 452073}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械技師\', \'text\': \'飛行機械技師が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcb1130b-0120-49d6-9a02-deabb11110a2\', \'multiverseId\': 452321}, \'multiverseid\': 452321}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiro de Tópteros\', \'text\': \'Quando Engenheiro de Tópteros entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\nAs criaturas artefato que você controla têm ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a91c024-35d6-43dc-8bd2-6a068fd55c45\', \'multiverseId\': 452569}, \'multiverseid\': 452569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopter-Spionagenetz\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2fe20e-e6c4-4565-a90c-098bca495333\', \'multiverseId\': 451310}, \'multiverseid\': 451310}, {\'name\': \'Red de espionaje tóptera\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas un artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1885a6c-9e82-420e-b1c3-a4ce4748ad49\', \'multiverseId\': 451558}, \'multiverseid\': 451558}, {\'name\': \'Réseau de mécanoptères espions\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez un artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d513ad40-796a-4445-a78a-f46bc295b48f\', \'multiverseId\': 451806}, \'multiverseid\': 451806}, {\'name\': \'Rete di Totteri Spia\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli un artefatto, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c62f89-451a-4d62-95d1-3b873b28af16\', \'multiverseId\': 452054}, \'multiverseid\': 452054}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械の諜報網\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f821430e-8a76-4d89-8beb-62c0fd7fba3c\', \'multiverseId\': 452302}, \'multiverseid\': 452302}, {\'name\': \'Rede de Espionagem de Tópteros\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar um artefato, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas artefato que você controla causarem dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70cfe511-13ae-44a1-b730-d934d17c6717\', \'multiverseId\': 452550}, \'multiverseid\': 452550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tintenfass-Leviathan\', \'text\': \'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nVerhüllt (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Leviathan\', \'flavor\': \'„Und in seinem Maul verschwand das siebte Meer und ward nicht mehr gesehen, während die Welt verblieb."\\n—Fabel aus Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451294&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b35ec6f5-6c51-43a8-85b4-79ee27e37c51\', \'multiverseId\': 451294}, \'multiverseid\': 451294}, {\'name\': \'Leviatán de Pozo de Tinta\', \'text\': \'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nArrolla.\\nVelo. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Leviatán\', \'flavor\': \'"Por su garganta cayó el séptimo mar, y nunca se lo volvió a ver mientras el mundo existió".\\n—Fábula de Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47765064-587f-4ba5-a5f0-72fd97686f60\', \'multiverseId\': 451542}, \'multiverseid\': 451542}, {\'name\': "Léviathan de l\'Encrier", \'text\': \'Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nPiétinement\\nLinceul (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : léviathan\', \'flavor\': "« La septième mer disparut dans sa gueule béante, à jamais avalée jusqu\'à la fin du monde. »\\n—Fable d\'Esper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea7a677c-e082-44f3-a4d0-4f0d565154c4\', \'multiverseId\': 451790}, \'multiverseid\': 451790}, {\'name\': "Leviatano del Mar d\'Inchiostro", \'text\': "Passa-Isole (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla un\'Isola.)\\nTravolgere\\nVelo (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Leviatano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tra le sue fauci finirono i sette mari, che nessuno avrebbe più rivisto fino alla fine del mondo."\\n—Favola di Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e532d9-5eee-4610-b42a-8f0dd00fb532\', \'multiverseId\': 452038}, \'multiverseid\': 452038}, {\'name\': \'墨溜まりのリバイアサン\', \'text\': \'島渡り（防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\nトランプル\\n被覆（このクリーチャーは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — リバイアサン\', \'flavor\': \'「その口に七つ目の海が消え、世界が存在する間、二度その姿を見せることはありませんでした。」\\n――エスパーの寓話\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07719e08-68ff-4ccf-88f4-1ae62b386e00\', \'multiverseId\': 452286}, \'multiverseid\': 452286}, {\'name\': \'Leviatã de Tinteiro\', \'text\': \'Travessia de ilha (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Ilha.)\\nAtropelar\\nManto (Esta criatura não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Leviatã\', \'flavor\': \'"Por sua gorja desceu o sétimo mar, para jamais tornar a ser visto enquanto durar o mundo."\\n— Fábula de Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a645de37-ccd7-4fbb-a853-d23f13d8a619\', \'multiverseId\': 452534}, \'multiverseid\': 452534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobende Baloths\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen 4/4 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn das Land zornig ist, sind sie es auch."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e3f2c6-a1e7-466f-b631-b7a2d7a82e42\', \'multiverseId\': 451361}, \'multiverseid\': 451361}, {\'name\': \'Báloths impetuosos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando la tierra está furiosa, también lo están ellos".\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df699e8c-3e0d-4645-96cd-24f0410f8fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 451609}, \'multiverseid\': 451609}, {\'name\': \'Baloths déchaînés\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand la terre enrage, ils enragent aussi. »\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451857&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cbf93e-7774-44f3-b099-27fcefc8f3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 451857}, \'multiverseid\': 451857}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Infuriati\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi creare una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando la terra è infuriata, lo sono anche loro."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b99194-46b9-41fd-94ed-30606aa40584\', \'multiverseId\': 452105}, \'multiverseid\': 452105}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂うベイロス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「大地が怒ってるなら、そいつらもそうよ。」\\n――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72258f01-3e5b-42f9-bfb3-8651ed4290a3\', \'multiverseId\': 452353}, \'multiverseid\': 452353}, {\'name\': \'Baloths Enfurecidos\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando a terra se enfurece, eles fazem o mesmo."\\n— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76763ac-b36f-4744-97f8-e52e5048178a\', \'multiverseId\': 452601}, \'multiverseid\': 452601}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todesernte-Ritual\', \'text\': \'Morbide — Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder, der Paliano betritt, wird zur Spielfigur im Ränkespiel der Mächtigen."\\n—Marchesa, die Schwarze Rose\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d646af-5703-47b5-8145-bcca2f5a01c6\', \'multiverseId\': 451377}, \'multiverseid\': 451377}, {\'name\': \'Ritual de la cosecha de muerte\', \'text\': \'Necrario — Al comienzo de cada paso final, si una criatura murió este turno, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quienes ponen un pie en Paliano no son más que peones de alguien en su juego por el poder".\\n—Marquesa, la Rosa Negra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b93aabc-4c52-457b-85b0-8102bc9decec\', \'multiverseId\': 451625}, \'multiverseid\': 451625}, {\'name\': \'Rituel de la moisson de mort\', \'text\': \'Morbidité — Au début de chaque étape de fin, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Tous ceux qui mettent les pieds à Paliano sont des pions dans la course au pouvoir de quelqu\'un. »\\n—Marchesa, la Rose Noire", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04282705-19ed-42ef-b7ce-6384dfc588f8\', \'multiverseId\': 451873}, \'multiverseid\': 451873}, {\'name\': \'Rituale Mietimorte\', \'text\': "Morboso — All\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se è morta una creatura in questo turno, puoi pescare una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Chiunque metta piede a Paliano è una pedina nei giochi di potere di qualcuno."\\n—Marchesa, la Rosa Nera\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ad5c6e-e61b-4684-9231-2a7f52481e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 452121}, \'multiverseid\': 452121}, {\'name\': \'死の収穫の儀式\', \'text\': \'陰鬱 ― 各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「パリアノに足を踏み入れた者はすべて、別の者が権力を得るための策謀の捨て駒となるの。」\\n――黒薔薇のマルチェッサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b031908a-90f6-4f9a-90c7-380771613f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 452369}, \'multiverseid\': 452369}, {\'name\': \'Ritual da Colheita Mortal\', \'text\': \'Mórbido — No início de cada etapa final, se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos que pisam em Paliano são peças no jogo de poder de alguém."\\n— Marchesa, a Rosa Negra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c06f043-b994-4fd6-8e67-f09e3964077f\', \'multiverseId\': 452617}, \'multiverseid\': 452617}]', "[{'name': 'Totenschlamm', 'text': 'Der Totenschlamm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Totenschlamm ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451469&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7da7bc49-884f-4267-bb5b-11ab7660e334', 'multiverseId': 451469}, 'multiverseid': 451469}, {'name': 'Ciénaga mortuoria', 'text': 'La Ciénaga mortuoria entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga mortuoria entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451717&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f049b6a1-db55-4afc-8cc3-748bd8b86d83', 'multiverseId': 451717}, 'multiverseid': 451717}, {'name': 'Fondrière mortuaire', 'text': 'La Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451965&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f065d7b4-3ad8-49de-9243-edc834ffe589', 'multiverseId': 451965}, 'multiverseid': 451965}, {'name': 'Pantano Mortuario', 'text': 'Il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452213&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a1ca3c8-e8c2-4a88-96dd-99430083a350', 'multiverseId': 452213}, 'multiverseid': 452213}, {'name': '亡骸のぬかるみ', 'text': '亡骸のぬかるみはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n亡骸のぬかるみが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452461&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37d030ee-3813-4581-907d-a07f119b269b', 'multiverseId': 452461}, 'multiverseid': 452461}, {'name': 'Lodaçal Mortuário', 'text': 'Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452709&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc73105c-e56c-4a7e-8c0a-d8fca8a570c0', 'multiverseId': 452709}, 'multiverseid': 452709}]", '[{\'name\': \'Totensturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du in dieser Partie deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast.\\nJeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur. Jeder Gegner, der das nicht kann, verliert die Hälfte seiner Lebenspunkte, aufgerundet.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein rapider und katastrophaler Verfall.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450678&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5bb785-5ab1-4f49-b375-6112c13734b4\', \'multiverseId\': 450678}, \'multiverseid\': 450678}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta de calaveras\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que lanzaste a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\\nCada oponente sacrifica una criatura. Cada oponente que no pueda hacerlo pierde la mitad de sus vidas, redondeando hacia arriba.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un declive rápido y catastrófico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b32d88-252e-4095-b1da-d90a2492b910\', \'multiverseId\': 450737}, \'multiverseid\': 450737}, {\'name\': \'Déluge de crânes\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez déjà lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.\\nChaque adversaire sacrifie une créature. Chaque adversaire qui ne peut pas perd la moitié de ses points de vie, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Un déclin rapide et catastrophique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c09d345-9ef0-4bbb-9987-1497297089e8\', \'multiverseId\': 450796}, \'multiverseid\': 450796}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta di Teschi\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai lanciato il tuo comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\\nOgni avversario sacrifica una creatura. Ogni avversario che non può farlo perde metà dei propri punti vita, arrotondati per eccesso.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Un declino repentino e catastrofico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15fd8eee-a220-4fbb-b3b4-27c1d018aeeb\', \'multiverseId\': 450855}, \'multiverseid\': 450855}, {\'name\': \'髑髏の嵐\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこのゲームで統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、これを１回コピーする。\\n各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。それができない各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分のライフの端数を切り上げた半分を失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'突発的致命的衰退。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1456945c-695b-44bb-badb-9d984d0a155b\', \'multiverseId\': 450914}, \'multiverseid\': 450914}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade de Crânios\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada vez que você conjurou seu comandante da zona de comando neste jogo.\\nCada oponente sacrifica uma criatura. Cada oponente que não puder fazê-lo perde metade dos pontos de vida, arredondada para cima.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um declínio rápido e catastrófico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c48d7a-7593-4a67-85e5-0c5cf15978ff\', \'multiverseId\': 450973}, \'multiverseid\': 450973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumspeicher\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge entweder gemeinsam oben auf deine Bibliothek oder darunter.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': "Geträumte Reichtümer sind schnell ausgegeben.\\n—Sprichwort der Suq\'Ata", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451291&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59c306d-7b35-4159-842a-1ea6d82fd220\', \'multiverseId\': 451291}, \'multiverseid\': 451291}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de ensueño\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas, luego pon dos cartas de tu mano ambas en la parte superior o el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': "Las riquezas de los sueños son efímeras.\\n—Proverbio de Suq\'Ata", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db67622-7838-4319-a368-ca5884be4323\', \'multiverseId\': 451539}, \'multiverseid\': 451539}, {\'name\': \'Cache des rêves\', \'text\': \'Piochez trois cartes, puis mettez deux cartes de votre main toutes les deux au-dessus ou au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les richesses imaginaires sont aisément dépensées.\\n—Adage souk\'ata", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd477b3-88af-4d74-9fb2-0752a402285b\', \'multiverseId\': 451787}, \'multiverseid\': 451787}, {\'name\': \'Ricchezze dei Sogni\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano entrambe in cima al tuo grimorio o entrambe in fondo al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "È facile spendere le ricchezze dei sogni.\\n—Adagio di Suq\'Ata", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1145423f-9d15-4706-a0b4-1d57ce0f5aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 452035}, \'multiverseid\': 452035}, {\'name\': \'夢での貯え\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引き、その後あなたの手札からカード２枚を、両方ともあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置くか、両方ともあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'夢の中の富は長続きしない。\\n――スークアタの格言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b8a5770-a1d6-4e92-9315-d1f0b2673a12\', \'multiverseId\': 452283}, \'multiverseid\': 452283}, {\'name\': \'Baú dos Sonhos\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards. Em seguida, coloque dois cards de sua mão no topo ou no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': "As riquezas dos sonhos são gastas facilmente.\\n— Adágio Suq\'Ata", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14cda6a2-6382-4126-bb00-91e4709456f2\', \'multiverseId\': 452531}, \'multiverseid\': 452531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumstein-Polyeder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere das Traumstein-Polyeder: Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nur der Verstand der Eldrazi kann so verworren denken, wie es notwendig ist, um die Polyeder zu öffnen und an die in ihnen eingeschlossene Macht zu gelangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451407&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ccdcb6-bc54-4a4c-b3d7-f85b79c76331\', \'multiverseId\': 451407}, \'multiverseid\': 451407}, {\'name\': \'Edro piedra del sueño\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro piedra del sueño: Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo la mente de los Eldrazi funciona de la retorcida forma que se requiere para abrir los edros y obtener el poder que hay dentro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e488ed39-725b-4ef8-a4a0-07d1ab66688a\', \'multiverseId\': 451655}, \'multiverseid\': 451655}, {\'name\': \'Hèdron pierre de rêve\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Hèdron pierre de rêve : Piochez trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Seul l\'esprit eldrazi est assez tordu pour ouvrir les hèdrons et puiser leur puissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a018167-9936-47fc-8e87-22b7b91e56e6\', \'multiverseId\': 451903}, \'multiverseid\': 451903}, {\'name\': \'Edro della Pietra Onirica\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Edro della Pietra Onirica: Pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo la mente degli Eldrazi può seguire le linee contorte necessarie ad aprire gli edri e attingere il loro potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d447f327-4ba6-4840-b235-7effadc53c48\', \'multiverseId\': 452151}, \'multiverseid\': 452151}, {\'name\': \'夢石の面晶体\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}, 夢石の面晶体を生け贄に捧げる：カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの精神のみが、面晶体を開きその力を自らの物にするための歪んだ道筋をたどることができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'084cc293-9936-419a-bd69-6dcaf4015534\', \'multiverseId\': 452399}, \'multiverseid\': 452399}, {\'name\': \'Edro da Pedra Onírica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifique Edro da Pedra Onírica: Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Somente a mente dos Eldrazi é distorcida o bastante para abrir os edros e utilizar o poder no seu interior.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279061d9-575e-4df9-806b-5913c614150e\', \'multiverseId\': 452647}, \'multiverseid\': 452647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tristes Gewässer\', \'text\': \'Das Triste Gewässer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Triste Gewässer ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451447&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d4941f-6515-4e1f-9b28-0b040ba692c4\', \'multiverseId\': 451447}, \'multiverseid\': 451447}, {\'name\': \'Laguna lúgubre\', \'text\': \'La Laguna lúgubre entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Laguna lúgubre entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780835c3-4d53-4d4a-a11f-63de4a1089a8\', \'multiverseId\': 451695}, \'multiverseid\': 451695}, {\'name\': \'Marigot lugubre\', \'text\': \'Le Marigot lugubre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marigot lugubre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6915e854-3b19-4080-8606-f159bfc78f63\', \'multiverseId\': 451943}, \'multiverseid\': 451943}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino Tetro\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino Tetro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino Tetro entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a630316-1f95-4699-9463-e461b97186c0\', \'multiverseId\': 452191}, \'multiverseid\': 452191}, {\'name\': \'陰鬱な僻地\', \'text\': \'陰鬱な僻地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n陰鬱な僻地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c0584ea-f5e7-4039-9a69-529f838e7fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 452439}, \'multiverseid\': 452439}, {\'name\': \'Remanso Funesto\', \'text\': \'Remanso Funesto entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Remanso Funesto entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'715c13e6-ee86-41e7-b5e9-1d80b60c59b6\', \'multiverseId\': 452687}, \'multiverseid\': 452687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tuvasa die Sonnenbeschienene\', \'text\': \'Tuvasa die Sonnenbeschienene erhält +1/+1 für jede Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Stamm war schon immer hier und wir werden immer hier sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49a4d62-0c50-4bfd-bd30-6dcff2f235c8\', \'multiverseId\': 450707}, \'multiverseid\': 450707}, {\'name\': \'Tuvasa, la Iluminada\', \'text\': \'Tuvasa, la Iluminada obtiene +1/+1 por cada encantamiento que controlas.\\nSiempre que lances tu primer hechizo de encantamiento cada turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi gente siempre estuvo aquí, y aquí nos quedaremos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34ce1108-ffb7-45b3-90b1-1209833398dd\', \'multiverseId\': 450766}, \'multiverseid\': 450766}, {\'name\': \'Tuvasa, baignée de soleil\', \'text\': "Tuvasa, baignée de soleil gagne +1/+1 pour chaque enchantement que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'enchantement à chaque tour, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon peuple a toujours été ici, et ici nous resterons. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1191bac1-162a-453e-8119-6d8f48beb918\', \'multiverseId\': 450825}, \'multiverseid\': 450825}, {\'name\': \'Tuvasa, Illuminata dal Sole\', \'text\': \'Tuvasa, Illuminata dal Sole prende +1/+1 per ogni incantesimo che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia incantesimo in ogni turno, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio popolo è sempre stato qui, e qui resteremo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761074cc-d4f8-4e69-8a9d-e1bc1cfc308a\', \'multiverseId\': 450884}, \'multiverseid\': 450884}, {\'name\': \'日照のトゥヴァーサ\', \'text\': \'日照のトゥヴァーサは、あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたが各ターンのあなたの１つ目のエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我が一族はいつでもここにいました。ここに留まらねばなりません。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54000a2e-cad6-4c98-a26d-d6bec4b180c3\', \'multiverseId\': 450943}, \'multiverseid\': 450943}, {\'name\': \'Tuvasa, a Ensolarada\', \'text\': \'Tuvasa, a Ensolarada, recebe +1/+1 para cada encantamento que você controla.\\nToda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica de encantamento a cada turno, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu povo sempre esteve aqui, e aqui permaneceremos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c907ba32-95bc-43f7-bbd8-b4aaee93e821\', \'multiverseId\': 451002}, \'multiverseid\': 451002}]', "[{'name': 'Umgießerei', 'text': '{3}: Enttappe die Umgießerei.\\n{2}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere einen Servo: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{T}, opfere einen Thopter: Erzeuge einen 4/4 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450717&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5198feaa-5ce1-4ab1-8168-daf18117b816', 'multiverseId': 450717}, 'multiverseid': 450717}, {'name': 'Fundición reconvertidora', 'text': '{3}: Endereza la Fundición reconvertidora.\\n{2}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar un Servo: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{T}, sacrificar un Tóptero: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 4/4.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450776&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40130def-ac9a-4e37-ab69-0db7b9c23f87', 'multiverseId': 450776}, 'multiverseid': 450776}, {'name': 'Fonderie de modernisation', 'text': '{3} : Dégagez la Fonderie de modernisation.\\n{2}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un servo : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un mécanoptère : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 4/4 incolore Construction.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450835&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8c40a86-6b4c-4466-99c6-ff4b8938654f', 'multiverseId': 450835}, 'multiverseid': 450835}, {'name': 'Fonderia Perfezionante', 'text': '{3}: STAPpa la Fonderia Perfezionante.\\n{2}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un Servomeccanismo: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un Tottero: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 4/4 incolore.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450894&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a5269f3-00db-4b90-b33d-dd85add94bb8', 'multiverseId': 450894}, 'multiverseid': 450894}, {'name': '改良式鋳造所', 'text': '{3}：改良式鋳造所をアンタップする。\\n{2}, {T}：無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{1}, {T}, 霊気装置１体を生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{T}, 飛行機械１体を生け贄に捧げる：無色の４/４の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450953&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a34d678-ff87-4cf3-a369-8d3be75e0259', 'multiverseId': 450953}, 'multiverseid': 450953}, {'name': 'Fundição Modificadora', 'text': '{3}: Desvire Fundição Modificadora.\\n{2}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique um Servus: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\n{T}, sacrifique um Tóptero: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 4/4 do tipo Constructo.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451012&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dace9146-481d-4edd-ae8e-bcc2ff1cd64d', 'multiverseId': 451012}, 'multiverseid': 451012}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unbeirrbare Tapferkeit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Lebensverknüpfung und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Als Trostanis Einfluss wuchs, durchströmte neue Lebenskraft das Konklave — sehr zum Missfallen der anderen Gilden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac22b01-efe4-4cfc-a919-03cee51e27cc\', \'multiverseId\': 451395}, \'multiverseid\': 451395}, {\'name\': \'Valor inquebrantable\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene las habilidades de arrollar y vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que la influencia de Trostani crece, la vitalidad se extiende por el Cónclave, para desgracia de los demás gremios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94671865-c70b-437c-9a9f-bf710ca0586d\', \'multiverseId\': 451643}, \'multiverseid\': 451643}, {\'name\': \'Courage inébranlable\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le piétinement et le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "À mesure que l\'influence de Trostani se répandit sur Ravnica, la vitalité gagna le Conclave... au grand dam des autres guildes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f44932-913a-40f7-834d-0ca5db014ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 451891}, \'multiverseid\': 451891}, {\'name\': \'Coraggio Inflessibile\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha travolgere e legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Man mano che l\'influenza di Trostani aumentava, la vitalità si diffondeva nel Conclave, per lo sconcerto delle altre gilde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6987fff-9590-4135-9bea-629a67651033\', \'multiverseId\': 452139}, \'multiverseid\': 452139}, {\'name\': \'ひるまぬ勇気\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、トランプルと絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'トロスターニの影響力が強まるにつれ、悔しがる他のギルドをよそに、議事会には活気が広がっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d86e03-7b9f-4d4a-b83d-418e12497af6\', \'multiverseId\': 452387}, \'multiverseid\': 452387}, {\'name\': \'Coragem Inabalável\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem atropelar e vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme a influência de Trostani crescia, a vitalidade se intensificava por todo o Conclave, para o espanto das outras guildas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d82d01a8-dcd2-49c6-b01f-8a1efd200f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 452635}, \'multiverseid\': 452635}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unbestrittene Autorität\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Unbestrittene Autorität ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Schutz vor Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem Gideon im Neunten Distrikt aufgeräumt hatte, wagte es kein Bandenboss mehr, die Boros herauszufordern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451281&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e291c83-1e53-4ce2-b329-40a5d38cd5df\', \'multiverseId\': 451281}, \'multiverseid\': 451281}, {\'name\': \'Autoridad incuestionable\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Autoridad incuestionable entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene protección contra criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Después de la purga que Gideon hizo en el distrito noveno, ningún jefe de ninguna banda osó desafiar a los boros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5960ab55-0ac6-45b2-ad57-43658dd45184\', \'multiverseId\': 451529}, \'multiverseid\': 451529}, {\'name\': \'Autorité incontestable\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Autorité incontestable arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée a la protection contre les créatures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Quand Gideon eut nettoyé la Neuvième Circonscription, aucun des chefs de gang ne s\'opposa à la Légion de Boros.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d8bb22-0ebf-45ee-9b98-a0d7be9f2a95\', \'multiverseId\': 451777}, \'multiverseid\': 451777}, {\'name\': \'Autorità Indiscussa\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nQuando l\'Autorità Indiscussa entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata ha protezione dalle creature.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo che Gideon ebbe fatto piazza pulita nel Nono Distretto, nessun capobanda si oppose ai Boros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99861e3e-45d7-485f-804c-faffc5a8e33b\', \'multiverseId\': 452025}, \'multiverseid\': 452025}, {\'name\': \'疑いなき権威\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n疑いなき権威が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーはプロテクション（クリーチャー）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'ギデオンが第９地区を浄化した後、ボロス団に挑む暗黒街のボスはいなくなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'484d89f2-0377-4a6b-ab5f-30d562519943\', \'multiverseId\': 452273}, \'multiverseid\': 452273}, {\'name\': \'Autoridade Incontestada\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Autoridade Incontestada entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nA criatura encantada tem proteção contra criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que Gideon limpou o Nono Distrito, nenhum dos líderes das gangues desafiou os Boros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a329912-5705-4fb3-8ebd-43153b81cc8f\', \'multiverseId\': 452521}, \'multiverseid\': 452521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Untergeschlüpfter Elf\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Untergeschlüpfte Elf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Grün des Wachstums gibt es weiterhin. Es versteckt sich derzeit nur zur Sicherheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451349&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9a5489-3ce5-4313-9196-d2e04efbc487\', \'multiverseId\': 451349}, \'multiverseid\': 451349}, {\'name\': \'Elfo refugio lejano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Elfo refugio lejano entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El florecimiento verde existe. Simplemente se esconde por su seguridad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df62b74f-3849-4619-99f8-3fcb147b315c\', \'multiverseId\': 451597}, \'multiverseid\': 451597}, {\'name\': \'Elfe des horizons lointains\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Elfe des horizons lointains arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« La verdure florissante existe. Elle ne se cache que pour éviter sa destruction. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd4c8ff-f375-4b63-8862-6d056d6ef5d3\', \'multiverseId\': 451845}, \'multiverseid\': 451845}, {\'name\': \'Elfa del Rifugio Lontano\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elfa del Rifugio Lontano entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vegetazione lussureggiante esiste davvero. Si nasconde semplicemente per la propria sicurezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0a0a4f-586f-49cd-9e8b-256d3c46ca4e\', \'multiverseId\': 452093}, \'multiverseid\': 452093}, {\'name\': \'彼方地のエルフ\', \'text\': \'彼方地のエルフが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「緑色の花も実在しますよ。自らの安全のために隠れているだけです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895f2f5d-9f6e-41a1-8875-bc70b07ab7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 452341}, \'multiverseid\': 452341}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Porto-longínquo\', \'text\': \'Quando Elfo Porto-longínquo entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"A florescência verdejante existe. Ela apenas se esconde para sua própria segurança"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42df3ff0-1d0e-4f5d-801d-7e3b412d9bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 452589}, \'multiverseid\': 452589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Uralter Steingötze\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede angreifende Kreatur {1} weniger.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Uralte Steingötze stirbt, erzeuge einen 6/12 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb5d48e3-a472-4f30-a0db-917446e21742\', \'multiverseId\': 450713}, \'multiverseid\': 450713}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo de piedra antiguo\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura atacante.\\nArrolla.\\nCuando el Ídolo de piedra antiguo muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 6/12 con la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3113a007-92e0-4cc2-952f-6b65f7b1b2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 450772}, \'multiverseid\': 450772}, {\'name\': \'Ancienne idole de pierre\', \'text\': "Flash\\nCe sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature attaquante.\\nPiétinement\\nQuand l\'Ancienne idole de pierre meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 6/12 incolore Construction avec le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf50fb66-38c8-428c-9265-a8dd5c080b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 450831}, \'multiverseid\': 450831}, {\'name\': \'Idolo di Pietra Antico\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuesta magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura attaccante.\\nTravolgere\\nQuando l\'Idolo di Pietra Antico muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 6/12 incolore con travolgere.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02575881-b9c5-4643-a6f7-b16bfae2d66d\', \'multiverseId\': 450890}, \'multiverseid\': 450890}, {\'name\': \'古き石の偶像\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nこの呪文を唱えるためのコストは、攻撃クリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nトランプル\\n古き石の偶像が死亡したとき、トランプルを持つ無色の６/12の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146d646e-75a4-4cf5-83e1-0e5f721ff85a\', \'multiverseId\': 450949}, \'multiverseid\': 450949}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo de Pedra Antigo\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEsta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura atacante.\\nAtropelar\\nQuando Ídolo de Pedra Antigo morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 6/12 do tipo Constructo com atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01625b3e-6a40-49d0-b39e-32300745bdb1\', \'multiverseId\': 451008}, \'multiverseid\': 451008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urnebel\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek manifestieren. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nSchicke eine verdeckte bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt ins Exil: Du kannst die Karte in diesem Zug spielen. (Du bezahlst immer noch ihre Kosten. Zeitpunkts-Einschränkungen gelten weiterhin.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450672&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbcd5480-0457-48ff-a205-c4de34c043ee\', \'multiverseId\': 450672}, \'multiverseid\': 450672}, {\'name\': \'Niebla primordial\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, puedes manifestar la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\\nExiliar boca arriba un permanente boca abajo que controlas: Puedes jugar esa carta este turno. (Sigues pagando sus costes. Las reglas sobre cuándo jugarla se siguen aplicando.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88e6d9f8-96dd-43d4-a39f-40ecf8762107\', \'multiverseId\': 450731}, \'multiverseid\': 450731}, {\'name\': \'Brume primordiale\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez manifester la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nExilez, face visible, un permanent face cachée que vous contrôlez : Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci. (Vous payez toujours ses coûts. Les restrictions de temps s\'appliquent quand même.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'447e1bb4-4617-4834-8b68-e2c2aa2dbc45\', \'multiverseId\': 450790}, \'multiverseid\': 450790}, {\'name\': \'Nebbia Primordiale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi manifestare la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nEsilia a faccia in su un permanente a faccia in giù che controlli: Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno. (Paghi comunque i suoi costi. Le regole sulla tempistica si applicano comunque.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c950e8-02bd-4fdc-bb7f-bb84f4650b63\', \'multiverseId\': 450849}, \'multiverseid\': 450849}, {\'name\': \'始源の霧\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示してもよい。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている裏向きのパーマネント１つを表向きに追放する：このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。（そのコストは支払う必要がある。タイミングのルールも依然として適用される。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b43c87-5e82-439b-a48e-e88303fb2d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 450908}, \'multiverseid\': 450908}, {\'name\': \'Névoa Primordial\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, você pode manifestar o card do topo de seu grimório. (Coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\\nExile uma permanente com a face voltada para baixo que você controla: Você pode jogar aquele card neste turno. (Você ainda paga seus custos. As regras de tempo ainda se aplicam.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6941630d-e49b-47c2-9056-8de3ac83fe06\', \'multiverseId\': 450967}, \'multiverseid\': 450967}]', "[{'name': 'Varchild, Verräterin von Kjeldor', 'text': 'Immer wenn Varchild, Verräterin von Kjeldor, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeugt der Spieler entsprechend viele 1/1 rote Überlebender-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nÜberlebende, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, können nicht blocken und weder dich noch einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreifen.\\nWenn Varchild das Spiel verlässt, übernimm die Kontrolle über alle Überlebenden.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450688&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6242bd9a-19e4-42c2-95a3-b6b47a2bbc3e', 'multiverseId': 450688}, 'multiverseid': 450688}, {'name': 'Varchild, traidora de Kjeldor', 'text': 'Siempre que Varchild, traidora de Kjeldor haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Superviviente rojas 1/1.\\nLos Supervivientes que controlan tus oponentes no pueden bloquear, y no pueden atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\\nCuando Varchild deje el campo de batalla, gana el control de todos los Supervivientes.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450747&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dc286c1-6926-4cc7-b8be-bb777c4051d4', 'multiverseId': 450747}, 'multiverseid': 450747}, {'name': 'Vartchaïld, traîtresse du Kjeldor', 'text': 'À chaque fois que Vartchaïld, traîtresse du Kjeldor inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur crée autant de jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Survivant.\\nLes survivants que vos adversaires contrôlent ne peuvent pas bloquer, et ils ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand Vartchaïld quitte le champ de bataille, acquérez le contrôle de tous les survivants.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450806&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5ae8ec8-3d1c-40ba-bca6-5ce256b9c0a1', 'multiverseId': 450806}, 'multiverseid': 450806}, {'name': 'Varchild, Traditrice di Kjeldor', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta Varchild, Traditrice di Kjeldor infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore crea altrettante pedine creatura Superstite 1/1 rosse.\\nI Superstiti controllati dai tuoi avversari non possono bloccare e non possono attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli.\\nQuando Varchild lascia il campo di battaglia, prendi il controllo di tutti i Superstiti.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450865&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96f66e2c-537a-47fc-a057-f3d93a475763', 'multiverseId': 450865}, 'multiverseid': 450865}, {'name': 'キイェルドーの背信者、ヴァーチャイルド', 'text': 'キイェルドーの背信者、ヴァーチャイルドがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい数の赤の１/１の生存者・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている生存者は、それらではブロックできず、それらではあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\\nキイェルドーの背信者、ヴァーチャイルドが戦場を離れたとき、生存者すべてのコントロールを得る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450924&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0df312b3-b4cf-4c0b-9f91-186b53d38830', 'multiverseId': 450924}, 'multiverseid': 450924}, {'name': 'Varchild, Traidora de Kjeldor', 'text': 'Toda vez que Varchild, Traidora de Kjeldor, causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador cria uma quantidade equivalente de fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Sobrevivente.\\nOs Sobreviventes que seus oponentes controlam não podem bloquear nem atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controla.\\nQuando Varchild deixar o campo de batalha, ganhe o controle de todos os Sobreviventes.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450983&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ae9364d-872b-4275-80bb-7b7788e61bdb', 'multiverseId': 450983}, 'multiverseid': 450983}]", '[{\'name\': \'Varina, Lichkönigin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du mit einem oder mehreren Zombies angreifst, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten und wirf dann entsprechend viele Karten ab. Du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{2}, schicke zwei Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450708&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd37efd-86a7-4feb-9394-4ad7eedc1dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 450708}, \'multiverseid\': 450708}, {\'name\': \'Varina, reina liche\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques con uno o más Zombies, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas. Luego, descarta esa misma cantidad de cartas. Tú ganas esa misma cantidad de vidas.\\n{2}, exiliar dos cartas de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fee8456-1546-40cf-ac59-bb024cc7075d\', \'multiverseId\': 450767}, \'multiverseid\': 450767}, {\'name\': \'Varina, reine liche\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins un zombie, piochez autant de cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'autant de cartes. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie.\\n{2}, exilez deux cartes depuis votre cimetière : Créez, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38634b19-5756-4069-80cf-041f403f3f51\', \'multiverseId\': 450826}, \'multiverseid\': 450826}, {\'name\': \'Varina, Regina Lich\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con uno o più Zombie, pesca altrettante carte, poi scarta altrettante carte. Guadagni altrettanti punti vita.\\n{2}, Esilia due carte dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee63810-df6d-42d5-8109-5035455eeeb2\', \'multiverseId\': 450885}, \'multiverseid\': 450885}, {\'name\': \'リッチの女王、ヴァリーナ\', \'text\': \'あなたが１体以上のゾンビで攻撃するたび、その総数に等しい枚数のカードを引き、その後それに等しい枚数のカードを捨てる。あなたはそれに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n{2}, あなたの墓地からカード２枚を追放する：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e25065-7ce0-455e-ab4b-4a83721143c1\', \'multiverseId\': 450944}, \'multiverseid\': 450944}, {\'name\': \'Varina, Rainha Lich\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar com um ou mais Zumbis, compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards e, em seguida, descarte uma quantidade equivalente de cards. Você ganha uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\\n{2}, exile dois cards de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi virada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Zumbi Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3627aaa-942d-4f55-b4e0-90092bc404c1\', \'multiverseId\': 451003}, \'multiverseid\': 451003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vedalken-Demütiger\', \'text\': \'Metallkunst — Immer wenn der Vedalken-Demütiger angreift und falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, verlieren alle Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, alle Fähigkeiten und haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Und wer will mich aufhalten? Du etwa?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77a3de3-f1b0-4d8e-bdb4-3b9d8e3de5e1\', \'multiverseId\': 450673}, \'multiverseid\': 450673}, {\'name\': \'Humillador vedalken\', \'text\': \'Metalurgia — Siempre que el Humillador vedalken ataque, si controlas tres o más artefactos, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes pierden todas las habilidades y tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Y quién va a detenerme? ¿Tú?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6860023-1c60-40c0-97be-a2644ebe21ea\', \'multiverseId\': 450732}, \'multiverseid\': 450732}, {\'name\': \'Humiliateur vedalken\', \'text\': "Art des métaux — À chaque fois que l\'Humiliateur vedalken attaque, si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent toutes leurs capacités et ont une force et une endurance de base de 1/1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Et qui va m\'en empêcher ? Toi ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39cb4965-50cd-4cd2-90fb-c59eacfa3261\', \'multiverseId\': 450791}, \'multiverseid\': 450791}, {\'name\': \'Umiliatore Vedalken\', \'text\': "Metallurgia — Ogniqualvolta l\'Umiliatore Vedalken attacca, se controlli tre o più artefatti, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari perdono tutte le abilità e hanno forza e costituzione base 1/1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"E chi potrà fermarmi? Tu?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e98a5670-ecd1-4a64-a33d-7012a2e328a4\', \'multiverseId\': 450850}, \'multiverseid\': 450850}, {\'name\': \'ヴィダルケンの貶め屋\', \'text\': \'金属術 ― ヴィダルケンの貶め屋が攻撃するたび、あなたがアーティファクトを３つ以上コントロールしている場合、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーはすべての能力を失い基本のパワーとタフネスが１/１になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「誰が俺様を止める？貴様か？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8468a08-3a3e-440c-bbf6-17927b64c709\', \'multiverseId\': 450909}, \'multiverseid\': 450909}, {\'name\': \'Humilhador Vedalkeano\', \'text\': \'Maestria com metais — Toda vez que Humilhador Vedalkeano ataca, se você controla três ou mais artefatos, as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam perdem todas as habilidades e têm poder e resistência básicos 1/1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"E quem vai me deter? Você?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'896e297a-715d-4a1b-9862-5058c9e5955a\', \'multiverseId\': 450968}, \'multiverseid\': 450968}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verfaulen lassen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Es bzw. sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir alle verfallen und sind stets dem Tode nahe. Ein Augenblick ohne Atem, und schon beginnen wir zu kollabieren."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b5900a-9635-4d5c-8f99-1e02ff350a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 451390}, \'multiverseid\': 451390}, {\'name\': \'Pudrir\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos estamos en descomposición, siempre en un estado cercano a la muerte. Un instante sin aliento y comenzamos a venirnos abajo".\\n—Cevraya, chamán golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68970934-5c3b-47b2-b9a4-39d1695a83b8\', \'multiverseId\': 451638}, \'multiverseid\': 451638}, {\'name\': \'Putréfier\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou la créature ciblée. Ils ne peuvent pas être régénérés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous pourrissons tous, dans un état perpétuel de mort imminente. Un instant sans respirer, et la désagrégation commence. »\\n—Cevraya, shamane de Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bac45e0-92b3-4b67-a689-ab8351b14acc\', \'multiverseId\': 451886}, \'multiverseid\': 451886}, {\'name\': \'Putrificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerato.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo tutti in decadimento, sempre in uno stato vicino alla morte. Pochi istanti senza respirare e iniziamo a guastarci."\\n—Cevraya, sciamana Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89993be9-77e7-429c-a497-ba6496515598\', \'multiverseId\': 452134}, \'multiverseid\': 452134}, {\'name\': \'化膿\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「みんな衰えていくばかりさ。いつだって死の一歩手前。そうして息が止まった瞬間に崩壊が始まるんだ。」\\n――ゴルガリのシャーマン、セヴリヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95209982-0d37-4fa7-b515-afa2e53175b7\', \'multiverseId\': 452382}, \'multiverseid\': 452382}, {\'name\': \'Putrificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou a criatura alvo. Ele não pode ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos todos em decadência, sempre em um estado de quase morte. Um momento sem respirar e começamos a sucumbir."\\n— Cevraya, xamã Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5859516e-37ac-48d8-96ac-1484a8a44e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 452630}, \'multiverseid\': 452630}]', "[{'name': 'Vergessene Höhle', 'text': 'Die Vergessene Höhle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nUmwandlung {R} ({R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451449&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '146f5b84-369b-4e2b-9910-1458030866f1', 'multiverseId': 451449}, 'multiverseid': 451449}, {'name': 'Cueva olvidada', 'text': 'La Cueva olvidada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nCiclo {R}. ({R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451697&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45c63cdb-f0f9-4c9e-bb77-5c3a7b404280', 'multiverseId': 451697}, 'multiverseid': 451697}, {'name': 'Caverne oubliée', 'text': 'La Caverne oubliée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nRecyclage {R} ({R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451945&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53fe03d3-9538-48b1-abd7-d8e64a47742d', 'multiverseId': 451945}, 'multiverseid': 451945}, {'name': 'Caverna Dimenticata', 'text': 'La Caverna Dimenticata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nCiclo {R} ({R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452193&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd352dfc3-4b6f-4d38-bf05-194ccbb06106', 'multiverseId': 452193}, 'multiverseid': 452193}, {'name': '忘れられた洞窟', 'text': '忘れられた洞窟はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{R}（{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452441&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39bbd307-974d-479c-b0be-e881a280a4b3', 'multiverseId': 452441}, 'multiverseid': 452441}, {'name': 'Caverna Esquecida', 'text': 'Caverna Esquecida entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\nReciclar {R} ({R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452689&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fbf39a0-95e3-46b1-8ef4-84a98bbeb4b2', 'multiverseId': 452689}, 'multiverseid': 452689}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vergrößerungsglas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen farblosen Hinweis-Artefaktspielstein mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ritter-Inquisitoren von Sankt Rabanus tauchen in Mysterien ein, die man besser unerforscht lassen sollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01abfb47-a3c1-46f5-abb4-1ca0d610044e\', \'multiverseId\': 451411}, \'multiverseid\': 451411}, {\'name\': \'Lente de aumento\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Investiga. (Crea una ficha de artefacto Pista incolora con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los caballeros inquisidores de San Raban ahondan en misterios que es mejor no explorar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d8b6e7-7378-4f67-9ad6-d138a75d70ac\', \'multiverseId\': 451659}, \'multiverseid\': 451659}, {\'name\': \'Loupe\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Enquêtez. (Créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore Indice avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les chevaliers-inquisiteurs de Saint Raban s\'intéressent à des mystères qu\'il vaudrait mieux ne pas explorer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eadab7b-1dce-4055-a840-ee6bc7dcdd37\', \'multiverseId\': 451907}, \'multiverseid\': 451907}, {\'name\': "Lente d\'Ingrandimento", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Indaga. (Crea una pedina artefatto Indizio incolore con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I cavalieri inquisitori di San Raban si addentrano in misteri che sarebbe meglio non esplorare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57dc750c-fae0-49c0-90c5-5e1f85a874a7\', \'multiverseId\': 452155}, \'multiverseid\': 452155}, {\'name\': \'拡大鏡\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：調査を行う。（「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。」を持つ無色の手掛かり・アーティファクト・トークンを１つ生成する。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'聖ラバンの騎士審問官は、触れない方がいい謎を徹底的に追及する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12009443-cbca-4303-a79e-7bc12a5ff74f\', \'multiverseId\': 452403}, \'multiverseid\': 452403}, {\'name\': \'Lente de Aumento\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Investigue. (Crie uma ficha de artefato incolor do tipo Pista com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card.")\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os Cavaleiros Inquisidores de Santo Raban mergulham fundo em mistérios que seria melhor não explorar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46323785-39b9-4c43-9cee-fd5b10746e8e\', \'multiverseId\': 452651}, \'multiverseid\': 452651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheertes Waldland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, opfere das Verheerte Waldland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c99692-e67e-431f-88f5-3a414c85ded1\', \'multiverseId\': 451439}, \'multiverseid\': 451439}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T},sacrificar la Arboleda corrompida: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c878b571-5b65-4965-b577-98e0d725fbe6\', \'multiverseId\': 451687}, \'multiverseid\': 451687}, {\'name\': \'Sylves gangrenées\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sylves gangrenées : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef3fac8-92b9-4ada-9bbb-8939df2107e9\', \'multiverseId\': 451935}, \'multiverseid\': 451935}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Boscaglia Morente: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce474c1b-b7c1-4c2b-8f06-239c49b4f44f\', \'multiverseId\': 452183}, \'multiverseid\': 452183}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した森林\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}{G}, {T}, 荒廃した森林を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d8903e-5344-4ceb-8447-330c589d110d\', \'multiverseId\': 452431}, \'multiverseid\': 452431}, {\'name\': \'Floresta Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifique Floresta Flagelada: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a366be5-b97a-446b-858c-9e12d2befe14\', \'multiverseId\': 452679}, \'multiverseid\': 452679}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhängnis des Verzauberers\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments fügt eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ihrem Beherrscher Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer umgewandelten Manakosten zu, es sei denn, der Spieler opfert sie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Wer die Macht nicht respektiert, wird bald schon von ihr verzehrt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d94717cb-4070-48f8-9dc3-d400d61ada19\', \'multiverseId\': 450681}, \'multiverseid\': 450681}, {\'name\': \'Ruina del encantador\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, el encantamiento objetivo hace una cantidad de daño igual a su coste de maná convertido a su controlador a menos que ese jugador lo sacrifique.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes no respetan el poder acaban consumidos por él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5dfb75-974a-4547-b117-5e4f5381bf90\', \'multiverseId\': 450740}, \'multiverseid\': 450740}, {\'name\': "Fléau de l\'enchanteur", \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, l\'enchantement ciblé inflige un nombre de blessures égal à son coût converti de mana à son contrôleur à moins que ce joueur ne le sacrifie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui ne respectent pas le pouvoir finiront par être consumés par lui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bec0aaf-08ff-4cd7-90c4-15b762264b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 450799}, \'multiverseid\': 450799}, {\'name\': "Flagello dell\'Incantatore", \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, un incantesimo bersaglio infligge al suo controllore danno pari al suo costo di mana convertito a meno che quel giocatore non lo sacrifichi.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Chi non rispetta il potere presto finirà per esserne consumato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e354a403-ff84-4d06-be87-9c0459c07486\', \'multiverseId\': 450858}, \'multiverseid\': 450858}, {\'name\': \'結界師の破滅\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、エンチャント１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーがそれを生け贄に捧げないかぎり、それはそれの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しいダメージをそのプレイヤーに与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'力を軽視する者は、そのうちに力の報いを受けるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94c556c-a617-4370-a5e5-d249b45084ec\', \'multiverseId\': 450917}, \'multiverseid\': 450917}, {\'name\': \'Perdição do Encantador\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, o encantamento alvo causa uma quantidade de dano igual a seu custo de mana convertido ao próprio controlador, a menos que aquele jogador o sacrifique.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os que não respeitam o poder logo são consumidos por ele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa0255c-709c-4c25-a697-79b4ac705542\', \'multiverseId\': 450976}, \'multiverseid\': 450976}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhängnisvoller Pfad\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\\nErwecken 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{B}{B} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451320&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea1c5c5-65ac-4b34-8859-e96c92bcb2a4\', \'multiverseId\': 451320}, \'multiverseid\': 451320}, {\'name\': \'Camino ruinoso\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\nDespertar 4—{5}{B}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{B}{B}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d1f0549-56d3-4a4a-b88f-7dda9dc3093f\', \'multiverseId\': 451568}, \'multiverseid\': 451568}, {\'name\': \'Chemin désastreux\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée ou le planeswalker ciblé.\\nÉveil 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{B}{B}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f017eec4-25f9-4282-a08e-cac302702537\', \'multiverseId\': 451816}, \'multiverseid\': 451816}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero della Sventura\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nRisveglio 4—{5}{B}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{B}{B}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b78eeb7-e60b-4d2c-85ee-2ad55df026cb\', \'multiverseId\': 452064}, \'multiverseid\': 452064}, {\'name\': \'破滅の道\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n覚醒４―{5}{B}{B}（この呪文を{5}{B}{B}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349bc3d3-353f-4dcf-bcf0-323bb86833e7\', \'multiverseId\': 452312}, \'multiverseid\': 452312}, {\'name\': \'Trilha Ruinosa\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou planeswalker alvo.\\nDespertar 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{B}{B}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fd9f86d-8c6e-45a5-9a77-2263353824be\', \'multiverseId\': 452560}, \'multiverseid\': 452560}]', "[{'name': 'Verlassene Ödnis', 'text': 'Die Verlassene Ödnis kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Verlassene Ödnis ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451479&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88343cc0-7718-451c-967d-34c2a2f85cde', 'multiverseId': 451479}, 'multiverseid': 451479}, {'name': 'Yermos desérticos', 'text': 'Los Yermos desérticos entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Yermos desérticos entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451727&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ae6526d-6aed-4387-aaa9-f712cf00ec4b', 'multiverseId': 451727}, 'multiverseid': 451727}, {'name': 'Landes érodées', 'text': 'Les Landes érodées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Landes érodées arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451975&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '036e83c8-d292-401e-b423-2bf483169fce', 'multiverseId': 451975}, 'multiverseid': 451975}, {'name': 'Distese Desolate', 'text': 'Le Distese Desolate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Distese Desolate entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452223&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9763386d-b0fb-4380-869e-252fb2a8822a', 'multiverseId': 452223}, 'multiverseid': 452223}, {'name': '磨かれたやせ地', 'text': '磨かれたやせ地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n磨かれたやせ地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452471&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94740070-d47d-4f14-9a63-33ad72e9ff83', 'multiverseId': 452471}, 'multiverseid': 452471}, {'name': 'Desertos Calcinados', 'text': 'Desertos Calcinados entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Desertos Calcinados entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452719&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed08ef7a-5200-4823-8efb-e841b95c4d57', 'multiverseId': 452719}, 'multiverseid': 452719}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verlassenes Heiligtum\', \'text\': \'Das Verlassene Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Würden Gebete hier nicht im Halse stecken bleiben, stießen sie nur auf verrottende Ohren."\\n—Minaldra, die Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ddd22b-3cac-47f7-9c2c-02d4277f158c\', \'multiverseId\': 451450}, \'multiverseid\': 451450}, {\'name\': \'Santuario abandonado\', \'text\': \'El Santuario abandonado entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Las oraciones se cuajarán en la lengua y serán escuchadas por oídos putrefactos".\\n—Minaldra, la Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099ce947-4ff1-4a6f-b530-5ac6614741ee\', \'multiverseId\': 451698}, \'multiverseid\': 451698}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire abandonné\', \'text\': \'Le Sanctuaire abandonné arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Les prières ranciront sur les langues et seront entendues par les oreilles pourrissantes. »\\n—Minaldra, la Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3e9aba8-e931-4adf-b468-5e1b55fff132\', \'multiverseId\': 451946}, \'multiverseid\': 451946}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Abbandonato\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario Abbandonato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Le preghiere si raggeleranno sulle labbra e verranno udite da orecchie putrefatte."\\n—Minaldra, la Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d83a6bc-8772-4b19-b3b3-fd84dfd7904b\', \'multiverseId\': 452194}, \'multiverseid\': 452194}, {\'name\': \'放棄された聖域\', \'text\': \'放棄された聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「祈りは舌の上で固まり、腐れる耳が聞くことでしょう。」\\n――ヴィザグ・アトゥムのミナルドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c5c23b-6b3c-4205-a272-d54c50539f07\', \'multiverseId\': 452442}, \'multiverseid\': 452442}, {\'name\': \'Santuário Abandonado\', \'text\': \'Santuário Abandonado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"As orações azedarão na língua e serão ouvidas por ouvidos putrefatos."\\n— Minaldra, a Vizag Athum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec5b3260-6802-419d-b59a-232716025db6\', \'multiverseId\': 452690}, \'multiverseid\': 452690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschüttete Ruinen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Verschütteten Ruinen: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte hat ihre Schätze tief vergraben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02f7c86-73e1-45bb-b55e-a207a1a22014\', \'multiverseId\': 451442}, \'multiverseid\': 451442}, {\'name\': \'Ruina enterrada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Ruina enterrada: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La historia ha enterrado sus tesoros profundamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20274825-0271-4aef-a660-c70275aa6c56\', \'multiverseId\': 451690}, \'multiverseid\': 451690}, {\'name\': \'Ruine ensevelie\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Ruine ensevelie : Renvoyez une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'histoire a profondément enfoui ses trésors.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d711c5-6f25-4397-8d92-3ed7024780cd\', \'multiverseId\': 451938}, \'multiverseid\': 451938}, {\'name\': \'Rovine Sepolte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica le Rovine Sepolte: Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La storia ha sepolto in profondità i suoi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b87226-0980-4aed-9e72-9bce50b3d63c\', \'multiverseId\': 452186}, \'multiverseid\': 452186}, {\'name\': \'埋没した廃墟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 埋没した廃墟を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は自身の価値を深く埋める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6442f58-0c7b-4dfe-a96a-209f65012e12\', \'multiverseId\': 452434}, \'multiverseid\': 452434}, {\'name\': \'Ruína Enterrada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Ruína Enterrada: Devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A história enterrou profundamente os próprios tesouros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84da8f16-37ca-41cb-8c09-73cea78a8561\', \'multiverseId\': 452682}, \'multiverseid\': 452682}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verwüstende Flut\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\nMirakulum {1}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Mit etwas, das aus göttlichem Willen erschaffen wurde, lässt sich nur schwer streiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451288&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9152381-5113-45de-9922-36a8917d02b8\', \'multiverseId\': 451288}, \'multiverseid\': 451288}, {\'name\': \'Marea devastadora\', \'text\': \'Regresa todos los permanentes que no sean tierra a las manos de sus propietarios.\\nMilagro {1}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuesta mucho discutir con una fuerza que está hecha de voluntad divina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd95a2af-4b53-4afe-a2af-2f6f3f878302\', \'multiverseId\': 451536}, \'multiverseid\': 451536}, {\'name\': \'Marée dévastatrice\', \'text\': "Renvoyez tous les permanents non-terrain dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\\nMiracle {1}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Difficile de lutter contre une force née d\'une volonté divine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451784&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c663ad-24d8-40de-86b6-b2fc51a66ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 451784}, \'multiverseid\': 451784}, {\'name\': \'Marea Devastatrice\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare tutti i permanenti non terra in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\\nMiracolo {1}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'È difficile discutere con una forza pervasa di volontà divina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fefe16ae-b942-4a63-a637-48d1eeec71b3\', \'multiverseId\': 452032}, \'multiverseid\': 452032}, {\'name\': \'壊滅的大潮\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネントをすべてオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n奇跡{1}{U}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれの奇跡コストを支払うことでこれを唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'神聖な意志から生まれた力に抵抗するのは困難である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d6bd2f-9b62-4e08-af57-8951fd659b14\', \'multiverseId\': 452280}, \'multiverseid\': 452280}, {\'name\': \'Maré da Devastação\', \'text\': \'Devolva todas as permanentes que não sejam terrenos para as mãos de seus donos.\\nMilagre {1}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'É difícil argumentar com uma força composta da vontade divina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664f87f9-5afc-47f0-909c-a7883498a5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 452528}, \'multiverseid\': 452528}]', "[{'name': 'Verzerrte Landschaft', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Verzerrte Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Jeder Kryptolith verzerrt das Mana dieser Welt und lenkt seinen Fluss in eine bestimmte Richtung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451494&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05945321-d306-4c31-b255-a01f2dcc737b', 'multiverseId': 451494}, 'multiverseid': 451494}, {'name': 'Paisaje retorcido', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje retorcido: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Cada criptolito afecta al maná del plano y dirige su flujo hacia un único propósito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451742&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecdad61b-428a-4d89-a36a-baddc1a3fd9e', 'multiverseId': 451742}, 'multiverseid': 451742}, {'name': 'Paysage difforme', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage difforme : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Chaque cryptolithe corrompt le mana du plan, canalisant son flux dans un seul but.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451990&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4996cee4-4cb1-4707-b364-f7704658060d', 'multiverseId': 451990}, 'multiverseid': 451990}, {'name': 'Paesaggio Distorto', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio Distorto: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Ogni criptolito distorce il mana del piano, deviandone il flusso per un singolo scopo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452238&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ffab487-225b-4d91-8ee4-02f5f779c74b', 'multiverseId': 452238}, 'multiverseid': 452238}, {'name': 'ねじれ地帯', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, ねじれ地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '謎の石が次元のマナを歪め、その流れをただ一つの目的に捻じ曲げている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452486&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73ec5844-278b-4f07-9faf-c7e47fed60a5', 'multiverseId': 452486}, 'multiverseid': 452486}, {'name': 'Paisagem Distorcida', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Distorcida: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Cada criptólito distorce o mana do plano, desviando seu fluxo com um único propósito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452734&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5337cd27-55d0-4636-ad3d-cc9aec1e3407', 'multiverseId': 452734}, 'multiverseid': 452734}]", "[{'name': 'Vorhersagen', 'text': 'Bestimme einen Kartennamen, dann legt ein Spieler deiner Wahl die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof. Falls die Karte den bestimmten Namen hat, ziehst du zwei Karten. Anderenfalls ziehst du eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451301&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f743174e-8760-483e-a939-3f3ce5114717', 'multiverseId': 451301}, 'multiverseid': 451301}, {'name': 'Predecir', 'text': 'Elige el nombre de una carta, luego el jugador objetivo pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Si esa carta tiene el nombre elegido, robas dos cartas. De lo contrario, robas una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451549&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc531fcb-302d-44b3-b6df-8fde87fa3c92', 'multiverseId': 451549}, 'multiverseid': 451549}, {'name': 'Prédiction', 'text': 'Nommez une carte, puis le joueur ciblé met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Si cette carte est la carte nommée, vous piochez deux cartes. Sinon, vous piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451797&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e4f4394-967a-44af-9edb-5049ee0ad7f5', 'multiverseId': 451797}, 'multiverseid': 451797}, {'name': 'Profetizzare', 'text': 'Scegli il nome di una carta, poi un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se quella carta ha il nome scelto, pesca due carte. Altrimenti, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452045&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '382c58c1-9086-4459-80d1-e299234f82d5', 'multiverseId': 452045}, 'multiverseid': 452045}, {'name': '予報', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。カード名１つを選ぶ。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。そのカードがその選ばれた名前を持っているなら、あなたはカードを２枚引く。そうでないなら、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452293&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abff902a-05a3-4ffa-83b9-297aa2447f21', 'multiverseId': 452293}, 'multiverseid': 452293}, {'name': 'Predizer', 'text': 'Escolha um nome de card. Em seguida, o jogador alvo coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério. Se o card tem o nome escolhido, você compra dois cards. Caso contrário, você compra um card.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452541&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fa67ae0-011d-4022-ba05-032b9c5db0cc', 'multiverseId': 452541}, 'multiverseid': 452541}]", "[{'name': 'Vorsteher der Gießerei', 'text': 'Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': 'Die Gießereien von Kaladesh laufen wie Uhrwerke unter der Kontrolle ihrer formidablen Aufseher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451402&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9ca7e69-c3bf-4aaf-8951-cb8b036c5a21', 'multiverseId': 451402}, 'multiverseid': 451402}, {'name': 'Capataz de la fundición', 'text': 'Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Las fundiciones de Kaladesh funcionan como un reloj bajo la supervisión de sus formidables supervisores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451650&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b1020f7-92fb-4893-9e11-2a9269e9af48', 'multiverseId': 451650}, 'multiverseid': 451650}, {'name': 'Chef de la fonderie', 'text': 'Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': 'Les fonderies de Kaladesh fonctionnent impeccablement sous la supervision de leurs redoutables brigadiers.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451898&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ce2152e-800a-44e3-ac22-94d55d61739f', 'multiverseId': 451898}, 'multiverseid': 451898}, {'name': 'Capo della Fonderia', 'text': 'Le altre creature artefatto che controlli prendono +1/+1.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': 'Le fonderie di Kaladesh funzionano alla perfezione sotto la supervisione dei loro formidabili sovrintendenti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452146&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4631a1e4-4d30-4184-8b59-e86d9ba2b11c', 'multiverseId': 452146}, 'multiverseid': 452146}, {'name': '鋳造所の隊長', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている他のアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': 'カラデシュの鋳造所は、その恐るべき監督者の管理の下で時計仕掛けのように規則正しく運営されている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452394&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44b0f562-1090-40d2-bcee-28af26ba3e38', 'multiverseId': 452394}, 'multiverseid': 452394}, {'name': 'Chefe da Fundição', 'text': 'As outras criaturas artefato que você controla recebem +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Os magníficos supervisores das fundições de Kaladesh garantem que elas funcionem como um relógio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452642&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fea31db-7d3c-4820-99ce-623f9ce8b851', 'multiverseId': 452642}, 'multiverseid': 452642}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vorzeichen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten der Bibliothek eines Spielers deiner Wahl an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück. Du kannst den Spieler seine Bibliothek mischen lassen.\\nZiehe zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des nächsten Zuges eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e57903-8287-4b39-8b1e-e15696bbc529\', \'multiverseId\': 451300}, \'multiverseid\': 451300}, {\'name\': \'Portento\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de la biblioteca del jugador objetivo, luego regrésalas en cualquier orden. Puedes hacer que ese jugador baraje su biblioteca.\\nRoba una carta al comienzo del mantenimiento del próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ccc023-e553-4782-9697-f7d50e216117\', \'multiverseId\': 451548}, \'multiverseid\': 451548}, {\'name\': \'Présage\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque du joueur ciblé, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous pouvez ensuite faire que ce joueur mélange sa bibliothèque.\\nPiochez une carte au début de l\'entretien du prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56dec53-daac-4904-a725-d90dd4de2621\', \'multiverseId\': 451796}, \'multiverseid\': 451796}, {\'name\': \'Portento\', \'text\': "Guarda le prime tre carte del grimorio di un giocatore bersaglio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine. Puoi far rimescolare a quel giocatore il suo grimorio.\\nPesca una carta all\'inizio del mantenimento del prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5577bd-6010-49ae-846c-13492eaceb29\', \'multiverseId\': 452044}, \'multiverseid\': 452044}, {\'name\': \'先触れ\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、その後それらを望む順番で戻す。あなたは「そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2733b9b1-10e3-4137-9f71-98ef0dcba7f9\', \'multiverseId\': 452292}, \'multiverseid\': 452292}, {\'name\': \'Presságio\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo do grimório do jogador alvo e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem. Você pode fazer com que aquele jogador embaralhe o próprio grimório.\\nCompre um card no início da manutenção do próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3fb666c-475e-40ca-9a2f-a4ee1b68c973\', \'multiverseId\': 452540}, \'multiverseid\': 452540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wachsame Schwelle\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner dich und/oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, mit einer oder mehreren Kreaturen angreift, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaubst du, die wissen, dass wir hier sind?"\\n—Orlo, Goblin-Plünderer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a71dae-add1-4632-9aeb-cab3b3cfdba2\', \'multiverseId\': 450669}, \'multiverseid\': 450669}, {\'name\': \'Umbral omnisciente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente te ataque a ti y/o a un planeswalker que controlas con una o más criaturas, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Crees que saben que estamos aquí?".\\n—Orlo, incursor trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74ba48b-9e16-46d4-bb0b-af599010f7ac\', \'multiverseId\': 450728}, \'multiverseid\': 450728}, {\'name\': \'Seuil de la providence\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque et/ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez avec au moins une créature, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Vous croyez qu\'ils savent qu\'on est là ? »\\n—Orlo, pillard gobelin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f7f497-83e2-4026-b8cb-e8d37a7f25af\', \'multiverseId\': 450787}, \'multiverseid\': 450787}, {\'name\': \'Soglia Sempre Vigile\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario attacca te e/o un planeswalker che controlli con una o più creature, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Secondo te sanno che siamo qui?"\\n—Orhlo, predone goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8928a51d-4bcd-46c8-bf88-b046f16ae289\', \'multiverseId\': 450846}, \'multiverseid\': 450846}, {\'name\': \'永久監視の敷居\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーをクリーチャー１体以上で攻撃するたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「オレたちが来てるって、アイツらにバレてるかな？」\\n――ゴブリンの略奪者、オルロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527ea81b-4496-47e7-9c72-2f279832828f\', \'multiverseId\': 450905}, \'multiverseid\': 450905}, {\'name\': \'Limiar Sempre Vígil\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente atacar com uma ou mais criaturas você ou um planeswalker que você controla, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Você acha que eles sabem que estamos aqui?"\\n— Orlo, salteador goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca94ac7-a80f-43be-8959-6cda4b4d4c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 450964}, \'multiverseid\': 450964}]', "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451508&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46240745-be9b-4abc-b11b-ef85effe1223', 'multiverseId': 451508}, 'multiverseid': 451508}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451756&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '234ef445-d163-465b-94a3-b6c91f93d38f', 'multiverseId': 451756}, 'multiverseid': 451756}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452004&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbaaf538-9770-4990-aafc-c63d1efe8d6a', 'multiverseId': 452004}, 'multiverseid': 452004}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452252&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc90e38c-66ce-4c15-85e7-671efcd3f2ba', 'multiverseId': 452252}, 'multiverseid': 452252}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452500&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcaeda82-db76-4b7c-b596-d748a24a6b9b', 'multiverseId': 452500}, 'multiverseid': 452500}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452748&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bb0b6d5-4d37-403f-9a47-e7d30cdfdccb', 'multiverseId': 452748}, 'multiverseid': 452748}]", "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451509&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6def8dd-eb54-49f1-b8ed-fb05e5bffa8c', 'multiverseId': 451509}, 'multiverseid': 451509}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451757&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5d29736-6a2c-4151-89a6-f6f8f93bc1e6', 'multiverseId': 451757}, 'multiverseid': 451757}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452005&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '026d036f-ad0b-47fc-854a-0d99c891ca3d', 'multiverseId': 452005}, 'multiverseid': 452005}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452253&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b34ff4c8-c40a-43cf-8b2f-a7fcbe6da141', 'multiverseId': 452253}, 'multiverseid': 452253}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452501&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd9066f5-f537-4e98-9aec-d55168ed7847', 'multiverseId': 452501}, 'multiverseid': 452501}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452749&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd11a69a3-3e8e-4b55-9ea1-e435b4247885', 'multiverseId': 452749}, 'multiverseid': 452749}]", "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451510&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05792657-4aef-49c8-885d-9d088365d607', 'multiverseId': 451510}, 'multiverseid': 451510}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451758&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa486bdb-6c02-4a09-96cb-35ab2ab8bbd8', 'multiverseId': 451758}, 'multiverseid': 451758}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452006&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bbb2978-653b-4fb1-aaeb-38680559547c', 'multiverseId': 452006}, 'multiverseid': 452006}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452254&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '207f5f7d-1e31-4595-ac45-87cefd7df450', 'multiverseId': 452254}, 'multiverseid': 452254}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452502&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe659f16-a29c-4502-ba15-0fc795d8fdbc', 'multiverseId': 452502}, 'multiverseid': 452502}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452750&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd0c4d74-355b-4cf0-b5f2-00f64e195dc9', 'multiverseId': 452750}, 'multiverseid': 452750}]", '[{\'name\': \'Waldlandstrom\', \'text\': \'Der Waldlandstrom kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wege, die sich das Wasser durch das Land bahnt, reflektieren die Wege, auf denen Ätherströme die Wolken durchdringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac7c62f-ccc6-4280-93c5-e2c69b2f6146\', \'multiverseId\': 451495}, \'multiverseid\': 451495}, {\'name\': \'Arroyo forestal\', \'text\': \'El Arroyo forestal entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El agua esculpe su camino por la tierra para reflejar el curso del éter que surca las nubes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9501af95-91bc-4e8a-9dc8-1d49ad27567e\', \'multiverseId\': 451743}, \'multiverseid\': 451743}, {\'name\': \'Ruisseau des sylves\', \'text\': \'Le Ruisseau des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les cours d\'eau creusent leur lit dans la terre pour refléter les chemins que prennent les flux d\'Éther dans les nuages.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451991&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'704ea25b-c439-4b8a-b1be-41717fdc60c8\', \'multiverseId\': 451991}, \'multiverseid\': 451991}, {\'name\': \'Ruscello nel Bosco\', \'text\': \'Il Ruscello nel Bosco entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "I corsi d\'acqua scavano nel terreno percorsi paralleli a quelli tracciati dai flussi d\'etere tra le nuvole.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3d26ee-5a97-4361-ae7a-6a5b8028d87d\', \'multiverseId\': 452239}, \'multiverseid\': 452239}, {\'name\': \'森林地の小川\', \'text\': \'森林地の小川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'霊気の流れが雲を通り抜ける道を映し出すかのように、小川もその経路を形作る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3375719f-1e6a-418b-80a1-e10b27101893\', \'multiverseId\': 452487}, \'multiverseid\': 452487}, {\'name\': \'Riacho da Floresta\', \'text\': \'Riacho da Floresta entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': "Os cursos d\'água traçam no terreno percursos paralelos aos desenhados pelos fluxos de éter entre as nuvens.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1321f7a0-6201-435d-87fe-ace6d36be0b8\', \'multiverseId\': 452735}, \'multiverseid\': 452735}]', "[{'name': 'Wechselbalg', 'text': 'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSchicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 1/1 farblosen Gestaltwandler-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wandelwicht.', 'type': 'Stammes-Spontanzauber — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451268&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e141f57-0413-4d7c-a8ed-0b573ac4c336', 'multiverseId': 451268}, 'multiverseid': 451268}, {'name': 'Cambio de cuna', 'text': 'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nExilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Metamorfo incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de cambiaformas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo tribal — Metamorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451516&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4485a519-ff14-4124-955f-7312b03b06aa', 'multiverseId': 451516}, 'multiverseid': 451516}, {'name': 'Échange au berceau', 'text': 'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nExilez la créature ciblée. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Changeforme avec le changelin.', 'type': 'Éphémère tribal : changeforme', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451764&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '834a46b6-7e42-4ac0-bc67-6ca7ddbb6eb7', 'multiverseId': 451764}, 'multiverseid': 451764}, {'name': 'Scambio di Culla', 'text': 'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nEsilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Polimorfo 1/1 incolore con cangiante.', 'type': 'Istantaneo Tribale — Polimorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452012&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '289572b7-bac8-4943-88a7-f32946cecd3a', 'multiverseId': 452012}, 'multiverseid': 452012}, {'name': '外身の交換', 'text': '多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、多相を持つ無色の１/１の多相の戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '部族・インスタント — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452260&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7eca2582-543d-4cf5-a3d8-d08cb4c224b9', 'multiverseId': 452260}, 'multiverseid': 452260}, {'name': 'Troca de Berço', 'text': 'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nExile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Metamorfo com morfoloide.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea Tribal — Metamorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452508&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d97d357-4d5a-43e7-9de7-c859c5416b96', 'multiverseId': 452508}, 'multiverseid': 452508}]", '[{\'name\': \'Weise der Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Weise der Renaturierung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Was einst von Steinmetzen errichtet, von Schmieden geformt oder von Magiern ins Leben gerufen wurde, werde ich an die Erde zurückgeben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451362&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41523027-31cf-4779-8851-8d88c6c1bde1\', \'multiverseId\': 451362}, \'multiverseid\': 451362}, {\'name\': \'Sabia de la recuperación\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sabia de la recuperación entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir el encantamiento o artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquello que construyeron los canteros, forjaron los herreros o animaron los magos, yo lo regresaré al abrazo de la tierra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98acfc4c-1660-4410-8d66-7e9a1d9b8cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 451610}, \'multiverseid\': 451610}, {\'name\': \'Sage du reboisement\', \'text\': "Quand la Sage du reboisement arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce qui jadis fut construit par des maçons, forgé par des forgerons ou animé par des magiciens, je le rends à la terre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec4bc8f-ba3e-45c8-89c5-2572ec3585ee\', \'multiverseId\': 451858}, \'multiverseid\': 451858}, {\'name\': \'Saggia della Rivendicazione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Saggia della Rivendicazione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che un tempo fu modellato dai tagliapietre, plasmato dai fabbri o infuso di vita dai maghi, io restituirò all\\\'abbraccio della terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6983146-cd51-4dc1-aab2-93281c437c09\', \'multiverseId\': 452106}, \'multiverseid\': 452106}, {\'name\': \'再利用の賢者\', \'text\': \'再利用の賢者が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「かつて石工によって作り出され、職人によって形が整えられ、そして魔道士によって命を与えられたものは、我によって再び大地の抱擁の中へと戻される。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b71de8e-1662-4069-af33-2458667632f3\', \'multiverseId\': 452354}, \'multiverseid\': 452354}, {\'name\': \'Sábio da Reivindicação\', \'text\': \'Quando Sábio da Reivindicação entra no campo de batalha, você pode destruir o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquilo que um dia foi formado por pedreiros, moldado por ferreiros ou animado por magos, eu devolverei ao abraço da terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e0419fa-f415-4ede-b170-9e17a057e63d\', \'multiverseId\': 452602}, \'multiverseid\': 452602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiser aus dem Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Weise aus dem Yavimaya stirbt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\n{2}, opfere den Weisen aus dem Yavimaya: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39c11bf-4fc2-4247-9293-1dd5ad264b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 451369}, \'multiverseid\': 451369}, {\'name\': \'Anciano de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Anciano de Yavimaya muera, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, mostrarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\n{2}, sacrificar al Anciano de Yavimaya: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a00f524-7e70-4e06-9a92-f2f221816970\', \'multiverseId\': 451617}, \'multiverseid\': 451617}, {\'name\': \'Vieux sage de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Quand le Vieux sage de la Yavimaya meurt, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main et mélanger votre bibliothèque.\\n{2}, sacrifiez le Vieux sage de la Yavimaya : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09242a3b-fb6d-4629-aa4a-dc4ab4c6b965\', \'multiverseId\': 451865}, \'multiverseid\': 451865}, {\'name\': \'Anziano di Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Anziano di Yavimaya muore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelarle, aggiungerle alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\n{2}, Sacrifica l\'Anziano di Yavimaya: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27db839b-09fc-45ec-bd03-683bc9dfc6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 452113}, \'multiverseid\': 452113}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの古老\', \'text\': \'ヤヴィマヤの古老が死亡したとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n{2}, ヤヴィマヤの古老を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9cfcc5-8cf8-4c61-94f0-35624487beac\', \'multiverseId\': 452361}, \'multiverseid\': 452361}, {\'name\': \'Ancião de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Quando Ancião de Yavimaya morre, você pode procurar até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-los, colocá-los em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\n{2}, sacrifique Ancião de Yavimaya: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e734751e-12cf-42ea-8f18-085725a0e0d7\', \'multiverseId\': 452609}, \'multiverseid\': 452609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weite Wanderungen\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\nGrenzwert — Falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, durchsuche deine Bibliothek stattdessen nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e0dca2d-23d3-42fa-84eb-70c6fcdeeed4\', \'multiverseId\': 451348}, \'multiverseid\': 451348}, {\'name\': \'Andanzas lejanas\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nUmbral — Si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, en vez de eso, busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813b0119-269e-4860-b3f5-ce465e516991\', \'multiverseId\': 451596}, \'multiverseid\': 451596}, {\'name\': \'Errances lointaines\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nSeuil — Si vous avez au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, à la place cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2832a3d-8e0a-410a-9e61-eb7fe478b6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 451844}, \'multiverseid\': 451844}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondaggi Lontani\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nSoglia — Se ci sono sette o più carte nel tuo cimitero, invece passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a5bbfa-82d5-4f13-954f-cb8108a82f35\', \'multiverseId\': 452092}, \'multiverseid\': 452092}, {\'name\': \'はるかなる放浪\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nスレッショルド ― あなたの墓地にカードが７枚以上あるなら、代わりに、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b10c0f-138a-4532-8852-57fcd9d108f7\', \'multiverseId\': 452340}, \'multiverseid\': 452340}, {\'name\': \'Viagem Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\\nLimiar — Se houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério, em vez disso, procure em seu grimório até três cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01540685-167b-4234-88c4-3e685082be5c\', \'multiverseId\': 452588}, \'multiverseid\': 452588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wendholzwald-Säer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Länderkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 0/1 grünen Pflanze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{G}, opfere drei Kreaturen: Bringe eine Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Zendikars Wunden können geheilt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450695&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acbc85f8-d226-4913-bb58-db0ed14803e9\', \'multiverseId\': 450695}, \'multiverseid\': 450695}, {\'name\': \'Sembrador de Madera Torcida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más cartas de tierra vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte, crea una ficha de criatura Planta verde 0/1.\\n{G}, sacrificar tres criaturas: Regresa la carta de tierra objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las heridas de Zendikar pueden curarse".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5de07da-5764-4e03-a052-161c8033fd6e\', \'multiverseId\': 450754}, \'multiverseid\': 450754}, {\'name\': \'Semeur de Tournebois\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de terrain est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, créez un jeton de créature 0/1 verte Plante.\\n{G}, sacrifiez trois créatures : Renvoyez une carte de terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Les blessures de Zendikar peuvent être soignées. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399ce127-bed4-414d-b38a-a5571e076770\', \'multiverseId\': 450813}, \'multiverseid\': 450813}, {\'name\': \'Seminatore di Legnotorto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più carte terra vengono messe nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona, crea una pedina creatura Pianta 0/1 verde.\\n{G}, Sacrifica tre creature: Riprendi in mano una carta terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le ferite di Zendikar possono essere sanate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95eadbcd-b72a-4d40-9513-d6ab749b750a\', \'multiverseId\': 450872}, \'multiverseid\': 450872}, {\'name\': \'変わり樹の蒔き手\', \'text\': \'いずれかの領域から土地・カードが１枚以上あなたの墓地に置かれるたび、緑の０/１の植物・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{G}, クリーチャー３体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーの傷は癒えうる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6384f5e6-7d37-46b8-916a-b07662f06451\', \'multiverseId\': 450931}, \'multiverseid\': 450931}, {\'name\': \'Semeador de Virapau\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais cards de terreno forem colocados no seu cemitério vindos de qualquer lugar, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 0/1 do tipo Planta.\\n{G}, sacrifique três criaturas: Devolva o card de terreno alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"As feridas de Zendikar podem ser curadas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75702e32-3868-47ce-bb2a-0d927b1d9ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 450990}, \'multiverseid\': 450990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wilde Landschaften\', \'text\': \'Die Wilden Landschaften kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}, {R} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jund ist als Welt so grausam wie die Lebewesen, die dort wohnen. Das brutale Mühen ums Überleben vernarbt das Land ebenso wie das Land seine Bewohner: ein Teufelskreis, der außer Kontrolle gerät.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3efea99e-0d92-4a25-9cc8-fa3470f874c3\', \'multiverseId\': 451478}, \'multiverseid\': 451478}, {\'name\': \'Tierras salvajes\', \'text\': \'Las Tierras salvajes entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}, {R} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Jund es un mundo tan cruel como quienes lo llaman hogar. Sus luchas brutales marcan la tierra tanto como esta a ellos, un círculo vicioso fuera de control.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb75fbfe-8744-46b1-b24b-bbbc218cda24\', \'multiverseId\': 451726}, \'multiverseid\': 451726}, {\'name\': \'Terres sauvages\', \'text\': \'Les Terres sauvages arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}, {R} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Jund est un monde aussi cruel que ses habitants. Leurs luttes brutales blessent la terre à mesure qu\'elle les façonne à son image... Un cercle vicieux qui échappe à tout contrôle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6475cfd-716b-4f0f-bd81-e03ec936b47e\', \'multiverseId\': 451974}, \'multiverseid\': 451974}, {\'name\': \'Territori Selvaggi\', \'text\': \'I Territori Selvaggi entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}, {R} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Jund è un mondo crudele quanto coloro che la chiamano casa. Le loro lotte intestine deturpano la terra proprio mentre essa li scolpisce a sua immagine, un circolo vizioso ben presto fuori controllo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9186cc-d0a4-4697-be0a-6001d5b2e4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 452222}, \'multiverseid\': 452222}, {\'name\': \'野蛮な地\', \'text\': \'野蛮な地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドは、そこを故郷と呼ぶものと同じぐらい残忍な世界だ。彼らの残忍な争いはその地に傷を残し、それはあたかも手に負えない凶暴な螺旋をかたどるようだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551375d3-ac54-42fa-9d52-2b5691a8d5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 452470}, \'multiverseid\': 452470}, {\'name\': \'Terras Selvagens\', \'text\': \'Terras Selvagens entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}, {R} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Jund é um mundo tão cruel quanto aqueles que ali habitam. Seus violentos conflitos deixam cicatrizes na terra ao mesmo tempo que essa os molda à sua imagem, um círculo vicioso fora de controle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9d0d85-9f44-4fd7-b315-d608aee550cc\', \'multiverseId\': 452718}, \'multiverseid\': 452718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wilder Wirbelwind\', \'text\': \'Der Wilde Wirbelwind fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur ist der denkbar rücksichtsloseste Zerstörer und hat eine Kraft und Wildheit, mit der keine Armee mithalten kann. Die Gruul bemühen sich, ihrem Beispiel zu folgen."\\n—Trigori, Senator der Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451393&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5068c77d-f7f5-4c57-bb6b-bb56072ef70c\', \'multiverseId\': 451393}, \'multiverseid\': 451393}, {\'name\': \'Torbellino salvaje\', \'text\': \'El Torbellino salvaje hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza es la destructora ciega por excelencia, capaz de un poder y una ferocidad que ningún ejército puede igualar, y los gruul siguen su ejemplo".\\n—Trigóri, senador azorio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f9f93e-a18b-41fb-9cfa-c27ccbdcd145\', \'multiverseId\': 451641}, \'multiverseid\': 451641}, {\'name\': \'Tornade sauvage\', \'text\': \'La Tornade sauvage inflige X blessures à chaque créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La nature est le destructeur ultime, capable d\'une force et d\'une férocité inégalées par nos armées. Et les Gruul suivent son exemple. »\\n—Trigori, sénateur d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba51ca8d-e2db-4ce6-a0da-b901be80cd0c\', \'multiverseId\': 451889}, \'multiverseid\': 451889}, {\'name\': \'Tornado Scatenato\', \'text\': \'Il Tornado Scatenato infligge X danni a ogni creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La natura è il distruttore definitivo e scriteriato, capace di sprigionare un potere e una ferocia che nessun esercito potrebbe eguagliare e i Gruul ne seguono l\\\'esempio."\\n—Trigori, senatore Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1688120b-5b51-4a1b-872c-f81d4fafee41\', \'multiverseId\': 452137}, \'multiverseid\': 452137}, {\'name\': \'大竜巻\', \'text\': \'大竜巻は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自然は究極の意思無き破壊者だ。その力と凶暴さにはどんな軍隊も相手にならない。そして、グルールはその例に従っているのだ。」\\n――アゾリウスの議員、トリゴリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5cc1653-d136-40b5-acd2-67a0e0c6df34\', \'multiverseId\': 452385}, \'multiverseid\': 452385}, {\'name\': \'Tornado Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Tornado Selvagem causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza é uma força destruidora implacável, com tal poder e crueldade que nenhum exército consegue igualar, e os Gruul seguem seu exemplo."\\n— Trigori, senador Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40699869-ef6d-4ac4-adb5-e15951d598b1\', \'multiverseId\': 452633}, \'multiverseid\': 452633}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildheitgelübde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3, verursacht Trampelschaden und kann weder dich noch einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Wildheit ist das Geburtsrecht jeder Kreatur, die atmet — oder wenigstens wünscht, dies zu tun."\\n—Karador, Geisterhäuptling\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2f11c9-d62d-46d0-80a8-72a05e47c4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 451367}, \'multiverseid\': 451367}, {\'name\': \'Promesa de salvajismo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3, arrolla y no puede atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"El salvajismo es el derecho de nacimiento de todas las criaturas que respiran, o que desearían poder hacerlo".\\n—Karador, Cacique Fantasma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f836d5-1eba-4f0b-98f9-cd1253bdd34d\', \'multiverseId\': 451615}, \'multiverseid\': 451615}, {\'name\': \'Vœu de sauvagerie\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3, a le piétinement et elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« La sauvagerie est le droit de naissance de chaque créature qui respire... Ou qui souhaiterait pouvoir le faire. »\\n—Karador, chef de clan fantôme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9064bfa7-3968-412c-9ae5-e012441b110f\', \'multiverseId\': 451863}, \'multiverseid\': 451863}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento del Selvatico\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3, ha travolgere e non può attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"La selvatichezza è il diritto di nascita di ogni creatura che respira... o che vorrebbe farlo."\\n—Karador, Capitano Fantasma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28706e85-1e7e-42e6-984b-b04893659329\', \'multiverseId\': 452111}, \'multiverseid\': 452111}, {\'name\': \'野生の誓約\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け、トランプルを持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「残虐さは息をする生き物にとって当然の権利だ。さもなくば、そうあればと願うことだ。」\\n――幽霊の酋長、カラドール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c983d3ab-8acb-4dd2-bd38-d8eae40ddf00\', \'multiverseId\': 452359}, \'multiverseid\': 452359}, {\'name\': \'Voto de Selvageria\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3, tem atropelar e não pode atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"A selvageria é o direito nato de toda criatura que respira — ou que gostaria de respirar."\\n— Karador, cacique fantasma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffec7b3-9766-4e1a-902d-b910e9c08660\', \'multiverseId\': 452607}, \'multiverseid\': 452607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildwasser-Najaden\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Wildwasser-Najaden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'Stell dich den brausenden Stromschnellen entgegen und du sollst die Kraft der Najaden zu spüren bekommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a5f4f4c-cd78-46d4-8d79-187643714305\', \'multiverseId\': 451315}, \'multiverseid\': 451315}, {\'name\': \'Náyades de aguablanca\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que las Náyades de aguablanca u otro encantamiento entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'Trata de resistir el ímpetu de los rápidos del río y conocerás la fuerza de las náyades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c8c5ae8-ced3-4218-8aa1-25f85681386f\', \'multiverseId\': 451563}, \'multiverseid\': 451563}, {\'name\': \'Naïades des eaux vives\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que les Naïades des eaux vives ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'Pour connaître le pouvoir des naïades, essayez simplement de résister aux rapides du fleuve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc803084-8072-4b1c-a25c-4e8a892a707e\', \'multiverseId\': 451811}, \'multiverseid\': 451811}, {\'name\': \'Naiadi delle Rapide\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Naiadi delle Rapide o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': "Opponiti all\'urto delle rapide del fiume e conoscerai il potere delle naiadi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de6ffd4-66ab-477b-af62-913ec6d7a4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 452059}, \'multiverseid\': 452059}, {\'name\': \'急流のナイアード\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 急流のナイアードか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': \'川の急流に逆らってみることで、ナイアードの持つ力の大きさが分かるようになるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df7439c-14e8-4644-98ca-87cd94ba390f\', \'multiverseId\': 452307}, \'multiverseid\': 452307}, {\'name\': \'Náiades das Corredeiras\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Náiades das Corredeiras ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo não poderá ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'Tente enfrentar a força da correnteza de um rio e você entenderá o poder das náiades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924b6791-6c1d-4f5e-a4bf-34dbeb57dae5\', \'multiverseId\': 452555}, \'multiverseid\': 452555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildwuchs\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher zusätzlich {G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du stehenbleibst, um zu lauschen, kannst du es wachsen hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc7aac4-18b9-48c7-90a2-23320a58a301\', \'multiverseId\': 451368}, \'multiverseid\': 451368}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento salvaje\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un {G} adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Si te detienes a escuchar, lo oirás crecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfeafeba-69c9-4e8b-8fe4-1603258a5065\', \'multiverseId\': 451616}, \'multiverseid\': 451616}, {\'name\': \'Végétation luxuriante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute {G} supplémentaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Si vous arrêtez d\'écouter, vous l\'entendrez penser.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bd265f2-9330-472c-9a8d-8b89c7a41943\', \'multiverseId\': 451864}, \'multiverseid\': 451864}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Rigogliosa\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge {G} addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Se ti fermi ad ascoltare, puoi sentirlo crescere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91a966b-974b-4c65-8856-637e9a747ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 452112}, \'multiverseid\': 452112}, {\'name\': \'繁茂\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'耳をすましてよく聞けば、それが成長している音が聞こえるよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261ab0d1-f3cb-4256-b9d1-3346c9c96450\', \'multiverseId\': 452360}, \'multiverseid\': 452360}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Virente\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona {G} extra.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Se você parar para escutar, dá para ouvi-la crescer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364daf68-2a85-465b-82db-36e83626ba8f\', \'multiverseId\': 452608}, \'multiverseid\': 452608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windgraces Richtspruch\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre für eine beliebige Anzahl an Gegnern jeweils eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht jeder, der sich an Urza erinnern kann, tut dies mit Freude.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd080e09-39dd-46ee-ab84-7ea9c54fe283\', \'multiverseId\': 450709}, \'multiverseid\': 450709}, {\'name\': \'Juicio de Windgrace\', \'text\': \'Por cualquier cantidad de oponentes, destruye el permanente que no sea tierra objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No todo el mundo guarda un buen recuerdo de Urza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577fdcc5-a09a-48b4-a3f1-281f32863ada\', \'multiverseId\': 450768}, \'multiverseid\': 450768}, {\'name\': \'Jugement selon Vent des vertus\', \'text\': "Pour n\'importe quel nombre d\'adversaires, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui se souviennent d\'Urza n\'en gardent pas toujours un bon souvenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d0a651-b863-4ccc-b1a4-f3a4e4bcb5f5\', \'multiverseId\': 450827}, \'multiverseid\': 450827}, {\'name\': \'Giudizio di Windgrace\', \'text\': \'Scegli un numero qualsiasi di avversari. Per ognuno di essi, distruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non tutti ricordano Urza con benevolenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'085613c0-66ae-47a6-ab6f-798bcf1e16f1\', \'multiverseId\': 450886}, \'multiverseid\': 450886}, {\'name\': \'ウィンドグレイスの裁き\', \'text\': \'望む数の対戦相手につき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザのことを思い出すとき、誰もが懐かしいと感じるわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429afb01-7b6e-4e9a-8645-9c7c7024180c\', \'multiverseId\': 450945}, \'multiverseid\': 450945}, {\'name\': \'Julgamento de Windgrace\', \'text\': \'Para qualquer número de oponentes, destrua a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nem todos que se lembram de Urza o fazem saudosos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bb9636-04bd-427d-8f79-d9e23ada6743\', \'multiverseId\': 451004}, \'multiverseid\': 451004}]', "[{'name': 'Wirbler-Räuberin', 'text': 'Wenn die Wirbler-Räuberin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451314&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee74116b-7295-4464-ab44-25a29f53651c', 'multiverseId': 451314}, 'multiverseid': 451314}, {'name': 'Bribona de los zumbones', 'text': 'Cuando la Bribona de los zumbones entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nGirar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice bribón humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451562&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e0ea392-2607-4b88-90b5-f3a337e5ad57', 'multiverseId': 451562}, 'multiverseid': 451562}, {'name': 'Gredine à voltigeurs', 'text': 'Quand la Gredine à voltigeurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : la créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et gredin et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451810&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9802006-b6ba-4635-b068-f071a93c9869', 'multiverseId': 451810}, 'multiverseid': 451810}, {'name': 'Canaglia dei Turbinanti', 'text': 'Quando la Canaglia dei Turbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Farabutto Umano Artefice', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452058&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6673281-1a70-4ff2-9e20-93023a334b0e', 'multiverseId': 452058}, 'multiverseid': 452058}, {'name': 'つむじ風のならず者', 'text': 'つむじ風のならず者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のアーティファクト２つをタップする：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452306&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '872f1479-aea7-4193-a2e1-6e1a1d32a893', 'multiverseId': 452306}, 'multiverseid': 452306}, {'name': 'Ladra dos Turbilinos', 'text': 'Quando Ladra dos Turbilinos entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\nVire dois artefatos desvirados que você controla: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ladino Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452554&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7325a16-f87f-41c5-bb40-c1de829aee2d', 'multiverseId': 452554}, 'multiverseid': 452554}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wolkenform\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Wolkenform ins Spiel kommt, wird sie zu einer Aura und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek und lege die Wolkenform daran an. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit und Fluchsicherheit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69b48f8-3b5a-4ec3-870a-d25cf9597626\', \'multiverseId\': 451286}, \'multiverseid\': 451286}, {\'name\': \'Forma de nube\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Forma de nube entre al campo de batalla, se convierte en un Aura con encantar criatura. Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca y anexa la Forma de nube a ella. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\\nLa criatura encantada tiene las habilidades de volar y antimaleficio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77f86f6-ae2f-4666-925e-04e635df8947\', \'multiverseId\': 451534}, \'multiverseid\': 451534}, {\'name\': \'Forme nuageuse\', \'text\': "Quand la Forme nuageuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle devient une aura avec enchanter : créature. Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et attachez-lui la Forme nuageuse. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée a le vol et la défense talismanique.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'086946a8-47d0-4e7d-8176-1b376d5adbd5\', \'multiverseId\': 451782}, \'multiverseid\': 451782}, {\'name\': \'Forma di Nube\', \'text\': "Quando la Forma di Nube entra nel campo di battaglia, diventa un\'Aura con incanta creatura. Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio e assegnale la Forma di Nube. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\\nLa creatura incantata ha volare e anti-malocchio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb4efee-73ca-4b06-b485-b212de2abb67\', \'multiverseId\': 452030}, \'multiverseid\': 452030}, {\'name\': \'雲変化\', \'text\': \'雲変化が戦場に出たとき、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラになる。あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示し、それに雲変化をつける。（カードを予示するとは、「それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。」ということである。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行と呪禁を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3601959b-e956-4537-a060-b09b369db7ed\', \'multiverseId\': 452278}, \'multiverseid\': 452278}, {\'name\': \'Nubiforme\', \'text\': \'Quando Nubiforme entra no campo de batalha, ele se torna uma Aura com encantar criatura. Manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório e anexe Nubiforme a ele. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada tem voar e resistência a magia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a345d3-d189-45a2-b218-8f4237e8739c\', \'multiverseId\': 452526}, \'multiverseid\': 452526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Würmerernte\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Würmchen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451397&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59da93dd-8492-47b1-bf7d-b11c66ffc4c8\', \'multiverseId\': 451397}, \'multiverseid\': 451397}, {\'name\': \'Cosechar gusanos\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Gusano negra y verde 1/1 por cada carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf193b3-e048-4827-8a88-94ce7fd64ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 451645}, \'multiverseid\': 451645}, {\'name\': \'Moisson de vers\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire et verte Ver pour chaque carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21468b10-3522-4b68-a86d-ae8b41411e65\', \'multiverseId\': 451893}, \'multiverseid\': 451893}, {\'name\': \'Raccolto del Verme\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Verme 1/1 nera e verde per ogni carta terra nel tuo cimitero.\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343f21c8-93d9-4a3b-9d04-4feb902c8f41\', \'multiverseId\': 452141}, \'multiverseid\': 452141}, {\'name\': \'蟲の収穫\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき、黒であり緑である１/１の蟲・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3dc5e66-3904-4d59-b3c7-bc1354a2d0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 452389}, \'multiverseid\': 452389}, {\'name\': \'Colheita de Verme\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura preta e verde 1/1 do tipo Verme para cada card de terreno em seu cemitério.\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card a partir de seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c432e1-5184-4fd9-ba0d-ec706da60cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 452637}, \'multiverseid\': 452637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Xantcha die Schläferin\', \'text\': \'Sowie Xantcha die Schläferin ins Spiel kommt, übernimmt ein Gegner, den du bestimmst, die Kontrolle über sie.\\nXantcha greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und kann weder ihren Besitzer noch einen Planeswalker, den ihr Besitzer kontrolliert, angreifen.\\n{3}: Xantchas Beherrscher verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du ziehst eine Karte. Jeder Spieler kann diese Fähigkeit aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Diener\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb93f66-a70a-412c-b671-01afeacca288\', \'multiverseId\': 450710}, \'multiverseid\': 450710}, {\'name\': \'Xantcha, agente durmiente\', \'text\': \'En cuanto Xantcha, agente durmiente entre al campo de batalla, un oponente de tu elección gana su control.\\nXantcha ataca cada combate si puede y no puede atacar a su propietario o a planeswalkers que controla su propietario.\\n{3}: El controlador de Xantcha pierde 2 vidas y tú robas una carta. Cualquier jugador puede activar esta habilidad.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Sicario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ea8fe9-197a-4463-93f8-91862c473d09\', \'multiverseId\': 450769}, \'multiverseid\': 450769}, {\'name\': \'Xantcha, agent en sommeil\', \'text\': "Au moment où Xantcha, agent en sommeil arrive sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire de votre choix en acquiert le contrôle.\\nXantcha attaque à chaque combat si possible et ne peut pas attaquer son propriétaire ou les planeswalkers que son propriétaire contrôle.\\n{3} : Le contrôleur de Xantcha perd 2 points de vie et vous piochez une carte. N\'importe quel joueur peut activer cette capacité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : mignon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450828&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5220c3-1abb-4088-ad64-85650db79aae\', \'multiverseId\': 450828}, \'multiverseid\': 450828}, {\'name\': \'Xantcha, Agente Dormiente\', \'text\': \'Mentre Xantcha, Agente Dormiente entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario a tua scelta ne prende il controllo.\\nXantcha attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo, e non può attaccare il suo proprietario o i planeswalker controllati dal suo proprietario.\\n{3}: Il controllore di Xantcha perde 2 punti vita e tu peschi una carta. Qualsiasi giocatore può attivare questa abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Servitore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'128307a5-e450-4e56-844c-6a9b82206066\', \'multiverseId\': 450887}, \'multiverseid\': 450887}, {\'name\': \'潜伏工作員、ザンチャ\', \'text\': \'潜伏工作員、ザンチャが戦場に出るに際し、あなたが選ぶ対戦相手１人はこれのコントロールを得る。\\n潜伏工作員、ザンチャは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃する。これはオーナーやオーナーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\\n{3}：潜伏工作員、ザンチャのコントローラーは２点のライフを失い、あなたはカードを１枚引く。この能力はどのプレイヤーも起動できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ミニオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0861606f-9a16-4e21-9bee-2853297fa3a7\', \'multiverseId\': 450946}, \'multiverseid\': 450946}, {\'name\': \'Xantcha, Agente Adormecida\', \'text\': \'Conforme Xantcha, Agente Adormecida, entra no campo de batalha, um oponente à sua escolha ganha o controle dela.\\nXantcha ataca a cada combate se estiver apta, e não pode atacar seu dono nem planeswalkers que seu dono controle.\\n{3}: O controlador de Xantcha perde dois pontos de vida e você compra um card. Qualquer jogador pode ativar esta habilidade.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Assecla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb3ef41-7b0c-4f43-84f8-c182cbfb9192\', \'multiverseId\': 451005}, \'multiverseid\': 451005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yavimayablütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Die Yavimayablütenzauberin erhält +1/+1 für jede Verzauberung im Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Wurzeln verbinden sie mit den Wünschen des Waldes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e97bf51-632c-49e8-8b4c-7796c6220afa\', \'multiverseId\': 451370}, \'multiverseid\': 451370}, {\'name\': \'Hechicera de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'La Hechicera de Yavimaya obtiene +1/+1 por cada encantamiento en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'Sus raíces la conectan con los deseos del bosque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc346213-2efa-4448-846d-af82b41b40a8\', \'multiverseId\': 451618}, \'multiverseid\': 451618}, {\'name\': \'Enchanteresse de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': "L\'Enchanteresse de la Yavimaya gagne +1/+1 pour chaque enchantement sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'Ses racines la relient aux désirs de la forêt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c3d6ab-6411-4943-aa67-da41f2c86ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 451866}, \'multiverseid\': 451866}, {\'name\': \'Incantatrice di Yavimaya\', \'text\': "L\'Incantatrice di Yavimaya prende +1/+1 per ogni incantesimo sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue radici la tengono in contatto con i desideri della foresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7a523c-3c75-4887-915c-fb6ef9eca441\', \'multiverseId\': 452114}, \'multiverseid\': 452114}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの女魔術師\', \'text\': \'ヤヴィマヤの女魔術師は、戦場にあるエンチャント１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の根は、彼女と森の願望とをつないでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961259fe-c598-4b50-82e3-06272be76ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 452362}, \'multiverseid\': 452362}, {\'name\': \'Encantadora de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Encantadora de Yavimaya recebe +1/+1 para cada encantamento no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Suas raízes a conectam aos desejos da floresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8c3240-3668-4721-9c8c-05056d1f1641\', \'multiverseId\': 452610}, \'multiverseid\': 452610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yennett, kryptische Souveränin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn Yennett, kryptische Souveränin, angreift, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls die umgewandelten Manakosten der Karte ungerade sind, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Ziehe sonst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Sie spricht in Rätseln, die nur ihre Schüler lösen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450711&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2519805-a97c-42ef-8ff0-30c9a5c3b780\', \'multiverseId\': 450711}, \'multiverseid\': 450711}, {\'name\': \'Yennett, soberana críptica\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, amenaza.\\nSiempre que Yennett, soberana críptica ataque, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si el coste de maná convertido de esa carta es impar, puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. De lo contrario, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Se expresa con acertijos que solo sus discípulos saben descifrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737caf40-2aea-4e94-95de-174cc7894ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 450770}, \'multiverseid\': 450770}, {\'name\': \'Yennett, souveraine cryptique\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance, menace\\nÀ chaque fois que Yennett, souveraine cryptique attaque, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si le coût converti de mana de cette carte est impair, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Sinon, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'exprime par énigmes que seuls ses disciples peuvent déchiffrer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a91cf5e-10e6-4dd9-bee3-e049dd21c385\', \'multiverseId\': 450829}, \'multiverseid\': 450829}, {\'name\': \'Yennett, Sovrana Criptica\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta Yennett, Sovrana Criptica attacca, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se il costo di mana convertito di quella carta è dispari, puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Altrimenti, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Parla per enigmi che solo i suoi discepoli sanno decifrare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c7c34f-1b5a-4e5f-9ef3-38f2108488c7\', \'multiverseId\': 450888}, \'multiverseid\': 450888}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた君主、イェンネット\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、威迫\\n謎めいた君主、イェンネットが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストが奇数である場合、あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。そうでないなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は謎かけを使って会話する。それを解けるのは彼女の弟子たちのみだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a327e728-cba9-4622-a8b8-c89ac9206da1\', \'multiverseId\': 450947}, \'multiverseid\': 450947}, {\'name\': \'Yennett, Soberana Enigmática\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, ameaçar\\nToda vez que Yennett, Soberana Enigmática, atacar, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se o custo de mana convertido daquele card for ímpar, você poderá conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Do contrário, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Ela fala usando enigmas que somente seus discípulos conseguem desvendar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d297fa4-78e4-4f45-ae8a-a4ad03026c13\', \'multiverseId\': 451006}, \'multiverseid\': 451006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yuriko, Schatten des Tigers\', \'text\': \'Kommandeur-Ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand oder der Kommandozone getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn ein Ninja, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Jeder Gegner verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten jener Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17d6239-9665-47ea-9d33-aa85c0f84460\', \'multiverseId\': 450712}, \'multiverseid\': 450712}, {\'name\': \'Yuriko, la Sombra del Tigre\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu de comandante {U}{B}. ({U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano o la zona de mando girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que un Ninja que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Cada oponente pierde una cantidad de vidas igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ninja humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af61ace5-2ec5-4f74-bb10-8b93020c3803\', \'multiverseId\': 450771}, \'multiverseid\': 450771}, {\'name\': "Yuriko, l\'ombre du tigre", \'text\': "Ninjutsu de commandant {U}{B} ({U}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main ou la zone de commandement.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un ninja que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez cette carte dans votre main. Chaque adversaire perd un nombre de points de vie égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa4b5cf-30e0-4204-aa58-0efd7e12a2fe\', \'multiverseId\': 450830}, \'multiverseid\': 450830}, {\'name\': "Yuriko, l\'Ombra della Tigre", \'text\': \'Ninjutsu del comandante {U}{B} ({U}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano o dalla zona di comando TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta un Ninja che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Ogni avversario perde punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ninja Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f070b3-dba6-4352-84e7-929f4803628f\', \'multiverseId\': 450889}, \'multiverseid\': 450889}, {\'name\': \'虎の影、百合子\', \'text\': \'上忍術{U}{B}（{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札か統率領域からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている忍者１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開してあなたの手札に加える。各対戦相手はそれぞれ、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06266158-0b5e-4b8c-b7b8-983ff893789e\', \'multiverseId\': 450948}, \'multiverseid\': 450948}, {\'name\': \'Yuriko, a Sombra do Tigre\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu de comandante {U}{B} ({U}{B}, devolva um atacante não bloqueado que você controla para a sua mão: Coloque este card da sua mão ou da zona de comando no campo de batalha virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que um Ninja que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, revele o card do topo de seu grimório e coloque aquele card em sua mão. Cada oponente perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad78b7f-4b29-4df2-9e43-959612171e10\', \'multiverseId\': 451007}, \'multiverseid\': 451007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zendikars Rächer\', \'text\': \'Wenn Zendikars Rächer ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge für jedes Land, das du kontrollierst, einen 0/1 grünen Pflanze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Pflanze-Kreatur legen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451332&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfe47696-8498-4e92-b619-1812efd6c274\', \'multiverseId\': 451332}, \'multiverseid\': 451332}, {\'name\': \'Vengador de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Vengador de Zendikar entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Planta verde 0/1 por cada tierra que controlas.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura Planta que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90bd160f-f700-492f-8ba0-39c560850701\', \'multiverseId\': 451580}, \'multiverseid\': 451580}, {\'name\': \'Vengeur de Zendikar\', \'text\': "Quand le Vengeur de Zendikar arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/1 verte Plante pour chaque terrain que vous contrôlez.\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature Plante que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451828&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1909ca05-aa46-46a9-ac4d-9a7d4a5f5899\', \'multiverseId\': 451828}, \'multiverseid\': 451828}, {\'name\': \'Vendicatore di Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Quando il Vendicatore di Zendikar entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Pianta 0/1 verde per ogni terra che controlli.\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura Pianta che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe75386d-3d5d-4d3b-b46a-b19284124c7f\', \'multiverseId\': 452076}, \'multiverseid\': 452076}, {\'name\': \'ゼンディカーの報復者\', \'text\': \'ゼンディカーの報復者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つにつき、緑の０/１の植物・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしている各植物・クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff36e80-71c9-47d3-bfe9-5ed307771c9b\', \'multiverseId\': 452324}, \'multiverseid\': 452324}, {\'name\': \'Vingador de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Quando Vingador de Zendikar entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 0/1 do tipo Planta para cada terreno que você controla.\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura do tipo Planta que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda72b3b-06cd-4566-99f4-f8580f8c8c5d\', \'multiverseId\': 452572}, \'multiverseid\': 452572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerlegender Schlag\', \'text\': \'Bonus {2}{U} (Du kannst zusätzlich {2}{U} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nZerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd56a19-4c46-4b97-9c78-fc49f48bf7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 451269}, \'multiverseid\': 451269}, {\'name\': \'Impacto desmantelador\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {2}{U}. (Puedes pagar {2}{U} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nDestruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64989262-1eba-4edb-ac38-c59546ae037c\', \'multiverseId\': 451517}, \'multiverseid\': 451517}, {\'name\': \'Coup désactivateur\', \'text\': "Kick {2}{U} (Vous pouvez payer {2}{U} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nDétruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé. Si ce sort a été kické, piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4145f098-c872-4a77-b4b1-3e318e452118\', \'multiverseId\': 451765}, \'multiverseid\': 451765}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Devastante\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {2}{U} (Puoi pagare {2}{U} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nDistruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e121df49-2528-42bc-8bdf-c3c813598576\', \'multiverseId\': 452013}, \'multiverseid\': 452013}, {\'name\': \'解体の一撃\', \'text\': \'キッカー{2}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{2}{U}を支払ってもよい。）\\nアーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa5f40a-f823-49cd-b054-8db53d328394\', \'multiverseId\': 452261}, \'multiverseid\': 452261}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Desmantelador\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {2}{U} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {2}{U} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nDestrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo. Se esta mágica foi reforçada, compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f133ff83-5076-4ff9-9448-5a43f1a718b8\', \'multiverseId\': 452509}, \'multiverseid\': 452509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu Staub zurückkehren\', \'text\': \'Schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil. Falls du diesen Zauberspruch während deiner Hauptphase gewirkt hast, kannst du bis zu ein weiteres Artefakt oder eine weitere Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Zeitstränge zerspleißen, verzweigen und vermischen sich. Andere enden unerwartet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308d5ade-c064-4d3a-950c-41d099f1ee02\', \'multiverseId\': 451274}, \'multiverseid\': 451274}, {\'name\': \'Volver al polvo\', \'text\': \'Exilia el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Si lanzas este hechizo durante tu fase principal, puedes exiliar otro artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas líneas temporales se ramifican, se deshilachan y se entrecruzan. Otras terminan abruptamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d27375a-9aa0-45c2-9045-85992815e772\', \'multiverseId\': 451522}, \'multiverseid\': 451522}, {\'name\': \'Rendre à la poussière\', \'text\': "Exilez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé. Si vous avez lancé ce sort pendant votre phase principale, vous pouvez exiler jusqu\'à un autre artefact ou enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Certaines lignes temporelles se multiplient, se rejoignent et se séparent perpétuellement. D\'autres s\'achèvent de manière abrupte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff7d6fd-de6f-4d38-972e-2c702e0c2147\', \'multiverseId\': 451770}, \'multiverseid\': 451770}, {\'name\': \'Ritornare Polvere\', \'text\': \'Esilia un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Se hai lanciato questa magia nella tua fase principale, puoi esiliare fino a un altro artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Alcune linee temporali continuamente si sfilacciano, si ramificano e si mischiano. Altre terminano bruscamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f38bb7d-dd2e-42f5-913c-5ec18a696f12\', \'multiverseId\': 452018}, \'multiverseid\': 452018}, {\'name\': \'塵への帰結\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。あなたがこの呪文をあなたのメイン・フェイズ中に唱えたなら、他のアーティファクトやエンチャント最大１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'歴史の中には、ほつれ、枝分かれし、混ざり合うものがある。それ以外はあっけなく終わるものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6f8e7b-a12d-49b2-9eac-913c7ed4e86c\', \'multiverseId\': 452266}, \'multiverseid\': 452266}, {\'name\': \'Voltar ao Pó\', \'text\': \'Exile o artefato ou encantamento alvo. Se você conjurou esta mágica durante sua fase principal, você pode exilar um outro artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas linhas do tempo sofrem desgastes, ramificações e fusões eternamente. Outras se encerram bruscamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93bb3982-069e-4cdd-819e-d4ce8a7c7374\', \'multiverseId\': 452514}, \'multiverseid\': 452514}]', "[{'name': 'Zusammenflicken', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nGrenzwert — Bringe die Karte stattdessen aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451322&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c2e68d9-a758-4215-8333-1642e25048f1', 'multiverseId': 451322}, 'multiverseid': 451322}, {'name': 'Suturar', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nUmbral — En vez de eso, regresa esa carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451570&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '684d0f6e-acad-41d3-ae64-67869088aa04', 'multiverseId': 451570}, 'multiverseid': 451570}, {'name': 'Cousus ensemble', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nSeuil — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille cette carte depuis votre cimetière à la place si vous avez au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451818&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29575f32-5ca4-4bc3-92e6-c16db9427eb6', 'multiverseId': 451818}, 'multiverseid': 451818}, {'name': 'Rappezzare', 'text': 'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nSoglia — Rimetti invece sul campo di battaglia quella carta dal tuo cimitero se nel tuo cimitero ci sono sette o più carte.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452066&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ad8b015-0fb4-4a06-83e0-7809cb37e345', 'multiverseId': 452066}, 'multiverseid': 452066}, {'name': '縫合', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nスレッショルド ― あなたの墓地にカードが７枚以上あるなら、代わりにあなたの墓地からそのカードを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452314&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41c64c69-035b-4c1f-8c6b-4daf0c9c4aeb', 'multiverseId': 452314}, 'multiverseid': 452314}, {'name': 'Costurar', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nLimiar — Se houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério, em vez disso, devolva aquele card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452562&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fa5f029-b210-4877-a5af-b0e4b2de3d90', 'multiverseId': 452562}, 'multiverseid': 452562}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zündelnder Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\n{1}{R}: Der Zündelnde Höllendrache erhält +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn er fliegt, brennt der Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c3b8dc-d850-4462-b63e-c67b1f2b10f1\', \'multiverseId\': 451327}, \'multiverseid\': 451327}, {\'name\': \'Engendro inflamador\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\n{1}{R}: El Engendro inflamador obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Su vuelo prende fuego a los cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5281006a-64c9-49ed-bd57-8e252aa9ff78\', \'multiverseId\': 451575}, \'multiverseid\': 451575}, {\'name\': \'Embraseur escouflenfer\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\n{1}{R} : L\'Embraseur escouflenfer gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Son envol embrase le ciel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d5bcb4-b1cb-43f9-8942-853d827d2c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 451823}, \'multiverseid\': 451823}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale Incendiario\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\n{1}{R}: Il Nibbio Infernale Incendiario prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo volo dà fuoco al cielo stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae0b3ea-dfb7-4317-839c-332b736733a4\', \'multiverseId\': 452071}, \'multiverseid\': 452071}, {\'name\': \'ヘルカイトの点火者\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、ヘルカイトの点火者は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'それが飛びたてば、空自身が燃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d60ae4-04d8-4ba0-b82e-f19845905417\', \'multiverseId\': 452319}, \'multiverseid\': 452319}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo Incendiário\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\n{1}{R}: Dragão Avérneo Incendiário recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Seu voo é capaz de incendiar o próprio céu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e5358b9-8298-4db0-9f70-2a283485c127\', \'multiverseId\': 452567}, \'multiverseid\': 452567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ältester des Sakura-Stamms\', \'text\': \'Opfere den Ältesten des Sakura-Stamms: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt keine Grabsteine im Gebiet der Orochi. Gefallene Krieger werden mit einem Baumsetzling begraben, damit sie nach dem Tode ein Teil des Waldes werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a875254e-b54e-4d6f-85fd-43eeedef60af\', \'multiverseId\': 451363}, \'multiverseid\': 451363}, {\'name\': \'Anciano de la tribu Sakura\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar al Anciano de la tribu Sakura: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán víbora\', \'flavor\': \'No hay tumbas en el territorio orochi. Los guerreros caídos son enterrados junto con un retoño de árbol, para convertirse en parte del bosque después de la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d1b522-616b-4dd7-bed8-9a62a2cc320b\', \'multiverseId\': 451611}, \'multiverseid\': 451611}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y avait pas de pierres tombales sur les territoires des orochi. Les guerriers étaient enterrés avec un jeune arbre, pour entrer en communion avec la forêt après leur mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b8a68e-b0fb-4eb7-acba-d2c675d6f715\', \'multiverseId\': 451859}, \'multiverseid\': 451859}, {\'name\': \'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Serpente\', \'flavor\': "Non c\'erano lapidi nei territori orochi. I guerrieri uccisi venivano sepolti insieme al virgulto di un albero, affinché potessero divenire parte della foresta dopo la loro morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b518a4-8bce-403b-ba8d-004ff1b338d8\', \'multiverseId\': 452107}, \'multiverseid\': 452107}, {\'name\': \'桜族の長老\', \'text\': \'桜族の長老を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、そのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'大蛇の領地には墓石が無い。死んだ戦士は木の苗と共に埋められ、死して後に森の一部となるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78ceac63-587f-4df2-b75e-61f2033a93bc\', \'multiverseId\': 452355}, \'multiverseid\': 452355}, {\'name\': \'Ancião da Tribo Sakura\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Ancião da Tribo Sakura: Procure um card de terreno básico no seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Não havia lápides no território dos orochis. Os guerreiros mortos eram enterrados com brotos de árvores, para que depois da morte se tornassem parte da floresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f134517-b8f2-4d92-ab92-8b2279e61df5\', \'multiverseId\': 452603}, \'multiverseid\': 452603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherium-Skulpteur\', \'text\': \'Artefaktzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die berühmtesten Künstler verzichten ganz auf Werkzeuge und formen das Metall nur mit Hand und Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451293&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f437b9-1bb1-4b9e-a086-ca4f36ce23ec\', \'multiverseId\': 451293}, \'multiverseid\': 451293}, {\'name\': \'Escultora de eterium\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Los más grandes maestros del arte abandonan todas sus herramientas, dando forma al metal solo con las manos y la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799294b5-f1ca-437b-953b-eb277b7bf76c\', \'multiverseId\': 451541}, \'multiverseid\': 451541}, {\'name\': "Sculpteur d\'étherium", \'text\': "Les sorts d\'artefact que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les plus grands maîtres abandonnent les outils et façonnent le métal uniquement avec la main et l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d00c5b-4474-4718-a8ac-831c1cc0ebce\', \'multiverseId\': 451789}, \'multiverseid\': 451789}, {\'name\': \'Scultrice di Eterium\', \'text\': \'Le magie artefatto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'I più grandi maestri artigiani abbandonano completamente gli attrezzi, modellando il metallo solo con le mani e la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52cc1e4-d96b-4622-98d1-df4fe603bcc3\', \'multiverseId\': 452037}, \'multiverseid\': 452037}, {\'name\': \'エーテリウムの彫刻家\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'最も偉大なる工芸の達人ともなれば、道具は全て投げ打ち、手と精神だけで金属を刻むものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0429ed48-6346-4b38-a5d8-624d9ff0067a\', \'multiverseId\': 452285}, \'multiverseid\': 452285}, {\'name\': \'Escultor de Etherium\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de artefato que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Vedalkeano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os maiores mestres artesãos abandonam totalmente o uso de ferramentas, moldando o metal somente com as mãos e o pensamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba971c54-e215-4943-998e-75c25cc47acf\', \'multiverseId\': 452533}, \'multiverseid\': 452533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätzender Schleim\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Ätzende Schleim ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Es fürchtet keine Klinge und lässt nicht einmal Knochen zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b306119-6235-4c60-8461-0ae8da2c4082\', \'multiverseId\': 451330}, \'multiverseid\': 451330}, {\'name\': \'Fango ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Fango ácido entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'No teme al acero y no deja ni huesos a su paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e03e83-9549-402b-a5eb-37c30fcb87c3\', \'multiverseId\': 451578}, \'multiverseid\': 451578}, {\'name\': \'Boue acide\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand la Boue acide arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, l\'enchantement ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'Elle ne craint aucune épée et ne laisse aucun corps derrière elle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cb0239-1de3-4f87-9db0-b9bb8335555d\', \'multiverseId\': 451826}, \'multiverseid\': 451826}, {\'name\': \'Melma Acida\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando la Melma Acida entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'Non teme la spada e non lascia traccia alcuna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e819d415-ca41-4e84-a871-884f65dbee85\', \'multiverseId\': 452074}, \'multiverseid\': 452074}, {\'name\': \'酸のスライム\', \'text\': \'接死\\n酸のスライムが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'それは如何なる刃も恐れず、如何なる骨も残さない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adec65de-cf3d-4874-870b-86cd4b9dd191\', \'multiverseId\': 452322}, \'multiverseid\': 452322}, {\'name\': \'Limo Ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Limo Ácido entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não teme nenhuma espada, e não deixa nenhum osso para trás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d8de84-beb9-4f17-80c9-8a4e22984ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 452570}, \'multiverseid\': 452570}]', "[{'name': 'Ödes Moor', 'text': 'Das Öde Moor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\nUmwandlung {B} ({B}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451438&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7201ed9e-61cf-47d2-be3a-cf68f6429561', 'multiverseId': 451438}, 'multiverseid': 451438}, {'name': 'Páramo estéril', 'text': 'El Páramo estéril entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\nCiclo {B}. ({B}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451686&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46fa61d3-80aa-4cc2-89d3-17ef607688b0', 'multiverseId': 451686}, 'multiverseid': 451686}, {'name': 'Lande stérile', 'text': 'La Lande stérile arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\nRecyclage {B} ({B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451934&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28592934-0653-4d82-9659-6f25438965c3', 'multiverseId': 451934}, 'multiverseid': 451934}, {'name': 'Brughiera Brulla', 'text': 'La Brughiera Brulla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\nCiclo {B} ({B}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452182&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ddef522-e0f7-4b4d-a504-392deaceb686', 'multiverseId': 452182}, 'multiverseid': 452182}, {'name': 'やせた原野', 'text': 'やせた原野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\nサイクリング{B}（{B}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452430&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57663e68-779b-4e53-9715-145b6e356644', 'multiverseId': 452430}, 'multiverseid': 452430}, {'name': 'Charneca Estéril', 'text': 'Charneca Estéril entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\nReciclar {B} ({B}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452678&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da013915-e850-401c-983b-d063afe8e94f', 'multiverseId': 452678}, 'multiverseid': 452678}]", '[{\'name\': \'Übermäßiges Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher zusätzlich {G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Möge sich der Wald ausbreiten! Aus Salz, aus Stein und aus Morast sollen neue Bäume emporsprießen."\\n—Molimo, Maro-Hexer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451360&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cdf10f-c76b-46cd-b877-5bfbf2103677\', \'multiverseId\': 451360}, \'multiverseid\': 451360}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento desmedido\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega {G}{G} adicionales.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Deja que el bosque se extienda! Deja que se alcen los nuevos árboles de entre la sal, las rocas y las ciénagas".\\n—Molimo, hechicero maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb2aeb35-ec0f-4cce-a8b7-4b8225abe5af\', \'multiverseId\': 451608}, \'multiverseid\': 451608}, {\'name\': \'Luxuriance\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute {G}{G} supplémentaires.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Laissez la forêt s\'épanouir ! Que les jeunes arbrisseaux jaillissent du sel, de la roche et des marais. »\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcier", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a765f360-5dd3-4bc1-b3f9-24d1b3d1667d\', \'multiverseId\': 451856}, \'multiverseid\': 451856}, {\'name\': \'Vegetazione Rigogliosa\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge {G}{G} addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Che la foresta si allarghi! Che i nuovi alberi nascano dal sale, dalla pietra e dalla palude."\\n—Molimo, stregone maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef910c2-bc09-4dba-8e92-0713c96dca5d\', \'multiverseId\': 452104}, \'multiverseid\': 452104}, {\'name\': \'はびこり\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で{G}{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「森よ広がれ！塩から、石から、沼から、新たな樹よ立つがいい。」\\n――マローの魔術師モリモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af5e1f1-5433-4c65-bd5f-f55651b7cf92\', \'multiverseId\': 452352}, \'multiverseid\': 452352}, {\'name\': \'Vegetação Exuberante\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona {G}{G} extras.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Que a floresta se espalhe! De sal, pedra e lama, que as novas árvores cresçam."\\n— Molimo, feiticeiro maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb40494-6e8b-4120-9f61-8aead35f10af\', \'multiverseId\': 452600}, \'multiverseid\': 452600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überschwemmter Knochenacker\', \'text\': \'Der Überschwemmte Knochenacker kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Noch lange nachdem man dem Land die letzten Geheimnisse entlockt hat, wird es Mysterien geben, die tief unter dem Meer begraben liegen."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e30d28f-3f40-44da-adbf-79ff451525dc\', \'multiverseId\': 451486}, \'multiverseid\': 451486}, {\'name\': \'Osario sumergido\', \'text\': \'El Osario sumergido entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Siglos después de que la tierra haya entregado el último de sus secretos, seguirá habiendo misterios en las profundidades marinas".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07513c7f-2d73-43de-8597-541eacdb6af6\', \'multiverseId\': 451734}, \'multiverseid\': 451734}, {\'name\': \'Ossuaire submergé\', \'text\': "L\'Ossuaire submergé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Longtemps après la découverte des derniers secrets gardés par la terre, les fonds marins recèleront encore de nombreux mystères. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=451982&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c0b2bb-e498-4038-a36d-edba90fff7e8\', \'multiverseId\': 451982}, \'multiverseid\': 451982}, {\'name\': \'Ossario Sommerso\', \'text\': "L\'Ossario Sommerso entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dopo che la terra avrà rivelato l\\\'ultimo dei suoi segreti, si celeranno ancora misteri nelle profondità del mare."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9631c1-5a9a-40f0-bb56-f59f4d16da76\', \'multiverseId\': 452230}, \'multiverseid\': 452230}, {\'name\': \'水没した骨塚\', \'text\': \'水没した骨塚はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「地上が踏破しつくされても、海の深部には未知の領域がずっと眠り続けているのよ。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4749cfed-2eb8-48d3-b9c2-1095a8c64415\', \'multiverseId\': 452478}, \'multiverseid\': 452478}, {\'name\': \'Ossário Submerso\', \'text\': \'Ossário Submerso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Muito depois de a terra ter revelado o último de seus segredos, ainda haverá mistérios nas profundezas do mar."\\n— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=452726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2322bf-7269-40e5-a03d-07091801e707\', \'multiverseId\': 452726}, \'multiverseid\': 452726}]']
